    step 0
    date "2022-03-13T14:00:16Z"
    title "10 Reasons Why Van Life SUCKS"
    description "Save up to $15 off your TurboTax purchase using my link https://go.magik.ly/ml/1fq9y/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Sometimes, Van Life sucks. In this video, I break down the top 10 reasons why I sometimes struggle with this lifestyle and things you might consider before moving onto the road full-time.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;0:05 sometimes van life sucks&amp;#10;0:54 overnight parking&amp;#10;3:00 space&amp;#10;3:55 shower and bathroom&amp;#10;4:37 lack of normalcy&amp;#10;5:30 i got pulled over&amp;#10;7:17 legal stuff&amp;#10;8:20 taxes&amp;#10;9:42 lack of convenience&amp;#10;11:00 lack of privacy&amp;#10;12:44 mail + shipping&amp;#10;13:41 wifi + internet&amp;#10;13:12 breakdowns + maintenance&amp;#10;15:44 the truth about #vanlife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Links to ALL my favorite photography, road life &amp;#38; camping essentials  &amp;#128722;  I get a small kickback when you purchase using these links, thanks for your support :)  https://christianschaffer.art/faq-gear &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Business Inquiries: info(at)christianschaffer.art&amp;#10;Website: https://christianschaffer.art/&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/christianschaffer&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/ChristianSchafR&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music is from MUSICBED &amp;#127926;  Elevate your videos with record-label quality songs: http://share.mscbd.fm/christianschaffer&amp;#10;&amp;#10;**My van is a 2019 Ram ProMaster 1500 High Roof, 136&amp;#34; WB with 37K miles** &amp;#128656;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FTC Disclaimer: This video is sponsored by @TurboTax  Some links above are affiliate links from which I get a small commission, which does not affect you as a customer at all, but helps me keep on making videos for you guys! All opinions are my own&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#TurboTaxLive #selfemployed #MagicLinks"
