    date "2018-05-10T02:48:34Z"
    title "VAN LIFE | A Day in The Life | MEXICO"
    description "We have been traveling in our van in Mexico for nearly 5 months. Today we bring you along on the adventure to show you what a typical travel day looks like for us!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUBSCRIBE to our channel &amp;#38; to join our community! &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/MaxLeeandOccy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us on INSTAGRAM!  @maxandlee_&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Become a Patreon!&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/MaxandLee&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHERE DO WE GET OUR MUSIC??&amp;#10;http://share.mscbd.fm/maxandlee &amp;#11013;&amp;#65039;&amp;#10;&amp;#11014;&amp;#65039;Get a 30-day free trial for the best music for your videos!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want to EDIT like us?? This is what we use!   https://bit.ly/2Px8tfk  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHO WE ARE:&amp;#10;We are Max &amp;#38; Lee + Occy. We are new to the YouTube world and stoked to be here. We are about living small with the world as our backyard. We love adventure and we want to bring you along with us! Follow us as we continue our travels, through Mexico and into Central America.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music:&amp;#10;enjoy ur coffee by a u x @auxofficial&amp;#10;Music provided by Free Music for Vlogs&amp;#160;youtu.be/ox0So3zx-bs&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The moment I wake up by a u x @auxofficial&amp;#10;Music provided by Free Music for Vlogs&amp;#160;youtu.be/5U-xVQVE1N8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vibe With Me by Joakim Karud @joakimkarud&amp;#10;Music provided by Free Music for Vlogs&amp;#160;youtu.be/XURcm5qllIQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Soul by Dj Quads @aka-dj-quads&amp;#10;Music provided by Free Music for Vlogs&amp;#160;youtu.be/Govo0Hu1l5A&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Just My Imagination by KSMK @imkosmik&amp;#10;Music provided by Free Music for Vlogs&amp;#160;youtu.be/tCppBIAJD9g&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Last Summer by Ikson @ikson&amp;#10;Music provided by Free Music for Vlogs&amp;#160;youtu.be/ZGPs5vi6pBY&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Emotions by Simon More @user-73416670&amp;#10;Music provided by Free Music for Vlogs&amp;#160;youtu.be/Ik5MhP1bRQY"
