  [
    id 3
    label "puNieGCEAZo"
    step 0
    date "2021-07-21T13:00:20Z"
    title "How living in a van changed our lives (USA Road Trip Documentary)"
    description "After living, working, and traveling full-time together in the tiniest little van for an entire year, both of our lives have been forever changed. Our darling van saw 38 states, drove over 30,000 miles across the entire US, and housed us through sunshine, rainfall, snowfall, and high-speed wind. What an incredibly wild year it was. It was both the most exciting year of our lives, while also being the most challenging. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you all for being a huge support to what we do and for choosing to be a part of our journey. This past year in the van will certainly be one to remember, and we can&amp;#8217;t wait for the start of chapter two (full-time international travel) starting tomorrow, when our flight takes off for our first country abroad post-pandemic. Thank you for taking the time to watch through this documentary, and we will see you in eight days with our first international video!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow along to see where we head next.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WE HAVE NEW MERCH!&amp;#10;VISIT OUR WEBSITE + STORE: www.chadandclaire.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BACKDOOR KITCHEN RECIPES (CLAIRE'S DIGITAL COOKBOOK):&amp;#10;https://chadandclaire.com/shop/p/clairesdigitalcookbook&amp;#10;&amp;#10;170+ USA VAN LIFE PARKING SPOTS (PLUS OUR ENTIRE USA ROUTE): &amp;#10;https://chadandclaire.com/shop/p/1-year-of-parking-spots&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJul...&amp;#10;Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/chadandclaire/&amp;#10;Support us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/chadandclaire&amp;#10;Email us for inquiries: contact@chadandclaire.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OUR GEAR&amp;#10;Main Camera - https://amzn.to/2JW0mZF &amp;#10;Wide Lens - https://amzn.to/3hRMnAB &amp;#10;Zoom Lens - https://amzn.to/35kYhh7&amp;#10;Tripod - https://amzn.to/38ubGFX &amp;#10;Microphone - https://amzn.to/36qTuLn &amp;#10;Drone - https://amzn.to/3bg0XAB &amp;#10;Waterproof Camera - https://amzn.to/35hUnWf"
