  [
    id 6
    label "ZqNDsBjdS4M"
    step 0
    date "2019-12-29T21:24:23Z"
    title "Top Van Life Travel Spots in the USA!"
    description "Top VanLife Travel Spots... From 7 months of Full Time Travel in our van! Our &amp;#34;Farewell USA&amp;#34; Travel Series has come to an end... this video recaps our favorite destinations we have traveled in our van over the past 6 months! Next up for us is &amp;#34;Van Vida En Mexico&amp;#34;... a Van Life Travel Series to Mexico! &amp;#10;------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you would like to help support our journey... keep fuel in the tank and the wheels turning so that the videos keep coming... you can visit our Patreon Page to learn more: https://www.patreon.com/SnowAndCurt&amp;#10;&amp;#10;--------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;We retired early and sold everything we own to become fulltime van life travelers! After and 8 month van build, we hit the road in our DIY Sprinter Van to start our 10 year journey around the world. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;In addition to our Travel Series, you can tour our van in our Van Tour Video on our channel... We also have several &amp;#34;Tech Talk' videos about our van build. Plus, we started a &amp;#34;Van Life Series&amp;#34; playlist so that you can see videos specifically about actually living in a van! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;-----------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OUR VLOG EQUIPMENT:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Camera Gimble&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VFL54V7/...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Cell Phone Gimble&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BGSPZ3L/...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vlog Camera&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MV3P7M8/...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can also go straight to our Amazon Store, if you click through and make a purchase, we will make a small commission. We will never promote something that we do not believe in and use ourselves. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/snowandcurt&amp;#10;&amp;#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-~-~~-~~~-~~-~-&amp;#10;Please watch: &amp;#34;Ep 15 -  OUR VANLIFE STORY&amp;#34; &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GUN2LtgvhSU&amp;#10;-~-~~-~~~-~~-~-&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;JOIN OUR MEMBERSHIP PAGE&amp;#10;To see behind the scenes action and help keep the wheels turning, head over to our YouTube Membership Page and JOIN. &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyrjbkxt4kBuVJJuqVTkylw/join&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;SEE SOMETHING YOU LIKE IN OUR VAN? &amp;#10;Chances are you can find it in our Amazon Store. FYI... If you shop through our links, we will make a small commission, which is much appreciated! &amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/snowandcurt?ref=cm_sw_em_r_inf_own_snowandcurt_dp_2vFBlimcgwjcT&amp;#10;--------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;LIKE OUR MUSIC? &amp;#10;We get it at Epideminc Sound. Here is a link to our Fav Van Lif Traveler Tunes:&amp;#10;https://www.epidemicsound.com/playlist/6a9vimoh50lhx2jqoazmctz9cez466c2&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you decide to join Epidemic Sound, Here is a Referral Link to save us a bit of cash towards one month of our subscription (THANKS):&amp;#10;https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/to9wvg/&amp;#10;----------------------------------------------------------------"
