  [
    id 8
    label "qo_gZUXmy0k"
    step 0
    date "2021-06-23T17:54:30Z"
    title "Why I Quit Vanlife"
    description "Vanlife or #vanlife was an incredible experience and I would recommend it to anyone with even the slightest of interest in the lifestyle to give it a try it. I learned a lot about myself and also had a great time doing it. However, it was time for a change and I'm diving in to this next chapter with nothing but commitment. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks for watching!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please support the channel if you are able: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;T-Shirts available on TeeSpring:&amp;#10;https://teespring.com/stores/captain-gnarkill-warehouse&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PayPal:&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.me/captaingnarkill&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join on Patreon for a dollar a month:&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/captaingnarkill&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please subscribe to the channel. Its free for you and helps me a lot.&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/captaingnarkill/?sub_confirmation=1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Shop the wonderful world of Amazon here:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2wHC0vN&amp;#10;DISCLAIMER: This is an affiliate link&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Things in my van that make vanlife better &amp;#38; easier:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;12 Volt Refrigerator:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2N3BLUe&amp;#10;&amp;#10;6&amp;#34; Memory Foam Mattress:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3qj3A9z&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Solar Panels 100W:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3rWE1eR&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Solar Batteries AGM 155AH:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/37eCMj5&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Solar Charge Controller:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3jQYf6L&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Solar 8awg wire:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3agc6k0&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Maxxair Roof Vent Fan:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2N1Q4bK&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Diesel Parking Heater Complete Kit:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2Zesew1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;7 Gallon Water Container w/ Spout:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2ZetsHx&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Best Camping Chair Ever:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3air4WJ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Dish Washer / Shower Sprayer Thing:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3rPewvQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Trasharoo Trash Can:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3pgH7bB&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Send Mail:&amp;#10;Jk, mail is no longer a thing. Heres what happened to that:&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VKTaakrtEa0&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow me on IG:&amp;#10;@CaptainGnarkill&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music by Epidemic Sound (http://www.epidemicsound.com)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #vanliving #livinginavan"
