    step 0
    date "2020-01-14T18:00:02Z"
    title "Living Your Best Life in a Van"
    description "&amp;#34;How Bob Wells Lives His Best Life in a Van.&amp;#34; Bob Wells lives in a refurbished van. After hitting a new low in the wake of a divorce, with no money to lean on, Bob found a new lease on life when he hit the road in his van for the last ten years, reaching celebrity status from his popular YouTube channel where he shares how-to&amp;#8217;s and inspiration for the van-dwelling set. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;How Bob Wells Lives His Best Life in a Van | American Nomads, Ep. 1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Learn more about &amp;#34;Independent Lens&amp;#34;:&amp;#10;http://www.pbs.org/independentlens&amp;#10;Like us on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/independentlens&amp;#10;Follow us on Twitter: https://twitter.com/IndependentLens&amp;#10;Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/independentlens/&amp;#10;Bob Wells's YouTube Channel: https://www.youtube.com/cheaprvliving&amp;#10;Executive Producers&amp;#10;Sally Jo Fifer&amp;#10;Lois Vossen&amp;#10; &amp;#10;Director &amp;#38; Producer&amp;#10;Ben Wu&amp;#10;David Usui&amp;#10; &amp;#10;Cinematography&amp;#10;Ben Wu&amp;#10;David Usui&amp;#10; &amp;#10;Editor&amp;#10;David Usui&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Sound Mix&amp;#10;Dan McHugh&amp;#10; &amp;#10;VP of Production &amp;#10;Royd Chung&amp;#10; &amp;#10;Senior Manager, Short-Form Content                        &amp;#10;Pamela Torno&amp;#10; &amp;#10;Supervising Producer                  &amp;#10;Clare Chambers &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Consulting Producer&amp;#10;David Casey&amp;#10;  &amp;#10;Associate Producer &amp;#10;Susan Cohen&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Legal Counsel&amp;#10;Kathleen Conkey, Law Offices of Kathleen Conkey&amp;#10; &amp;#10;Production Accountant&amp;#10;Ameena Din&amp;#10; &amp;#10;Special thanks to:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;KC Colter&amp;#10;Carolyn Merriman&amp;#10;Bob Wells&amp;#10;Cheap RV Living (www.cheaprvliving.com)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ITVS Contributing Staff&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Senior VP of Content&amp;#10;Jim Sommers&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VP of Content&amp;#10;Noland Walker&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VP of Marketing &amp;#38; Communication&amp;#10;Lisa Tawil&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Senior Counsel Business &amp;#38; Legal Affairs&amp;#10;Noah Wald&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Senior Creative Director&amp;#10;Louise Cousins&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Senior Director of Marketing&amp;#10;Daniel Ross&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Senior Content Manager&amp;#10;Aldo Mora-Blanco&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Post Production Supervisor&amp;#10;Joanna Goldfarb&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Art Director&amp;#10;Michael Silva&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Assistant Editor&amp;#10;Michael Steve&amp;#10;&amp;#10;AMERICAN NOMADS is a co-production of LOST &amp;#38; FOUND FILMS and INDEPENDENT TELEVISION SERVICE (ITVS), with funding provided by the CORPORATION FOR PUBLIC BROADCASTING (CPB)&amp;#10;This program was produced by LOST &amp;#38; FOUND FILMS, which is solely responsible for its content.&amp;#10;&amp;#169; 2019 Lost &amp;#38; Found Films, Inc. All Rights Reserved."
