  [
    id 10
    label "SIkM7TaCByk"
    step 0
    date "2020-06-15T14:30:03Z"
    title "Solo Van Life. Living in a Van for 5 months Changed his Life. Camper Van Tour and Mini Documentary."
    description "Jake and his dog Louie live full time in a 1986 Ford Get-Away-Van. When he bought it he did some cosmetic upgrades like re doing the counter tops, adding a collage of maps, and buttons on the ceiling. Jake shares with us an interesting way that he does his dishes, and he also shares how he shared the van for 3 weeks with someone and how that worked. &amp;#10;Jake uses a Jackery 500 for all his electrical needs (https://amzn.to/2N2woAV) he uses a Wave 3 to keep warm (https://amzn.to/37xyORz) and he uses pot lights to stay lit! (https://amzn.to/2C7dB5j)&amp;#10;If you click any of those links and shop on amazon in the next 24hrs you help support this channel at no extra cost to yourself!&amp;#10;If you enjoyed this video make sure to share it on social media!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you would like to follow Jake on instagram click the link below.&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/thedrivinghouse/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Discord&amp;#10;https://discord.gg/4kWjnSfF6U&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Van Life Tours&amp;#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL8TC5LCUPfit4qO8aiIh_iHtC2xFWtIzA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vanlife Video Podcast&amp;#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL8TC5LCUPfitJMClK--WFcx1CUHI-rGM7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vanlife Audio Podcast&amp;#10;https://anchor.fm/vanlifeandchill&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Movies&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3HnMwHJ&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3HmmEfw&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3gxFchf&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vlogs&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/ForrestStevensYT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you to Patreons! Jamie F, Renay E, Andrew B, Madison and Raynor, Jennifer S, Mario R, Doug B, Marian H, Cody S, Ashton S, Akshay A, Curtis, and Sonya B! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Patreon&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/ForrestStevens &amp;#10;Paypal&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=ML6MEHLAHUMFN&amp;#10;Bitcoin&amp;#10;3Ao1PoA7i1mY4R2eQp8HYSJv77jZ1HkMN7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you read all this give us 1 thumbs up emoji, 1 tree emoji and 1 Video camera emoji in the comment section."
