    title "COMPANY OWNER Walks Out And Asked Me If I LIVE IN MY VAN "
    description "Van life in three small towns on the East Coast. Thanks so much for all the Love!!! Grab a shirt/hoodie/Sticker and support the Madness!  https://www.vancityvanlife.ca/shop&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My Van (List of everything)  https://www.vancityvanlife.ca/van&amp;#10;&amp;#10;$ Wanna Toss Us a Tip! Real time updates n posts&amp;#10;PATREON https://www.patreon.com/VancityVanlife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to contact Vancity Vanlife&amp;#10;Business Inquiries workwithus@vancityvanlife.ca&amp;#10;Want Your Van Filmed vantours@vancityvanlife.ca&amp;#10;Filming Opportunities getitfilmed@vancityvanlife.ca&amp;#10;Wanna say something nice? sayit@vancityvanlife.ca (Sorry, No Response)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The companies who built my van:&amp;#10;OVERLAND INTERIORS  https://www.overlandinteriors.com&amp;#10;RAY OUTFITTED https://www.rayoutfitted.com/&amp;#10;J5 CUSTOM VANS https://www.j5customvans.ca&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Longest Channel Sponsor :&amp;#10;JACKERY PORTABLE LITHIUM BATTERIES: http://www.jackery.com?aff=77&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music in my videos:&amp;#10;EPIDEMIC SOUND http://share.epidemicsound.com/vancityvanlife"
