  [
    id 22
    label "aNWaFxIVbQM"
    step 0
    date "2019-12-16T21:25:24Z"
    title "Winter Storm In a Van - Living The Van Life"
    description "Solo Stove Ranger - Portable Fire Pit: https://amzn.to/36JD28f&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OLight Flashlights: 10% off Coupon Code : VanLife&amp;#10;https://olight.idevaffiliate.com/idevaffiliate.php?id=477&amp;#10;&amp;#10;LTVL Tee Shirts HERE:  https://www.livingthevanlife.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;HOW I STAY WARM IN MY VAN: 5KW 12V Diesel Heater: https://amzn.to/2OSFrGC&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I have been following the weather forecasts profusely looking for the perfect winter storm.  It has finally hit here in the North Cascade Mountains with a heavy winter storm warning.  Join me on the adventure as I take you guys camping in a winter storm.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Support The LTVL Channel:&amp;#10;--------------&amp;#10;Paypal: https://www.paypal.me/livingthevanlife&amp;#10;Patreon:  https://www.patreon.com/LivingTheVanLife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow me:&amp;#10;Van Life Instagram: @LivingTheVanLife&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/livingthevanlife/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Personal Instagram: @chad_derosa&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/chad_derosa/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My Current Film Production - &amp;#8220;Rockets and Titans&amp;#8221;:&amp;#10;YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaekVy98pF50VoCwWHwl2ZA&amp;#10;Instagram:  https://www.instagram.com/rocketsandtitans/   &amp;#10;Facebook:  https://www.facebook.com/rocketsandtitans/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The gear I use while Living The Van Life:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My Cold Weather Gear:&amp;#10;--------------&amp;#10;5KW 12V Diesel Heater: https://amzn.to/2OSFrGC&amp;#10;Sorel Caribou snow boots: https://amzn.to/2V4Z2Ud&amp;#10;Marmot Down Coat: https://amzn.to/2SOAlts&amp;#10;Dehumidifying Packs (Moisture Control): https://amzn.to/2KTlSKy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Personal Wear:&amp;#10;-------------&amp;#10;Oakley Sunglasses: https://amzn.to/2Y7URcu&amp;#10;Carhartt Pants: https://amzn.to/2CvdbTM&amp;#10;Marmot Down Coat: https://amzn.to/2SOAlts&amp;#10;Sorel Caribou snow boots: https://amzn.to/2V4Z2Ud&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My Cooking Gear:&amp;#10;--------------&amp;#10;Jetboil MiniMo Camping Stove Cooking System: https://amzn.to/2TH3yrF&amp;#10;Coleman Bottle Top Propane Stove: https://amzn.to/2SS82P0&amp;#10;12&amp;#8221; Stone Earth Non-Stick Pan: https://amzn.to/2GLUcqP&amp;#10;Tovolo Nylon Flex: https://amzn.to/2GLvy9Z&amp;#10;Farberware Cutting Board: https://amzn.to/2TRj4kS&amp;#10;Seventh Generation Disinfecting Wipes: https://amzn.to/2IpC34S&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Fishing Gear&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;-&amp;#10;Redington Fly Rod:  https://amzn.to/33imvoR&amp;#10;Survival Knife - Schrade SCHF9:  https://amzn.to/2Mwr7Ru&amp;#10;Tackle Shoulder Bag: https://amzn.to/35R1XWT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Van Gear&amp;#10;--------------&amp;#10;Agawa Canyon Boreal Folding Saw: https://amzn.to/2pLnSho&amp;#10;Inergy Kodiak Solar Generator Battery: https://www.inergysolar.com/ref/17/    ***COUPON CODE: vanlife&amp;#10;ARB 2500 Awning: https://amzn.to/2SmJjyq&amp;#10;Off Road 783 Watt LED Light Bar: https://amzn.to/2XlP9SJ&amp;#10;Leveling Blocks: https://amzn.to/2CdtnbE&amp;#10;Coleman Northstar 1500 Lumen Lantern: https://amzn.to/2OgBQQB&amp;#10;Hydro Flask 10oz wine tumbler: https://amzn.to/2thUvlf&amp;#10;Hydro Flask 12oz travel mug: https://amzn.to/2GnJ1Fw&amp;#10;Dimmable LED Lighting: https://amzn.to/2KR9qe9&amp;#10;USB Mood Lights: https://amzn.to/2PjYdn8&amp;#10;Sony Bluetooth Speaker: https://amzn.to/2Pj2qY3&amp;#10;Van Life Garbage Can: https://amzn.to/2PfJNEw&amp;#10;Dehumidifying Packs (Moisture Control): https://amzn.to/2KTlSKy&amp;#10;USB Charging HUB: https://amzn.to/2Pj1Ut5&amp;#10;USB Fan (circulates heat from the heater): https://amzn.to/2DBh7lu&amp;#10;Dash Mount Phone Holder: https://amzn.to/2zGNs9j&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Off Road Gear&amp;#10;-------------&amp;#10;General Grabber A/TX All Terrain Tires - 225/75r16 - https://amzn.to/2RsKSLS&amp;#10;MaxTrax: https://amzn.to/2U77Sku&amp;#10;Hi-Lift Jack: https://amzn.to/2PcCOMF&amp;#10;Hi-Lift Wheel Jack Strap: https://amzn.to/2Pkn5vb&amp;#10;Coyote Tire Deflators: https://amzn.to/2KRQhZL&amp;#10;Portable Air Compressor: https://amzn.to/2PcDq4V&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My Camera Gear&amp;#10;--------------&amp;#10;Canon EOS 70D: https://amzn.to/2KYnF17&amp;#10;Joby Vlog Tripod: https://amzn.to/2RybHxo&amp;#10;Rode VideoMic Pro Plus: https://amzn.to/2PfKTjC&amp;#10;DJI Mavic Air: https://amzn.to/2SvB9nz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Living The Van Life YouTube Channel is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program,&amp;#10;&amp;#8203;an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com &amp;#10;FTC Disclosure Statement:&amp;#10;Some links on this youtube channel may be affiliate links. We may get paid if you buy something or take an action after clicking one of these."
