  [
    id 30
    label "lIUWTQfuHwA"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-10T13:00:20Z"
    title "Why We are ENDING VAN LIFE (Q Our Next Chapter)"
    description "Description: After 1 and a half years of van life driving all across North America, from Canada all the way to Central America, it's time to make some life adjustments. We start out with a van life Q&amp;#38;A and answer all your biggest questions about travel planning, relationships in the van, dumping black water / gray water tanks, and discuss money, burnout, and YouTube. At the end we tell you our plans with the camper van and what's next for the channel. If you haven't seen all of our videos yet make sure to start at day 1 until now for the Chapter 1!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#Vanlife #TravelCouple #Q&amp;#38;A&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Products We Use in the Van&amp;#10;Bed&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Mattress topper (We have 2 in and wish we went with 3 in) - https://amzn.to/3BZfUSw&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Sheets and Pillowcases (Full - Blue Grey) - https://amzn.to/3j7W5jm&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Duvet Cover - https://amzn.to/3zU5JwF&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Cover for Side Pieces on bed - used body pillowcases and sewed/fitted to correct size - https://amzn.to/3lex20L&amp;#10;Kitchen &amp;#38; Cooking&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Paper Towel Holder - https://amzn.to/3Am1MBk&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Refrigerator Storage Bins - Medium - https://amzn.to/3rHjsnM&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Refrigerator Storage Bins - Bottom Shelf -  https://amzn.to/2UYlCUb&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Plastic Dish Set -https://amzn.to/3rHLkbr&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Yeti 30 oz Rambler - https://amzn.to/3yt26xD&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Sink Scrubbie Holder - https://amzn.to/3j6CMH5&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Drawer Organizers - https://amzn.to/3xfokl1&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Blackstone Griddle - https://amzn.to/3yh6Vtx&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Blackstone Griddle Cover - https://amzn.to/3BXJZBS&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Griddle Utensils - https://amzn.to/3lde3Dw&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Portable Espresso Maker - https://amzn.to/3zQ3udR&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Aeropress Coffee Maker - https://amzn.to/3xyKqz8&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Coffee Bean Grinder - https://amzn.to/3xF1kfL&amp;#10;Cleaning&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Mini Shark Vacuum - https://amzn.to/2Vx0Aft&amp;#10;Bathroom&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Toilet Cleaner Brush - https://amzn.to/3j5WKld&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Porta Pack for Holding Tank - https://amzn.to/3rXgJGX&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Eco-Friendly Shower Shampoo/Soap - https://amzn.to/3jzcYn0&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Laundry Bags - https://amzn.to/3lF7EkI&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Mirror - https://amzn.to/3CrKa8H&amp;#10;Work Stations &amp;#38; Electronics&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Computer Monitor Stand - https://amzn.to/3lFnKuI&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Kindle - https://amzn.to/36twRpL&amp;#10;Storage &amp;#38; Hooks&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Clothing Bins fit in cubby above driver &amp;#38; passenger seats -  https://tidd.ly/3feK1vm&amp;#10;  &amp;#9675; Message Seller for custom bins - Length 12.25in, Width 10.5in, Height 7.5in&amp;#10;  &amp;#9675; Color: Black&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Storage Bins - Used in bathroom - 2 small, kitchen - 1 small, electronics cabinet - 1 small, garage on top of black aluminum boxes - 1 large, 1 small, Garage under bench seat - 1 medium  - https://amzn.to/3CpLjxt&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Aluminum Black Storage Box 1 used in garage, 1 used on roof - https://amzn.to/2Voa6lf&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Adhesive Velcro Netting - https://amzn.to/3xv4CBO&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Travel Packing Cubes - https://amzn.to/3yBnzo8&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Self Adhesive Wall Hooks - Stainless steel - https://amzn.to/3AgKSE0&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Plastic Adhesive Wall hooks - https://amzn.to/2VDhM2p&amp;#10;Cockpit&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Visor Mirror - https://amzn.to/37uGQLG&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Blackout Curtains - https://amzn.to/3xxCa2i&amp;#10;Adhesives &amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Velcro - Curtains, kitchen top extender, etc - https://amzn.to/3lGaNAL&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Double Sided Tape - Mirror - https://amzn.to/3rYx0v6&amp;#10;Bikes&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Bike Cover - XL - https://amzn.to/3fEGYNb&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Bike Rack - https://rockymounts.com/backstage/&amp;#10;Modifications&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Hose Filter - Drinking Water - https://amzn.to/3yuoMxr&amp;#10;Vehicle Maintenance / Needs&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Tire Deflator - https://amzn.to/3fDW99z&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Portable Compressor 40045 400P - https://amzn.to/3CsQ7m6&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; 25 FT Water Hose Fill Up - https://amzn.to/2TYCYj4&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Tool Roll Organizer - https://amzn.to/3Cs6BdS&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Bungee Cords - https://amzn.to/3yygILS&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Hatchet - https://amzn.to/3xtOSiA&amp;#10;Outside&amp;#10; &amp;#8226; Camping Chairs - https://www.rei.com/product/164385/rei-co-op-flexlite-camp-dreamer-chair&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Connect With Us!&amp;#10;Blog -  https://farisandlisa.com/ &amp;#10;Weekly Newsletter Tina's Tea Sign Up &amp;#38; Get a FREE Travel Starter Kit - https://farisandlisa.com/about/ &amp;#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/farisandlisa/ &amp;#10;Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/farisandlisa &amp;#10;Tik Tok - @farisandlisa&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Camera Gear&amp;#10;Camera 1: https://amzn.to/3zzNa0H&amp;#10;Camera 2: https://amzn.to/3zBNUlL&amp;#10;Lens 1: https://amzn.to/3BSJlFZ&amp;#10;Lens 2: https://amzn.to/3rCbRXr&amp;#10;Lens 3: https://amzn.to/3BBrvH8&amp;#10;Lens 4: https://amzn.to/3iIwTzu&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We're Faris and Lisa&amp;#10;&amp;#10;A travel couple from Metro Detroit, MI. We met in business school and started traveling immediately post graduation in 2016 while maintaining automotive marketing positions. We&amp;#8217;ve traveled to over 35 different countries together and still can&amp;#8217;t get enough!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In April 2021, we made the leap and quit our 9-5 jobs to follow our dreams of full time travel. We sold our house, donated all of our belongings and moved into our camper van / RV, &amp;#8220;Tina&amp;#8221; or &amp;#8220;Big T&amp;#8221;. Now we document all of our travels and van life adventures via travel vlog style! Subscribe to our YouTube channel and Newsletter to follow along on our adventure as we explore North America."
    channeltitle "Faris and Lisa"
    channelid "UCuLRhhkLNIPltDxRmqppyWw"
    favcount 0
    viewcount 2957
    likecount 179
    commentcount 66
