  [
    id 31
    label "TLrLaoJm-ag"
    step 0
    date "2018-07-11T20:04:13Z"
    title "How To Free Camp in the USA ! Van Life America"
    description "We free camp 99% of the time, largely because it helps our budget but also because you couldn't pay to stay in half if the places we've camped in!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;There's also not much chance of seeing the things we see whilst free camping, whether that's amazing nature or completely random stuff.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Watch the rest of our USA Roadtrip series here:&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cBEpxVTaaHk&amp;#38;list=PLAEl3ci6ChXgTWJjX0F0Hj0BQciWvkg01&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW US!&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Website: http://theindieprojects.com&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Instagram: http://instagram.com/TheIndieProjects&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Twitter: http://twitter.com/theindyprojects&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Facebook: http://facebook.com/theindieprojects&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Travel blog: http://www.vdubvanlife.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Filmed on:&amp;#10;&amp;#8608;  Sony RX100 MV: http://amzn.to/2tJBKVK&amp;#10;&amp;#10;JOIN US for exclusive Patreon content, monthly giveaways, early access to YouTube videos, and tons more!&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; https://www.patreon.com/theindieprojects&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you for watching! Please like, comment, subscribe and turn on post notifications :)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Contact us: &amp;#10;&amp;#8608; contacttheindieprojects@gmail.com"
