  [
    id 34
    label "w_aVEonbNa4"
    step 0
    date "2021-02-19T20:00:11Z"
    title "Her Bohemian Camper Van Tiny House - Solo Female Van Life On The Road"
    description "Subscribe For Weekly Newsletter : https://bit.ly/THT-Newsletter&amp;#10;Tiny Home Tours Podcast : http://bit.ly/THT-Podcast&amp;#10;Life On The Road In A Skoolie Newsletter : http://bit.ly/OGSN-Signup&amp;#10;Interested In Being Featured On The Channel? : http://bit.ly/Tour-Application&amp;#10;Are you considering a skoolie build? Check this out - http://bit.ly/SkoolieSchool&amp;#10;Subscribe For More Videos : https://www.youtube.com/user/tylerdurdeno9/&amp;#10;Subscribe For Life On The Road Videos : http://bit.ly/OffGridSkoolieSubscribe&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VIDEO DESCRIPTION:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Meet Brenda and her little travel companion Ranger! These two have been living in her self-converted 2012 Ford E-350 named Copper. This #solofemalevanlife converted her rig from start to finish with the help of her Dad in 42 days! The time and effort that was put into her van can be seen throughout this tour.  From the cute pocket door that separates the cab area from the rest of the van, to the little doggie bed under her bed ~ no space was wasted.   The L-shaped kitchen counters really makes the kitchen space feel huge. The design aesthetic is so fresh and so clean, and copper throughout the rig is gorgeous!  This single independent woman does it all and works a regular 9-5 job while on the road. Don't miss this tour, Thanks Brenda! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Her YouTube - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCHEdDEewQhAW9qC9LSnemig&amp;#10;Her Insta - https://www.instagram.com/theroadthroughmyeyes/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;______________________________BONUS CONTENT_____________________________________&amp;#10;Nature's Head Toilet With Bonuses - http://bit.ly/NaturesHeadTHT&amp;#10;Tiny House &amp;#38; Skoolie Build Gear - https://skooliecentral.com/gear/&amp;#10;Tiny Home Tours Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/Tinyhome.tours/&amp;#10;Tiny Home Tours Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/tinyhometours/&amp;#10;Life On The Road Newsletter - http://eepurl.com/gAyDP5&amp;#10;Want To See More Skoolie Videos? - https://skooliecentral.com/&amp;#10;Need Something On Amazon? Shop With This Link - http://amzn.to/1R7HfqE"
