    id 38
    label "2r1ebo2tp_w"
    step 0
    date "2022-03-27T08:04:33Z"
    title "Full Time Van Life (our first night in the van)"
    description "#VanLifeUK #NewHome We have to move into our new tiny home today (an old big green removals truck) but are we ready?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are on week two of decorating our campervan, and we are eager to move into it and get on the road. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this episode we visit Brighton which is where we lived for 5 years before doing van life UK.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our extremely comfortable duvet &amp;#38; pillows came from Duvet Hog, which are vegan and made of recycled materials https://duvethog.co.uk/?gclid=CjwKCAjwloCSBhAeEiwA3hVo_T0mieY25WIHjb5a-o_27lO89Hkbjxhca45IUIw6rbAtKPOMeEOUJxoCuksQAvD_BwE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our mattress came from a company that do awesome made-to-fit mattresses for campervans (and houses). The company is called Custom Size Beds https://customsizebeds.co.uk/made-to-measure-mattresses/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;There was a whole team of people involved in the build, Liam at Coalition vans https://instagram.com/coalitionvans?utm_medium=copy_link Along with @mule vans  and @The Beechwoods, and Harry at Supermoon Campers https://instagram.com/supermooncampers?utm_medium=copy_link&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We visited Idyea Cafe in Brighton, which is situated on North Laines &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please subscribe to the channel if you like the content youtube.com/c/thosehappydays &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Interested in Van Life, say hello on Instagram:-&amp;#10; https://www.instagram.com/thosehappy_days/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you would like promotional help then send us an email here vfooduk@gmail.com"
