    id 39
    label "YNilaLh2Zuo"
    step 0
    date "2020-03-01T14:00:11Z"
    title "WE DROVE 2000 KM FOR THIS | Van Life Africa"
    description "Week of Van Life in Africa | Driving 2000km for This! Was it Worth it?? &amp;#9658; CLICK to SUBSCRIBE so you never miss a video  http://bit.ly/2DDSUgu &amp;#128522;&amp;#10;OVERLANDING AFRICA IN OUR SPRINTER VAN | Our road trip through Morocco continues after our amazing experience with van life in the Sahara Desert. From there we decided it was time to make the HUGE trek to the African destination of our dreams! But, by kilometre 1555 we started asking ourselves... was this place really going to be worth it? &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10035; Eamon &amp;#38; Bec Products &amp;#10035;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; our handmade chai blends https://chaiwalachai.com/ &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; our plant-based cookbook https://www.eamonandbec.com/weekday-whip-ups &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; our beautiful photo filters https://www.eamonandbec.com/presets &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want updates in between videos? &amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Instagram https://instagram.com/eamonandbec&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What's in Our Camera Bag? &amp;#10;For a blog post on our camera gear click here: https://www.eamonandbec.com/blog/cameragear&amp;#10;Secret Weapon to our Steady Shots https://amzn.to/3c327xq&amp;#10;The Lens that Does it All https://amzn.to/2Tb88zq&amp;#10;Main Camera https://amzn.to/38X6fNw&amp;#10;How We Shoot a Timelapse https://amzn.to/2VgAOcQ&amp;#10;Our Flying Camera https://amzn.to/38U5TqB&amp;#10;Starting a Vlog? BEST CAMERA! https://amzn.to/32nTZmM&amp;#10;Favourite Vlogging Accessory https://amzn.to/2uoclHu&amp;#10;Camera Backpack https://amzn.to/3a3HnU7&amp;#10;The Go Pro Tool You NEED https://amzn.to/2w1DDUs&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Planning a Trip and/or Want to Follow our Route? Here's where we went in this week's van life vlog in Morocco:&amp;#10;1. Tantan to Dakhla (possible to drive in one long day!)&amp;#10;2. All camp spots were free &amp;#38; found on the app Park 4 Night &amp;#10;Welcome to Dakhla, a Kite Boarders Paradise &amp;#38; rated one of the top spots to kite board in the world!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FYI We took the ferry from Algeciras to Tangier Med and it cost each campervan 180 euros and took about 1.5 hours. Tangier Med is a relatively new port and is very well maintained which led to a seamless border crossing. To all those making the journey, GOOD LUCK and remember not to bring your drone!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Get a free trial of the best music: http://share.mscbd.fm/rebeccamoroney&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Catch up on our last adventures:&amp;#10;Van Life in the Sahara Desert&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XDbwVRvMjFY&amp;#10;The Reality of Van Life in Morocco &amp;#10;https://bit.ly/3bZKYVm&amp;#10;First Impressions of Van Life in Morocco &amp;#10;https://bit.ly/2Ht7OGU&amp;#10;Shipping Our Van to Africa | preparing for van life morocco &amp;#10;https://bit.ly/2SQ7hUu&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Van Squad &amp;#128656; &amp;#10;Alex @KiteVanMan &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128171; We are so excited to continue to share our favourite vegan supplement brand with you: Vivo Life! We've recently introduced their B12, Omega + Vitamin D supplements into our diet and loving it. Check out their full line up here http://bit.ly/2OKMNMy and use code EAMONANDBEC for 10% off at checkout &amp;#128171; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tour the renovations we've done to our self converted sprinter van:&amp;#10;VAN TOUR after 2 years living in our TINY HOUSE on wheels http://bit.ly/newvantour&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Looking for an all-inclusive, detailed van build guide?! Look no further!&amp;#10;https://thewanderful.co/?ref=eamonfit...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Things We Couldn't Live Without&amp;#10;Tooth Brush Holder https://amzn.to/2p1fIO9&amp;#10;Spice Jars https://amzn.to/2NxlTHY&amp;#10;Gimbal Fan https://amzn.to/2Qjlyae&amp;#10;Keep Cup http://bit.ly/beckeepcup&amp;#10;Fruit Hammock https://amzn.to/2QmLyBt&amp;#10;Essential Oils https://amzn.to/2oZFMJS&amp;#10;Car Diffuser https://bit.ly/2NkLjsI&amp;#10;Bug Screen https://amzn.to/2QmMjL0&amp;#10;Vitamix https://amzn.to/2BiW35r&amp;#10;Water Filter http://bit.ly/vanlifewaterfilter&amp;#10;Blinds http://www.vanmadegear.com/&amp;#10;Chaiwala Chai Kit https://chaiwalachai.com/&amp;#10;MAX TRAX https://amzn.to/2XBT8f9&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9644; Our Personal Instagrams &amp;#9644; &amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Instagram: &amp;#10;https://instagram.com/eh.mon&amp;#10;https://instagram.com/rebeccamoroney&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Who are we?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We're Eamon and Bec, a Toronto-based couple who live full-time in our self converted Sprinter Van!! SUBSCRIBE for wanderlust travel, behind the scenes of what it's really like to live in a van, and videos all about the yummy vegan food we make + eat! VAN LIFE COUPLE. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We post new videos every Sunday :)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our goal here is to inspire you to chase after your own dreams however big (or small... tiny homes anyone?) they may be! We hope to create a community of like-minded, positive individuals who will grow to love and support one another on their own journeys.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlifeafrica #vanlife #eamonandbec"
