    id 41
    label "BsoU_jJTOTc"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-13T13:00:07Z"
    title "WE ALMOST DIDNT MAKE IT! [GOCTA] - VAN LIFE PERU"
    description "We both almost quit.  After 3 years of living van life and 6 months after Snow's Total Knee Replacement, we find ourselves struggling to go on.  Gocta is the 3rd tallest waterfall in the world, but it is a 5-plus-mile rugged jungle hike to get up and close to the phenom of nature.  You will be surprised to know that Snow will be joining Curt on this epic hike.  The problem is, this is not a loop trail, which means if we make it there, we have to make it back.  Come join us on our 3rd Vanninversay as Snow pushes beyond her comfort zone.  This is going to be epic!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks always for all the beautiful support.  Love having you along for the adventures!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Cheers&amp;#10;Snow and Curt&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-----------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;FOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/snowandcurt/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;JOIN US ON FACEBOOK:&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/SnowAndCurt&amp;#10;&amp;#10;------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUPPORT OF OUR CONTENT IS MUCH APPRECIATED! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;JOIN OUR MEMBERSHIP PAGE&amp;#10;To help keep the wheels turning and get a guaranteed comment response, head over to our YouTube Membership Page, and JOIN. &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyrjbkxt4kBuVJJuqVTkylw/join&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ONE TIME DONATION&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/chilldaze&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SEE SOMETHING YOU LIKE IN OUR VAN? &amp;#10;Chances are you can find it in our Amazon Store. FYI... If you shop through our links, we will make a small commission, which is much appreciated! &amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/snowandcurt?ref=cm_sw_em_r_inf_own_snowandcurt_dp_2vFBlimcgwjcT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;--------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;LIKE OUR MUSIC? &amp;#10;We get it at Epidemic Sound. Here is a link to our Fav Van Life Traveler Tunes:&amp;#10;https://www.epidemicsound.com/playlist/6a9vimoh50lhx2jqoazmctz9cez466c2&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We also use MusicBox for our video music, you can visit their website here: https://www.musicbed.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you decide to join Epidemic Sound, Here is a Referral Link to save us a bit of cash towards one month of our subscription (THANKS):&amp;#10;https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/to9wvg/&amp;#10;----------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VISIT OUR WEBSITE&amp;#10;www.TheChillDaze.com"
