  [
    id 44
    label "11Pw_fi2TOg"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-25T15:00:01Z"
    title "HE LEFT ME! (First solo female van life)"
    description "Thanks to EcoFlow: EcoFlow US: https://us.ecoflow.com?aff=260 - My Husband has left me as a solo van life Mum as I look after my toddler in our van...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For more information&amp;#10;EcoFlow US: https://us.ecoflow.com?aff=260 &amp;#10;EcoFlow AU: https://au.ecoflow.com?aff=4&amp;#10;&amp;#10;From tailgate power to extreme blackouts that last for days on end, DELTA Pro delivers up to 25kWh of capacity. DELTA Pro also leads the industry when it comes to AC output. With 3600W you can power heavy-duty appliances such as dryers, AC units, and more.&amp;#8221;. &amp;#10;For more information, please visit: https://au.ecoflow.com Or find its local distributor next to your door:  http://www.cppower.com.au/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out the Heli-camping experience Stephen did: https://bit.ly/38KLABs&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#solofemaletravel #vanlife #solovanlife&amp;#10;----------------------------------------&amp;#173;&amp;#173;--&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Flying the Nest:&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Follow our Journey &amp;#8594; https://linktr.ee/flyingthenest&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Shop our Presets &amp;#8594; https://linktr.ee/flyingthenestshop&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Learn to edit videos for YouTube &amp;#8594; https://bit.ly/ftnacademyvideo&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Learn to grow your Instagram &amp;#8594; https://bit.ly/FTNacademyinstagram&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Sign up for our Weekly Coop Update email: https://bit.ly/2Xj573c &amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Our current camera + gear setup &amp;#8594; http://bit.ly/currentgear&amp;#10;&amp;#10;----------------------------------------&amp;#173;&amp;#173;--&amp;#10;0:00 Intro: Who are Flying the Nest? (Stephen, Jess &amp;#38; Hunter)&amp;#10;0:12 My Husband is leaving me alone in the van&amp;#10;0:28 Driving to Flinders Ranges, South Australia&amp;#10;0:32 Leaving the Van&amp;#10;1:04 Hopping onto a helicopter&amp;#10;1:14 Saying Goodbye&amp;#10;1:46 First time driving the van by myself&amp;#10;2:02 Issues with the van&amp;#10;2:48 Landing at the Chase Ranges&amp;#10;3:11 Surviving for the next 16 hours in the Aussie Outback&amp;#10;3:30 Finally fixing the van&amp;#10;3:55 Arriving at the Campground&amp;#10;4:46 Views from the Campground&amp;#10;5:15 Cooking as a Solo Van Life Mum&amp;#10;5:26 Campground Tour&amp;#10;6:17 Cooking Solo Female in a van&amp;#10;6:29 Making a campfire&amp;#10;6:56 Setting up the van&amp;#10;7:15 Enjoying Wine &amp;#38; the Views of the Flinders Ranges&amp;#10;8:01 Cooking with my Toddler&amp;#10;8:37 Cooking at the Camp&amp;#10;9:00 Cooking in the Van&amp;#10;9:38 Eating Dinner at the Camp&amp;#10;9:47 Dinner at the Van&amp;#10;10:02 Swag and camp tour&amp;#10;11:20 Van evening routine solo mum&amp;#10;11:41 Getting my sleeping bag ready&amp;#10;11:54 ??&amp;#10;12:12 Night Routine Toddler Van&amp;#10;12:25 Night in the Swag&amp;#10;12:38 Ad - EcoFlow&amp;#10;14:02 Waking up in the morning on top of the Chase Ranges&amp;#10;14:22 Morning Routine Van Solo Mum&amp;#10;15:02 Having Breakfast whilst waiting for the Helicopter&amp;#10;15:42 Issues starting the van again&amp;#10;16:24 Reunited as a family again&amp;#10;&amp;#10;----------------------------------------&amp;#173;&amp;#173;--&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHERE YOU CAN FIND US:&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Instagram &amp;#8594; https://linktr.ee/ftnInstagram&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Flying the Nesters Travel Community Group &amp;#8594; https://linktr.ee/FTNFacebook&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Twitter &amp;#8594; https://linktr.ee/ftntwitter&amp;#10;&amp;#8594;  Our Blog &amp;#8594;  https://linktr.ee/flyingthenestblog&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Listen to our Podcast &amp;#8594; https://linktr.ee/storiesflyingthenest&amp;#10;----------------------------------------&amp;#173;&amp;#173;-&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Where we get our music from &amp;#8594; http://share.mscbd.fm/flyingthenest&amp;#10;&amp;#10;----------------------------------------&amp;#173;&amp;#173;--&amp;#10;Hi, we are Stephen, Jess and little Hunter, a travelling van life family who self-converted their dream house on wheels - we now live full-time in our Sprinter van called Cooper as we do a full lap of our home Australia."
