  [
    id 57
    label "ZfAS4fSkd6Q"
    step 0
    date "2022-03-27T08:59:37Z"
    title "Our first impressions of Costa Rica (Tropical Van Life Begins!)"
    description "Woo hoo! We made it to COSTA RICA! &amp;#127796; &amp;#127464;&amp;#127479; Welcome to the first episode of our tropical van life series. Thank you to Athletic Greens for sponsoring this video! Click https://athleticgreens.com/JITS to get yourself a 12-month supply of vitamin D &amp;#38; 5 travel packs for free with your first order! &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are incredibly excited to take you along with us as we explore this stunning country. In this episode, we experience the differences between backpacking and camping through this landscape. In particular, we discover what it's like to travel in a 4x4 converted camper truck! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;As always, we truly appreciate having you here as part of our community! If you're new, be sure to subscribe so you don't miss upcoming episodes! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128075;&amp;#127996; &amp;#120284;&amp;#120289;&amp;#120294;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120282;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120288;: We post daily updates here: https://www.instagram.com/jits.into.the.sunset/&amp;#10;&amp;#127803; &amp;#120281;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120278;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120277;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120286;: Join our community: https://bit.ly/3mafxfw&amp;#10;&amp;#128155; Help support our filmmaking and unlock exclusive content by supporting us on &amp;#120291;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120289; https://www.patreon.com/jitsintothesunset&amp;#10;&amp;#10; - - -  &amp;#120297;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120279;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120290; &amp;#120278;&amp;#120283;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120291;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120294; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;00:00 Intro to our Tropical Van Life Series&amp;#10;01:40 Arriving in the Jungle&amp;#10;03:07 Cecropia Eco Lodge - Night Tour featuring frogs!&amp;#10;05:23 Exploring a Hidden Treasure&amp;#10;08:32 Backpacking vs. Van Life in Costa Rica&amp;#10;09:56 Crocodile Bridge&amp;#10;10:44 Hiring a 4x4 converted truck in Costa Rica&amp;#10;11:58 Why we recommend Athletic Greens! &amp;#10;13:46 First time Wild Camping in Costa Rica&amp;#10;16:53 Exploring Manuel Antonio National Park&amp;#10;19:11 Wild Camping at Playa Dominical &amp;#10;21:55 Still to come in our tropical van life series&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- - - - &amp;#120276; &amp;#120277;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120282; &amp;#120295;&amp;#120283;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120289;&amp;#120286; &amp;#120300;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120296; &amp;#120295;&amp;#120290;: &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;- Book your Jungle getaway and stay at Cecropia Eco-Lodge where our friends Jay &amp;#38; Nohe will make you feel right at home: cecropiaecolodge@gmail.com&amp;#10;- Rent your 4x4 camper from Nomad America: https://www.nomadamerica.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10; - - - - &amp;#120298;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120278;&amp;#120283; &amp;#120290;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120293; &amp;#120295;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120297;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120287; &amp;#120281;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120287;&amp;#120288;&amp;#120294; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;&amp;#128250; From Ireland to France to Iceland and everywhere in between! Watch our 16 travel films in Chronological Order: https://bit.ly/2USoi1I&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- - - - &amp;#120276; &amp;#120277;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120295; &amp;#120276;&amp;#120277;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120295; &amp;#120296;&amp;#120294; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;We are Tania &amp;#38; Adam and in Sep 2019, we left our busy lives in London to travel Europe in our 21-year-old campervan named Jitters aka Jits &amp;#128656; &amp;#128149; Living in a van &amp;#38; capturing our adventures through film &amp;#38; photography is our biggest creative endeavor yet. More than anything, we feel fortunate that in doing so, we have grown a wonderful &amp;#38; supportive travel-loving community. THANK YOU! More about us here: https://www.jitsintothesunset.com/about-us&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- - - - &amp;#120295;&amp;#120283;&amp;#120280; &amp;#120288;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120294;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120278; &amp;#120298;&amp;#120280; &amp;#120281;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120280; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;We use these two main music libraries - we love &amp;#38; recommend them both:&amp;#10;&amp;#10140;  ARTLIST: Get 2 months free off your annual membership when you use our referral link: https://bit.ly/2Uq3xOr&amp;#10;&amp;#10140; EPIDEMIC SOUND: Get a 30 Day Free Trial when you use our referral link: &amp;#10;https://bit.ly/3xS8o9I&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- - - - &amp;#120279;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120294;&amp;#120278;&amp;#120287;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120288;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120293; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;Where we could, we included our affiliate links, so that we may receive a very small microscopic commission, at no cost to you. It's a great way you can support our films for free. THANK YOU!"
