  [
    id 64
    label "j3eRAGKVLys"
    step 0
    date "2020-02-16T11:59:46Z"
    title "VAN LIFE SECURITY - 9 ESSENTIAL TIPS!"
    description "*Grab our brand new ebook now! https://www.theindieprojects.com/travel-the-nordics-guide-book*&amp;#10;Head to https://www.squarespace.com/INDIEPROJECTS to save 10% off your first purchase of a website or domain using code INDIEPROJECTS. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife security, it's important and not something to be taken lightly! Unfortunately, break-ins are common for many who travel in campervans/motorhomes/RVs etc... as most people are aware that people travelling will have goods with them, which might be valuable to a thief (when we were broken into in 2014 they even stole my make-up!). Check out our video where we talk about:&amp;#10;- Reolink CCTV - https://geni.us/blA4R&amp;#10;- Car Lock Tracker - https://geni.us/UUh7tD&amp;#10;- Wheel lock - https://geni.us/Ryys&amp;#10;- and many more!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;03:00 - CCTV&amp;#10;05:07 - Car Lock GPS tracker&amp;#10;06:18 - Wheel lock&amp;#10;06:40 - Closed Cab&amp;#10;09:00 - Slam locks&amp;#10;10:28 - Small windows&amp;#10;11:13 - Retractable ladder&amp;#10;12:00 - Lock box&amp;#10;12:20 - CCTV/Alarm stickers&amp;#10;&amp;#10;READ THE BLOG POST HERE: https://www.theindieprojects.com/blog/van-life-security&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127925;Enjoyed the music in this video? Download our playlist for free from Music Bed: http://share.mscbd.fm/indieprojectsplaylist&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW US!&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Instagram: http://instagram.com/TheIndieProjects &amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Facebook: http://facebook.com/theindieprojects&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Twitter: http://twitter.com/theindyprojects &amp;#10;&amp;#10;SHOP: www.theindieprojects.com/shop &amp;#10;&amp;#10;BLOG: http://theindieprojects.com/blog&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FILMING KIT:&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/filmingkit&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PODCAST:&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/IndieProjectsPodcast &amp;#10;&amp;#10;CONTACT: &amp;#10;contacttheindieprojects@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;*We use affiliate links which we earn a small percentage from qualifying purchases at no extra cost to you. We use these funds to feed our cat, who demands an abundance of cat soup (yes that&amp;#8217;s a real thing!)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Theo and Bee gave up their busy city lifestyles in 2014 to explore alternative living, and have lived in vans and boats since then without looking back! Along with their cat Ginjey Bear they are driving around the world in their self-converted Sprinter Van &amp;#128506;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#VanLifeSecurity #TravelSafety"
