    title "Self-converted Off-Grid Sprinter Van with Full Office, Bathroom, and Garage"
    description "#vanlife #sprintervantour #diysprintervan&amp;#10;&amp;#128656; SUBSCRIBE HERE &amp;#128656;: https://bit.ly/2SjRUBF&amp;#10;&amp;#128276;BE SURE TO HIT THE BELL TO BE NOTIFIED OF NEW VIDEOS!&amp;#128276;&amp;#10;&amp;#128247; FOLLOW ON INSTAGRAM HERE &amp;#128247; https://bit.ly/2Y13l4d&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;&amp;#127995; PATREON https://www.patreon.com/letsbeus &amp;#128072;&amp;#127995;&amp;#10;&amp;#128187; WEBSITE &amp;#128187;https://www.letsbe.us&amp;#10;&amp;#128296;OUR VAN BLUEPRINT&amp;#128296; https://lets-be-us.myshopify.com/collections/blueprints&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hey, #vanlife friends! Check out our van tour. We work full time from the road and have as many adventures along the way as we can.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10022;Get $40 off your first AirBNB reservation!&amp;#10022;&amp;#10;https://www.airbnb.com/c/saraa7699?currency=USD&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10022; Get a FREE trial of the best music for your videos!&amp;#10022;&amp;#10; (the same music we use in our videos!) &amp;#10;http://share.mscbd.fm/letsbeus&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OUR VLOGGING GEAR&amp;#10;camera: https://amzn.to/2DJ60I6&amp;#10;lens: https://amzn.to/2GZeRHS&amp;#10;tripod: https://amzn.to/2COM4mC&amp;#10;microphones: https://amzn.to/2FKcBCx&amp;#10;microphone adapters: https://amzn.to/2HP6QGV&amp;#10;drone: https://amzn.to/36726Frstabilizer: https://amzn.to/2PlahYR&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PRODUCTS USED IN OUR VAN:&amp;#10;Kitchen:&amp;#10;Paper Towel Holder - https://amzn.to/2REN6GS&amp;#10;Strainer - https://amzn.to/2qAvEI7&amp;#10;Fridge/Freezer - https://amzn.to/2E4UR3H&amp;#10;Stove &amp;#38; Oven - https://amzn.to/2F9tb1j&amp;#10;Fridge Vent - https://amzn.to/2F6WMbF&amp;#10;Faucet - https://amzn.to/2RErsCH&amp;#10;Knife Magnet - https://amzn.to/2SRgdbD&amp;#10;Cabinet Organizers - https://amzn.to/2RFgRr6&amp;#10;Magnetic Spice Jars - https://amzn.to/2qxnFvr&amp;#10;AeroPress kit - https://amzn.to/2JX9rwZ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Office:&amp;#10;Office Chairs - https://amzn.to/2RJgLyW&amp;#10;iMac 5k 27&amp;#34; - https://amzn.to/2XiGQZ7&amp;#10;iMac Mount - https://amzn.to/2QlP0fp&amp;#10;Secturity System - https://amzn.to/2PGgMWQ&amp;#10;Phone Mount - https://amzn.to/2JOHOWs&amp;#10;Bookshelf - https://amzn.to/2H4zMtj&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Bathroom:&amp;#10;Shower Faucet - https://amzn.to/2qB0bFH&amp;#10;Toliet - https://amzn.to/2SY5R9G&amp;#10;Shower Basket - https://amzn.to/2Du5244&amp;#10;Towel Hooks - https://amzn.to/2JOGQK5&amp;#10;Squeegee - https://amzn.to/2SXSZ3h&amp;#10;Fresh Water Tank - https://amzn.to/2Du1FtT&amp;#10;Water Heater - https://amzn.to/2RIiYdA&amp;#10;Water Pump - https://amzn.to/2RKfszA&amp;#10;Accumlator Tank - https://amzn.to/2PS8laS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Van:&amp;#10;Heater - https://amzn.to/2EvZCn4&amp;#10;Propane Tank - https://amzn.to/2RMA2PX&amp;#10;Fan - https://amzn.to/2D9mqKr&amp;#10;Signal Booster - https://amzn.to/2Ds8Rqm&amp;#10;Water Pump Switch - https://amzn.to/2QlP0fp&amp;#10;Slider Door Window - https://amzn.to/2JOqrW3&amp;#10;Back Door Windows - https://amzn.to/2OwOdXe&amp;#10;Ceiling Lights - https://amzn.to/2DcRglz&amp;#10;Light Switch - https://amzn.to/2SVOiae&amp;#10;Electrical Outlets - https://amzn.to/2PLYGmk&amp;#10;Fire / CO Dectector - https://amzn.to/2PQGCY4&amp;#10;Propane and CO Detector - https://amzn.to/2qDvGin&amp;#10;Inverter - https://amzn.to/2qBbRbH&amp;#10;Battery Monitor - https://amzn.to/2OA3Pt9&amp;#10;Solar Panels - https://amzn.to/2OBg3lc&amp;#10;Solar Panel Mounts - https://amzn.to/2SVNPF7&amp;#10;Solar Charge Controller - https://amzn.to/2DtRzsT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ABOUT US&amp;#10;Hey y'all! We're Chris + Sara, a husband and wife travel duo currently working and traveling full time with our pup, Kramer. We've always dreamed of traveling full time, and in May of 2018 we took the leap and made it happen! Today we're balancing work and fun everywhere between the Pacific and Atlantic. From hiking and cycling to tacos and coffee, we're trying to see and experience as much of this world as we can! While our home is currently on wheels in our DIY Sprinter van, our travels take us all around the world.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Be sure to hit subscribe here on Youtube and follow along on Instagram for more daily fun! Oh, and be sure to say hi while you're here. :)&amp;#10;________________________________&amp;#10;&amp;#10;**Some of the links above are affiliate links through Amazon&amp;#8217;s affiliate program, which means that if you choose to make a purchase, we will earn a small commission. This commission comes at no additional cost to you. All of the products we have linked to are products we use and can truly recommend. Please do not spend any money on these products unless you feel you need them or that they will help you achieve your goals.**"
