  [
    id 69
    label "m8mmC3tyQ_I"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-13T23:00:12Z"
    title "Its too hot for van life"
    description "It's way too hot to be living in a van. It's way too hot to be hiking and way too hot to be cooking. We are doing all of that anyways while we are in this Colorado heat wave. Maybe it's not even a heatwave and it's just summer, idk. This would be a full day of complaining (next hit video!?) but we have our sweet zero breeze to cool us and the dogs off before we head to higher ground.&amp;#10;vlog 174 | 7/9/22&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want to stay cool?&amp;#10;https://www.zerobreeze.com/products/zero-breeze-mark-2&amp;#10;LostRenegades - $50 off orders of min. $599 (Mark 2 and batteries), valid till 7/12/23&amp;#10;&amp;#10;JOIN THE RENEGADE BRIGADE FOR COOL SHIT&amp;#10;we spent this money on cool shit to send you in the mail (and beer)&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/lostrenegades&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHO ARE WE?&amp;#10;We're Jenn and Charlie and this not your average vlog. We like a good time and we like sharing exactly who we are, maybe too much of who we are. Charlie is the funny, sly guy while Jenn is loud and crazy. We are not trying to save the world one day at a time, more like crack a beer and live life one day at a time. We gave up what was a regular unfulfilling life in New York to search the world for shit that seems like fun and give our two dogs the best life they could ever imagine. Bored with everyone's fake vlogs? Maybe you'll like us...maybe you won't.&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X9QWyXXtEj8&amp;#38;t=126s&amp;#10;#lostrenegades #vlog #vanlife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CONTACT&amp;#10;lostrenegadesvan@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Jenn &amp;#38; Charlie Curcio&amp;#10;4940 Merrick road suite 171&amp;#10;Massapequa Park, NY 11762&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/lost.renegades&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/lostchazz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;INTRO- Fall by Cospe&amp;#10;OUTRO- Feeling Crazy by Layn&amp;#10;&amp;#10;and always remember &amp;#34;phones off, friends on&amp;#34; &amp;#10;-Christina, the wise."
    channeltitle "Lost Renegades"
    channelid "UCoXOKfFqGBOlqMaWL1xb-pg"
