  [
    id 70
    label "rzATsR_Qdow"
    step 0
    date "2018-06-27T21:43:25Z"
    title "Van Life - Couple Travels Over 20 Countries While Living in Camper Vans"
    description "Brittany and Drew from Mr and Mrs Adventure have spent an incredible 3 years living full-time in different vans while travelling across the USA, Canada, and most of mainland Europe.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;To follow their van life journey, check out their YouTube, Instagram, and blog here:&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9fSBF61eAEI2JOcFrM2Mng&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/mrandmrsadventure/&amp;#10;https://mrandmrsadventure.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;They've travelled to: Canada, USA, England, France, Ireland, Scotland, Croatia, Sweden, Denmark, Senegal, Italy, Morocco, Germany, Portugal, Spain, Montenegro, and more!!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The couple spent their first year on the road in a Sprinter van borrowed from Drew's parents, and they bought their second van in Europe: a right hand drive Ford Transit.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;They earn money on the road through Drew's management work for a doctor in the US.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;They have to carefully plan their travels because as Americans, they can only visit certain countries in Europe for 90 days at a time because of the Schengen Agreement, and then they have to leave the Schengen zone for 90 days.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The couple says that van life has completely changed their lives and their relationship, and despite some of the challenges they want to continue living in vans, so when they're ready to head back to the US, they plan to sell their van in Europe and convert a different van in the US to continue their van life adventures.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks for watching!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Mat &amp;#38; Danielle&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;STAY IN TOUCH!&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Blog: www.exploringalternatives.ca&amp;#10;Facebook: /exploringalternativesblog&amp;#10;Instagram: @exploringalternatives&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;COMMENTS&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We want our channel and our comments section to be an inclusive space where everyone feels welcome to watch and to contribute.  For this reason, comments that are inappropriate or hateful will be reported and/or deleted.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please discuss and debate with respect, and report inappropriate or hateful comments directly to YouTube.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;SUBTITLES AND CLOSED CAPTIONS&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;A very special thank you to our subtitle and closed captions contributors! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you would like to contribute subtitles or closed captions to an Exploring Alternatives video, please click here to see which ones need your help:&amp;#10;http://www.youtube.com/timedtext_cs_panel?c=UC8EQAfueDGNeqb1ALm0LjHA&amp;#38;tab=2&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;SPONSORS&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We occasionally include paid sponsor messages/integrations in our videos to help fund the channel.  We do our best to work with companies and organizations that offer products or services that are in line with our values, and that we think would be interesting and useful to our viewers.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We will always disclose if we&amp;#8217;re promoting products that were given to us for free, or if we&amp;#8217;re including a sponsored message in our video.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For business or sponsorship inquiries, please email us at danielle.is.exploring@gmail.com &amp;#10;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;VIDEO CREDITS&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music &amp;#38; Song Credits: &amp;#10;All music in this video was composed, performed, and recorded by Mat of Exploring Alternatives.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Editing Credits:&amp;#10;Mat and Danielle of Exploring Alternatives&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Filming Credits:&amp;#10;Drew and Brittany from Mr and Mrs Adventure&amp;#10;YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC9fSBF61eAEI2JOcFrM2Mng&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/mrandmrsadventure/"
    channeltitle "Exploring Alternatives"
