  [
    id 73
    label "2ucBTKaEPMc"
    step 0
    date "2022-06-05T08:03:08Z"
    title "After A Year Of Living In A Van, This Really Shocked Us! (Northumberland)"
    description "We've just spent the last week on our favourite UK beach park ups, doing van life in the incredible Northumberland (UK), but how does it compare to the NC500 (North Coast 500, Scotland)?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We have been living in a van in the UK now for over a year, and this place truly shocked us...it was simply magnificent &amp;#10;&amp;#10;The Northumberland Coast is one of the best campervan road trips in Britain. We started the trip off at Blast Beach, Seaham, Teeside. We then drove into Northumberland to Blyth, followed by Cresswell Beach, Amble Marina, Warkworth Castle, Alnmouth, Alnwick (where Harry Potter &amp;#38; Hogwarts films were set, and Robin Hood Prince of Thieves), Lower Newton, Seahouses (where we saw puffins), Bamburgh, Holy Island/Lindisfarne, and then Cheswick Beach near Berwick.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Did you know that Northumberland has a similar NC500 route? It's called the NL250 and we intend to drive the other half of it on the way back down&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join this channel to get access to perks:&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqRs-3IcoKCMGXsfLvOgTUg/join&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you like our content, please subscribe to our channel for weekly content&amp;#10;youtube.com/c/thosehappydays&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We also post daily updates on Instagram, please come and say Hi over there:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/thosehappy_days/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For Collabs or Promos, please contact us via our email hello@thosehappydays.co.uk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please check out our new website thosehappydays.co.uk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OUR AMAZON SHOP - USE THE LINK TO SEE ITEMS WE USE IN OUR VAN &amp;#38; VIDEOS&amp;#10;Some of the items/gadgets/foods/drinks we use in the videos, and in our campervan are available on our Amazon shop here https://www.amazon.co.uk/shop/thosehappydays?ref=inf_own_thosehappydays&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you are Interested in Veganism or Plant Based Food, then check out these links:- &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127856;&amp;#127856; Our Vegan Food Website:&amp;#10;https://veganfooduk.co.uk/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127829;&amp;#127829;Find the latest vegan food on our Instagram:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/vegan_food_uk/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you want daily news about vegan food then please Check out our Facebook Page: https://www.facebook.com/veganfooduk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128055;&amp;#128020;&amp;#128004;&amp;#128017;&amp;#128007;&amp;#128054;&amp;#128572;&amp;#128044;&amp;#128032;&amp;#128012;&amp;#10;If you are interested in veganism or plant-based food, please Join our Facebook Group &amp;#38; Community: https://www.facebook.com/groups/VeganFoodUK"
    channeltitle "Those Happy Days"
