    id 75
    label "q8xSdySw8kc"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-10T15:00:33Z"
    title "Life, Van Life, and Baby Updates..."
    description "We've missed you all. Hope to see you over here more frequently again.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We've been gone a while. Mariajos&amp;#233;'s pregnancy hasn't been the easiest, but she's in the 3rd trimester now and finally starting to feel a little more like herself, only with swollen hands, feet, and new pains and discomforts by the day.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our shop is finished, and we JUST got power turned on. We're waiting on final inspections before we start putting building equipment and tools in it, and we're sharing the space with my parent's 40' fifth wheel and appliances for their house. So to say it's a little tight in the shop would be a slight understatement.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We've bought another van. We have 4 vans on the property now... haha... &amp;#10;&amp;#10;More to come with all of that. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Life is good.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Need help with your van build or like our layout? We've got you covered!: https://bit.ly/vanbuildguide&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We participate in the Amazon Influencer Program and others affiliate programs listed below. We earn affiliate commissions from Amazon and other retailers for qualifying purchases associated with our Amazon storefront and all links listed below.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We've curated a list of items that will make your rv, bus, or van conversion so much better!: https://Amazon.com/shop/Tioaventurabus &amp;#10;&amp;#10;The best windows covers for sprinter vans: https://bit.ly/2ECuRRH&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Business or brand wanting to work together?&amp;#10;&amp;#9993;  Email Us: Zaira@thestation.io&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us on Instagram for behind the scenes content: https://www.instagram.com/tioaventuravan/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/tioaventura&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Inspired? Support our work: https://www.patreon.com/TioAventura&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Heard our Podcast?:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Apple: https://apple.co/3dp7JTj&amp;#10;Spotify: https://spoti.fi/2WJd5Tu&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We're Mariajos&amp;#233; and Chase. In 2018 we sold our house in Nashville, Tennessee, moved into our self-converted school bus  #buslife and took off traveling the United States. We sold our bus, bought a new-to-us Sprinter Van #vanlife and we're doing it all over again. If you're new to our channel, subscribe &amp;#38; stick around. We're excited to have you here. If you enjoy our videos please let us know, give us a like and drop a comment down below. If our videos just aren't for you, we understand and hope you find what you're looking for somewhere else! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #vanliferocks #digitalnomad"
    channeltitle "T&amp;#237;o Aventura"
