    title "SHOCKING $200k Van Life Tour - 4x4 Mercedes Sprinter with Unlimited Power  Home Automation"
    description "Van Life Tour of Mercedes Sprinter Passenger Van with 4x4, UNLIMITED POWER, Queen Size Murphy Bed, Home Automation, Expandable Shower. This luxury camper takes living in a van to a whole new level. True Van invited us out Yosemite National Park to test out there brand new Vision X concept. This $200,000 Mercedes Sprinter Passenger Van 2500 will leave you Speechless. This luxury van has home automation where you can control everything like A/C, Heat, Lights, fresh water, with your smartphone. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#129327;&amp;#128656; Check Out TrueVan: https://truevan.com/&amp;#10;(Revolutionary Mercedes Sprinter Van Conversions)&amp;#10;&amp;#128241;TrueVan Instagram: https://bit.ly/3y80vO5&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128187; Website: theothersidevlog.com&amp;#10;&amp;#128656; Van Life Essentials: https://www.theothersidevlog.com/van-life&amp;#10;&amp;#128561; Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/theotherside_vlog/&amp;#10;&amp;#128525; TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@theotherside_vlog?lang=en&amp;#10;&amp;#128233; Email: othersidevlog@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tools and services we recommend:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127925;The copyright-free music we use in all our videos: https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/fjzme2/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128202;The tool we use for youtube research &amp;#38; stats:&amp;#10;https://vidiq.com/#_l_22d&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128213;The book that will get you started on Youtube:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2kCUZlj&amp;#10;&amp;#10;.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#VanLife&amp;#10;#MercedesSprinter&amp;#10;#VanConversion&amp;#10;&amp;#10;.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WE ARE A PARTICIPANT IN THE AMAZON SERVICES LLC ASSOCIATES PROGRAM, AN AFFILIATE ADVERTISING PROGRAM DESIGNED TO PROVIDE A MEANS FOR US TO EARN FEES BY LINKING TO AMAZON.COM AND AFFILIATED SITES."
