  [
    id 91
    label "ARfMk1rZlto"
    step 0
    date "2020-10-04T15:00:05Z"
    title "Van Life France | Our 2 Month Roadtrip from The Pyrenees to The French Alps | Europe Travel Ep 9"
    description "We absolutely fell in love with France! We spent two months road-tripping from the Pyrenees to the French Alps. Our original plan was to road trip France in two weeks but we were simply blown away by its beauty and in true Jits fashion, we took our time and indulged in slow travel. We are delighted to have you join along with us. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thumbs up if you enjoy our film and as always, thank you to all our 15.6k subscribers!! We are so grateful and proud to have grown a little community through our corner on YouTube. Whether you&amp;#8217;re a long-time subscriber or relatively new&amp;#8230; we love hearing from you in our comments. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Liking, commenting and sharing our films nudges YouTube to share our channel with others, and helps us grow! It's the best way you can support us to continue. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128656; &amp;#128149; Lots of love from the three of us, &amp;#10;Tania, Adam &amp;#38; Jitters!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; Check out Chesca &amp;#38; Ben's YouTube Channel (Overlanding Sophia) - They are now planning to travel from Cornwall (UK) to Capetown (Africa)! : www.youtube.com/overlandingsophia &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;..&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;..&amp;#10;&amp;#10;|| &amp;#10024; IF YOU APPRECIATE JITS &amp;#38; HER RUSTY BITS &amp;#10024; ||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128077;&amp;#127996; THUMBS UP if you enjoy our films &amp;#38; want to help YouTube take notice of us&amp;#10;&amp;#127775; SUBSCRIBE to our channel to join our community &amp;#38; help us grow: https://bit.ly/ilovejitters&amp;#10;&amp;#128155; SUPPORT us on PATREON &amp;#38; unlock exclusive updates &amp;#38; videos: https://www.patreon.com/jitsintothesunset&amp;#10;&amp;#128075;&amp;#127996; INSTAGRAM: Come say hi, we love hearing from you (tag us)!: https://bit.ly/3lbSsrv&amp;#10;&amp;#127803; FACEBOOK: Join our community (we also have a private over 50s group!): https://bit.ly/3mafxfw&amp;#10;&amp;#128248; BLOG: A detailed tour of our filmmaking equipment: https://bit.ly/cameraequipment&amp;#10;&amp;#127470;&amp;#127466; BLOG: Read our Ultimate Van Life Ireland Guide: https://bit.ly/vanlifeireland&amp;#10;&amp;#127926; PLAYLIST: Listen to our Road Trip favourites: https://spoti.fi/3kz5yij&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;..&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;..&amp;#10;&amp;#10;|| &amp;#128071;&amp;#127996; IF YOU ENJOYED THIS FILM &amp;#128071;&amp;#127996; ||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128250; WATCH Our Full Travel Series - 14 episodes in chronological order: https://bit.ly/2USoi1I&amp;#10;Or choose below from our full list of films:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;1. &amp;#127909; Van Life Ireland Part 1: https://youtu.be/UNkG7Ofwqi4&amp;#10;2. &amp;#127909; Van Life Ireland Part 2: https://youtu.be/kYar142Ws3Y&amp;#10;3. &amp;#127909; Van Life Ireland Part 3: https://youtu.be/I_TDLsUDdvU&amp;#10;4. &amp;#127909; Van Life Northern Ireland: https://youtu.be/kkzbrV_zMi4&amp;#10;5. &amp;#127909; Van Life Scotland: https://youtu.be/cLzkYdg4XtE&amp;#10;6. &amp;#127909; Van Life Portugal (Life before Lockdown): https://youtu.be/UpbMkcDrdbw&amp;#10;7. &amp;#127909; Van Life Lockdown on a Portuguese Farm during a Global Pandemic: https://youtu.be/Monw3vfC1rM&amp;#10;8. &amp;#127909; Van Life Spain: https://youtu.be/0SOJOaoxP7I&amp;#10;9. &amp;#127909; Van Life France: https://youtu.be/ARfMk1rZlto&amp;#10;10. &amp;#127909; Van Life Switzerland: https://youtu.be/FdOeI6-q_pE&amp;#10;11. &amp;#127909; Van Life Italy: https://youtu.be/TOMwRzs6ia4 &amp;#10;12. &amp;#127909; Van Life Wales with  @Kinging- It  : https://youtu.be/TrzBGY7fOAQ&amp;#10;13. &amp;#127909; Van Life on the Welsh Coast: https://youtu.be/FV4Mxo7zl2M&amp;#10;14. &amp;#127909; Van Life Iceland: https://youtu.be/lnVnsG_Q8o0&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;..&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;..&amp;#10;&amp;#10;|| &amp;#128656;  A BIT ABOUT JITTERS AKA. JITS &amp;#128656; || &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Jitters is a Peugeot Boxer Autosleeper Conversion. She was born in 1999 &amp;#38; is a 'Symphony' Model. Jits belonged to Adam's mum, Sally, who sadly passed away in Jan 2019 from ovarian cancer. During this time, we were reminded how life is too short and felt inspired to take the plunge &amp;#38; pursue our dream of full-time van life.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128250; WATCH OUR VAN TOUR where we show you Jits' smart &amp;#38; modular design, in hope that she may serve as inspiration for your own van build research: https://youtu.be/Nx1x5mXYYy0 &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;..&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;..&amp;#10;&amp;#10;|| &amp;#128105;&amp;#127997; A BIT ABOUT US &amp;#129492;&amp;#127995; || &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are Tania (Irish) &amp;#38; Adam (English) &amp;#38; in Sep 2019, we left our busy lives in London to travel Europe in our 21-year-old campervan named Jitters aka Jits &amp;#128656; &amp;#128149; Living in a van &amp;#38; capturing our adventures through film &amp;#38; photography is a dream come true - it's our biggest creative endeavour yet. And more than anything, we feel so fortunate that in doing so, we have managed to grow such a wonderful &amp;#38; supportive travel-loving community. THANK YOU! More about us here: https://www.jitsintothesunset.com/about-us&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;..&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;..&amp;#10;&amp;#10;|| FAQ &amp;#8211; OUR FILMMAKING KIT ||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9999;&amp;#65039; BLOG: Read a detailed tour of our camera equipment including our tips &amp;#38; other recommendations: https://bit.ly/cameraequipment. Quick Links: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9675; Adam&amp;#8217;s Camera: https://amzn.to/3dGKbIA&amp;#10;&amp;#9675; Tania&amp;#8217;s Camera: https://amzn.to/381dsMR&amp;#10;&amp;#9675; Waterproof Action Camera: https://amzn.to/31alSPn&amp;#10;&amp;#9675; Aerial Shots/Drone: https://amzn.to/3evQPCu &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;..&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;..&amp;#10;&amp;#10;|| &amp;#127925; THE MUSIC WE FEATURE &amp;#127925; || &amp;#10;We use these two main music libraries - we love &amp;#38; recommend them both:&amp;#10;&amp;#9675;  ARTLIST: Get 2 months free off your annual membership when you use our referral link: https://bit.ly/2Uq3xOr&amp;#10;&amp;#9675;  EPIDEMIC SOUND: Get a 30 Day Free Trial when you use our referral link: &amp;#10;https://bit.ly/3xS8o9I&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The above are affiliate links, so we may receive a very small, microscopic commission, at no cost to you. It's a way you can support our films. THANK YOU!"
