  [
    id 92
    label "yNEAOGqDe1I"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-25T21:00:32Z"
    title "Van Life is Back! Hitting the Road in Our Storyteller Overland MODE LT"
    description "After a break from camper van life, we are back in a Ford Transit camper van fully converted by Storyteller Overland. Save 20% on your system and your first month is free when you sign up for interactive monitoring. Visit https://SimpliSafe.com/RUSSOS to learn more! &amp;#10;The Storyteller Overland MODE LT is built on the Transit AWD 350 chassis with seating for four, indoor and outdoor shower, portable toilet, and a lithium battery system that can run the roof mounted AC, microwave, refrigerator and induction cooktop. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Official Website https://weretherussos.com&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Newsletter http://bit.ly/wtrsignup&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Books https://weretherussos.com/books/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Joe and Kait have been traveling in various adventure based campers since 2015. For travel destinations, camper guides, essential gear and tips from the road visit https://weretherussos.com and youtube.com/weretherussos&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9442;&amp;#9444;&amp;#9425;&amp;#9442;&amp;#9426;&amp;#9441;&amp;#9432;&amp;#9425;&amp;#9428; &amp;#38; Turn on Notifications for New Videos&amp;#10;http://www.youtube.com/subscription_center?add_user=weretherussos&amp;#10;&amp;#10;=========================&amp;#10;&amp;#169; We're the Russos, LLC 2022. All Rights Reserved.&amp;#10;=========================&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- Disclosures -&amp;#10;We&amp;#8217;re the Russos is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com."
