    step 0
    date "2021-07-21T13:00:19Z"
    title "Van Life Paris  We Slept Under the Eiffel Tower! // Europe Ep 2"
    description "Living in a van in Paris, France was actually easier than we thought! We found the most incredible parking spots and vegan french food. We even slept right under the Eiffel Tower!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUBSCRIBE - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC5bzfokDRn3iXsjwkyHHEAg?sub_confirmation=1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Raya&amp;#10;Youtube // https://www.youtube.com/rayawashere&amp;#10;Twitter // https://twitter.com/rayawashere&amp;#10;Instagram // http://instagram.com/rayawashere&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Louis &amp;#10;Youtube // https://www.youtube.com/funforlouis&amp;#10;Twitter // https://twitter.com/louiscole&amp;#10;Instagram // http://instagram.com/louiscole&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MUSIC FOR VIDEOS (Best website for Youtubers!) &amp;#8594; http://bit.ly/2Hy3fNI&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks to music from&amp;#10;https://soundcloud.com/conoralbert&amp;#10;https://soundcloud.com/daytoner&amp;#10;https://soundcloud.com/dcuttermusic&amp;#10;-----&amp;#10;Thanks for watching our couple's channel! This channel is a space for us to share more of our relationship with you, lessons we're learning and tools we're using to grow closer and to communicate better. We're excited to share couple travel vlogs, life update vlogs (maybe one day even our kids?), relationship advice videos and so much more! Subscribe to follow our journey!"
