  [
    id 98
    label "WA26ItyG3Ik"
    step 0
    date "2022-02-27T09:00:13Z"
    title "Experiencing THE DANGERS Of Living In A Campervan (Winter Van Life UK)"
    description "#VanLifeUK This week we Experienced the real dangers of Living in a campervan in the UK, doing winter van life&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this episode we travel from Barnsley to Gloucestershire visiting Stroud, Gloucester, Cheltenham and the NEC Campervan show in Birmingham &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We also return to see the updates and build of our new #tinyhome on wheels, the luton conversion, to see how it's getting on (are we almost finished)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The main dangers we Experience in Winter doing #vanlife is the weather! The strong winds have brought down many trees, and having Storm Dudley, Eunice, Franklyn and Gladys all in one week left caused flooding and other extreme weather &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We literally have never seen anything like it!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you like our content, please subscribe to our channel&amp;#10;youtube.com/c/thosehappydays &amp;#10;&amp;#10;And we post regular updates on our Instagram throughout the week Instagram.com/thosehappy_days&amp;#10;&amp;#10;There was a whole team of people involved in the build, Liam at Coalition vans https://instagram.com/coalitionvans?utm_medium=copy_link Along with @mule vans  and @The Beechwoods, and Harry at Supermoon Campers https://instagram.com/supermooncampers?utm_medium=copy_link&amp;#10;&amp;#10;@Roaming Radfords were the guys doing the speech at the NEC Campervan Show&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The New wheels are from Rogue Alloys https://www.roguealloy.co.uk/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The new hatch going onto the roof of the campervan is a SkyMaxx, bit of a game changer for us, and comes in two sizes, compatible with roof thicknesses 23-60mm. Here is a link with locations to find one yourself&amp;#160;https://leisurevehicleservices.co.uk/where-to-buy/&amp;#160;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We mentioned Ecotree Lithium in our video, here is there Link https://ecotreelithium.co.uk/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Sometimes we get viewers who want to donate to our channel to keep it going, if you would like to do that then here is our PayPal Link https://www.paypal.me/veganfooduk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Interested in Van Life and Those Happy Days? Come say hello on Instagram where we do regular updates throughout the week&amp;#10; https://www.instagram.com/thosehappy_days/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you would like promotional help or to collaborate with us then please send us an email here vfooduk@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Interested in Plant Based Food, check out these links:- &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127856;&amp;#127856; Our Vegan Food Website:&amp;#10;https://veganfooduk.co.uk/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127829;&amp;#127829;Find the latest vegan food on our Instagram:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/vegan_food_uk/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#129363;&amp;#129363;Check out our Facebook Page for all vegan food: https://www.facebook.com/veganfooduk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128055;&amp;#128020;&amp;#128004;&amp;#128017;&amp;#128007;&amp;#128054;&amp;#128572;&amp;#128044;&amp;#128032;&amp;#128012;&amp;#10;Join our Facebook Group &amp;#38; Community: https://www.facebook.com/groups/VeganFoodUK"
    channeltitle "Those Happy Days"
