    id 102
    label "_DC8g_NxwmU"
    step 0
    date "2022-04-26T14:00:40Z"
    title "Van Life In The Arctic - Part THREE - Living The Van Life"
    description "Living The Van Life **SWAG** - CLICK HERE - https://www.livingthevanlife.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Van Life In The Arctic - PART THREE - Winter Content has always been a huge hit here on Living The Van Life.  This winter season, I just was not satisfied with driving to a snowy parking lot and setting up camp.  So instead I decided to see what it would take to live in a van in the extreme climate of the arctic.  Join me in part 3 of a 3 part series as I drive my 2020 Mercedes 4x4 Sprinter Van to the Arctic Ocean.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Support The LTVL Channel:&amp;#10;--------------&amp;#10;Paypal: https://www.paypal.me/livingthevanlife&amp;#10;Patreon:  https://www.patreon.com/LivingTheVanLife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow me:&amp;#10;Van Life Instagram: @LivingTheVanLife&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/livingthevanlife/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Personal Instagram: @chad_derosa&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/chad_derosa/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My Current Film Production - &amp;#8220;Rockets and Titans&amp;#8221;:&amp;#10;YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaekVy98pF50VoCwWHwl2ZA&amp;#10;Instagram:  https://www.instagram.com/rocketsandtitans/   &amp;#10;Facebook:  https://www.facebook.com/rocketsandtitans/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The gear I use while Living The Van Life:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Battle Born Off-Grid Battery System:&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;Battle Born GC2 LiFePo4 Batteries:  https://bit.ly/3t24Gaj&amp;#10;Victron Inverter/Charger: https://bit.ly/3eTNuif&amp;#10;Victron Distributor: https://bit.ly/3vjPuqu&amp;#10;Victron Solar Controller: https://bit.ly/3t0YLCm&amp;#10;Secondary Alternator: https://bit.ly/32XIFPc&amp;#10;Wakespeed Alternator Regulator: https://bit.ly/3xGeUkf&amp;#10;Battle Born Batteries Affiliate Link:  http://battlebornbatteries.com?afmc=Living+The+Van+Life&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FlareSpace Flares:&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;Full Flare/Bed Package: https://bit.ly/3nCAQYH&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Van Compass Lift, Suspension, Skid Plates&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;Stage 6.3 2&amp;#8221; Lift and Shocks: https://bit.ly/3gNdEFW&amp;#10;Rear Diff Skid Plate: https://bit.ly/3nxtHcb&amp;#10;Engine Skid Plate: https://bit.ly/3vrVa1z&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Wheels &amp;#38; Tires:&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;Trailbuilt Off-Road: https://bit.ly/3xA2Vof&amp;#10;315/70r17 BFGoodrich KO2 All Terrain Tires: https://bit.ly/3xx91ph&amp;#10;ARB Air Compressor: https://amzn.to/3u4QOgB&amp;#10;Speedflate Inflate/Deflate System (preferred): https://bit.ly/3nwrhdL&amp;#10;Staun Tire Deflators: https://amzn.to/3aOhCu2&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Off-Road Recovery Gear:&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;Warn Winch: https://amzn.to/3dZ6rkc&amp;#10;Snatch Block: https://amzn.to/3dZcqFu&amp;#10;8&amp;#8217; Tree Saver: https://amzn.to/3u1clXu&amp;#10;MaxTrax Recovery Boards: https://amzn.to/2PvqcGw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Off-Road Lighting:&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;Baja Designs LP9 Pro LED: https://amzn.to/3gRG5lV&amp;#10;Baja Designs XL Pro LED: https://amzn.to/3nwxcQ1&amp;#10;Rigid Industries Scene Lights: https://amzn.to/3nwxcQ1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Camp Fire &amp;#38; Cooking Equipment:&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;NEW: Matthew Paul Ankou Knife: https://www.mpknives.com&amp;#10;Esee 5 Surival Knife: https://amzn.to/3fnQSkQ&amp;#10;Solo Stove Ranger - Portable Fire Pit: https://amzn.to/36JD28f&amp;#10;Lodge Dutch Oven Tripod: https://amzn.to/3gnqgjy&amp;#10;8&amp;#34; Dutch Oven: https://amzn.to/3ilGFH7&amp;#10;Cooking Gloves: https://amzn.to/2BXdIjU&amp;#10;Jetboil Cooking System: https://amzn.to/2TH3yrF&amp;#10;Bottle Top Propane Stove: https://amzn.to/2SS82P0&amp;#10;Solo Stove Titan - Twig Stove: https://amzn.to/3cbYAeZ&amp;#10;Solo Stove Pot 1800: https://amzn.to/3gxNioK&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Forestry Tools:&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;Trayvax Trek Field Knife - 10% Coupon Code: VANLIFE - https://bit.ly/2BpqaJh&amp;#10;Esee 5 Surival Knife: https://amzn.to/3fnQSkQ&amp;#10;Schrade SCHF9 Camp Knife:  https://amzn.to/2Mwr7Ru&amp;#10;21&amp;#34; Folding Saw: https://amzn.to/2RQjFmO&amp;#10;Campcraft Canvas Sheath: https://amzn.to/2T4aJMr&amp;#10;Gransfors Bruk Hand Hatchet:  https://amzn.to/2SFqLMg&amp;#10;Hults Bruk Akka Foresters Axe: https://amzn.to/2tQx6LD&amp;#10;BareBones Living - Japanese Nata Tool: https://bit.ly/2yHBXRL&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My Cold Weather Clothing:&amp;#10;--------------&amp;#10;Fjallraven Pants:  https://amzn.to/3fnwDn4&amp;#10;Fjallraven Jacket: https://amzn.to/2L2BYm7&amp;#10;Fjallraven Hat: https://amzn.to/2SEj6xE&amp;#10;Marmot Down Coat: https://amzn.to/2Wuol4h&amp;#10;Base Layer Bottoms: https://amzn.to/3b8XvUL&amp;#10;Base Layer Top: https://amzn.to/2YC2xGB&amp;#10;WoolX Socks: https://amzn.to/2W5hf7i&amp;#10;Sorel Winter Boots: https://amzn.to/3fpVirp&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OLight Flashlights: 10% off Coupon Code : VanLife&amp;#10;https://olight.idevaffiliate.com/idevaffiliate.php?id=477&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Winter Van Equipment:&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;-&amp;#10;5KW 12V Diesel Heater: https://amzn.to/2OSFrGC&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Personal Wear:&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;Oakley Sunglasses: https://amzn.to/2Y7URcu&amp;#10;Carhartt Pants: https://amzn.to/2CvdbTM&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Fishing Gear&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;-&amp;#10;Redington Fly Rod:  https://amzn.to/33imvoR&amp;#10;Tackle Shoulder Bag: https://amzn.to/35R1XWT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My Camera Gear&amp;#10;--------------&amp;#10;Canon EOS R5 Camera: https://amzn.to/3t8czLq&amp;#10;Canon EOS RCamera (Backup): https://amzn.to/3u1dUVm&amp;#10;Canon RF 24-105 f/4L Lens: https://amzn.to/3e30UJa&amp;#10;Rode VideoMic Pro Plus: https://amzn.to/2PfKTjC&amp;#10;DJI Mavic 2 Zoom Drone: https://amzn.to/3nuaBnc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Living The Van Life YouTube Channel is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program,&amp;#10;&amp;#8203;an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com &amp;#10;FTC Disclosure Statement:&amp;#10;Some links on this youtube channel may be affiliate links. We may get paid if you buy something or take an action after clicking one of these."
