    id 110
    label "7XrymquihYE"
    step 0
    date "2020-03-28T13:00:08Z"
    title "VAN LIFE in a PANDEMIC | trapped in South America"
    description "VAN LIFE in a PANDEMIC | we're trapped in South America // Follow us on instagram: https://instagram.com/thematneys_ for daily updates during this quarantine. // Buy our course: https://thematneys.co/course&amp;#10;&amp;#10;As this global pandemic has hit the world, we find ourselves in South America. Thankfully, Argentina, the country we're in, has acted quickly, instilling a quarantine with only a few hundred cases. But, that means that very few travelers were able to leave the country before the lockdown began, even if they wanted to. As vanlifers, we are fortunate to have our home with us, but we don't have an address. Thankfully, a local hostel has let us park in the back and use their facilities, making it possible for us to observe this national quarantine within the law.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Friends:&amp;#10;Follow Ale and Duda: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCL8nrNkZhsRq6OFHq4w06kQ&amp;#10;Follow Ana and Gio: https://www.instagram.com/roadtrippersbr/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Map of South America Travels: http://bit.ly/2H8lEOL&amp;#10;Map of Colombia Travels: http://bit.ly/2Hqg1f1&amp;#10;Map of Central America Travels: http://bit.ly/2wxiazP&amp;#10;Map of Mexico Travels: http://bit.ly/2Z0c3kv&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out our recommended products: https://thematneys.co/recommended-products&amp;#10;&amp;#10;About The Matneys:&amp;#10;We're Christian and Aubry, a couple traveling North and South America in our converted Sprinter Van. On The Matneys, we love chatting about the reality of living in a van, what van life allows us to do, and how traveling to new places with new cultures can really open your eyes to so much about the world, our own country, and ourselves. Our little home is simple, but it takes us to the most magical paradises in the world."
    channeltitle "The Matneys"
