    step 0
    date "2022-04-07T16:00:03Z"
    title "Van Life in Colorado - Complete Road Trip Adventure - Van Life Camping Backpacking Movie"
    description "This is the Colorado Bound Movie which includes every single part of Susie and I&amp;#8217;s Epic 2021 Road Trip to the beautiful mountains of Colorado.  In this adventure, we drive across the country in our Ford Transit Van and camp in a variety of places along the way!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Once in CO, we backpack the incredible Lost Creek Wilderness to battle the elements;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;High Elevation&amp;#10;Very little Water&amp;#10;Extremely Remote&amp;#10;Intense Heat&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Then Susie and I head outside of Denver and spend the night next to active Minuteman Nuke Missile Silos!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Get ready to see landscapes which can only be described as otherworldly!&amp;#10;...&amp;#10;:: Gear List For This Adventure ::&amp;#10;I have begun using Amazon Affiliate links in the Adventure Videos &amp;#38; if you choose to purchase one of these products via these links I will receive a small commission which will help fund future honest reviews &amp;#38; adventures. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Gear List : &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Camera Equipment :&amp;#10;- Sony A7S III : https://amzn.to/3eZM7zb&amp;#10;- Sony 35mm 1.8 Lens : https://amzn.to/3BFs8iZ&amp;#10;- SIRUI Carbon Fiber Travel 5C Tripod : https://amzn.to/3BEahZX&amp;#10;- Batteries : https://amzn.to/3geFtG5&amp;#10;- Rode VideoMic Pro Plus Mic : https://amzn.to/3iZMqMO&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Photo Camera : &amp;#10;Canon R5 : https://amzn.to/2Vy42GO&amp;#10;R5 Batteries : https://amzn.to/3ttqr4s&amp;#10;Canon RF 24-70 2.8 Lens : https://amzn.to/2Vy49Ce&amp;#10;Canon RF 100M 2.8 Macro Lens : https://amzn.to/2VuQ8VT&amp;#10;Canon R5 Memory Card : https://amzn.to/2VsOsvV&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- GoPro 10 : https://amzn.to/3BSAJhZ&amp;#10;- GoPro Batteries : https://amzn.to/3jPJba9&amp;#10;- GoPro Wind Cover : https://amzn.to/3AtoN58&amp;#10;- SIRUI Carbon Fiber Travel 5C Tripod : https://amzn.to/3BEahZX&amp;#10;- POVGear GoPro Stick : https://amzn.to/2VKFeLk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;USB Fan SmartDevil : https://amzn.to/3yYYpje&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Dewalt Air Compressor : https://amzn.to/34czT0h&amp;#10;Dewalt Batteries : https://amzn.to/3wAtOHn&amp;#10;Gas One GS-3900P Dual Fuel Stove : https://amzn.to/3z33s24&amp;#10;Butane Fuel : https://amzn.to/3oTpWyw&amp;#10;Propane Fuel Canisters 4 Pack : https://amzn.to/3iVWoik&amp;#10;Dometic CFX35 Fridge/Freezer :  https://amzn.to/3mdi6jI&amp;#10;Bluetti Power Station : https://amzn.to/38SFwTR&amp;#10;Stanley Coffee Press : https://amzn.to/3jXGX9E&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Savotta Vehicle Bags : https://youtu.be/V4nDa9Y8Ml0&amp;#10;Maxpedition Ironstorm Duffle : https://amzn.to/37UKqiD&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Toilet Bucket : https://amzn.to/3wIgnoT&amp;#10;Trash Bags for Toilet : https://amzn.to/3z363Jm&amp;#10;Odor Bio-Blue for Toilet : https://amzn.to/3iU89FT&amp;#10;Cat Litter : https://amzn.to/3ga1vcX&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Smart Bottle 5 Gallon Water Bag : https://amzn.to/2XaL2yS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Luke Clothing : &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Columbia Tamiami Shirt : https://amzn.to/3oEprbo&amp;#10;Fjallraven Pants : https://amzn.to/3leUdXb&amp;#10;Arcteryx Belt : https://amzn.to/3i3CRfb&amp;#10;Outdoor Research Sun Runner Hat : https://amzn.to/3BVaneU&amp;#10;Old Navy T-Shirt : oldnavy.com&amp;#10;Outdoor Research Helium Jacket Review : https://amzn.to/3FpcPNe&amp;#10;Patagonia Men's Micro D Full Zip Sweater : https://www.patagonia.com/product/mens-micro-d-fleece-jacket/26171.html &amp;#10;Oakley Men's Gradient Flak Jacket Sunglasses : https://amzn.to/2WcOGYm &amp;#10;Darn Tough Socks : https://amzn.to/3mx20A5&amp;#10;Soloman Boots : https://amzn.to/3AgcV5X&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Susies Clothing :&amp;#10;Mountain Hardwear Crater Lake 3/4 Crew shirt : https://amzn.to/3AgfTaB&amp;#10;Eddie Bauer Women's Sightscape Convertible Roll-Up Pants : https://amzn.to/3lhZBtA&amp;#10;Mountain Hardware Unclassic Fleece Sweater : https://amzn.to/3DlZweA&amp;#10;Eddie Bauer Mountain Button Up Shirt : https://amzn.to/3mwcQ9A&amp;#10;Outdoor Research Sun Runner Hat : https://amzn.to/3BVaneU&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Luke Rain Gear :&amp;#10;Outdoor Research Helium II Jacket : https://amzn.to/3mBFs1d&amp;#10;Outdoor Research Helium II Pants : https://amzn.to/3bKRiS9&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Susie Rain Gear :&amp;#10;Mountain Hardware Jacket : https://amzn.to/3oFTMbz&amp;#10;Outdoor Research Helium Rain Pants : https://amzn.to/3mv3FpT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Granite Gear Crown 2 Mens Backpack : https://amzn.to/3FpbuGc&amp;#10;Granite Gear Crown 2 Women&amp;#8217;s Backpack : https://amzn.to/3FqRl2A&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Komperdell Trekking Poles :&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Zpacks Duplex Tent : https://zpacks.com/products/duplex-tent&amp;#10;Groundsheet : https://mountainlaureldesigns.com/product/ul-ground-cloth/&amp;#10;Thermarest Sleeping Pad : https://amzn.to/3vcsEBr&amp;#10;Nemo Sleeping Pad : https://amzn.to/3iIohK9&amp;#10;Thermarest Sleeping Bag : https://amzn.to/3Fn9RJ8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Katadyn BeFree Water Filter : https://amzn.to/3kWx77j&amp;#10;Granite Gear Food Bag : https://amzn.to/3yNYCVH&amp;#10;Toaks Long Spoons : https://amzn.to/3vcItrL&amp;#10;Matches : https://amzn.to/2QNgMH3&amp;#10;TT Modular Pouch Kit : https://amzn.to/3grXq4m &amp;#10;TT Mesh Pouch Kit : https://amzn.to/35qSqXc &amp;#10;Soto Stove : https://amzn.to/3q0bDIQ &amp;#10;Toaks Pot with Bail Handle : https://amzn.to/3ywOpOw&amp;#10;MSR Cup : https://amzn.to/3f8U4T0&amp;#10;TOAKS Long Handle Spoon : https://amzn.to/3vcItrL&amp;#10;Boundless Titanium 600ml Cookset : https://amzn.to/3hHmHZd&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Fenix Headlamp : https://amzn.to/2QEatFF&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Kershaw Folding Knife : https://amzn.to/2Sej6aD&amp;#10;Anker Battery Pack : https://amzn.to/3oNSKsg&amp;#10;NiteCore Power Bank : https://amzn.to/3B4hiD0 &amp;#10;...&amp;#10;100% Agenda Free : &amp;#10;This channel is Agenda Free and is fully supported by the viewers. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Patreon : https://www.patreon.com/TOGR&amp;#10;&amp;#10;or&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Support YouTube : https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpmbA7yNOl7aTj_ffkaWWag/join&amp;#10;..."
