    date "2019-08-11T13:58:15Z"
    title "The HIGHEST Weve Ever Been | VAN LIFE in SOUTH AMERICA"
    description "Ready to conquer a mountain whilst surrounded by jaw dropping beauty? Well, get your ice axes out because we are going to take you with us as we attempt to summit Huayna Potosi, a 6088m (20,000ft) mountain in the heart of Bolivia! Oh, and did we mention our dog was doing it with us??&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are Max &amp;#38; Lee + Occy. We are about living small with the world as our backyard. We love adventure and we want to bring you along with us! Join us us as we work, travel and live in our self converted tiny home. We started van life in Canada and we are on the way down to Argentina! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Become a PATRON and get:&amp;#10;-exclusive access to extended videos (inc bloopers)&amp;#10;-access to Patron only live streams&amp;#10;-early access to videos&amp;#10;-prioritised response to comments&amp;#10;-behind the scenes info&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/MaxandLee&amp;#10;-OR- &amp;#10;Send us a one time donation via PayPal to help with our video production!&amp;#10;helloleeandmax@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For more travel updates follow our instagram @maxandlee_ &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want to be more secure online? Get Surfshark VPN at https://Surfshark.com/occy, Enter promo code OCCY for 83% off and 1 FREE month!  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want 25% OFF an unreal Blendtec Blender? Use the Promo code 'OCCY' on the Blendtec website! https://www.blendtec.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHERE DO WE GET OUR MUSIC??&amp;#10;http://share.mscbd.fm/maxandlee &amp;#11013;&amp;#65039;&amp;#10;&amp;#11014;&amp;#65039;Get a 30-day free trial for the best music for your videos!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want to EDIT like us?? This is what we use!   https://bit.ly/2Px8tfk  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;LINKS TO OUR GEAR &amp;#10;Occy's hiking pack - https://amzn.to/2Xc7Qss&amp;#10;Drone - https://amzn.to/2RSZtiX&amp;#10;Sony RX100 V with accessories - https://amzn.to/2C59hmW&amp;#10;Camera Gimbal - https://amzn.to/2MRxAJd&amp;#10;Photography Camera - https://amzn.to/2Dyv4TQ&amp;#10;Polaroid camera - https://amzn.to/2ROl5gi&amp;#10;12v Dometic Fridge - https://amzn.to/2ohGvFD&amp;#10;Maxxair Fan - https://amzn.to/2PbSW1l&amp;#10;Renogy 200 Watt 12V Solar Starter Kit - https://amzn.to/2Iw66Cr&amp;#10;6v Deep Cycle Batteries - https://amzn.to/2wnwICB&amp;#10;Bestek 400W inverter - https://amzn.to/2ok6SLo&amp;#10;6 Inch Memory Foam Mattress - https://amzn.to/2N2QiuH&amp;#10;Lagun table leg - https://amzn.to/2AXTQub&amp;#10;Black out curtains - https://amzn.to/2OBn4Cz&amp;#10;Cabinet Door Gas Struts (x4) - https://amzn.to/2Kob8mm&amp;#10;Portable stove - https://amzn.to/2MUJUs4&amp;#10;Aquatainer - https://amzn.to/2PM3nJZ&amp;#10;12v Water Pump - https://amzn.to/2N0lsFM&amp;#10;Solar Shower - https://amzn.to/2N02SNZ&amp;#10;Roof Seal Paint - https://amzn.to/2wuFs9c&amp;#10;Rivet Nut Tool - https://amzn.to/2C3Ebf4&amp;#10;Bamboo Utensils - https://amzn.to/2DygJa4&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #summit #livelifeoutside"
