  [
    id 120
    label "lkrgRl_g__4"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-09T17:30:04Z"
    title "Van Life Wedding Photographers (week in the life)"
    description "Today we share how we make money doing wedding photography and living in our vintage Van Life camper van. Follow along for some behind the scenes as full time wedding and portrait photographers working in our van as a couple.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Should we make more videos about photography?&amp;#10;we would love to share more tips and tricks and everything about that side of our life as well along with van life. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We couldn't be happier to be back in our van conversion as a couple but breakdowns are around the corner. Still lots of work to be done but we can't wait to call this tiny home on wheels our home. Canadian Van Life is perfect in the summer especially for road trips around Vancouver and we can't wait to share the highs and the lows in living the off grid alternative lifestyle. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHAT'S NEW WITH THE VAN??&amp;#10;Our van no longer turns on haha ! Restoring our 1981 Ford e150 van life conversion camper has been a journey already but Van life is just getting started! We can't wait to do our first van life road trip across Canada or around Vancouver. Will it be the pnw Vanlife goals that we expected? Subscribe and join the journey to find out!  Thank you so much to our inspirations such as Van Wives, Eamon and Bec and Kara and Nate. Seeing others van conversions has helped us learn how to convert a van and create our dream tiny home on wheels.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you don't know us, we are digital Nomads who do photography and videography. We traded a villa in Bali to live in our van in Vancouver Canada! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please consider subscribing to help us reach our goals of supporting our dreams through these videos! So much more to come with this van conversion so stick around and subscribe&amp;#10;&amp;#10;xo,&amp;#10;zo &amp;#38; max&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW OUR SOCIALS&amp;#10;MAX&amp;#10;ig : https://www.instagram.com/maxwell_gro...&amp;#10;tiktok : https://www.tiktok.com/@maxwellgrover&amp;#10;youtube : https://www.youtube.com/c/MaxwellGrover&amp;#10;website : https://www.maxwellgrover.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ZOE &amp;#10;ig (self portraits) : https://www.instagram.com/zoeakiko/&amp;#10;ig (photography) : https://www.instagram.com/akikoarchive/&amp;#10;tiktok : https://www.tiktok.com/@zoeakiko&amp;#10;portfolio : https://www.zoeakiko.com/&amp;#10;youtube : https://www.youtube.com/c/zoeakiko"
    channeltitle "Zoe and Max"
