    date "2020-07-16T12:30:01Z"
    title "VAN LIFE ALASKA 2020. CROSSING THE US-CANADA BORDER IN OUR OFF-GRID TINY HOUSE?!"
    description "Become a Patron: https://bit.ly/2NCe02g&amp;#10;Buy our van blueprint here: https://bit.ly/3gQ8a9U&amp;#10;Get 10% off Buddha Pants using the code 'adventure' https://bit.ly/3eDbu7S&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Decisions, decisions. One of the biggest determining factors when it comes to directing the trajectory of your life&amp;#8230; Drew and I thrive on these kinds of &amp;#34;big-life decisions,&amp;#34; and we usually tend to go for the one that provides the least amount of comfort and requires the largest amount of faith and courage. In this instance though, perhaps having the courage to let go of our plans to go to Alaska was the most courageous thing we could have done&amp;#8230; &amp;#10;BIG LOVE, always and everywhere. &amp;#10;B + D&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PayPal: https://www.paypal.me/mrandmrsadventure&amp;#10;This video's music: https://bit.ly/3iSHjMe&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Where we get all our adventure gear: https://bit.ly/3erjiIP&amp;#10;Get $50 off your camper rental here: https://bit.ly/307glIp&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our entire Amazon Shop organized all nice for ya:&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/mrandmrsadventure&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; OUR VAN LIFE NECESSITIES:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;3-PART WATER FILTER: https://youtu.be/C4PgNSYYsic&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/2Dz9DAk&amp;#10;Use promo code MRANDMRSADVENTURE10 for 10% off (apply on the shipping page) and ask about the VanLife Adventure Van Bundle when wanting to learn more about our set up.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;TOP LOADING 66L SNOMASTER FRIDGE: https://youtu.be/xX6H3U3WvGM&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/2Wa1IAJ&amp;#10;Use promo code mrandmrsadventure for 5% off&amp;#10;&amp;#10;3-100W RENOGY SOLAR PANELS: https://youtu.be/mfC8IhFWal0&amp;#10;http://www.renogy.com?afmc=MrAndMrsAdventure&amp;#10;Use code MrAndMrsAdventure in the coupon box 5% off (except for batteries)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;2.5 GALLON WATER HEATER: https://amzn.to/33czgBs&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; CAMERA GEAR:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MAIN VLOGGING CAMERA: https://amzn.to/2DZo3M2&amp;#10;DSLR CAMERA: http://amzn.to/2mEA8cT&amp;#10;GIMBLE: https://amzn.to/2Q0kADu&amp;#10;GOPRO: http://amzn.to/2my5p1U&amp;#10;DRONE: https://amzn.to/2LKoHlg&amp;#10;ALL OTHER PHOTO/VIDEO GEAR: https://amzn.to/2PzrwSJIs&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; JOIN US ON OUR OTHER SOCIAL CHANNELS:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Daily updates via Instagram:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/mrandmrsadventure&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/heradventure&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FaceBook: https://www.facebook.com/mrmrsadventure/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our blog/website where you can sign up for our Newsletter:&amp;#10;http://www.mrandmrsadventure.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;As always, we are so grateful to have you joining us on our journey here and we appreciate all your support &amp;#9825;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #mrandmrsadventure #sprintervanconversion"
