  [
    id 124
    label "07ABUwjEW44"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-06T16:00:02Z"
    title "VAN LIFE in EUROPE (24 hrs of driving across 4 countries) "
    description "Our perfectly pint-sized, trusty steed Bluey is back on the road after a minor hiccup with the gear linkage and we are putting Josh + Bertel&amp;#8217;s repair job to the test with a full on 24 hours of driving across 4 European countries as we test out what it&amp;#8217;s really like to transit across borders whilst driving in Europe. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our VW T4 is our home on wheels as we travel across Europe this month and we are really pushing her to the limit with winding mountain roads, crazy switch backs and endless toll roads. Join us as we leave Germany and the Autobahn behind, briefly enter Austria, cross Switzerland with a dip into Geneva before entering France to cool off in the Mountains. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;VAN LIFE in EUROPE (24 hrs of driving across 4 countries) &amp;#128656;&amp;#10;#VanlifeEurope #MEGATRIP04 #EuropeRoadtrip&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We appreciate all your support on this channel. We started Wandering Home to document our Van Conversion (almost 2 years ago now) and we never expected to grow such a wonderful community of like-minded people through doing so. If you want to support us, the best thing you can do is subscribe to the channel, like our videos and leave a comment to say Hi &amp;#128075;  It's free to do and helps YouTube notice us and push us out to even more like-minded people, just like you! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128250; Watch More from us Here www.youtube.com/Wandering_Home&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;&amp;#127995; Support us through our Shop www.wanderinghome.co.uk/shop&amp;#10;&amp;#128248; Follow our Daily Lives on Instagram www.instagram.com/wandering_home_&amp;#10;&amp;#9889; Power your set up with an EcoFlow Portable Battery https://uk.ecoflow.com?aff=60&amp;#38;aff=60"
