  [
    id 125
    label "Jcm72G9gLCY"
    step 0
    date "2022-06-12T12:00:09Z"
    title "VAN LIFE in OUTBACK AUSTRALIA HAS BEGUN (its beyond wild!) Ep.1"
    description "Ready for an adventure?!? ROOS. SNAKES. EMUS. CAMELS. This is just the beginning.  Let Audible help you discover new ways to laugh, be inspired, or be entertained. New members can try it free for 30 days. Visit https://www.audible.com/occy or text occy to 500-500.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Occy and I have set out on our OUTBACK adventure in the van. We have never been to Central Australia and think it's finally time for that to change!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;DONATE to PUSH UP CHALLENGE - https://www.thepushupchallenge.com.au/fundraisers/MaxOccysTeam&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join my crew by supporting me on Patreon : )&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/maxandoccy&amp;#10;Or, for one time donations PayPal to maxbid88@gmail.com   Thank you!!! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;For the behind the scenes - Follow me on Instagram &amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/max_bids/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Interested in the Cell signal booster? Use code MO22 for 15% off at&amp;#10;https://www.powertec.com.au/ &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Like my hats??&amp;#10;Get 10% off using this link - https://www.willandbear.com/maxandoccy &amp;#10;&amp;#10;MUSIC:&amp;#10;SONG 1 - Enduring Hope by Daniel Deuschle&amp;#10;SONG 2 - Keep Moving by Riley Pearce&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHERE DO I GET MY MUSIC??&amp;#10;http://share.mscbd.fm/maxandlee &amp;#11013;&amp;#65039;&amp;#10;Elevate your videos with record-label quality music from Musicbed!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Occy and have moved into my van to join the van life movement in Australia, allowing me to live, work and travel full time! We are currently overlanding outback Australia &amp;#128588;&amp;#127996;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#australia  #solovanlife #vanlife"
