    id 134
    label "qmN7MfOysXg"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-10T13:00:24Z"
    title "I Live in a Truck Camper Down by the River - Van Life in the Mountains  Waterfall Swimming"
    description "Remember when he tried to scare us out of living in a van down by the river? Enter at https://www.omaze.com/drhannah for your chance to win an Airstream&amp;#174; Caravel 20FB and RAM&amp;#174; 1500 Limited Truck and support a great cause, MuttNation Foundation! Woof!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Aren't you glad we didn't listen? Life in the mountains during the summer, a beautiful way to slow down and enjoy simple moments on the river. A nearby lake here flows into a river and down into a beautiful waterfall canyon. Living in a truck camper is my favorite way to get off grid, off road and explore the high mountains!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;See more exclusive content, send me a message!&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/hannahstraight&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Try my instant mushroom coffee (instant coffee with 7 mushrooms) perfect for camping!&amp;#10;https://www.drstraight.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;xoxo&amp;#10;Hannah"
