  [
    id 135
    label "iVvaBHyHbFM"
    step 0
    date "2020-04-26T15:16:16Z"
    title "BEST FRIDGE FOR VAN LIFE | fridges for van living"
    description "Thanks to Squarespace for sponsoring today's video! Head to https://squarespace.com/40hours to save 10% off your first purchase of a website or domain&amp;#10;Wondering what fridge to get to live in a van? We&amp;#8217;ve got you covered with the best fridge for van life. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;After building out 10 van conversion, we&amp;#8217;ve dealt with the two main types of 12 volt fridges for a van:&amp;#10;1.Upright Style&amp;#10;2. Cooler Style&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We'll discuss some of the pros and cons of these fridges for van life and how we typically build a fridge into the kitchen cabinet.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can read more about the best fridge for van life here: https://saraandalexjames.com/vanlife-blog/best-fridge-for-van-life&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; GET THE VAN LAYOUT GUIDE HERE: &amp;#10;http://saraandalexjames.com/van-build-layout-guide&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; &amp;#128656;CLICK TO SUBSCRIBE HERE: https://bit.ly/2U4HBWV &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; HOW MUCH OUR VAN CONVERSIONS COST:&amp;#10; https://youtu.be/syl3Erx0aY0&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; VAN LIFE ESSENTIALS: &amp;#10;100ah Battle Born Batteries: https://amzn.to/2Gt8GM0 &amp;#10;3000 watt Victron Inverter Charger: https://amzn.to/2GhrufQ &amp;#10;Farmhouse Sink: https://amzn.to/2DhEUYC &amp;#10;Faucet: https://amzn.to/2Nj2NX7&amp;#10;Separett Urine Diverting Toilet: https://amzn.to/2Is0rC1&amp;#10;30 gallons of Fresh Water storage: https://amzn.to/2InYMNB &amp;#10;2.5 gallon Electric Water Heater: https://amzn.to/2V5oQmE&amp;#10;Aeropress: https://amzn.to/2KC93qh&amp;#10;Electric Kettle: https://amzn.to/2zau9Yu&amp;#10;Hand Vacuum: https://amzn.to/2z42OXT&amp;#10;Tech Towels: https://amzn.to/2KDQq24&amp;#10;Sun Shade: https://amzn.to/2Ni8iBf&amp;#10;EnamelWare: https://amzn.to/2LhzotO&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; CAMERA STUFF&amp;#10;Sony A6300: https://amzn.to/2PpmWI1&amp;#10;Gimbal: https://amzn.to/2BxR9By&amp;#10;Drone: https://amzn.to/2NcPJ5k&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; VAN DETAILS&amp;#10;https://saraandalexjames.com/vanlife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; WHO ARE WE? &amp;#10;We are Sara &amp;#38; Alex (aka &amp;#34;40 Hours of Freedom&amp;#34;), and definitely don't forget about our dogs - Bambi &amp;#38; Nugget - or else they might be a little upset. We converted our own Sprinter van and have hit the road for full time adventure and fun. Subscribe for new van life and travel videos every week.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We hope to inspire you to create the life you love - whatever that looks like for you! So get out there and start creating some epic content. We live by: Create more, Consume Less.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; CONNECT WITH US:&amp;#10;https://saraandalexjames.com&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/saraandalexjames&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/40hoursoffreedom"
    channeltitle "Sara &amp;#38; Alex James &amp;#8211; Custom Crafted Vans"
