    id 140
    label "o93IxHyEcbk"
    step 0
    date "2022-04-10T17:00:00Z"
    title "We swapped VAN LIFE for BOAT LIFE! (full tour)"
    description "We swapped VAN LIFE for BOAT LIFE for the week and it was AMAZING!&amp;#10;We head up to Scotland on an LNER train to explore one of our favourite cities in the world! If you're planning on heading to Edinburgh you'll want to save this video for some inspo as our itinerary was JAM-PACKED!&amp;#10;We stayed on the Final boat and it was absolutely incredible - we felt so welcome and so posh - we'll give you the full tour - we'd definitely love to try out full time boat life some time!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Huge thanks to @VisitScotland and @London North Eastern Railway for the best week possible.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128653; Our bus stats:&amp;#10;2001 Mercedes Vario 814&amp;#10;4.2 Litre Diesel &amp;#10;Was 24 seats (now 2) &amp;#10;Air Suspension&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128663; Top 10 videos to watch on Kinging-it&amp;#8217;s channel:&amp;#10;WATCH HERE! - http://bit.ly/3uHC5sy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10145;&amp;#65039;&amp;#128107; A bit about US- &amp;#10;We are Craig and Aimee, from South Wales, UK. After Aimee was diagnosed with Cancer at 18 and Craig broke his neck shortly after by a freak accident, we decided life really is too short. Watch our story here -  https://bit.ly/3kuiZBA&amp;#10;&amp;#10; &amp;#127932; MUSIC!&amp;#10;The music in this video is all copyright free and from Artlist - anyone who signs up through your link will get 2 extra months free with their subscription!&amp;#10;Sign up here: https://bit.ly/3yLpN3r&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Social Media -&amp;#10;&amp;#128998; Facebook - https://www.facebook/com/kingingit&amp;#10;&amp;#128997; Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/wearekingingit&amp;#10;&amp;#129000; Website - http://www.kinging-it.com&amp;#10;&amp;#129002; Twitter - https://twitter.com/kingingit100&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127804;SHOP &amp;#10; Get your Kinging-it clothing here -  http://www.kinging-it.com/shop&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127800;PODCAST&amp;#10; Kinging it PODCAST - https://www.kinging-it.com/the-podcast&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#boatlife #Vanlife #travelvlog"
    channeltitle "Kinging- It"
