  [
    id 142
    label "0WyDAPkyChE"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-12T17:00:00Z"
    title "VAN LIFE IN TROUBLE | SPAIN PAMPLONA"
    description "Join us in Pamplona, Spain - home of the Pamplona Bull Run. &amp;#10;We look around this gorgeous Fortress City, well known for the annual Bull Run where people fill the streets and attempt to escape the Bull's that are let free!&amp;#10;Things get heated and not only with the hot weather as we get pulled by the Police !&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The Aire featured in this video is available to view on Search for Sites app.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Don't forget to Like, Comment and Subscribe and make sure you click the notification bell so you receive all notifications when we upload a new video.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#VANLIFE #ukvanlife #motorhome&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music courtesy of Epidemic sounds.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Filmed using GoPro 10  GoPro 7 and  iPhone 12 Pro Max.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Support our channel by buying us a Coffee !  -  https://www.buymeacoffee.com/northontour&amp;#10;                &amp;#10;LINKS:&amp;#10;Facebook : https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100066971643046&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Instagram : https://www.instagram.com/northerners_on_tour_/"
