  [
    id 143
    label "S-GLlNDpOtk"
    step 0
    date "2021-04-18T11:00:10Z"
    title "Border Crossing USA | Van Life Washington"
    description "After two years exploring and overlanding the beautiful State of Alaska in our Winnebago Revel 4x4 Sprinter Adventure van we are moving on down to the Lower 48 where a brand new opportunity awaits us on the other side of Canada. &amp;#10;This requires essential travel for us with Ember and our van. We blasted through Canada in 4 days and now it's time to cross back into the United States where we can relax in the most remote and off grid locations we can find and breathe easy for a few days, before continuing on to our exciting new adventure of van life. &amp;#10;Our last series of videos covers this experience and we're happy to have you with us along for the ride.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Help support our channel by shopping our Amazon Store.  &amp;#10;Here you will find all of our favorite things to include our Lifestraw Gravity filled water filter and purifier and Helian LED Camping Lights. &amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/wingsandwheelsalaska&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Jim's Beard Upgrade&amp;#10;Visit www.permafrostbeards.com and use discount code WINGSANDWHEELSALASKA for 15% off all of their amazing products!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;*For Business inquires or Collaborations contact us at &amp;#10;WingsandWheelsAlaska@gmail.com &amp;#10;PO Box:&amp;#10;Wing and Wheels Alaska&amp;#10;PO Box 212489&amp;#10;Anchorage, AK 99521-2489&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Visit the Buffalo Wool Company at: https://www.TheBuffaloWoolCo.com &amp;#10;Use Discount Code Wings and Wheels for 10% off purchases at checkout!  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Their products are great for every outdoor activity.  Fishing, Hunting, Skiing.  &amp;#10;Their socks and gloves make the perfect gift.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out http://www.Overlandgearguy.com for additional storage needs.  &amp;#10;Use discount code WingsandWheelsAlaska for 10% off.&amp;#10;offering many storage solutions for your off-road adventures!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Shout out to Canyon Adventure Vans for making the rear conversion simple and easy for folk like us.  Check out all of the variations https://www.canyonadventurevans.com for more info on the GLSS.&amp;#10;They also have an Instagram page with daily updates on their creations. https://canyonadventurevans.com &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Helian lighting has been gracious enough to offer all of you 10% off as well on their excellent products.  http://bit.ly/2WMVFTP discount code HELIAN10%OFF&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#alaska #revel #vanlife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Interested in Havelock Wool?  Use our link below!&amp;#10;http://havelockwool.refr.cc/jamess&amp;#10;pots and pans: https://amzn.to/36xq2C5&amp;#10;Instant Pot: https://amzn.to/2PQhXBA&amp;#10;Life Straw: https://amzn.to/3kYr3da&amp;#10;Pendleton Wool Blanket: https://amzn.to/30htcGg&amp;#10;Salmon Sister Boots: https://amzn.to/2XzkKAy&amp;#10;Open Road Yoga Blanket:  https://amzn.to/36tdbRz&amp;#10;Felt Storage Bins:  https://amzn.to/2N8DmoU&amp;#10;There are two sizes of bins (13.8&amp;#34; and 15.7&amp;#34;) depending on where you place them.  The smaller size fits the cabinet above the bench seat and the second shelf of the bathroom.  The larger size fits the top shelf.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Camera Equipment:&amp;#10;Drone Mavic Air: https://amzn.to/2JzdMXn&amp;#10;Camera Canon 6D: https://amzn.to/2FY8of6&amp;#10;Microphone Rode Pro+: https://amzn.to/2L8vdBg&amp;#10;DJI Osmo Pocket: https://amzn.to/2NcDbsW&amp;#10;Canon G7X Mark II: https://amzn.to/2NzOavj&amp;#10;Canon 17-40 mm Lens:  https://amzn.to/2qccCuS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Purchases made from the links above result in a commission paid to us via the Amazon Affiliate Program.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music: https://www.epidemicsound.com"
