    title "NO LONGER ALONE | Big Changes to Solo Van Life"
    description "Thanks Athletic Greens for sponsoring this video. Get up to a year&amp;#8217;s supply of immune supporting Vitamin D + 5 individual travel packs, both FREE with your first purchase! Click: https://athleticgreens.com/rideandseek&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VAN LIFE VLOG #13 - No Longer Alone&amp;#10;This week on Ride and Seek, Abi is exloring some beautiful places, Horseshoe bend and Antelope Canyon but the best part of all is meeting up with a good friend who also lives in a bus. Join us for an amazing time in the life of a nomad! &amp;#10;Check out our friend Alyssa's channel here: https://www.youtube.com/c/REGRETLYSS1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ABI'S ART&amp;#10;Check out Abi's art for sale on our website and shop! &amp;#10;Website:  https://www.letsplayrideandseek.com/art/2022/4/6/paintings-for-sale&amp;#10;Shop paintings and prints: https://www.nonpareil-photography.square.site&amp;#10;&amp;#10;JOIN OUR RIDE AND SEEK CREW ON PATREON &amp;#10;These youtube videos are made possible with the support of our patreon crew. Watch exclusive videos, behind the scenes fun and get early access to Sunday Vlogs, only on Patreon. &amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/Letsplayrideandseek&amp;#10;&amp;#10;TIP JAR&amp;#10;Loving our videos? Send a tip to help us keep creating them. Your tips make a big difference for us! &amp;#10;Venmo: @letsplayrideandseek&amp;#10;CashApp: $letsplayrideandseek&amp;#10;Paypal: https://www.paypal.me/letsplayrideandseek &amp;#10;&amp;#10;RIDE AND SEEK MERCHANDISE&amp;#10;Stickers, Shirts, Hoodies, Tumblers, Mugs, Totes and more! &amp;#10;https://ride-and-seek.creator-spring.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CONNECT WITH US IN BETWEEN VIDEOS&amp;#10;INSTAGRAM @letsplayrideandseek : https://bit.ly/368lq7v&amp;#10;WEBSITE  http://letsplayrideandseek.com &amp;#10;&amp;#10;OUR VAN BUILD SERIES&amp;#10;Watch us build this tiny home from the beginning - https://bit.ly/2YO4Zss&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OUR VAN BUILD HIGHLIGHTS&amp;#10;DIY composting toilet: https://youtu.be/f83jBZuZU4k&amp;#10;Painting the van: https://youtu.be/1PKBb2nfhwc&amp;#10;Ceiling Disaster: https://youtu.be/Np8wHQV7ahk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WATCH NEXT: &amp;#10;How we shower - https://youtu.be/JTGM7cj7QuY&amp;#10;Chef Nat in the kitchen - https://youtu.be/SCfMVivJJ9I&amp;#10;Get to know us -  https://youtu.be/2Pq47aKSL08&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VAN BUILD DETAILS&amp;#10;BattleBorn Batteries: http://battlebornbatteries.com?afmc=3z&amp;#10;Solar Panel: https://gpelectric.com/product-category/available-now/&amp;#10;Ceiling Puck Lights: https://amzn.to/2WCkMdM &amp;#10;Mood Lighting: https://amzn.to/3fRNVsK &amp;#10;Ceiling Fan: https://amzn.to/2TaW1Db &amp;#10;Mattress: https://amzn.to/2WBwUeV &amp;#10;Fresh Water Tank: https://amzn.to/366QcMu &amp;#10;Pump: https://amzn.to/2WAQmso &amp;#10;Accumulator: https://amzn.to/2WY0qKR &amp;#10;Shower: https://www.geysersystems.com/?wpam_id=5&amp;#10;DIY composting toilet kit: https://etsy.me/3wDgdzE&amp;#10;Raptor Liner Textured Paint: https://amzn.to/38vnQhl&amp;#10;Ladder: https://amzn.to/3fRWJz0 &amp;#10;Wood Burner (make your own secret tree door): https://amzn.to/3aAFrFA&amp;#10;Henna Stamps (Abi got hers in India, but you can now buy them on amazon): https://amzn.to/3dHaphc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VAN LIFE ESSENTIALS&amp;#10;Cast Iron Pan Set: https://amzn.to/3kfoGmr&amp;#10;Hammock: https://amzn.to/2z3vW27 &amp;#10;Bug Screen: https://amzn.to/3cza64Y &amp;#10;CarbonMonoxide Alarm: https://amzn.to/3dRVA8W &amp;#10;First Aid: https://amzn.to/3by4pCX &amp;#10;Dog food storage: https://amzn.to/3dPxrzw &amp;#10;Heater: https://amzn.to/3dM7eC2 &amp;#10;Moon Night Light: https://amzn.to/3BZu8l0&amp;#10;&amp;#10;*Disclaimer: Some links are affiliate links, we receive a small commission if you purchase something using our link, at no extra cost to you. Thanks for your support!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MUSIC CREDITS&amp;#10;We claim no rights or ownership to music. All credit to artists.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;UppBeat&amp;#10;Get sweet tracks for your channel for FREE: &amp;#10;https://uppbeat.io?referral=lets-7lgyk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHO ARE WE?&amp;#10;We are Nat &amp;#38; Abi, a married couple from the USA, and we turned an ex prison van into an off grid cabin on wheels in order to travel the world with our 2 rescue dogs, Bear + Peluche. For the past 2 and half years, we've embraced life on the road in our tiny home and we share our highs + lows right here every week. By living and sharing our story, we hope to inspire you in your own life. Subscribe to our channel, and together, let's play ride and seek. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;ALL LOVE, NO HATE&amp;#10;We love our LGBTQ+ friends and have founded a platform for queer nomads, check out @VANLIFEPRIDE on INSTAGRAM &amp;#10;https://bit.ly/3pORxAG&amp;#10;&amp;#10;A lot of ya&amp;#8217;ll have been asking how you can support us, so we put some info together on our website:&amp;#10;http://letsplayrideandseek.com/giving-back&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks for watching!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128156; &amp;#10;Nat &amp;#38; Abi&amp;#10;Bear + Peluche&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Lets Play RIDE AND SEEK&amp;#10;#vanlife&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203; #livinginavan #solofemalevanlife"
