  [
    id 153
    label "NmcoQFuBJGg"
    step 0
    date "2021-12-27T13:30:03Z"
    title "Van Life Tour : Truly Unique DIY Sprinter van Camper conversion build."
    description "James and Emily have been living in their DIY converted Sprinter van for over a year, and prior to that lived in a self converted school bus camper. In this video James tours us through his unique build which right off the bat doesn't have a fixed or folding type bed but is instead where their kitchen, bathroom, and living area is. Their bed is behind the cab of the van and they chose to do their van build that way so they would be able to open their back doors and be able to access outside them when camping or parked. Their side sliding door does open and work but they use that as a view area when parked somewhere nice because that's where the bed is, and a way to access under their bed which is like most vans, a &amp;#34;Garage&amp;#34;. There are some unique lighting options put in this van with an array of led light stripes, inlaid pot lights, and of course the Nano leaf triangle in their bedroom area. If you enjoyed this van tour documentary, make sure to share it with your friends, like the video, and click the alternative dwelling playlist below to watch more from this channel.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow James &amp;#38; Emily's adventures here&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/canlifevanlife/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Van Life Tours&amp;#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL8TC5LCUPfit4qO8aiIh_iHtC2xFWtIzA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vanlife Video Podcast&amp;#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL8TC5LCUPfitJMClK--WFcx1CUHI-rGM7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vanlife Audio Podcast&amp;#10;https://anchor.fm/vanlifeandchill&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Discord&amp;#10;https://discord.gg/4kWjnSfF6U&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Movies&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3HnMwHJ&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3HmmEfw&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3gxFchf&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vlogs&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/ForrestStevensYT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you to Patreons! Jamie F, Renay E, Andrew B, Madison and Raynor, Jennifer S, Mario R, Doug B, Marian H, Cody S, Ashton S, Akshay A, Curtis, and Sonya B! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Patreon&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/ForrestStevens &amp;#10;Paypal&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=ML6MEHLAHUMFN&amp;#10;Bitcoin&amp;#10;3Ao1PoA7i1mY4R2eQp8HYSJv77jZ1HkMN7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you read all this give us 1 thumbs up emoji, 1 tree emoji and 1 Video camera emoji in the comment section."
