    title "BEGINNING OUR MOVE ABROAD  THE RETURN TO VAN LIFE IN EUROPE!"
    description "After landing in Lisbon, Brittany and Drew tour the city and rent an RV for Season &amp;#9996;&amp;#65039; of their property search! Click here &amp;#38; try AG1 https://athleticgreens.com/mrandmrsadventure + get 5 bonus travel packs and a 1-year supply of Vit D3 with your 1st purchase&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Buy Brittany's Recovery book: https://www.mrandmrsadventure.com/heartfully-healed&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Subscribe for a new video every single Sunday: https://bit.ly/3fW095N&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Sign up for our weekly(ish) Newsletter: http://eepurl.com/bn13VD&amp;#10;&amp;#9825; Become a Patron: https://bit.ly/2NCe02g&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; JOIN US ON OUR SOCIALS:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/mrandmrsadventure&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/heradventure&amp;#10;FaceBook: https://www.facebook.com/mrmrsadventure/&amp;#10;TikTik: https://www.tiktok.com/@mrandmrsadventure&amp;#10;Our blog: http://www.mrandmrsadventure.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PayPal: MrandMrsAdventure@gmail.com&amp;#10;Buy our van blueprint here: https://bit.ly/3gQ8a9U&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our AirBnB link to save $55 on your 1st trip: https://bit.ly/3Jy7oNo&amp;#10;Use code MrAndMrsAdventure for 5% off Renogy: https://bit.ly/2DokIYa&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our mailing address:&amp;#10;Mr and Mrs Adventure &amp;#10;PO Box 5034&amp;#10;Fort Myers Beach, FL 33932&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our entire Amazon Shop organized all nice for ya:&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/mrandmrsadventure&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; OUR VAN LIFE NECESSITIES:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;3-PART WATER FILTER: https://youtu.be/C4PgNSYYsic&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/2Dz9DAk&amp;#10;Use promo code MRANDMRSADVENTURE10 for 10% off (apply on the shipping page) and ask about the VanLife Adventure Van Bundle when wanting to learn more about our set up.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;TOP LOADING 66L SNOMASTER FRIDGE: https://youtu.be/xX6H3U3WvGM&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/2Wa1IAJ&amp;#10;Use promo code mrandmrsadventure for 5% off&amp;#10;&amp;#10;3-100W RENOGY SOLAR PANELS: https://youtu.be/mfC8IhFWal0&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/2DokIYa&amp;#10;Use code MrAndMrsAdventure in the coupon box 5% off (except for batteries)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;2.5 GALLON WATER HEATER: https://amzn.to/33czgBs&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; CAMERA GEAR:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MAIN VLOGGING CAMERA: https://amzn.to/2DZo3M2&amp;#10;DSLR CAMERA: http://amzn.to/2mEA8cT&amp;#10;GIMBLE: https://amzn.to/2Q0kADu&amp;#10;GOPRO: http://amzn.to/2my5p1U&amp;#10;DRONE: https://amzn.to/2LKoHlg&amp;#10;ALL OTHER PHOTO/VIDEO GEAR: https://amzn.to/2PzrwSJIs&amp;#10;&amp;#10;As always, we are so grateful to have you joining us on our journey here and we appreciate all your support &amp;#9825;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#travel #travelvlog #vanlife"
