    id 163
    label "jV7-EYA0MGo"
    step 0
    date "2018-11-10T15:21:39Z"
    title "VAN LIFE TOUR: Family of Four DIY Sprinter Van Conversion | Van Life with Kids"
    description "&amp;#128656;&amp;#128149;SUBSCRIBE HERE: https://bit.ly/2U4HBWV&amp;#10;Join us for a Van Life Tour with the @rosenesontheroad who live (almost) full-time van life with kids. They did their own Sprinter Van conversion and plan to hit the road full time for a year next year!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can find them here: &amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/rosenesontheroad/&amp;#10;https://rosenesontheroad.com/&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCObjsVPggZPSPzR6unW_aqQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Watch more van tours here: https://bit.ly/2AWZpZG&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Get our van layout guide here: https://saraandalexjames.com/van-build-layout-guide&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; VAN INFO HERE: https://saraandalexjames.com/vanlife/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; WHO ARE WE? &amp;#10;We are Sara &amp;#38; Alex, and definitely don't forget about our dogs - Bambi &amp;#38; Nugget - or else they might be a little upset. We converted our own Sprinter van and have hit the road for full time adventure and fun. Subscribe for new van life and travel videos every week!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We hope to inspire you to create the life you love - whatever that looks like for you! So get out there and start creating some epic content.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; CONNECT WITH US:&amp;#10;https://saraandalexjames.com&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/saraandalexjames&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/40hoursoffreedom&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Van Life Tour | The Ultimate DIY Sprinter Van Conversion with Bathroom: https://bit.ly/2Km0899&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlifewithkids #vantour #sprintervan"
    channeltitle "Sara &amp;#38; Alex James &amp;#8211; Custom Crafted Vans"
