  [
    id 165
    label "RPqFQgvsOx4"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-10T07:56:33Z"
    title "Travelling Cornwall In Our Campervan Conversion (Our First Week)"
    description "(Our first week Travelling through Cornwall in our campervan conversion - Van Life UK)&amp;#10;Yescapa Is a fantastic service &amp;#38; platform to either try out Van Life by renting a camper or motorhome, OR to make money renting out your camper&amp;#10;&amp;#128073; &amp;#163;20 off Discount Code &amp;#34;HAPPYDAYS&amp;#34;&amp;#10;Click here to try out vanlife this summer with Yescapa &amp;#8594;&amp;#160;https://bit.ly/3MAu68x&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;Click here to find out how much you could earn &amp;#8594;&amp;#160;https://bit.ly/3xBW4wo&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This week we travel along the Cornish Coast, from Falmouth to Lizard Peninsula (and the incredible Kynance Cove), and then onto Porthleven and Praa Sands. Searching for the best Uk beach park ups in our camper van Morgan&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join this channel to get access to perks:&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCqRs-3IcoKCMGXsfLvOgTUg/join&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you like our content, please subscribe to our channel for weekly content&amp;#10;youtube.com/c/thosehappydays&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We also post daily updates on Instagram, please come and say Hi over there:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/thosehappy_days/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For Collabs or Promos, please contact us via our email hello@thosehappydays.co.uk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OUR AMAZON SHOP - USE THE LINK TO SEE ITEMS WE USE IN OUR VAN &amp;#38; VIDEOS&amp;#10;Some of the items/gadgets/foods/drinks we use in the videos, and in our campervan are available on our Amazon shop here https://www.amazon.co.uk/shop/thosehappydays?ref=inf_own_thosehappydays&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We couldnt recommend the Electronics enough, and were supplied by Ecotree Lithium https://ecotreelithium.co.uk/ We will give a full honest review in the coming weeks, in exchange for the product being gifted on a PR Sample Basis&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The new hatch on the roof of the campervan is a SkyMaxx, bit of a game changer for us, and comes in two sizes, compatible with roof thicknesses 23-60mm. Here is a link with locations to find one yourself https://leisurevehicleservices.co.uk/where-to-buy/ We got this as a PR sample, and are really impressed so far&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The lighting on top of the van is supplied by AuxBeam and we love them, including that light-bar that is all operated by a switch panel and bluetooth. Here is a link https://auxbeam.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our extremely comfortable duvet &amp;#38; pillows came from our friends at Duvet Hog, which are vegan and made of recycled materials. We have used them in our previous van and honestly is the comfirst bedding we hage ever bought. PR Sample  https://duvethog.co.uk/?gclid=CjwKCAjwloCSBhAeEiwA3hVo_T0mieY25WIHjb5a-o_27lO89Hkbjxhca45IUIw6rbAtKPOMeEOUJxoCuksQAvD_BwE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our mattress came from a company that do awesome made-to-fit mattresses for campervans (and houses). The company is called Custom Size Beds https://customsizebeds.co.uk/made-to-measure-mattresses/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The Woodburner is from Outbacker Stoves&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The Fridge is a 130l Webasto, and is really good so far, once again will let you know more in coming weeks&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Both the cooker and the oven are from Jackson Leisure, and are Thetford branded&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you are Interested in Veganism or Plant Based Food, then check out these links:- &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127856;&amp;#127856; Our Vegan Food Website:&amp;#10;https://veganfooduk.co.uk/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127829;&amp;#127829;Find the latest vegan food on our Instagram:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/vegan_food_uk/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you want daily news about vegan food then please Check out our Facebook Page: https://www.facebook.com/veganfooduk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128055;&amp;#128020;&amp;#128004;&amp;#128017;&amp;#128007;&amp;#128054;&amp;#128572;&amp;#128044;&amp;#128032;&amp;#128012;&amp;#10;If you are interested in veganism or plant-based food, please Join our Facebook Group &amp;#38; Community: https://www.facebook.com/groups/VeganFoodUK"
    channeltitle "Those Happy Days"
