  [
    id 166
    label "2RLI90ZbwPk"
    step 0
    date "2022-03-01T18:37:31Z"
    title "Van Tour With Bathroom | WHATS AROUND THAT CORNER??! | Off Grid Tiny Home By Van Life Builds"
    description "#vanlife #vanlifebuilds #MiRiDER&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are proud to partner with MiRiDER UK on this sponsored Van Tour of our latest van conversion! The E Bikes have so many awesome features, check them out here: https://mirider.co.uk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MiRiDER Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/mirideruk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We only partner with brands that we fully trust, and that we would genuinely recommend to others in our van life community!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We have been testing out our MiRiDER Foldable E Bikes for over a month now, and we are still as obsessed about them as the day we received them! They are SO much fun for all the family, and are absolutely perfect for van lifers because the bikes fold up really small (even smaller than we demonstrated because the handle bars can be removed too) we will be sharing more details over on our Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/vanlifebuilds&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our recommendation does not stop at the product, the customer service we have received is top notch, and they are the friendliest northern chaps you&amp;#8217;ll come across &amp;#128524;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Drone work by our friend Wolfget Media. He is based in Wales, UK, but can travel anywhere! We would totally recommend him for all forms of videography: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/wolfget.media&amp;#10;https://youtube.com/channel/UCziUQPRXScjFUQToS0GFLug&amp;#10;https://www.wolfgetmedia.co.uk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe here so you never miss a van tour: https://www.youtube.com/vanlifebuilds&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PINCH US NOW! Our next van build is for the lovely Carol Vorderman! Check out this link to find out more: https://www.instagram.com/vordersvan &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Website / floor plans:&amp;#10;https://www.vanlifebuilds.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join us on our other social channels:&amp;#10;TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/vanlifebuilds&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/vanlifebuilds&amp;#10;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.com/vanlifebuilds&amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/vanlifebuilds&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Product Links below:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases, we may also share other affiliate links for which we earn a small commission, this is at no extra cost to you.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can now bake cakes, pizza, or anything your heart desires in or out of a camper van with this amazing little stove top oven! Whats more, you save weight, money and space by using this in your build instead of a conventional oven!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Omnia Stove Top Oven: &amp;#10;https://brownbirdandcompany.co.uk/?ref=vanlifebuilds&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Whale Heat Air: https://www.whalevanlife.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Simploo Compost Toilet:&amp;#10;http://www.simploo.co.uk&amp;#10;USE DISCOUNT CODE: vanlifebuilds0522&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Remis Cab Blinds:&amp;#10;https://ebay.us/SFtvS5 (expensive but worth every penny, for connivence, temperature control and privacy in an instance)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Swivel Seat Bases:&amp;#10;https://rjcampersolutions.co.uk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Swivel Table Leg:&amp;#10;https://ebay.us/6V64pP  (less expensive compared to popular Lagun Leg)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Fridge:&amp;#10;https://ebay.us/iTWftA (perfect for vans or small spaces thanks to its narrow depth)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Kitchen Hob:&amp;#10;https://ebay.us/7Wsqmz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Maxx Fan:&amp;#10; https://amzn.to/39F2zCy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Maxx Fan Blind:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3hir2Su&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Bathroom Skylight:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3rcWjb7 &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Large Sky Light Over Bed:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2YPwxhj &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Shower Door:&amp;#10;https://shop.stoett.com/nautilus-retractable-shower-doors-for-rv/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;More about this design:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This is a fully off grid van made to feel like a small home! The base model is a LWB 170 VW Crafter (same as a Sprinter Van) Here @Van Life Builds we design and create one off bespoke camper van conversions for people to live and enjoy the amazing van life! We like to steer clear of standard motorhome layouts and bring fresh, unique and innovative designs!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We&amp;#8217;ve used tiny home concepts creating key individual areas and a private bedroom. The decor is Inspired by woodland vibes, using natural tones, wood and greens, BUT with a modern twist incorporating unusual angles, and a wedge shaped kitchen to really invite you in to the space!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;There is a long garage at the back, it can be used with the tray for bikes etc or for storage of long length adventure items such as surf boards or skis &amp;#127935;"
    channeltitle "Van Life Builds"
