    title "60 SECOND VAN TOUR with a Hidden Shower!! #shorts #vanlife #vanbuild"
    description "Full 10 Minute tour: https://youtu.be/FLIVOu7LkZs&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #vanbuild #tinyhouse &amp;#10;&amp;#10;ITEMS used in this conversion are LINKED BELOW.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;GENERAL&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Drawer Pulls Rv Labs: https://expeditionupfitter.com/produc...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Blackout Window Covers: https://shop.thewanderful.co/collecti...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Windows: https://www.dkhardware.com/universal-non-contoured-awning-34-3-4-x-11-3-4-aw1033-product-1289476.html?utm_source=google&amp;#38;utm_medium=shopping&amp;#38;utm_campaign=free_listings&amp;#38;gclid=Cj0KCQjwxtSSBhDYARIsAEn0thQZKicfi94QvDgwINh3ggQDJI3Fcmj3TPnPhAOhnrGLeJCRiih3nmkaAvIJEALw_wcB&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Indel B 65QT 12v Refrigerator: https://truckfridge.com/products/tf65&amp;#10;LED STRIPS: https://amzn.to/3Jvma6V&amp;#10;LED Channel: https://amzn.to/365JBGj&amp;#10;Touch Light Switches: https://amzn.to/3pELAH1&amp;#10;Wall outlets: https://amzn.to/3O3BBXz&amp;#10;Leaf supports for table: https://amzn.to/3JBFzmE&amp;#10;Sink:https://amzn.to/3E5cfEe&amp;#10;Sink Drain: https://amzn.to/3jxPlfc&amp;#10;Shower System: https://amzn.to/3LQxxIm&amp;#10;Shower Pan: https://amzn.to/3rl7n8L&amp;#10;HepvO Waterless trap: https://amzn.to/3z8adjI&amp;#10;DEISEL cooktop: https://www.webasto-comfort.com/en-au/product-overview/product/show/diesel-cooker-x100/&amp;#10;12v Water Pump: https://amzn.to/3ghj75Z&amp;#10;Accumulator Tank: https://amzn.to/3z8btmW&amp;#10;Water filter: https://amzn.to/3O75NAZ&amp;#10;Upper Cabinet Hinges: https://amzn.to/3pzRA40&amp;#10;Upper Cabinet Struts: https://amzn.to/3w6UMq1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Maxxair Vent: https://amzn.to/3gqabeA  &amp;#10;Drawer Slides: https://amzn.to/3FsEKv8&amp;#10;Espar D2 Heater: https://amzn.to/3vgf0P1&amp;#10;Heater Mounting Plate:https://amzn.to/38Q7we9&amp;#10;Water Warmer Matt: https://amzn.to/2TblAHf&amp;#10;Mattress: https://amzn.to/3O3IeJx&amp;#10;&amp;#10;POWER &amp;#10;Security system converter: https://amzn.to/3M3o28T&amp;#10;Victron Charge controller: https://amzn.to/3v53Gmu&amp;#10;Victron DC to DC: https://amzn.to/3a0O6A0&amp;#10;500W Pure Sine Inverter: https://amzn.to/3JyPhWX&amp;#10;Inverter switch: https://amzn.to/3M3YJ6B&amp;#10;Solar Entry Port: https://amzn.to/3ghbU5V&amp;#10;SOK Lithium  Batteries: https://amzn.to/3jyVLuG&amp;#10;Blue Sea 120V Breaker Panel: https://amzn.to/3u08pt9&amp;#10;Inverter/120 Accesory connections: https://amzn.to/36hzdIB&amp;#10;Blue Sea on/off Switch: https://amzn.to/2M5Mhd6&amp;#10;LYNX Distributor: https://amzn.to/3GNVmhQ&amp;#10;Blue Sea 12v Fuse Boxes: https://amzn.to/2ShVoul&amp;#10;2 Way Switch (Gray Dump): https://amzn.to/2YjRj8e&amp;#10;20A Accesory Switches: https://amzn.to/2THyNHS&amp;#10;usb/12v Ports: https://amzn.to/34YO3m7&amp;#10;4/0G Wire: https://amzn.to/3a7uie9&amp;#10;2/0G Wire: https://amzn.to/2Mw4JM0&amp;#10;6G Wire: https://amzn.to/3oCoC39&amp;#10;8G Wire: https://amzn.to/3ckokrQ&amp;#10;12G Wire: https://amzn.to/3iNqJ0E&amp;#10;14G Wire: https://amzn.to/2LXc0ob&amp;#10;16G Wire: https://amzn.to/2MseuL6&amp;#10;Wire Loom: https://amzn.to/3qTXVq9&amp;#10;150A Fuse: https://amzn.to/3Kn6mF0&amp;#10;175A Fuse: https://amzn.to/33VlqsB&amp;#10;40A Fuse: https://amzn.to/3nmxr1M&amp;#10;ANL fuse holder: https://amzn.to/3oBggJc&amp;#10;Copper Lugs SM: https://amzn.to/39mLa1D&amp;#10;Copper Lugs 4/0G: https://amzn.to/36wCFPN&amp;#10;Copper Lugs 2/0G: https://amzn.to/3iqNlG5&amp;#10;Butt connectors SM: https://amzn.to/3sVO6tI&amp;#10;Spade Connectors: https://amzn.to/3pvFmZY&amp;#10;  &amp;#10;TOOLS &amp;#10;Liteband Headlamp: https://amzn.to/2YdWqXL&amp;#10;Reciprocating Knife: https://amzn.to/3bDmYHL&amp;#10;Clamps: https://amzn.to/3jUobNy&amp;#10;Track Saw: https://amzn.to/3lCDWdX&amp;#10;Jig Saw: https://amzn.to/3gZc3JC&amp;#10;Recip Saw: https://amzn.to/3gSA8BE&amp;#10;Impact Drill &amp;#38; Drill Set: https://amzn.to/2QKzOdH&amp;#10;Router: https://amzn.to/3jDPs6R&amp;#10;Scribe: https://amzn.to/2F2ZFL1&amp;#10;Pocket Hole Jig: https://amzn.to/334Jplp&amp;#10;Angle Grinder: https://amzn.to/2EQ00Bc&amp;#10;Clamps: https://amzn.to/3gVt8Uu&amp;#10;Nail Gun &amp;#38; Air Compressor Kit: https://amzn.to/31RkemM&amp;#10;Miter Saw: https://amzn.to/2YYqHdM&amp;#10;Table Saw: https://amzn.to/3lJmqEQ&amp;#10;Hydraulic lug crimper: https://amzn.to/2TdQCOo&amp;#10;Mounting straps: https://amzn.to/3ggCLyN&amp;#10;Rivnut tool: https://amzn.to/3zm51ce&amp;#10;ZIP TIE MOUNTS: https://amzn.to/2SiNfWy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#tinyhouse #vanlife #vantour"
