    id 169
    label "4M6fW1ElZwQ"
    step 0
    date "2019-09-07T13:00:03Z"
    title "VAN LIFE COLOMBIA | A Normal Day in the Life "
    description "What happens when you get stuck walking in the middle of the jungle during a thunderstorm at night? That's what we found out in this video. Today, we begin our true exploration of Colombia and we couldn't be more excited! Living in a van in Colombia is both challenging and incredible - as you'll see in this video. &amp;#128514; We got to experience Tayrona National Park near Santa Marta, Colombia in ALL its glory - both rain and shine. And this really is our normal day in the life, we're finding, here in places with a rainy season. One second, the day can be absolutely beautiful, with not a cloud in the sky, and the next, you can be stuck walking in the jungle in the middle of a rainstorm at NIGHT. &amp;#128561; Watch this video to find out what happens!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe to LEAW: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNh-5z8hRA8_W0vf-KI_3YQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Course: https://thematneys.co/course&amp;#10;&amp;#10;HOW TO MAKE THIS LIFESTYLE A REALITY FOR *YOU* (read below)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;THE MOST CRITICAL THING we did to get here was effectively manage our money. If you are looking to live life on the road, this is the first step. We share with you our money-management strategies in our $19 course here: https://thematneys.co/course * &amp;#10;&amp;#10;SECONDLY, here is a list of companies that*:&amp;#10; - Save us money&amp;#10; - Teach us skills to make us money&amp;#10; - Make products we NEED to live our current lifestyle&amp;#10;#1 - Our easy plug-and-play electrical setup: http://amzn.to/2sB7LPF &amp;#10;#2 - Unlimited international phone plan: https://g.co/fi/r/E04EN6 &amp;#10;#3 - This helped us grow a profitable social media brand that allows us to travel while earning money: http://bit.ly/2YULTPc&amp;#10;#4 - Travel insurance is a MUST, and here's our favorite: http://bit.ly/2WrwFVu&amp;#10;#5 - We earned our Bachelors' degrees DEBT-FREE here: https://lumerit.com/matneys&amp;#10;&amp;#10;*IMPORTANT NOTE: If you cannot afford our course, you can email us at info@thematneys.co and we will give you the course for free.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;**Disclaimer: If you purchase one of these products, we will earn a small commission at no extra cost to you. Thank you for your support! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Map of Colombia Travels: http://bit.ly/2Hqg1f1&amp;#10;Map of Central America Travels: http://bit.ly/2wxiazP&amp;#10;Map of Mexico Travels: http://bit.ly/2Z0c3kv&amp;#10;&amp;#10;About The Matneys:&amp;#10;We're Christian and Aubry, a couple traveling North and South America in our converted Sprinter Van. On The Matneys, we love chatting about the reality of living in a van, what van life allows us to do, and how traveling to new places with new cultures can really open your eyes to so much about the world, our own country, and ourselves. Our little home is simple, but it takes us to the most magical paradises in the world.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MUSIC:&amp;#10;Get a 30-day free trial of the best music for your videos: http://share.mscbd.fm/thematneys&amp;#10;Matt Cherne https://sellfy.com/mattcherne&amp;#10;Joe Bae: https://soundcloud.com/joebaemusic"
