  [
    id 172
    label "SUSillmduSE"
    step 0
    date "2020-01-05T14:32:37Z"
    title "TOP 10 TRAVEL DESTINATIONS | where to van life in 2020"
    description "We asked 10 of our favourite van life creators to share their TOP TRAVEL DESTINATIONS for 2020 &amp;#127757;&amp;#128656; After years of living in a tiny house on wheels we think these spots are worthy of your bucket list &amp;#38; ours too!! Wishing you all a wonderful year of adventure ahead x&amp;#10;&amp;#10;A huge thank you to each of the following van life channels who are featured in this video. We are so lucky to call them friends. Head to their channels and SUBSCRIBE!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Kinging-It https://www.youtube.com/user/kingingit365&amp;#10;Kombi Life https://www.youtube.com/user/kombilife&amp;#10;The Matney&amp;#8217;s https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC_NVASg3VB2TCjHx5w2ZJ-Q&amp;#10;Levi Allen https://www.youtube.com/user/LeftCoastVisuals&amp;#10;Trent &amp;#38; Allie https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCwh2SF7McSUf1GVFVk0nP8w&amp;#10;Indie Projects https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWq4rBWfctWP0duZwofs61w&amp;#10;Tio Aventura https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyMNphgSyMqPy7oxJ0ZaFkA&amp;#10;Tyler and Todd https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZkGmgbBziqGCYI3x9hVQPg&amp;#10;Mr and Mrs Adventure https://www.youtube.com/user/TheMrandMrsAdventure&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Ever dreamed of taking a vacation in a camper van or thought of building your own tiny home on wheels to travel the world? We hope this video can inspire you to take action in 2020.  Hear from the van life experts on what it&amp;#8217;s like to live in a van in Morocco, Norway, Guatemala and more!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Shoutout to Hey Nadine for this creative video concept :) You can check out her yearly video with travel creators here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1hbjs7a05yI&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; shop our Cookbook https://www.eamonandbec.com/weekday-whip-ups &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; shop our chai blends https://chaiwalachai.com/ &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;From the US? shop here chaiwalachai.com/usa&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; shop our photo filters https://www.eamonandbec.com/presets &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Catch up on our last adventures:&amp;#10;Someone Broke into our House (Van Life Nightmare)&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UcZMMR9SK_w&amp;#10;Life After Van Break In (van life barcelona)&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sx7VajPOFWU&amp;#10;Van Life Scotland | 3 People Living in a Van &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iXSxc6bnANk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tour the renovations we've done to our self converted sprinter van:&amp;#10;VAN TOUR after 2 years living in our TINY HOUSE on wheels http://bit.ly/newvantour&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Get a free trial of the best music for your videos: http://share.mscbd.fm/rebeccamoroney&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Looking for an all-inclusive, detailed van build guide?! Look no further!&amp;#10;https://thewanderful.co/?ref=eamonfitzgerald&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9825; Support Us &amp;#9825;  &amp;#10;&amp;#8608; shop our Cookbook https://www.eamonandbec.com/ &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; shop our chai blends https://chaiwalachai.com/ &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; shop Bec's handmade linen collection https://cedarandvine.net/collections/... &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; binge our latest adventures: BAJA BOUND http://bit.ly/2TJw6QL&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Favourite Products &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Bec&amp;#8217;s Linen Clothing https://cedarandvine.net/collections/...&amp;#10;Bec&amp;#8217;s Workout/Everyday Gear https://bit.ly/2XeApWd&amp;#10;Our Sunglasses johnnyflyco.com/eamon (get 20% off with this link!)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What We Shoot On!&amp;#10;Daily Vlogger  https://amzn.to/2rgaNtN&amp;#10;B-Roll Beast https://amzn.to/2vYD2CF&amp;#10;Aerial Footage https://amzn.to/2XauZvi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Top Ten Van Life Essentials &amp;#10;Tooth Brush Holder https://amzn.to/2p1fIO9&amp;#10;Spice Jars https://amzn.to/2NxlTHY&amp;#10;Gimbal Fan https://amzn.to/2Qjlyae&amp;#10;Keep Cup http://bit.ly/beckeepcup&amp;#10;Fruit Hammock https://amzn.to/2QmLyBt&amp;#10;Essential Oils https://amzn.to/2oZFMJS&amp;#10;Car Diffuser https://bit.ly/2NkLjsI&amp;#10;Bug Screen https://amzn.to/2QmMjL0&amp;#10;Vitamix https://amzn.to/2BiW35r&amp;#10;Water Filter http://bit.ly/vanlifewaterfilter&amp;#10;Blinds http://www.vanmadegear.com/&amp;#10;Chaiwala Chai Kit https://chaiwalachai.com/&amp;#10;MAX TRAX https://amzn.to/2XBT8f9&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks for sharing a REAL WEEK of VAN LIFE in Spain with us!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you enjoyed today's video, you'll love our series from van life in Iceland!&amp;#10;Trading Van Life Canada for Van Life Iceland https://bit.ly/32Fevia&amp;#10;Land of Fire &amp;#38; Ice | Van Life Iceland https://bit.ly/2LxQPaq&amp;#10;Week of Van Life in Iceland | Ring Road Trip https://bit.ly/30MAzWE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want updates in between videos?&amp;#10;&amp;#9644; SHARE WITH US &amp;#9644; &amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Instagram: &amp;#10;https://instagram.com/eh.mon&amp;#10;https://instagram.com/rebeccamoroney&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OUR CAMERAS:&amp;#10;Daily Vlogger:  https://amzn.to/2rgaNtN&amp;#10;B Roll Beast: https://amzn.to/2vYD2CF&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Who are we?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We're Eamon and Bec, a Toronto-based couple who live full-time in our self converted Sprinter Van!! SUBSCRIBE for wanderlust travel, behind the scenes of what it's really like to live in a van, and videos all about the yummy vegan food we make + eat! VAN LIFE COUPLE. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We post new videos every Sunday :)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our goal here is to inspire you to chase after your own dreams however big (or small... tiny homes anyone?) they may be! We hope to create a community of like-minded, positive individuals who will grow to love and support one another on their own journeys. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #eamonandbec #endofvanlife"
