    id 178
    label "jfxWfKgP4VQ"
    step 0
    date "2019-07-25T13:00:09Z"
    title "Van Life 101: 12 MUST-HAVE items for MINIMALIST Tiny House life"
    description "VAN LIFE | Essential items for maximum enjoyment in your tiny home, on wheels or not :) &amp;#10;&amp;#128317;ITEM LINKS BELOW &amp;#128317;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#9825; Support Us By &amp;#8608; Hit that bell + Subscribe https://bit.ly/2PDqDdG&amp;#10;And if you know anyone who might enjoy, please share the &amp;#9825;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Our LEGENDARY 6-month Sprinter van conversion series!:&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLCTwz2HZPRzlGg1-0Wsx0MlQNvU7I0fiw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Our FULL van tour (you're gonna love it) &amp;#9825;:&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/ubaSj6KxT6I&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Recap vid after returning from Europe: &amp;#10;https://youtu.be/p6Sv-9k-OcE&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128317;As seen in this week&amp;#8217;s episode &amp;#128317;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The full double rainbow video, classic OG YouTube:&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/OQSNhk5ICTI&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vanlife Diaries book:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2LUA9K8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;1. Gneiss Spice &amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2StFBUO&amp;#10;&amp;#10;2. Stainless steel spray bottles&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2Y8QUmz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Aluminum is a great, less expensive, option too:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2XXYHIV&amp;#10;&amp;#10;3. Clothing organizer bags&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2YayfH0&amp;#10;&amp;#10;4. Suction cup basket &amp;#10;We bought ours at World Market but here&amp;#8217;s a similarly-sized one on Amazon: &amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2y8OklT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;5. Wireless bluetooth speaker&amp;#10;Ours is called the &amp;#8220;Sonosphere&amp;#8221;:&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/2y0m4C4&amp;#10;&amp;#10;6. FabHab outdoor rug made from recycled plastic bottles&amp;#10;Our color is Copenhagen: https://amzn.to/2Lza7Mr&amp;#10;&amp;#10;7. Bug screen for slider door&amp;#10;The slider of our Dodge Sprinter 3500 fit the 62 x 81&amp;#8221; size: https://amzn.to/32GtMPS&amp;#10;+ magnets, though we usually just tuck it under the rubber door seal: &amp;#10;https://amzn.to/32JolQo&amp;#10;&amp;#10;8. Barebones (poo) shovel &amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2JV6Pjm&amp;#10;&amp;#10;9. Solar LED twinkle lights&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2Y5CRyl&amp;#10;&amp;#10;10. Rechargeable Mighty Bright book lights&amp;#10;Brittany&amp;#8217;s (lavender): https://amzn.to/2K2fC2W&amp;#10;Drew&amp;#8217;s (midnight blue): https://amzn.to/2K0xAmJ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;11. Polaroid camera&amp;#10;Mini: https://amzn.to/2Sv68Ba&amp;#10;Mini film: https://amzn.to/2SzzMoT&amp;#10;+ album: https://amzn.to/32JSmPW&amp;#10;Wide: https://amzn.to/2Y5DAQ5&amp;#10;Wide film: https://amzn.to/2JUCOjS&amp;#10;+ album: https://amzn.to/2JWpZpc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;12. Hydrus &amp;#8220;Paradise&amp;#8221; SUP paddleboard&amp;#10;Visit https://www.hydrusboardtech.com/mrandmrsadventure to unlock 30% off travel inspired inflatable paddle boards!!  Limited time, so get em in time to enjoy summer :)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;+ Our van build faves:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;3-PART WATER FILTER (18:03): https://youtu.be/C4PgNSYYsic&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/2Dz9DAk&amp;#10;Use promo code MRANDMRSADVENTURE10 for 10% off (apply on the shipping page) and ask about the VanLife Adventure Van Bundle when wanting to learn more about our set up.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;TOP LOADING 66L SNOMASTER FRIDGE (10:26): https://youtu.be/xX6H3U3WvGM&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/2Wa1IAJ&amp;#10;Use promo code mrandmrsadventure for 5% off&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ESPAR HEATER (4:17): https://youtu.be/2ReE4rXC4aU&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/2Vqba60&amp;#10;Use promo code mrandmrsadventure for $100-ish off (changes with the GBP)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;3-100W RENOGY SOLAR PANELS (19:45): https://youtu.be/mfC8IhFWal0&amp;#10;https://bit.ly/2DokIYa&amp;#10;Use code MrAndMrsAdventure in the coupon box 5% off (except for batteries)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;2.5 GALLON HOT-WATER HEATER (18:16): https://amzn.to/2EnA0Kn&amp;#10;&amp;#10;+ You can browse ALL our other FAVE gear in our Amazon Affiliate Shop:&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/mrandmrsadventure&amp;#10;&amp;#10;---------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;All videos made by Brittany, starring Drew!&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/mrandmrsadventure/&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/heradventure&amp;#10;&amp;#10;As always, we are so grateful to have you joining us on our journey here and we appreciate all your support &amp;#9825;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;Don't forget to like us on FaceBook!&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/mrmrsadventure/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;+ Sign up for exclusive updates via our Newsletter here :)&amp;#10;http://www.mrandmrsadventure.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;+Become a Patron! &amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/mrandmrsadventure&amp;#10;-OR- &amp;#10;If you'd like, send us a one time donation via PayPal&amp;#10;MrandMrsAdventure@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Also, you can shop (for holidays, birthdays, everyday things, VanLife things) via our beautifully organized Amazon Shop, made especially for you: &amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/mrandmrsadventure&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;FAQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MAIN VLOGGING CAMERA: https://amzn.to/2DZo3M2&amp;#10;DSLR CAMERA: http://amzn.to/2mEA8cT&amp;#10;GIMBLE: https://amzn.to/2Q0kADu&amp;#10;GOPRO: http://amzn.to/2my5p1U&amp;#10;DRONE: https://amzn.to/2LKoHlg&amp;#10;ALL OTHER PHOTO/VIDEO GEAR: https://amzn.to/2PzrwSJ&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;MUSIC:&amp;#10;Intro song, &amp;#8220;Home is Where You Park It,&amp;#8221; by our dear friends Anne and Arnan:&amp;#10;http://www.weareANAE.com/buy/&amp;#10;+ all other beats via https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/x7uwj3/"
