  [
    id 181
    label "JZVzjriV9_M"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-10T16:00:14Z"
    title "Van Camping: First Night in the VW Campervan | Van Life"
    description "Join me on my first night camping in the campervan. I've officially joined the van life and got myself a VW Transporter T6.1 which is fully rigged out for off grid camping! I hope to do some camping with my family over the summer months and so I wanted to get used to using the camper and all it's gadgets! Safe to say I had an awesome night and can't wait to explore more places to camp in the van! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Recipe:&amp;#10;1 x Onion&amp;#10;2 x Cloves Garlic&amp;#10;Around 150-200g of Pancetta &amp;#10;1 x can chopped tomatoes&amp;#10;1/2 can chickpeas&amp;#10;Baby Spinach leaves&amp;#10;1 x Lemon&amp;#10;A shake of Moroccan spice! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MY BUSHCRAFT &amp;#38; SURVIVAL GEAR SHOP: https://www.taoutdoors.com/shop/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My Bushcraft, Survival and Filming Gear (Amazon): https://www.amazon.com/shop/taoutdoors&amp;#10;These are amazon affiliate links&amp;#10;&amp;#10;TA OUTDOORS MERCHANDISE: https://taofficial.com &amp;#10;&amp;#10;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/taoutdoorofficial&amp;#10;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/totallyawesomeoutdoors&amp;#10;TWITTER: https://twitter.com/OutdoorsTa&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#bushcraft #vanlife #campervan #survival #camping #taoutdoors #skills"
