    title "Solo Female Living in a Van for 2 years with a Cat  Dodge Class B van tour."
    description "Today's alternative dwelling documentary features Sarah and her cat bodhi who live in a van and have for the past 2 years in western Canada. she shares her experience about what it is like for her to do Vanlife&amp;#10;follow her here.&amp;#10;https://instagram.com/find_your_wild_?igshid=YmMyMTA2M2Y=&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Van Life Tours&amp;#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL8TC5LCUPfit4qO8aiIh_iHtC2xFWtIzA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vanlife Video Podcast&amp;#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL8TC5LCUPfitJMClK--WFcx1CUHI-rGM7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vanlife Audio Podcast&amp;#10;https://anchor.fm/vanlifeandchill&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want your van featured in a tour?!&amp;#10;https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1mdpgF9x6KCrqODlO_fD27Ql2o7rPHVsJQAXMwyZyDY8/edit &amp;#10;or email&amp;#10;Forrest@differentmedia.ca&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Discord&amp;#10;https://discord.gg/4kWjnSfF6U&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Movies&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3HnMwHJ&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3HmmEfw&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3gxFchf&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vlogs&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/ForrestStevensYT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you to Patreons! Jamie F, Renay E, Andrew B, Madison and Raynor, Jennifer S, Doug B, Marian H, Cody S, Ashton S, Akshay A, Curtis, and Sonya B! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Patreon&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/ForrestStevens &amp;#10;Paypal&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=ML6MEHLAHUMFN&amp;#10;Bitcoin&amp;#10;3Ao1PoA7i1mY4R2eQp8HYSJv77jZ1HkMN7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you read all this give us 1 thumbs up emoji, 1 tree emoji and 1 Video camera emoji in the comment section."
