    title "Everything is about to change! (We need help) | Solo Van Life Australia"
    description "This is what we've been waiting for! Join us as we overland remote outback Australia in our van! Go to https://www.audible.com/occy or text 'occy' to 500 500 to get your free 30 day trial!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PUSH UP CHALLENGE! - Join the Max &amp;#38; Occy Team here or DONATE here:&amp;#10;https://www.thepushupchallenge.com.au/fundraisers/MaxOccysTeam&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Get Connected with POWERTECH! https://www.powertec.com.au/ &amp;#10;Use code MO22 for 15% off!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join my crew by supporting me on Patreon : )&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/maxandoccy&amp;#10;Or, for one time donations PayPal to maxbid88@gmail.com   Thank you!!! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;For the behind the scenes - Follow me on Instagram &amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/max_bids/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHERE DO I GET MY MUSIC??&amp;#10;http://share.mscbd.fm/maxandlee &amp;#11013;&amp;#65039;&amp;#10;Elevate your videos with record-label quality music from Musicbed!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Occy and I have moved into my van to join the van life movement in Australia, allowing me to live, work and travel full time! I cannot wait to get out there and overland Australia &amp;#128588;&amp;#127996;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #solovanlife #vanlifeaustralia"
