    label "hFpYHlq4nfA"
    step 0
    date "2022-04-22T18:27:40Z"
    title "Stunning van conversion w/ wet bath. They traded in #buslife for #vanlife"
    description "Tour Kels &amp;#38; Jay's amazing new van conversion. This is their 2nd build &amp;#38; it's better than ever. &amp;#10;Save 20% on your system and your first month is free when you sign up for interactive monitoring. Visit https://SimpliSafe.com/tinyhousegiantjourney to learn more!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW KELS &amp;#38; JAY:&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-GP8fx60ZBrjBB2P8nBOSQ&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/kelsandjay/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUBSCRIBE FOR MORE VIDEOS: &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/tinyhousegj/noodlemx?sub_confirmation=1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;---------GET SOCIAL W/ THIS CHANNEL ------------&amp;#10;Website: http://www.tinyhousegiantjourney.com&amp;#10;Facebook: http://www.facebook.com/tinyhousegiantjourney&amp;#10;Instagram: http://www.instagram.com/tinyhousegiantjourney&amp;#10;Twitter: http://www.twitter.com/tinyhousegirl&amp;#10;&amp;#10;----------CREDITS---------------&amp;#10;PRODUCED &amp;#38; HOSTED BY: &amp;#10;Jenna Kausal&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VIDEOGRAPHY &amp;#38; EDITING BY: &amp;#10;Kels &amp;#38; Jay of:&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-GP8fx60ZBrjBB2P8nBOSQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ONLINE EDITING BY:&amp;#10;Marcia Trader&amp;#10;http://www.marciatrader.com &amp;#10;&amp;#10;MUSIC: https://www.epidemicsound.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ADDITIONAL PHOTOS PROVIDED BY THE BUILDER, HOME OWNER.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vantour #vanlife #nomadland&amp;#10;&amp;#10;00:00 Intro&amp;#10;01:08 Meet Kels &amp;#38; Jay &amp;#10;01:27 Why they started with a Skoolie&amp;#10;02:12 What's better about living in a van?&amp;#10;02:50 Build out &amp;#38; cost&amp;#10;03:07 Filming for Tiny House Giant Journey&amp;#10;03:30 Let's take a tour! Starting with the kitchen&amp;#10;04:47 How they designed some space for their cat (including the kitty litter box)&amp;#10;06:19 Pippa montage!&amp;#10;06:33 SimpliSafe security system (sponsored)&amp;#10;08:07 Convertible chair w/ storage&amp;#10;08:56 Pull out table &amp;#38; fridge&amp;#10;09:01 Wet bath&amp;#10;10:29 Bedroom, closet, and desk&amp;#10;12:19 Exterior van tour&amp;#10;14:10 What's next for them?"
