  [
    id 198
    label "dMZUZJUk-sg"
    step 0
    date "2018-04-25T18:26:46Z"
    title "VAN LIFE // minimalist wardrobe while living in a van | Eamon  Bec"
    description "THANK YOU FOR JOINING ME IN MY FIRST SOLO VIDEO!! You have requested this one for ages and it turns out...I LOVED walking you through my van life minimalist wardrobe tour.  I had no idea I owned only 40 articles of clothing (including outerwear) and was excited to lay it all out for you! As an aside, I try to buy as ethical as possible but I still obviously have a few pieces that are not - just do the best you can :)  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Here are links for some of the clothing I featured in today's video:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;KNIXWEAR USA: https://bit.ly/2qYgZGw&amp;#10;KNIXWEAR CANADA: https://bit.ly/2HqOEDN&amp;#10;BATHING SUIT: http://bit.ly/onepiecebather&amp;#10;LULULEMON: https://amzn.to/2jkw9mb&amp;#10;MADAME BABU: https://www.etsy.com/ca/shop/madamebabu&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;&amp;#9658; CLICK TO SUBSCRIBE + join our van life adventures: http://bit.ly/2DDSUgu&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9644; SHARE WITH US &amp;#9644; &amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Instagram: &amp;#10;https://instagram.com/eh.mon&amp;#10;https://instagram.com/rebeccamoroney&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Who are we?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We're Eamon and Bec, a Toronto-based couple who live full-time in our self converted Sprinter Van!! SUBSCRIBE for wanderlust travel, behind the scenes of what it's really like to live in a van, and videos all about the yummy vegan food we make + eat!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We upload videos 3x per week (Wednesdays, Fridays + Sundays)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our goal here is to inspire you to chase after your own dreams however big (or small... tiny homes anyone?) they may be! We hope to create a community of like-minded, positive individuals who will grow to love and support one another on their own journeys. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;New to our channel? Watch our 2017 recap video to get caught up:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2DyCi6r&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Some of our most popular videos...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Watch Van Life Tour | Our Custom DIY Sprinter Van Conversion:&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2n6QvRl&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Watch How to Convert a Sprinter Van in 30 Days: &amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2BpzBlW&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We&amp;#8217;ve pulled inspiration from several of our favourite vloggers/van lifers/vegans on YouTube, such as: Casey Neistat , Jinti Fell , Lauren Toyota, Fun for Louis and any other talented creators that YouTube&amp;#8217;s algorithm will hopefully connect us with ;)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #eamonandbec #minimalist"
    channeltitle "Eamon &amp;#38; Bec"
    channelid "UC4laAHbk8VSgmvB47tsd2XQ"
