  [
    id 201
    label "mWziPCrfjfw"
    step 0
    date "2022-02-20T17:57:19Z"
    title "ILLEGAL in Morocco (Van Life - why do we do this?)"
    description "The inevitable has happened, we're Illegal in Morocco! Get up to a year's supply of immune supporting Vitamin D + 5 individual travel packs, both FREE with your first purchase! Click: http://athleticgreens.com/kingingit&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Well, our visas have run out! Is this the end of van life?&amp;#10;BUT there is naff all we can do about it!&amp;#10;The boat borders are still closed in and out and Morocco so we cannot leave.&amp;#10;This week is all about the madness we have to endure to getting ourselves and our van out of Morocco, including heading to court &amp;#128514;.&amp;#10;Then once she's out and home - is this the end of van life? will we be taking her on another adventure? or will she be going back into storage .. watch and find out all the juicy details of new adventures this summer! &amp;#129395;&amp;#129395;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128653; Our bus stats:&amp;#10;2001 Mercedes Vario 814&amp;#10;4.2 Litre Diesel&amp;#10;Was 24 seats (now 2) &amp;#10;Air Suspension&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128663; Top 10 videos to watch on Kinging-it&amp;#8217;s channel:WATCH HERE! - http://bit.ly/3uHC5sy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10145;&amp;#65039;&amp;#128107; A bit about US- &amp;#10;We are Craig and Aimee, from South Wales, UK. After Aimee was diagnosed with Cancer at 18 and Craig broke his neck shortly after by a freak accident, we decided life really is too short. Watch our story here -  https://bit.ly/3kuiZBA&amp;#10;&amp;#10; &amp;#127932; MUSIC!&amp;#10;The music in this video is all copyright free and from Artlist - anyone who signs up through your link will get 2 extra months free with their subscription!&amp;#10;Sign up here: https://bit.ly/3yLpN3r&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Social Media -&amp;#10;&amp;#128998; Facebook - https://www.facebook/com/kingingit&amp;#10;&amp;#128997; Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/wearekingingit&amp;#10;&amp;#129000; Website - http://www.kinging-it.com&amp;#10;&amp;#129002; Twitter - https://twitter.com/kingingit100&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127804;SHOP &amp;#10; Get your Kinging-it clothing here -  http://www.kinging-it.com/shop&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127800;PODCAST&amp;#10; Kinging it PODCAST - https://www.kinging-it.com/the-podcast&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#Vanlife #moroccovlog"
