  [
    id 202
    label "RFIh5X_yP54"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-06T15:34:26Z"
    title "VAN LIFE ROAD TRIP UP THE PACIFIC COAST HIGHWAY CALIFORNIA"
    description "We head north on the Pacific Coast Highway 101 and wow it didn't disappoint!&amp;#10;Read more about TomTom GO Camper Max: https://tomtom.co/3t2W1av&amp;#10;or Purchase TomTom GO Camper Max here : https://tomtom.co/39TLN5h&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow Tom Tom on social media here:&amp;#10; YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/user/TomTomOfficial&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/tomtomdrivers/?hl=nl&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow TomTomDrivers on social media here:&amp;#10;Instagram:  https://www.instagram.com/tomtomdrivers/ &amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/TomTomDrivers/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Travel vlog 507| Filmed June 2022 | Redwood park |  Country 32/197   &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128308; SUBSCRIBE to our Youtube channel  https://www.youtube.com/treadtheglobe/?_confirmation=1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127909; Join  the TREAD TRIBE patreon page: https://www.patreon.com/treadtheglobe   &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128085; BUY exclusive TREAD the Globe Merch here: https://treadtheglobe.com/tread-boutique/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128221; Sign up for our free weekly newsletter https://treadtheglobe.com/newsletter-2/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128205; Track us live (free) : https://www.polarsteps.com/TREADTheGlobe&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9193; Follow us on Social Media for behind the scenes action:  &amp;#10;     INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/treadtheglobeofficial&amp;#10;     FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/treadtheglobe  &amp;#10;     TWITTER: https://twitter.com/treadtheglobe  &amp;#10;     WEBSITE: https://treadtheglobe.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127925;Enjoyed the music in this video?   Get it copyright free here: https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/fohfcc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127916; OUR FAVOURITE VIDEOS: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLlDFQvGT7bR-vpijioMHZ0viT8HtbF7CQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PRODUCTS WE USE:  https://treadtheglobe.com/products-we-use/&amp;#10;SERVICES WE USE: https://treadtheglobe.com/services-we-use/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#TomTomDrivers #GOCamperMax #ad #vanlife &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;NOTE: Some of these may be affiliate links, which means when you buy something we may receive a small commission. There is no additional charge to you, and it helps keep us travelling so thank you.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;COMPANIES WE'RE WORKING WITH&amp;#10;  &amp;#10;&amp;#128656; APLAN - THATCHAM SERVICES:  &amp;#10; UK based van/motorhome insurance (including self builds). Quote TREAD the Globe for a preferential rate.   Tel: 01635 879 910 (UK)  &amp;#10;  &amp;#10;&amp;#128187;CONNECT PLUS Internet:  &amp;#10;Need internet on your travels? World wide cover available  &amp;#10;For longer travels visit: CONNECT PLUS: https://www.connectpls.com/ &amp;#10;For shorter term visit RENT N CONNECT: https://www.rentnconnect.com/ &amp;#10;Mention TREAD THE GLOBE for a special discount&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128512; A BIT ABOUT US:&amp;#10;We&amp;#8217;re Marianne &amp;#38; Chris, a happily married couple from the UK.  Marianne is a living kidney donor to her best friend, and realising that life was for living and never really knowing what&amp;#8217;s round the corner - we decided to fulfil our dream of travelling full time.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;So in March 2018 after the kids had left home, we sold our belongings, rented our house and moved into our campervan called Trudy.  We set off to see the world and after vanlifing around Ireland and Europe, we grabbed our backpacks and spent 5 months exploring Central America.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Feeling like we needed a challenge, we planned the ultimate van life adventure! In Jan 2020 set off to drive around the World from UK to UK.  But after arriving in Turkey, covid caught up with us and closed the borders, so we had a wonderful 18 months exploring this special country.  Realising we were not going to be able to head further East, we decided to do a handbrake turn and go the other way and shipped our van to the USA.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We hope you enjoy coming with us, and we&amp;#8217;ll continue to share our real adventures and hope you feel inspire to step out of your comfort zone and try something new.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CHAPTERS&amp;#10;0:00. Waking up at the Golden Gate Bridge&amp;#10;3:36. Why you need this for your road trip&amp;#10;6:37   Driving North&amp;#10;8:46.  Waking up at Bodega Bay&amp;#10;11:14  Continuing the road trip north&amp;#10;14:36.  The avenue of the Giants&amp;#10;18:55.   The road trip continues and finding a spot for the night"
    channeltitle "TREAD the globe"
