    title "FULL VAN BUILD | RAIN SHOWER IN A SPRINTER VAN | LUXURY MODERN Tiny Home for Full Time VANLIFE!"
    description "CONNECT WITH US more on Instagram @louisthevan &amp;#10;&amp;#10;This van has been sold. Join our mailing list to be notified of future vans for sale: https://www.ltvcustoms.com/for-sale&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ALL ITEMS used in this conversion are LINKED BELOW..&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#tinyhome #vanlife #nomad&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Build Resources: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Interior  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Iceco 65QT Refrigerator: https://icecofreezer.com/products/com...&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;10% OFF Discount Code (LOUISVAN10)&amp;#10; &amp;#10;Cushion Foam: https://amzn.to/3iQFjos&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Cushion Foam Bed: https://amzn.to/2MshZBe&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Touch Light Switches: https://amzn.to/3a7vuhD&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Faucet: https://amzn.to/3a3P5PX&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Sink: https://amzn.to/3a44NKQ&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Shower Mixer and head: https://amzn.to/39iU28g&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Shower on/off valve: https://amzn.to/2KTlLTK&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;1500W Water Heater: https://amzn.to/36hSFVo&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Shower door handles: https://amzn.to/3omy20H&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;1800W induction Stove: https://amzn.to/3sXia8n&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Freshwater fill port: https://amzn.to/2M4rvKM&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Fresh Water Tank: https://amzn.to/2Mw0yji&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Grey Tank: https://amzn.to/3iRXmdU&amp;#8203;  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;12v Water Pump: https://amzn.to/39i3Csa&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Water filter: https://amzn.to/2NFsRfF&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;HepvO Waterless Valve; https://amzn.to/36hWM3M&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Shower Drain: https://amzn.to/2KPc3Sb&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;500lbs 24&amp;#34; Slides: https://amzn.to/39mnaM6&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;250lbs 20&amp;#34; Slides: https://amzn.to/3t0vQQ0&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Mica Powder for epoxy:  https://amzn.to/3t0tr7W&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Epoxy Kit: https://amzn.to/2M4oI4g&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Fiberglass: https://amzn.to/3omWK0G&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Upper Cabinet Hinges: https://amzn.to/3qOYgdC&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Upper Cabinet Struts: https://amzn.to/3a8ot06&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Maxxair Vent: https://amzn.to/3a8NGaD&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Pop Up Outlet: https://amzn.to/3sYi5kO&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Slide Outlet: https://amzn.to/3caoPGl&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Maxxair dome: https://amzn.to/3ccPjXC&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Heater To Tank Connector: https://amzn.to/2NE6ffv&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;5KW Heater: https://amzn.to/2MoLDY6&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;POWER   &amp;#10;Victron CHarge controller: https://amzn.to/3sYe5AB&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Victron DC to DC: https://amzn.to/3a0O6A0&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;3000W Pure Sine Inverter: https://amzn.to/2YjpQDD&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Flexible solar panels: https://amzn.to/3qYpDCn&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Solar Entry Port: https://amzn.to/3iPAprN&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;lifepo4 Batteries: https://amzn.to/39kmBCj&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;120V Breakers: https://amzn.to/36wFb8H&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Inverter connectors: https://amzn.to/36hzdIB&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Blue Sea on/off Switch: https://amzn.to/2M5Mhd6&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Buss Bars: https://amzn.to/2NvA9Cs&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Fuse Boxes: https://amzn.to/2KPxJxA&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Switch Panel/USB Ports: https://amzn.to/3iM8gSm&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;2 Way Switch: https://amzn.to/2YjRj8e&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Copper Bar for Batteries: https://amzn.to/39Z7tJy&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;4/0G Wire: https://amzn.to/3a7uie9&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;2/0G wire: https://amzn.to/2Mw4JM0&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OFC BLACK 4G: https://amzn.to/2NyFglj&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OFC RED 4G: https://amzn.to/3cfmcTA&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OFC BLACK 8G: https://amzn.to/2YkaQW0&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OFC RED 8G: https://amzn.to/3ccT5jH&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OFC 10G: https://amzn.to/2NtglQ7&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;12G Wire: https://amzn.to/3iNqJ0E&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;14G Wire:https://amzn.to/2LXc0ob&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;16G Wire: https://amzn.to/2MseuL6&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Wire Loom: https://amzn.to/3qTXVq9&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;300A Fuse: https://amzn.to/2NvC1uY&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;250A Fuse: https://amzn.to/36hlcuj&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Copper Lugs SM: https://amzn.to/39mLa1D&amp;#8203;&amp;#10; &amp;#10;Copper Lugs 4/0G:https://amzn.to/36wCFPN&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Butt connectors SM:https://amzn.to/3sVO6tI&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Spade Connectors: https://amzn.to/3okJh9K&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Warmer MAT 7x40: https://amzn.to/3caRLxS&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Warmer MAT 12X18: https://amzn.to/3sYosEH&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Grey Tank Ball Valve: https://amzn.to/3t1F1zo&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Other&amp;#10;Edge Banding: https://amzn.to/3pmo1BX&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Eternabond Tape 2&amp;#8221;: https://amzn.to/39lOOIW&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Eternabond Tape 4&amp;#8221;:https://amzn.to/3olfyxw&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Sikaflex: https://amzn.to/3qYqenB&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Butyl Tape: https://amzn.to/2YexDmn&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Kilmat: https://amzn.to/36ibVSW&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tools  &amp;#10; &amp;#10; Liteband Headlamp: https://amzn.to/2YdWqXL&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10; Reciprocating Knife: https://amzn.to/3bDmYHL&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;  Clamps: https://amzn.to/3jUobNy&amp;#8203;&amp;#10; &amp;#10;  Track Saw: https://amzn.to/3lCDWdX&amp;#8203;&amp;#10; &amp;#10;  Jig Saw: https://amzn.to/3gZc3JC&amp;#8203;&amp;#10; &amp;#10;  Recip Saw: https://amzn.to/3gSA8BE&amp;#8203;&amp;#10; &amp;#10;  Impact Drill &amp;#38; Drill Set: https://amzn.to/2QKzOdH&amp;#8203;&amp;#10; &amp;#10;  Router: https://amzn.to/3jDPs6R&amp;#8203;&amp;#10; &amp;#10;  Scribe: https://amzn.to/2F2ZFL1&amp;#8203;&amp;#10; &amp;#10;  Pocket Hole Jig: https://amzn.to/334Jplp&amp;#8203;&amp;#10; &amp;#10;  Angle Grinder: https://amzn.to/2EQ00Bc&amp;#8203;&amp;#10; &amp;#10;  Clamps: https://amzn.to/3gVt8Uu&amp;#8203;&amp;#10; &amp;#10;  Nail Gun &amp;#38; Air Compressor Kit: https://amzn.to/31RkemM&amp;#8203;&amp;#10; &amp;#10;  Miter Saw (Bought Used): https://amzn.to/2YYqHdM&amp;#8203;&amp;#10; &amp;#10;  Table Saw (Bought Used): https://amzn.to/3lJmqEQ&amp;#8203;"
