  [
    id 210
    label "Q5l7ymvdKeU"
    step 0
    date "2021-06-06T14:34:20Z"
    title "JUST THREE GIRLS IN A VAN  two dogs (a van life vlog)"
    description "Visit http://Simplisafe.com/vanwives to check out SimpliSafe&amp;#8217;s award-winning home security system that keeps your home safe around the clock! It&amp;#8217;s really reliable, easy to use and no contracts!&amp;#10;This video is sponsored by SimpliSafe&amp;#10;JUST THREE GIRLS IN A VAN &amp;#38; two dogs (a van life vlog in British Columbia, Canada) &amp;#10;&amp;#10;This weeks van life vlog -it&amp;#8217;s just three girls in a van exploring beautiful British Columbia. We&amp;#8217;re loving van life Canada as we&amp;#8217;re seeing old friends along the way as we travel in our campervan. Usually we&amp;#8217;re off grid exploring as a van life couple but this week we add one more to the mix to make three van girls exploring the city of Kamloops, British Columbia. Hope you enjoy the tour of Kamloops while living in a van as much as we did :-) &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Business Inquiries &amp;#10;hello@vanwives.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join the Patreon Pack HERE! &amp;#10;For exclusive content, photos in our camera roll, live streams, and MORE!&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/vanwives&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Journey! How did we get here?&amp;#10;In the winter of 2019 we moved in to our self built van full time to begin living, working and travelling Canada. We quickly fell in love with chasing our dreams of adventuring off the beaten path, living off grid and being self sustaining. We drove our van thousands of miles through various countries-Canada, USA, Mexico &amp;#38; Guatemala. All of which we documented here on our channel, be sure to check that out! After many years on the open road we found ourselves 15 acres of remote woods on the East Coast of Canada where we are building a homestead and renovating our fully off the grid cabin. We are diving into this chapter of our lives in no experience, we're so happy we can bring you all along as we learn to do it all with our own two hands. Thank you for being here with us for cabin life, van life and all the in between!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;NEW VIDEO EVERY SUNDAY 9:30&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203; EST &amp;#127774; &amp;#10;3+ Years of Van life with 2 dogs&amp;#10;Off- Grid Living at our Cabin in the woods&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us on Instagram &amp;#10;@vanwives &amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/vanwives/?h...... &amp;#10;Jaz https://www.instagram.com/jazzyjoyy/?......&amp;#10;Crystal  https://www.instagram.com/crysdd/?hl=...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MUSIC: Brought to you by Music Bed- Elevate your films &amp;#38; projects with better music http://share.mscbd.fm/vanwives&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music License: &amp;#10;MB01W2PHQSBLRER&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203; #threegirlsinavan #vanlifevlog"
    channeltitle "Vanwives"
    channelid "UCtf6aq_atnqF6shEam6m1sQ"
