    date "2021-05-08T17:00:16Z"
    title "VAN LIFE | TINY $1600 Van Tour!"
    description "In this video, I give my long awaited van tour! It goes in depth on just about every part of my tiny ford transit connect! It's the perfect video to watch if you want to see more of my van! If you liked the video, please consider subscribing for more content just like this! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;PATREON: https://www.patreon.com/LadyBugout&amp;#10;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/ladybug.out/&amp;#10;PayPal: https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/ladybugout&amp;#10;&amp;#10;As an Amazon Associate I earn from qualifying purchases and the following are paid links to products shown in the video. It helps me out and allows me to support products I enjoy:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Back up camera: https://amzn.to/3bLlTyC&amp;#10;iPhone Car Mount: https://amzn.to/3vnfVM8&amp;#10;12 v. Defroster/Heater: https://amzn.to/3oCgBuR&amp;#10;Rainguards: https://amzn.to/3hRSqaf&amp;#10;Fire Extinguisher: https://amzn.to/3yGOmjl&amp;#10;Yescom Awning: https://amzn.to/3yyxlaH&amp;#10;Universal Roof Rack: https://amzn.to/3fe7ixY&amp;#10;Shoe Organizer: https://www.target.com/p/over-the-door-24-pocket-mesh-shoe-organizer-light-gray-made-by-design-8482/-/A-53170313 (I bought mine at a Target store. This is the closest to it that I could find online).&amp;#10;Tatami Mattress: https://amzn.to/2RwqlL4&amp;#10;Faucet Pump: https://amzn.to/3yOYXYV&amp;#10;Shower head and bucket (The 2.5 gallon one is no longer available. This is the brand, but a 5 gallon version): https://amzn.to/2SezlV9&amp;#10;Portable Butane Stove: https://amzn.to/3u9J0JN&amp;#10;Salinas Storage Cabinet: https://amzn.to/3hHFQdx&amp;#10;Mesh Shoe Holder (Target): https://bit.ly/3s190Wx&amp;#10;Plastic Anchor Toggles (for mirror): https://www.acehardware.com/departments/hardware/screws-and-anchors/anchors/5335252&amp;#10;Tension Rod (Target): https://bit.ly/3b941O0&amp;#10;Front Window Bug Screens: https://amzn.to/2TbeDG7&amp;#10;IKEA FLISAT Wall Shelf: https://bit.ly/3w5kGLq&amp;#10;IKEA BEKVAM Spice Rack: https://bit.ly/3lYTE3m&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Links on Other Videos:&amp;#10;Green Elephant Portable Composting Bags: https://amzn.to/3ytUX0c&amp;#10;Blue Snail Portable Potty: https://amzn.to/3hJH8os&amp;#10;Hudson Exchange Lid: https://amzn.to/3bNoXKL&amp;#10;Compostable Bags: https://amzn.to/3hFuyGS&amp;#10;Hudson Exchange 3.5 Gallon Bucket: https://amzn.to/3xBeTxH&amp;#10;White 3.5 Gallon Bucket : https://amzn.to/3yvrfYU&amp;#10;Stansport Portable Toilet: https://amzn.to/3yuXveq&amp;#10;Pop Up Tent:https://amzn.to/346oejE&amp;#10;Folding Camp Stool: https://amzn.to/2TelBKB&amp;#10;HALLBAR Bin IKEA: https://bit.ly/3u9iZuJ &amp;#10;Plastic Anchor Toggles (for mirror): https://www.acehardware.com/departments/hardware/screws-and-anchors/anchors/5335252&amp;#10;Atepa Bamboo Table: https://amzn.to/3fDVFzf&amp;#10;Yescom Awning: https://amzn.to/3yyxlaH&amp;#10;IKEA FLISAT Wall Shelf: https://bit.ly/3w5kGLq&amp;#10;IKEA BEKVAM Spice Rack: https://bit.ly/3lYTE3m&amp;#10;Shoe Organizer: https://www.target.com/p/over-the-door-24-pocket-mesh-shoe-organizer-light-gray-made-by-design-8482/-/A-53170313 (I bought mine at a Target store. This is the closest to it that I could find online).&amp;#10;Solar flashlight: https://amzn.to/3bMEE4R&amp;#10;iPhone Car Mount: https://amzn.to/3vnfVM8&amp;#10;12 v. Defroster/Heater: https://amzn.to/3oCgBuR&amp;#10;Aootek Solar Motion Sensor Light:https://amzn.to/346w112&amp;#10;Arrow 1.5 gallon water jugs: https://amzn.to/3oFGFF6&amp;#10;Hudson exchange 2.5 gallon water jugs: https://amzn.to/3yxaXPa&amp;#10;Gray fabric bins (Target): https://bit.ly/2PWsqhV&amp;#10;Long Johns: https://amzn.to/2ShuEcU&amp;#10;Sammart collapsible dishpan: https://amzn.to/3f9hUOL&amp;#10;Universal mesh nets: https://amzn.to/3c3Ge2H&amp;#10;Blanket mat: https://amzn.to/3bIqQsk &amp;#8203;&amp;#10;QLLY Adjustable Legs: https://amzn.to/3oCOtYp&amp;#10;Foldable Shelf Bracket:  https://amzn.to/3f9aaMz&amp;#10;Cooler (Different than in video): https://amzn.to/3hHFinZ&amp;#10;Portable Butane Stove: https://amzn.to/3u9J0JN&amp;#10;12-inch Skillet: https://amzn.to/3oDxHIE&amp;#10;Salinas Storage Cabinet: https://amzn.to/3hHFQdx&amp;#10;Cutting Board with Sliding Tray: https://amzn.to/3f7c9Rp&amp;#10;Bamboo Utensils: https://amzn.to/3wuBFpR&amp;#10;Shower head and bucket (The 2.5 gallon one is no longer available. This is the brand, but a 5 gallon version): https://amzn.to/2SezlV9 &amp;#10;Faucet Pump: https://amzn.to/3yT1xho&amp;#10;Food Grade Tubing: https://amzn.to/3fzerrO&amp;#10;Hidden Desk Drawer (Small): https://amzn.to/3bL53Qw&amp;#10;Hidden Desk Drawer (Medium): https://amzn.to/3oCcWgB&amp;#10;IKEA FLISAT Wall Shelf: https://bit.ly/3w5kGLq&amp;#10;IKEA BEKVAM Spice Rack: https://bit.ly/3lYTE3m&amp;#10;IKEA SKADIS Elastic Cord: https://bit.ly/2PE7zjC&amp;#10;IKEA SOCKERBIT Box with Lid: https://bit.ly/3crfZ6x&amp;#10;Puzzle Roll Mat: https://amzn.to/3yozwh0&amp;#10;Voited Blankets: https://voited.com/&amp;#10;Norwex: https://norwex.biz/en_US/&amp;#10;Tru Earth Laundry Strips: https://www.tru.earth/&amp;#10;Patio Curtains: https://amzn.to/2QGCLzx&amp;#10;Tension Rod: &amp;#10;https://www.target.com/p/72-shower-tension-rod-room-essentials/-/A-76779447?preselect=14431562#lnk=sametab&amp;#10;SOCKER&amp;#196;RT Vase: &amp;#10;https://www.ikea.com/us/en/p/sockeraert-vase-white-10148464/&amp;#10;Magnets: https://amzn.to/3wrsc2w&amp;#10;Norwex Towel for Face and Body: &amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2Q2Y3Xl&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Special thanks to:&amp;#10;ImYourSpoon (Editor): https://bit.ly/3tdLNl6&amp;#10;Alize Jireh (Videography): alizejireh.com and @alizejireh on Instagram&amp;#10;Eddaviel (Art): @Eddaviel on Instagram"
