  [
    id 219
    label "XP23G5-HVkE"
    step 0
    date "2022-06-30T22:00:16Z"
    title "Loreto Bay National Marine Park Mexico"
    description "Join us in Loreto, Baja California Sur, Mexico where a chance encounter led us on a wild goose chase through town and brought us on a boat tour to Coronado Island in Loreto Bay National Marine Park. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join FnA to get access to perks:&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCRMq9IwRIxI_v9xeTGZVIxA/join&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Like any trip to town, we started off by searching the market for much-needed provisions and a few treats. Watch us try raw tamarind for the first time! Then, after failing to get cash at the ATM, we drive around the quaint town of Loreto on our way to catch a boat.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;On the advice of the local grocer, we decided to take a tour of the islands just offshore. After climbing aboard our tour boat, we zoomed over the water keeping a lookout for wildlife like sea turtles, dolphins, and stingrays. Frankie even fulfills his lifelong dream of seeing a blue-footed booby in the wild.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Then it was time to splash into the water and check out the fish. Snorkeling here is simply amazing! The wildlife and the underwater rock formations are definitely worth braving the cold water to see. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;But what really made our day was swimming with the sea lions. Of course we were nervous, but this was a once-in-a-lifetime experience, so into the water we went! After lunch on the beach, we explored the shoreline of the island, seeing one amazing sight after another!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What&amp;#8217;s your favorite part of our Loreto adventure? Leave a comment below!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;//SUPPORT FNA VAN LIFE &amp;#10;Read our Book: https://amzn.to/2NhpbAl&amp;#10;Buy a Sticker: http://fnavanlife.com/merch/&amp;#10;Become a Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/fnavanlife &amp;#10;Follow on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/fnavanlife&amp;#10;Listen to our Podcast: https://anchor.fm/fnavanlife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;//LINKS FROM TODAY'S VIDEO&amp;#10;&amp;#8226; Shop Van Life Essentials: https://www.amazon.com/shop/fnavanlife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;//STUFF WE ALWAYS LOVE&amp;#10;&amp;#8226; Our Fridge - https://icecofreezer.com/ get 12% off with code FNAVANLIFE12&amp;#10;&amp;#8226; Havelock Wool - http://havelockwool.refr.cc/fnavanlife&amp;#10;&amp;#8226; Become a Health Coach: https://geti.in/2Jtd3JY&amp;#10;&amp;#8226; Our Music: https://artlist.io/FRANCIS-1148169&amp;#10;&amp;#8226; The Best Nomad Internet: https://www.fnavanlife.com/internet&amp;#10;&amp;#8226; Moon Fab Awning - https://moonfab.com/fnavanlife use code FNAVANLIFE to get $30 off&amp;#10;&amp;#8226; Get 10% off at OutdoorMaster with Code: FNA10 https://fnavanlife.com/outdoormaster&amp;#10;&amp;#8226; Join Sekr for FREE today and start Boondocking: https://sekr.com/auth?ref=qL1u4cr80yY5NJTd6B1ZXdtFNO72&amp;#38;email=true&amp;#38;type=sign-up&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are pumped for you to step into the vanlife of your dreams, break free from the norm, and create a positive life full of freedom. We post new videos every week from our tiny home on wheels to share the endless possibilities van life has to offer. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Sending you love, health, and happiness,&amp;#10;&amp;#10;XO Frankie and Alex *and Paco!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PS: 10% of all our earnings are donated to tree planting charities!&amp;#10;PPS: As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases from Amazon links. This costs you nothing but helps keep us on the road. Thank you!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;00:00 Welcome to Loreto!&amp;#10;00:35 Trying Something New at the Market&amp;#10;03:07 Heading to Coronado Island&amp;#10;06:10 Looking at Boobies&amp;#10;07:23 Snorkeling Around the Island&amp;#10;09:30 Swimming with Sea Lions&amp;#10;11:50 Exploring Coronado Island&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #mexico #travel #vanlifedreams #loreto"
    channeltitle "FnA Van Life"
    channelid "UCRMq9IwRIxI_v9xeTGZVIxA"
