  [
    id 226
    label "4VBWiMudQf0"
    step 0
    date "2020-06-10T18:45:00Z"
    title "VAN TOUR - Tiny House with Amazing SHOWER!"
    description "VAN TOUR - Tiny House with Amazing SHOWER!&amp;#10;-----------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;WANT DETAILED PLANS OF OUR VAN? Visit the Van Build Workshop!&amp;#10;****************************************************&amp;#10;VAN PLANS - https://www.vanbuildworkshop.com&amp;#10;****************************************************&amp;#10;-----------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;After living in this Tiny House for a year we are so excited to share our Van Tour of this one of a kind design.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Full of innovative ideas, this is a custom DIY Van Build/Van Conversion includes; Full-Size Bathroom with Recirculating Shower, Tilting Solar Panels, Attic Van Storage, 12v AC, huge garage and much more! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;This 4x4 Sprinter Adventure Van was designed for Full Time Van Life and Full Time Travel.  Full build details are discussed in a series of Van Build Tech Talk videos designed for DIY Van Builders or Dreamers looking for How to or inspiration. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join us, Snow and Curt, van life travelers, as we Travel The World for 10-12 years.  We have already been living in this van for one year and couldn't be happier that we have joined the Vanlife community and are living our dream.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We share our journey in a Vanlife Real Talk Series where we keep it real and talk about all the Vanlife details we encounter and in a Vanlife Travel Series where we take you with us on a cinematic interpretation of our journey of a lifetime.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;So come on... take a van tour of our tiny house on wheels and come along with us on the journey.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Don't forget to like, subscribe and turn the notifications on.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Cheers&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-----------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;FOLLOW US ON INSTAGRAM:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/snowandcurt/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;JOIN US ON FACEBOOK:&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/SnowAndCurt&amp;#10;&amp;#10;------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUPPORT OF OUR CONTENT IS MUCH APPRECIATED! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;JOIN OUR MEMBERSHIP PAGE&amp;#10;To see behind the scenes action and help keep the wheels turning, head over to our YouTube Membership Page, and JOIN. &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyrjbkxt4kBuVJJuqVTkylw/join&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ONE TIME DONATION&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/chilldaze&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-----------------------&amp;#10;GET OUR VAN PLANS&amp;#10;Build your own dream van!&amp;#10;www.VanBuildWorkshop.com&amp;#10;------------------------&amp;#10;SEE SOMETHING YOU LIKE IN OUR VAN? &amp;#10;Chances are you can find it in our Amazon Store. FYI... If you shop through our links, we will make a small commission, which is much appreciated! &amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/snowandcurt?ref=cm_sw_em_r_inf_own_snowandcurt_dp_2vFBlimcgwjcT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;--------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;LIKE OUR MUSIC? &amp;#10;We get it at Epidemic Sound. Here is a link to our Fav Van Life Traveler Tunes:&amp;#10;https://www.epidemicsound.com/playlist/6a9vimoh50lhx2jqoazmctz9cez466c2&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We also use MusicBox for music. You can check out their website at: https://www.musicbed.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you decide to join Epidemic Sound, Here is a Referral Link to save us a bit of cash towards one month of our subscription (THANKS):&amp;#10;https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/to9wvg/&amp;#10;----------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VISIT OUR WEBSITE&amp;#10;www.TheChillDaze.com&amp;#10;----------------------------------------------------------------"
    channeltitle "Snow &amp;#38; Curt"
