    description "Van conversions are complex, but trying to do one with no experience is even harder. I started my Vauxhall Vivaro van build, but I have no idea what I'm doing. My only knowledge of van conversions is from watching other van lifers convert their vans here on YouTube. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanbuild #vanlifeuk #vanconversion"
