  [
    id 235
    label "2eknwRAXpu0"
    step 0
    date "2021-10-03T15:00:05Z"
    title "6 PEOPLE LIVING IN A VAN ft. Kara  Nate + Kinging-It"
    description "Could you live in an 80 sq-ft van with 6 people? We give van life a try with Kara &amp;#38; Nate + Kinging It! For your chance to win a Mercedes-Benz 4x4 Sprinter Van and support a great cause, enter at https://omaze.com/eamonandbec &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; SUBSCRIBE for a new video every single Sunday http://bit.ly/2DDSUgu&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; The vlog continues on Instagram https://instagram.com/eamonandbec&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Share the love &amp;#38; subscribe to our friends: @Kara and Nate  @Kinging- It  &amp;#128155; &amp;#127774; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Eamon &amp;#38; Bec Products&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; handmade chai blends https://chaiwalachai.com/&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203; &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; cookbook, merch &amp;#38; van conversion guide https://eamonandbec.com/ &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In 2017 we bought our first sprinter van and spent 30 days renovating it into our dream tiny home. The plan was to van life around the world and we'd made it all the way from Canada to Africa. Fast forward to COVID...us abandoning our van in a Moroccan parking lot, flying home to Canada, converting yet another van, and then moving to our cabin in the woods.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We've always envisioned moving into the woods by the lake and building our dream tiny cabin as a home base for us to come back to in between our international van life travels. With our sights set on returning to Morocco, we thought it was time we dust off our van life skills. So, we squeeze 6 people into our sprinter van conversion for 24 hours!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Catch up on our #vanlife videos&amp;#10;VAN TOUR | Sprinter Van Converted to Tiny Home https://youtu.be/KwcowOqSzbc&amp;#10;Back to Van Life https://bit.ly/2ZMEXtf&amp;#10;Abandoning Our Van in Africa https://bit.ly/2Wz3CAi"
    channeltitle "Eamon &amp;#38; Bec"
    channelid "UC4laAHbk8VSgmvB47tsd2XQ"
