  [
    id 239
    label "EdVvjlMh4x0"
    step 0
    date "2021-06-13T15:00:04Z"
    title "BACK TO VAN LIFE"
    description "One Year Later and we are BACK TO VAN LIFE... but it's not really how we remembered it &amp;#129320;. &amp;#10;For your chance to win an Airstream Caravel &amp;#38; a 2021 Ford F-150 to tow it and support a great cause enter at http://omaze.com/eandb&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; SUBSCRIBE for a new video every single Sunday http://bit.ly/2DDSUgu&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; The vlog continues on Instagram https://instagram.com/eamonandbec&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In 2017 we bought our first sprinter van and spent 30 days renovating it into our dream tiny home. The plan was to van life around the world and we'd made it all the way from Canada to Africa. Fast forward to COVID...us abandoning our van in a Moroccan parking lot, flying home to Canada, converting yet another van, and then moving to our cabin in the woods.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks to our pal Larry for checking in on Trinity &amp;#128156; Be sure to give him a follow https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCTrgB7MfhFpEynB2JSFDI0Q&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We've always envisioned moving into the woods by the lake and building our dream tiny cabin as a home base for us to come back to in between our international van life travels. And as much as we love cabin life we've definitely been craving a van life adventure so we pack up our van Casa B and plan to hit the road. But, van life kinda sucks during this lockdown!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Catch up on our cabin in the woods videos: https://bit.ly/3mNAcpX&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Eamon &amp;#38; Bec Products&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; handmade chai blends https://chaiwalachai.com/&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203; &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; cookbook &amp;#38; merch https://eamonandbec.com/ &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Get Caught up on this Van Life Build Project:&amp;#10;Building Off-Grid Tiny House During Pandemic https://bit.ly/2Y0KGIJ&amp;#10;VAN LIFE BUILD: Full Bathroom w/ Indoor Shower &amp;#38; Toilet https://bit.ly/2CtCzfi&amp;#10;VAN TOUR | Sprinter Van Converted to Tiny Home https://youtu.be/KwcowOqSzbc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Musicbed SyncID:&amp;#10;MB0176GUYU857NE"
