  [
    id 240
    label "UgHQMGxFdc0"
    step 0
    date "2022-03-24T16:53:25Z"
    title "im done. the end of van life."
    description "Well, this is it. The end of van life as I know it. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;In an unexpected turn of events, I sold my van this week and moved into a smaller, temporary space to take a trip to Arizona. While this is the end of van life for me, it's not the end of life on the road - far from it. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;I will be traveling in this lil rental rig (24 hour conversion!) for a few weeks before picking up my NEW rig...any guesses as to what it will be?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; SUBSCRIBE for a new video every Thursday | https://tinyurl.com/yc7wwxx5 &amp;#10;&amp;#8608; FOLLOW our adventures on Instagram | @alex.lives.well&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; VISIT my non-profit's website | https://www.herterra.org&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music from Epidemic Sound&amp;#10;#vanlife #diyvanbuild #solofemalevanlife"
