  [
    id 241
    label "6OEBt6tf_wk"
    step 0
    date "2019-08-11T11:00:10Z"
    title "VAN TOUR | This Van Life Kitchen is INCREDIBLE! Sprinter Van Conversion"
    description "*Grab our brand new ebook now! https://www.theindieprojects.com/travel-the-nordics-guide-book*&amp;#10;Welcome to a much-awaited tour of our van! We bought our LWB Mercedes Sprinter, converted, and moved into it in 2018. The entire build was dreamed up over many years, from originally living in a VWT4 for 18months, then a narrowboat for three years, we knew how we wanted our ideal van and the way to do it was to create it ourselves!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608;  You can watch the entire build series here: http://bit.ly/VanConversionSeries &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608;  Ways you can keep us on the road http://bit.ly/SupportOurContent &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Kitchen:&amp;#10;Cabinet - Second hand custom made&amp;#10;Oak Countertop https://bit.ly/2PakKrF&amp;#10;Fridge (Isotherm) eBay: https://ebay.to/2TfpJ8V / https://geni.us/isotherm&amp;#10;Oven and Stove https://ebay.to/2MMpnp2 &amp;#10;Gas-it Refillable LPG kit https://ebay.to/2ZTdAJi &amp;#10;Sink - made it ourselves&amp;#10;Whale water Pump https://geni.us/footpump&amp;#10;Dometic ceiling vent https://geni.us/roofvent&amp;#10;Paint used (Rustoleum Bramwell chalk paint) https://geni.us/kitchenpaint&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Living Area:&amp;#10;Cat Upholstery http://bit.ly/2MQcLxc&amp;#10;Osmo oil https://geni.us/osmooil &amp;#10;Caravan cushions https://ebay.to/2yNGf6N &amp;#10;Wooden crates https://bit.ly/2ZkaCAB &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Bedroom:&amp;#10;IKEA matteress https://bit.ly/33OGzAm&amp;#10;IKEA slats https://bit.ly/2P7X6w1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Electrics:&amp;#10;Nautical lights https://ebay.to/2TlNufx &amp;#10;Light switches https://ebay.to/2Ywva9e&amp;#10;Victron Smart Battery Monitor https://geni.us/batterymonitor&amp;#10;Victron MPPT https://geni.us/mppt&amp;#10;Victron MultiPlus Charger https://geni.us/victroncharger&amp;#10;Webasto Airtop Evo 40 heater https://www.webasto.com/uk/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;External:&amp;#10;Front Runner roof rack and accessories https://bit.ly/2PanXHT&amp;#10;Light bar - bought from a friend&amp;#10;Solar panel https://ebay.to/2GVuxeK &amp;#10;4g booster http://bit.ly/MotorhomeWiFi&amp;#10;Snorkel  http://bit.ly/campervanculture&amp;#10;Lift kit http://bit.ly/blackrockoutfitters &amp;#10;Tyres https://ebay.to/2MOOUOm &amp;#10;Wheeliams wheel carrier http://bit.ly/2ZKjwEi&amp;#10;Recovery tracks https://ebay.to/2MU2IqN &amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUBSCRIBE so you don&amp;#8217;t miss new content every week: http://bit.ly/SubscribeTheIndieProjects (click that notification bell too!)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Become a member of our Patreon : http://bit.ly/IndieProjectsPatreon&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW US!&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Instagram: http://instagram.com/TheIndieProjects &amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Facebook: http://facebook.com/theindieprojects&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Twitter: http://twitter.com/theindyprojects &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Enjoy the music used in our videos? Try a FREE trial from Musicbed for great tracks: http://share.mscbd.fm/theindieprojects&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Exclusive Merchandise and more: http://theindieprojects.com &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; BLOG POSTS: http://theindieprojects.com/blog&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; FILMING KIT:&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/filmingkit&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; FREE Van Life eBook:&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/freevanlifebook&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Check out our PODCAST:&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/IndieProjectsPodcast &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Contact us: &amp;#10;&amp;#8608; contacttheindieprojects@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #vantour #vankitchen #theindieprojects&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VAN TOUR | This Van Life Kitchen is INCREDIBLE! Sprinter Van Conversion&amp;#10;&amp;#10;*We use affiliate links which we earn a small percentage from qualifying purchases at no extra cost to you. We use these funds to feed our cat, who demands an abundance of cat soup (yes that&amp;#8217;s a real thing!)"
