  [
    id 243
    label "O9Vbn7bT4jI"
    step 0
    date "2019-05-04T17:59:50Z"
    title "WERE VAN LIFE MILLIONAIRES!"
    description "Welcome back to another episode of The Alternative Living Podcast, where today we discuss all of the assumptions people have about us!&amp;#10;Assumptions discussed:&amp;#10;2:35 - I assume you feed Marmite to Ginjey&amp;#10;4:22 - You can't sit &amp;#38; chill&amp;#10;7:53 - Theo has gnarly toenails&amp;#10;9:57 - There's always a lot of work to do&amp;#10;13:56 - When I heard your podcast I assumed you'd be really cool cats, then I watched your videos...&amp;#10;14:50 - You spend the majority of your time spending new ways to wash or go to the toilet&amp;#10;18:20 - If we met we would be friends&amp;#10;20:26 - Stop saying 'Our Land', we know it is&amp;#10;21:28 - You're millionaires/rich&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUBSCRIBE so you don&amp;#8217;t miss new content every week: http://bit.ly/SubscribeTheIndieProjects (click that notification bell too!)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Become a member of our Patreon : http://bit.ly/IndieProjectsPatreon&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Exclusive Unlisted Videos for Patrons: http://bit.ly/UnseenClips&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Fancy a Shout-Out in our video? http://bit.ly/VideoShoutOut &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Exclusive Merchandise and more: http://theindieprojects.com &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music from Music Bed: http://share.mscbd.fm/theindieprojects&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; BLOG POSTS:&amp;#10;http://theindieprojects.com/blog&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW US!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Instagram: http://instagram.com/TheIndieProjects &amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Facebook: http://facebook.com/theindieprojects&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Twitter: http://twitter.com/theindyprojects &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; FILMING KIT:&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/filmingkit&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; FREE Van Life eBook:&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/freevanlifebook&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Check out our PODCAST:&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/IndieProjectsPodcast &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Contact us: &amp;#10;&amp;#8608; contacttheindieprojects@gmail.com"
