    id 244
    label "B2zwe8a4arM"
    step 0
    date "2019-08-16T19:49:42Z"
    title "I Lived in a Van with my Sisters for a Week | CloeCouture"
    description "My sisters and I spent a whole week in a Van!! Watch The #FeldmanSisters embark on our journey through California where we visit Sequoia National Park and more! In this video we try to convince Mia to join along by giving her a whole presentation about why #VanLife is a good idea. We also spend time picking out the van and decorations to make it pretty and &amp;#34;CloeCouture&amp;#34;. Watch us pick up the vehicle, test drive it and decorate it before we go! We give you a FULL TOUR before we head on our way. If you like these types of videos where we bring you exploring with us please let us know in a comment below. We have so much fun adventuring and we hope you love joining us! To see more from my sisters, go follow their channels linked below!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Part 2! We Lived in a Tiny House for a Week: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pFix5M6TGxE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Saige's channel: http://bit.ly/2LlQ6sG&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Mia&amp;#8217;s channel: http://bit.ly/2Ba1bEW &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Credits: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Produced by: &amp;#10;Kalia Machado - @kaliaemachado&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2Y2SMBp&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Travis Larson - @travis.larson&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2HKI0rP &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Edited by:&amp;#10;Susan @itsdreamcat&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thumbnail by:&amp;#10;Diego Hernandez - @jdiegoph&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/j.diegoph&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Intro and End Card created by Susan&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/Itsdreamcat&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music: &amp;#10;End Song is &amp;#34;Crazy&amp;#34; by Adam Fine: https://soundcloud.com/adamfine/crazy&amp;#10;Check out Adam's other music: https://soundcloud.com/adamfine&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Intro and End Card created by Susan&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/Itsdreamcat &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Other 24 hour challenges:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;24 Hours in a Mermaid Tail&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/30vI4kw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;24 Hours in a Tiny House with My Sisters&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2Xb9AS8 &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If I Lived in a Tiny House&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2xOxsUf &amp;#10;&amp;#10;24 Hour Overnight Challenge in a Mattress Store&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2RI6eVy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;24 Hour Overnight Challenge in a Mall&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2sN8f6Q&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I Lived Like a Princess for a Day (24 hour challenge)&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2ITJY8x&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I Wore Only Glitter for a Day (24 Hour Challenge)&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2ZT2x2j&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If I lived in a Tiny House! 24 hour challenge in a tiny house: &amp;#10;http://bit.ly/31YwTlY &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Top Videos:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;100 Last-Minute DIY Halloween Costume Ideas&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2FK8Gqw &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If I Lived in a Tiny House&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2xOxsUf &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If I Lived in Barbie's Dream House!&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2z2061n &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If I Lived in a Candy Store&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2HOnmHl &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If I Lived in a Store&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2HL2Gjn &amp;#10;&amp;#10;30 Last-Minute DIY Halloween Costume Ideas!&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2xOxsUf &amp;#10;&amp;#10;30 Last-Minute BEST FRIEND Halloween Costume Ideas!&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2gXifsA &amp;#10;&amp;#10;My Dream Locker! If I Lived in my Locker | Back To School 2017 &amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2OxrAna&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe: http://bit.ly/CloeCoutureSub&amp;#10;Check out my TopVideos! http://bit.ly/CloeCoutureTopVideos&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9829; Vlog Channel!&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/user/VivaLaCloe&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9829; Business Inquiry&amp;#10;Contact Business@CloeCouture.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9829; Twitter: http://www.twitter.com/cloecouture&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9829; Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/cloecouture/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9829; Snapchat: RealCloeCouture&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9829; Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/pages/CloeCo...&amp;#10;&amp;#10; #FeldmanSisters #CloeCouture&amp;#10;&amp;#10;About CloeCouture:&amp;#10;Hi! I'm Cloe Feldman and welcome to my channel, CloeCouture! I started making YouTube videos in January 2011.&amp;#10;My channel is a reflection of my life! I've made all types of videos ranging from makeup and fashion to comedy skits and fantasy worlds. I can make anything happen in my videos, and I want my subscribers to know that they can create anything they want in life! &amp;#10;I am so thankful to everyone who watches my videos and supports all of my endeavors. I love you guys!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I Lived in a Van with my Sisters for a Week | CloeCouture&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=B2zwe8a4arM&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CloeCouture&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/CloeCouture"
