    date "2020-09-27T13:00:09Z"
    title "The ULTIMATE DIY VAN TOUR with FULL BATHROOM and an AMAZING MURPHY BED"
    description "Take the quiz at https://bit.ly/33c5cYa and get your recommendation. Use code *TIO50* to get 50% off your first order of Care/of.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hola Amigees!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;It's here! Can you believe it? &amp;#10;&amp;#10;The light at the end of the tunnel for this crazy year and crazy build is here and we are so relieved, so in love, and looking forward to the adventures this van is going to guide us on.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;With that said, we've put together a massive build guide with fully customizable 3D layout and it's available at the link below or on our website! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks as always for being the best part of our week and we can't wait to see you next Sunday.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Life is good.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8609;&amp;#8609;OUR COMPLETE VAN BUILD GUIDE IS FOR SALE&amp;#8609;&amp;#8609;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; https://bit.ly/vanbuildguide&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10174;We participate in the Amazon Influencer Program and others affiliate programs listed below. We earn affiliate commissions from Amazon and other retailers for qualifying purchases associated with our Amazon storefront and all links listed below.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8609;&amp;#8609;LINKS TO ITEMS USED ON OUR BUILDS&amp;#8609;&amp;#8609; &amp;#10;&amp;#10163; https://Amazon.com/shop/Tioaventurabus &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8609;&amp;#8609;THE BEST WINDOW COVERS FOR VAN LIFE&amp;#8609;&amp;#8609;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; https://bit.ly/2ECuRRH&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Murphy Bed Hardware: https://amzn.to/3hDpJKM&amp;#10;Our 270 degree awning: https://amzn.to/3hP7AtR&amp;#10;150W Mono Solar Panels: https://amzn.to/30Lfiy9&amp;#10;Renogy 60A MPPT Charge Controller: https://amzn.to/39rnXK2&amp;#10;Victron 3000W Inverter: https://amzn.to/30LfkpL&amp;#10;Kitchen Sink: https://amzn.to/30Uowbw&amp;#10;Kitchen Faucet: https://amzn.to/3f9t1Ed&amp;#10;Water Filtration System: https://amzn.to/3jEinbP&amp;#10;Puck lighting: https://amzn.to/2OUiodF&amp;#10;Toilet: https://amzn.to/2ZY3LMy&amp;#10;Shower Hardware: https://amzn.to/2BxavYp&amp;#10;Shower pan: https://amzn.to/2OYKkwY&amp;#10;46 Gal water tank: https://amzn.to/2D9z1PG&amp;#10;Water heater: https://amzn.to/3eZMJ51&amp;#10;One way valves: https://amzn.to/3hCcSsf&amp;#10;12v ball valve: https://amzn.to/2CFpHn6&amp;#10;Dry fit Toilet roll holder: https://amzn.to/2WX7ubf&amp;#10;Outdoor shower: https://amzn.to/3hDXHil&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163;Heard our Podcast?: &amp;#10;Apple: https://apple.co/3dp7JTj&amp;#10;Spotify: https://spoti.fi/2WJd5Tu&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Business or brand wanting to work together?&amp;#10;&amp;#10174; &amp;#9993;  Email Us: Collab@TioAventura.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8609;&amp;#8609;Visit us over here!&amp;#8609;&amp;#8609;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/tioaventuravan/&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; Twitter: https://twitter.com/tioaventura&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; LBRY: https://lbry.tv/@tioaventurabus:9&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/TioAventura&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We're Mariajos&amp;#233; and Chase. In 2018 we sold our house, moved into our self-converted school bus and took off traveling the United States. We sold our bus, bought a new-to-us Sprinter Van and we're doing it all over again. If you're new to our channel, subscribe &amp;#38; stick around. We're excited to have you here. If you enjoy our videos please let us know, give us a like and drop a comment down below. If our videos just aren't for you, we understand and hope you find what you're looking for somewhere else! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #sprinterconversion #vantour"
    channeltitle "T&amp;#237;o Aventura"
