  [
    id 253
    label "sSg5VMwIDHY"
    step 0
    date "2021-09-12T10:30:07Z"
    title "Unique LUXURY OFF-GRID van | Family of 3 full time van life."
    description "We've lived a full year of #vanlife and this is our second van build. We are excited to share our FULL VAN TOUR of our brand new, bigger and way more luxurious self-converted tiny home on wheels. This is our Renault Master, long-wheel-base self converted van called Safari, which means journey in Swahili. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Useful AMAZON Links&amp;#10;The silent but awesome fridge - https://amzn.to/3jJk21I &amp;#10;The Solar Panels 150 watt each - https://amzn.to/3yFNFFr&amp;#10;Our best pick for a solar controller for 100 - 300 watt - https://amzn.to/2WOYzvp&amp;#10;Great priced Leisure batteries  - https://amzn.to/3jHAwrl &amp;#10;Power inverter - https://amzn.to/38ETAjB &amp;#10;Whale water pump (only runs when the tap is open, no switch needed) - https://amzn.to/3teZWzG&amp;#10;Climate controlled roof vent and fan - https://amzn.to/3l0qYY2&amp;#10;Thetford Porta Potti - https://amzn.to/3tgLCXn &amp;#10;USB sockets - https://amzn.to/38DPpV5&amp;#10;Gasland two hob gas cooker - https://amzn.to/3zKNcDv &amp;#10;That's everything, so it must be time for the kitchen sink - https://amzn.to/3tf5ytG&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUBSCRIBE for a new episodes of our adventures every Sunday!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;JOIN US for daily updates:&amp;#10;Instagram:  https://instagram.com/thenewbys&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUPPORT our adventures and see more and exclusive content:&amp;#10;Patreon: www.patreon.com/thenewbys&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our goal is to inspire you, to prove that anything is possible, that dreams do come true. We hope to create a supportive community of people who share their own dreams with us and each other.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;BE BRAVE - THINK BIG - EXPLORE &amp;#10;Because we believe that lines across a map are more important than numbers in the bank. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks so much for watching!!!"
