  [
    id 255
    label "oT6YmGoAn5c"
    step 0
    date "2020-10-26T14:00:19Z"
    title "Solo Female Van Life at age 70! Tour of INCREDIBLE DIY Ford Transit Stealth Camper Conversion."
    description "Virginia lives in her van full time and has been traveling North America in her Ford Transit that she designed her self and helped mostly DIY'ers build. She did get her Solar and electrical done by friends of the channel Ray outfitted (https://www.rayoutfitted.com/) &amp;#10;Virginia wasn't sure what she was going to do with her retirement until she learned about van life and decided that designing and building out a van to travel and live in was her next creative project. She finds a lot of joy meeting other travelers on the road and has made lots of friends on her adventures.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow Virgina's social media.&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjmTF8QAIpocv1tKnVscDYw&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/veevanvoom/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Van Life Tours&amp;#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL8TC5LCUPfit4qO8aiIh_iHtC2xFWtIzA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vanlife Video Podcast&amp;#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL8TC5LCUPfitJMClK--WFcx1CUHI-rGM7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vanlife Audio Podcast&amp;#10;https://anchor.fm/vanlifeandchill&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Movies&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3HnMwHJ&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3HmmEfw&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3gxFchf&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Discord&amp;#10;https://discord.gg/4kWjnSfF6U&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vlogs&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/ForrestStevensYT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you to Patreons! Jamie F, Renay E, Andrew B, Madison and Raynor, Jennifer S, Mario R, Doug B, Marian H, Cody S, Ashton S, Akshay A, Curtis, and Sonya B! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Patreon&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/ForrestStevens &amp;#10;Paypal&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=ML6MEHLAHUMFN&amp;#10;Bitcoin&amp;#10;3Ao1PoA7i1mY4R2eQp8HYSJv77jZ1HkMN7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you read all this give us 1 thumbs up emoji, 1 tree emoji and 1 Video camera emoji in the comment section."
