    id 257
    label "ryPBLk90xEQ"
    step 0
    date "2019-12-12T16:01:36Z"
    title "VAN TOUR | Solo Female Photographer Lives Full-Time On The Road"
    description "I&amp;#8217;m an outdoor adventure &amp;#38; travel photographer living full-time on the road. I&amp;#8217;m pretty new to YouTube, but I&amp;#8217;m stoked to share what it&amp;#8217;s like to live in a van while working as a freelance photographer. My goal here is to inspire you to step outside your comfort zone by sharing my own personal highs and lows along this (sometimes) wild journey. Thanks for being here. Maybe one day I'll see you out on that open road. #VanLife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Links to ALL my favorite photography, road life &amp;#38; camping essentials  &amp;#128722;**ps I get a small kickback when you purchase using these links, thanks for your support :)  https://christianschaffer.art/faq-gear&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Socials &amp;#128242;&amp;#10;Website: https://christianschaffer.art/&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/christianschaffer&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/ChristianSchafR&amp;#10;Business Inquiries: info(at)christianschaffer.art&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Huge thanks to @Nathaniel Wise for helping me film this!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out  @Yulia Burova  to see the van build videos &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127926; Music &amp;#127926; &amp;#10;I find all my songs on Musicbed! Elevate your videos with record-label quality music: http://share.mscbd.fm/christianschaffer&amp;#10;&amp;#10;**My van is a 2019 Ram ProMaster 1500 High Roof, 136&amp;#34; WB with 7K miles** &amp;#128656;"
    channeltitle "Christian Schaffer"
