  [
    id 259
    label "Vp_PN4aMMPM"
    step 0
    date "2020-11-05T13:30:01Z"
    title "Unlimited RV Internet and WiFi for VAN LIFE | 2020 Update"
    description "In this episode we take you through out internet set-up for full time van life. As digital nomads living in an RV full-time, we need consistent and strong WiFi. Here are our top pics:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;UPDATE: There have been a few changes to our wifi setup since we made this video. We still use the hotspot I show in the video and the flat panel antenna. They continue to work the best! We have links to them down below.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;But we no longer use a sim card with EZCom. The customer service wasn't the best and we found a much better plan directly with T-Mobile and AT&amp;#38;T. Info on that below:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Favorite Wifi Setup:&amp;#10;1. HotSpot: https://amzn.to/2tWzxwe&amp;#10;(If it's out of stock, this should work too: https://amzn.to/2GrXods )&amp;#10;2. Flat panel antenna: https://amzn.to/3mQLMQU&amp;#10;3. Sim Card: As of right now, both AT&amp;#38;T and T-Mobile have 100gb hotspot only plans for about $50 a month. Both are great plans. We have the T-Mobile one. Info about both of them can be found here:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;T-Mobile: https://www.rvmobileinternet.com/t-mobile-prepaid-and-metro-by-t-mobile-discontinue-100gb-mobile-internet-data-plans/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;AT&amp;#38;T: https://www.att.com/prepaid/mobile-hotspot-tablet/?fbclid=IwAR2R0nGFdSLhyxSEgng4G6o5LTjLVOxaVAnnOX8Gnl_fJ9PqF9B4lZnVNHg&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Other stuff mentioned:&amp;#10;WeBoost: https://amzn.to/2FmfOYX&amp;#10;Cheaper WeBoost: https://amzn.to/2TUFKCm&amp;#10;Tie-Fighter Looking Router: https://amzn.to/3l0MlXI&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;Follow us on instagram:&amp;#10;@chadandpaul &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128108;Who we are: &amp;#10;Hey, we're Chad and Paul. We lived a pretty typical life up until a few years ago. Chad was a speech-language pathologist and Paul was an attorney. We worked in New York City and by all means were set. But we didn't feel settled. We wanted something different. We started a bunch of online businesses, quit our 9-5's and now we live an unconventional life in our van (a 21' Winnebago Travato). Follow along with us on our journey.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Affiliate Links to our favorite van life products:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128073; Microfiber towel &amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2SsifRc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128073; Kindle &amp;#10;https://amzn.to/37xIZUC&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128073; Travel Berkey Water Filter&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2SNmaH9&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128073; AT&amp;#38;T Hotspot&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2tWzxwe&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128073; Wyze Security Cameras&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2HpGmK7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128073; WeBoost Drive 4G-X RV &amp;#10;https://amzn.to/2FmfOYX&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music:&amp;#10;Song: Del - Tropical Love (Vlog No Copyright Music)&amp;#10;Music provided by Vlog No Copyright Music.&amp;#10;Video Link: https://youtu.be/k-4zY7Ri2Po&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#travato #vanlife #chadandpaul"
    channeltitle "Chad and Paul"
    channelid "UCJFG3hGeb9j5J7N6BMh5-yw"
    favcount 0
    viewcount 61225
