    title "IM BACK. (story 42)"
    description "After two unexpected weeks off from youtube, I'M BACK. And I have some crazy stories to tell...&amp;#10;In this week's video, I drive to an area of the country I have NEVER been to, and decide to meet up with internet friends for the first time and attend a nomad/ van life festival. Let's just say it was not what I expected. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10084; WATCH MY FRIENDS' CHANNELS!&amp;#10;LOST RENEGADES: https://www.youtube.com/c/LostRenegades&amp;#10;BUS LIFE PIRATES: https://www.youtube.com/c/BusLifePirates&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ENCHILADA BAKE RECIPE:&amp;#10;https://www.twopeasandtheirpod.com/black-bean-and-quinoa-enchilada-bake/ &amp;#10;_________________________________________________________________________&amp;#10;&amp;#10084; HOW TO SUPPORT MY JOURNEY &amp;#10;Subscribe, Like, &amp;#38; Comment&amp;#10;Let Ads Run&amp;#10;PATREON:&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/regretlyss&amp;#10;&amp;#10;_________________________________________________________________________&amp;#10;&amp;#10084;  FOR DAILY UPDATES &amp;#10;Instagram:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/regretlyss&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#offgrid #offgridliving #solofemalevanlife"
