    title "SOME UNIQUE VAN LIFE HACKS NEVER SEEN BEFORE / WAFFLE ON A WEDNESDAY"
    description "VAN LIFE Q&amp;#38;A WAFFLE ON A WEDNESDAY&amp;#10;THIS WEEK I SHOW YOU SOME UNIQUE VAN LIFE HACKS &amp;#10;Unistrut company i used  https://directchannel.uk.com/&amp;#10;Stickermule https://www.stickermule.com/uk?utm_source=google&amp;#38;utm_medium=cpc&amp;#38;src=GOOG&amp;#38;cid=319950247&amp;#38;gclid=CjwKCAjw2rmWBhB4EiwAiJ0mtQYZRt3YsDvXZIhzZqBup1_iPkTc3SFJDi3KiAQgSDTiVQ9_RBYQ9RoCBWIQAvD_BwEEntering Amazon through my virtual storefront doesn't cost you anything but helps me continue to make this videos so thank you https://www.amazon.co.uk/shop/melsvanworld&amp;#10;buy me a coffee and i will send you a sticker . your support is really appreciated https://www.buymeacoffee.com/BigVanSmalWorld&amp;#10;Another way to get stickers is through paypal &amp;#163;5.00 Remember to include name and address   https://paypal.me/bigvansmallworld&amp;#10;My Treasure hunting eqipment i use&amp;#10;Minelab Excalibur II Metal Detector https://amzn.to/3Mid9zt&amp;#10;Evolution 360 Sandscoop https://ebay.us/wel24d&amp;#10;Scubapro Nova Scotia Semi Dry 7-5 mm https://amzn.to/3xaVC71&amp;#10;Crewsaver Crewfit Sport Non-Harness Manual Life Jacket https://amzn.to/3NjSz3l&amp;#10;Filming equipment that i use &amp;#10;Sony Alpha ZV-E10 | APS-C Mirrorless Interchangeable-Lens Vlog Camera&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3mFRaYY&amp;#10;GoPro HERO 9 Black https://amzn.to/3xobLpJ&amp;#10;DSLR Microphone https://amzn.to/3mFgfTT&amp;#10;Heavy Duty Video Tripod with Video Fluid Head,&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/39i6qIC&amp;#10;SOONSUN Dome Port for GoPro Hero 10 Hero 9 Black https://amzn.to/3xjtuia&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you need advice and want fast answers to your questions then join my member's community and get a fast and quick response.&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC72V8FXcD4SIxZx7_P6Ak9g/join &amp;#10;Jackery UK official website https://uk.jackery.com?aff=24&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MaXpeedingRods generator: https://bit.ly/3iotmqp&amp;#10;Coupon code: Melvanlife (10% discounts for generator)&amp;#10;MaXpeedingRods air heater: https://www.maxpeedingrods.co.uk/category/Air-Heater.html?tracking=Melvanlife&amp;#10;Coupon code: Melvanlife( 10% discounts for only air heater)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I use this scanner to keep my sprinter running and on the road &amp;#10;iCarsoft Professional Multi-System Auto Diagnostic Tool MB V2.0 Compatible for Mercedes-Benz/Sprinter/Smart, &amp;#10;UK https://amzn.to/3d3s5m6&amp;#10;US https://amzn.to/32IPAPj&amp;#10;here's a link to my woodstove (affiliate link)&amp;#10;https://cubicminiwoodstoves.com/collections/all?ref=melpettipher&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I have put together a collection of popular campervan building products in my Amazon storefront along with some great ideas for you to look through &amp;#10;https://www.amazon.co.uk/shop/melsvanworld &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Jackery Portable Power Station &amp;#10;UK https://amzn.to/3dovzz7&amp;#10;USA https://amzn.to/3136ZBG&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Revolution outside Laundry Locations &amp;#10;https://www.revolution-laundry.com/our-locations/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Beck's channel https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCE3qsP742E_SjaYNmkLqPhw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;*Affiliate Links*&amp;#10; I do get a small commission on sales. This helps YouTubers like myself to continue to create content and live a van life. I really appreciate your support, without you and promotions like this #vanlife wouldn't be possible - so thank you!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;0:00 waffle on wednesday &amp;#10;0:10 van life coffee smoothie&amp;#10;2:50 where do you get your stickers printed &amp;#10;4:14 how to stop kitchen paper unrolling &amp;#10;5:04 do i have to pay a fortune for a decent reversing camera &amp;#10;6:03 how to get a free sticker  &amp;#10;6:30 where do i get unistrut from &amp;#10;7:19 why don't the video links pop up &amp;#10;8:03 how safe is it to smoke around Gas  &amp;#10;9:20 troll of the week &amp;#10;11:09 brilliant anti theft for campers &amp;#10;11:57 is it a rooter or a router ?&amp;#10;13:55 camper van tours on beckys channel &amp;#10; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlifeuk #bigvansmallworld #rvlife #sacredtraveller #melsvanlife #melsvanworld #vanlife"
