  [
    id 267
    label "Gepp4Z5pv5o"
    step 0
    date "2017-12-10T19:01:43Z"
    title "Van Life  Boho Diary | USA"
    description "After converting our van into a tiny home, we embarked on a new adventure: the Boho Beautiful Positive Movement Tour. 3 months of travelling across the USA took us to 40 different cities, and with our coordinators and all the people who came out we were all able to raise over $20,000 for local non-profit animal welfare organizations through the charity yoga classes, and conquered over 10,000 miles in our newly converted camper van (talk about tiny van life living).  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Through this digital nomadic lifestyle we finally got to experience what &amp;#34;vanlife&amp;#34; was truly about. The ups and downs of tiny living, to exhausting drives, to uplifting human connections... all of this was something we will forever remember. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you and stay tuned for more from our wild nomadic travel adventures! XO&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Juliana and Mark  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music: www.artlist.io&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#10;Boho Beautiful Yoga Links:&amp;#10;Boho Beautiful Official- Our NEW Streaming Platform &amp;#38; App https://www.bohobeautiful.tv&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Download from your App Store Right Now! &amp;#10;Apple Store- https://apps.apple.com/us/app/boho-beautiful-official/id1508335876 &amp;#10;Android Store- https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.bohobeautiful.BohoBeautifulTV&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Get Two FREE Boho Beautiful Books here! https://www.bohobeautiful.life/returnhome&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Boho Beautiful Life- Our 2nd More Personal Youtube Channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBbs2c6JCjU_HZPOeY6jWVg/?sub_confirmation=1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Boho Beautiful RETREAT- Your 7 Day Home Yoga Retreat https://bohobeautiful.life/retreat&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Boho Instagram- http://instagram.com/bohobeautifullife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Boho Beautiful is a travel yoga lifestyle channel that is creating positive content for your body, mind, and the earth. Yoga, Wanderlust, Fitness, Vegan food, Travel, Conscious Living, and Meditation! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you so much for watching and subscribing to our channel! &amp;#10;Let's Connect!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Custom App &amp;#38; Streaming Platform- https://www.bohobeauitful.tv&amp;#10;Premium Programs- https://www.bohobeautiful.life/our-store&amp;#10;Boho Beautiful Website- https://www.bohobeautiful.life&amp;#10;Instagram- http://instagram.com/bohobeautifullife&amp;#10;Facebook: http://facebook.com/bohobeautifullife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;----------------------------------------&amp;#173;&amp;#173;&amp;#173;&amp;#173;&amp;#173;&amp;#173;-----------------------------------&amp;#173;-&amp;#173;-&amp;#173;-&amp;#173;-&amp;#173;-&amp;#173;-------------&amp;#10;DISCLAIMER:&amp;#10;Please consult your doctor before starting any diet or exercise program. By using our videos, you understand and agree that neither Boho Beautiful Ltd. nor any persons associated with it have any liability to you for any injury or loss you may suffer in connection with any content we may post."
