  [
    id 270
    label "oPUMzw1Rhjw"
    step 0
    date "2021-07-23T19:00:12Z"
    title "FABulous DIY Van Conversion - Solo Black Female Van Life as Self Care"
    description "Thanks to Policygenius for sponsoring this video! To start comparing quotes &amp;#38; simplify insurance-buying, check out Policygenius: https://policygenius.com/tinyhouse &amp;#127969;&amp;#128656; Meet Claudia, an amazingly resilient woman who designed &amp;#38; built an incredible #vanconversion as her traveling tiny home. Her high-top Ram ProMaster 3500 van features an amazing closet, full bathroom, piano/desk &amp;#38; 2-sided Murphy bed--taking space-efficient tiny home design to the max! Living life on the road has been challenging but #vanlife has become the ultimate in self-care for Claudia. She shares insights into her experience on the road as a solo Black female.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128656;&amp;#128168; Follow Claudia on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/rolling_resilience&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;Visit her site: RollingResilience.com (with her rad t-shirt is for sale &amp;#38; a blog post with her origin)&amp;#10;&amp;#10024;&amp;#128073;Her Consulting Biz - Entertainment &amp;#38; Lifestyle: ClaudiaMBConsulting.com&amp;#10;AND https://www.instagram.com/claudiambconsulting&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;&amp;#127969; More tiny house tours &amp;#38; stories: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLlvBXhDyr9H3XQbgDHQG23m1P_7LN1yyS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;********************************************************************************************************** New to our Channel? Welcome! We are Alexis and Christian, the creators behind Tiny House Expedition. &amp;#128666;&amp;#127969;&amp;#128168; After falling in love and building our 130 sq ft tiny house on wheels, we hit the road to explore the tiny house movement. Brief backstory: https://youtu.be/jQNkI1G0b3I&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join us as we share real-life tiny homes, inspiring projects, and legalize tiny news! &amp;#10;&amp;#128073;&amp;#127969; Every Friday: #TinyHome Tours &amp;#38; Stories&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;INTERESTED in LIVE In-Depth Tiny Living Discussions with Us, PLUS Exclusive Content? Become a Patreon member: https://www.patreon.com/TinyHouseExpedition&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Connect with Alexis &amp;#38; Christian and see more #TinyHouse Inspiration: &amp;#10;&amp;#128073; https://instagram.com/tiny_house_expedition&amp;#10;&amp;#10024;&amp;#128073; https://facebook.com/TinyHouseExpedition&amp;#10;&amp;#128073; https://tinyhouseexpedition.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127969; Tiny House FAQ:&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;Where can I PARK a tiny house? https://youtu.be/75YnIRSwAc0&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;What are the LEGAL issues around tiny houses? https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLlvBXhDyr9H3vVYh9UlqAuLQQ_rR8-Hph&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;Where can I EXPERIENCE tiny homes in person? https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLlvBXhDyr9H2U0HdzPqb3E3cwKwhjtenc&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;How can I DIY relocate or road trip with my THOW? https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLlvBXhDyr9H0ORrxRVJcZAwSY7zk6nznE&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;What are tiny home COMMUNITIES like? https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLlvBXhDyr9H1KYgiaoNKa-OZfOq6vXbkm&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;WHO lives tiny? https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLlvBXhDyr9H3XQbgDHQG23m1P_7LN1yyS&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;What is it like to be a NOMADIC tiny dweller? https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLlvBXhDyr9H367n5Yqc9sYhifXbK00bv9"
