    step 0
    date "2021-06-06T15:00:04Z"
    title "VAN TOUR | the Vanlife with the comfort of camping car, with a doghouse and a washing machine!"
    description "#vanlife #vantour #vanconversion&amp;#10;Follow our current conversions:  &amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/vantastip/&amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/vantastip&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Presentation of our new VAN, Fiat Ducato L4H2 which fits for a full-time living! It is equipped with an oven, a video projector, an indoor shower, a toilet, a Doghouse, a roof air conditioner and much more! If you have any questions, do not hesitate to ask us in the comments :) Enjoy your visit! &amp;#10;To contact us: vantastip@gmail.com &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#34;CHARLIE&amp;#34; layout: https: //www.youtube.com/watch? v = KvXmb ...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHO ARE WE? Hi! We are Laurie and Shahar! After traveling for over a year from the United States to Panama with our campervan Charlie, we embarked on a whole new adventure: setting up our own van fitting workshop in France. We share with you our construction projects, our trips, and everything that inspires us. We regularly publish Van Tour videos after each installation. Looking forward to meeting each other on the roads! :)"
