    description "Get the Van Conversion Guide: http://bit.ly/GetVanGuide&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Rent a Van with Outdoorsy - https://t2m.io/qQN1UWxy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;THIS VAN:&amp;#10;SUBSCRIBE to their YOUTUBE; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCLvvDtooElDEAIY5rHyY9Wg&amp;#10;FOLLOW them on INSTAGRAM; https://www.instagram.com/werollwithit/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VAN CONVERSION PART LISTS&amp;#10;&amp;#128656; ALL PARTS             https://bit.ly/2ZypQE0 &amp;#10;&amp;#9889; ELECTRICS             https://bit.ly/3vNBUNy &amp;#10;&amp;#128167; WATER SYSTEM   https://bit.ly/2ZEvioV &amp;#10;&amp;#128293; GAS SYSTEMS      https://bit.ly/3ClDNDB &amp;#10;&amp;#128017; INSULATION           https://bit.ly/3BkZYZh &amp;#10;&amp;#128736;&amp;#65039; TOOLS                      https://bit.ly/2XU4P64&amp;#10;&amp;#10;About this van:&amp;#10;Bruce Banner the van is probably the most pimped up campervan I've seen.  Starting it's life as a jumbo LWB Sprinter van, it has been converted into the ultimate off-road, off-grid, go anywhere van conversion!  On top of the usual modern mod cons like fridge, cooker, inside shower and out back shower, this van has so many epic and unique features such as its Wi Boost or its battery array, which has got to be the biggest lithium ion battery array I've seen in a van!  But yeah, it has too many cool featured to list here, so you'll just have to watch the film to find out more!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Connect with Nate Murphy:&amp;#10;&amp;#128248; Nate is on Instagram: http://bit.ly/2ZVaHri&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanconversion #vanlife #vantour"
