  [
    id 286
    label "NA-5Xv9HBuQ"
    step 0
    date "2021-09-19T15:00:08Z"
    title "OUR 2021 TRAVEL PLANS where can VAN LIFE take us after brexit."
    description "Go to https://nordvpn.com/campervibe to get a 2-year plan with a huge discount plus an additional gift using our coupon code: campervibe&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The one reason we CAN'T FULLY disclose our TRAVEL PLANS.. vanlife UK or Europe? Travelling in 2021.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;As the world is starting to open up and people are traveling, and beginning to hit the road and travel to Europe in their vans, we are getting asked more and more when and where, and, if we are going?&amp;#10;So, obviously we have made a video! We discuss where we will be driving our self converted campervan to (sort of) when we are going, and how long we are going for. We give you as much information as we can but if you watch the whole video you will see there's a few reasons why we cant give you all the details!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What we can tell you though, is we are definitely hitting the road, we are going for a considerable period of time, we will visit some interesting places and, we are so excited to be able to get out and make proper (or our version of proper) travel vlogs again! &amp;#10;Being a vanlife travel couple that want to make travel videos, getting prepared for this adventure is just too exciting! And, we will have to be prepared as we will be travelling with a dog and a cat, however, as you will see in the video our attitude to PLANNING a big van life trip across europe and beyond is a bit more relaxed.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us on our journey as we attempt to create a proper youtube travel series as we, two female travelers, attempt to drive around the world (vanlife breakdowns and pandemics permitting)&amp;#10;Hit the subscribe button to see where our little tiny home on wheels takes us next and how we cope living in a van!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out our instagram for real time updates..&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/camper_vibe/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Have a look at emily's blog for her thoughts on all things van..&amp;#10;http://campervibe.co.uk/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For stickers..&amp;#10;Make a &amp;#163;5.00 payment to &amp;#10;https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/campervibe&amp;#10;and just leave your name and full address in the notes, just click add note.&amp;#10;If paypal confuses you (as it does me, Lou) then follow the below instructions;&amp;#10;Use your name as the reference then, email &amp;#10;campervibe6@gmail.com &amp;#10;with the same name as your reference of payment and full address.&amp;#10;The stickers will then be shipped out, thanks again for your support :-)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;*We use affiliate links from which we earn a small percentage at no extra cost to yourself. Most of this is used to keep emilys snack cupboard topped up but occasionally she lets Lou have some to buy the dog treats!"
