    id 289
    label "1501-MD82n0"
    step 0
    date "2018-09-20T21:48:26Z"
    title "VAN LIFE TIPS | where to park your van overnight"
    description "We open our van build shop next week! Before then, we want to share where to sleep living in a van. It's often one of the unknowns when first starting van life, so we wanted to share our top tips on where to park your van overnight.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you have any tips and suggestions for others living van life or rv life, please drop them in the comments section!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Van Build Inquiry: https://saraandalexjames.com/custom-van-build-inquiry-camper-conversion-sprinter&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128656;&amp;#128149;SUBSCRIBE HERE: https://bit.ly/2U4HBWV&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How much our Sprinter Van Conversion cost: https://youtu.be/SjkGy26AOKM&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CAMERA: https://amzn.to/2PpmWI1&amp;#10;GIMBAL: https://amzn.to/2BxR9By&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; VAN DETAILS: https://saraandalexjames.com/vanlife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; WHO ARE WE? &amp;#10;We are Sara &amp;#38; Alex, and definitely don't forget about our dogs - Bambi &amp;#38; Nugget - or else they might be a little upset. We converted our own Sprinter van and have hit the road for full time adventure and fun. Subscribe for new van life and travel videos every week.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We hope to inspire you to create the life you love - whatever that looks like for you! So get out there and start creating some epic content. We live by: Create more, Consume Less.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; CONNECT WITH US:&amp;#10;https://saraandalexjames.com&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/saraandalexjames&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/40hoursoffreedom&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; HOW WE TRAVEL FULL TIME: &amp;#10;https://www.joincreatorclub.com/squeeze-page25509325&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; OUR CURRENT VAN (2014 MERCEDES SPRINTER):&amp;#10;Van Life Tour | The Ultimate DIY Sprinter Van Conversion with Bathroom: https://bit.ly/2Km0899&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlifetips #vanlifecouple #wheretoparkyourvanovernight"
    channeltitle "Sara &amp;#38; Alex James &amp;#8211; Custom Crafted Vans"
    channelid "UCaFdHs0RzJv5PnlQR-OFWFw"
