  [
    id 290
    label "F5Hip6Kd55U"
    step 0
    date "2021-12-12T15:00:06Z"
    title "Our Van Upgrades After 2 years of Van Life | Modernising our Tiny Old Camper | VAN TOUR"
    description "These are the game-changing upgrades to we've made to our van, Jitters (Jits) after living full-time on the road, for the last 2 years. We hope you find these interesting &amp;#38; helpful! Detailed blog post coming soon but quick links below! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you enjoy this video, &amp;#10;&amp;#128077;&amp;#127996; &amp;#120295;&amp;#120283;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120288;&amp;#120277;&amp;#120294; &amp;#120296;&amp;#120291;, &amp;#120278;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120288;&amp;#120288;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120289;&amp;#120295; &amp;#38; &amp;#120294;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120277;&amp;#120294;&amp;#120278;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120277;&amp;#120280; if you enjoy our films. It helps hugely in getting YouTube to take notice of us so that it recommends our films to others.&amp;#10;&amp;#128075;&amp;#127996; &amp;#120284;&amp;#120289;&amp;#120294;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120282;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120288;: Come say hi, we love hearing from you (tag us)!: https://bit.ly/3lbSsrv&amp;#10;&amp;#127803; &amp;#120281;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120278;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120277;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120286;: Join our community (we also have a private over 50s group!): https://bit.ly/3mafxfw&amp;#10;&amp;#128155; SUPPORT us by joining our &amp;#120291;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120289; community where we share exclusive videos e.g. unseen footage and Q&amp;#38;As: https://www.patreon.com/jitsintothesunset&amp;#10;&amp;#10; - - -  &amp;#120297;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120279;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120290; &amp;#120278;&amp;#120283;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120291;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120294; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;00:00 Intro - About Us&amp;#10;00:54 Electricity Set-Up &amp;#10;03:34 Kitchen&amp;#10;05:56 Fridge Freezer&amp;#10;07:59 Water Filter&amp;#10;09:53 Diesel Heater&amp;#10;15:02 Water Fill-up&amp;#10;16:18 Summary &amp;#38; Travel Sneak Peak &amp;#10;&amp;#10;- - - -  &amp;#120291;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120279;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120278;&amp;#120295; &amp;#120287;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120289;&amp;#120286;&amp;#120294; &amp;#38; &amp;#120294;&amp;#120291;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120278;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120287; &amp;#120288;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120289;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120289;&amp;#120294; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;&amp;#10140; Get 10% off your first online electrical consultation with Tom from https://www.tinybuildelectrics.com/ with the code JITS10. &amp;#10;&amp;#10140; Get 5% off all your battery &amp;#38; solar panel purchases through www.tinybuildectrics.com with our code JITS5. This is what we bought from Tom, following our consultation with him:&amp;#10;&amp;#991; 200 Watt Solar Panel https://bit.ly/3pMx28U&amp;#10;&amp;#991; 50 Watt Solar Panels https://bit.ly/3EPUp7M&amp;#10;&amp;#991; Our Victron Lithium Batteries: https://bit.ly/3IU6RpB&amp;#10;&amp;#991; Our Inverter: https://bit.ly/3DKm5tf&amp;#10;&amp;#991; Victron Smart Dongle: https://bit.ly/3GFhXwn&amp;#10;&amp;#991; Alternator Charger: https://bit.ly/3ILIBWj&amp;#10;&amp;#991; Solar MPPT Charger: https://bit.ly/3dL09Uo&amp;#10;&amp;#991; DC Distribution: https://bit.ly/3IEFzTQ&amp;#10;&amp;#991;  Battery Monitor: https://bit.ly/3rZc899&amp;#10;Remote System Configuration &amp;#38; Monitoring: https://bit.ly/31QlitY &amp;#38; https://bit.ly/3IE5NGd&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10140; Thank you Gary from Barry for fitting all of our upgrades. Gary is based in Wales, UK., and is a motorhome conversion specialist. Get in touch with him on www.dragonmotors.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10140;  Fridge Freezer: We are so pleased to have upgraded to a Vitrifrigo C60i. We bought it here https://bit.ly/31QJfku as they were the cheapest we could find but please note that their customer service wasn't good (delivery delays).&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10140; Water Filter: https://generalecology.com/products/420630&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10140; Chinese Diesel Heater: https://amzn.to/3dIqbYa &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10140; 100% Bamboo bedsheets, ethically &amp;#38; sustainably produced: https://tidd.ly/3hioz92 &amp;#10;&amp;#10140; Bamboo Memory Foam Pillows: https://tidd.ly/3yaUFKz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10140; Super Handy Water Funnel: https://amzn.to/3rYifdH&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10; - - - - &amp;#120298;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120278;&amp;#120283; &amp;#120290;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120293; &amp;#120295;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120297;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120287; &amp;#120281;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120287;&amp;#120288;&amp;#120294; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;&amp;#128250; From Ireland to France to Iceland and everywhere in between! Watch our 14 travel films in Chronological Order: https://bit.ly/2USoi1I&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- - - - &amp;#120276; &amp;#120277;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120295; &amp;#120276;&amp;#120277;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120295; &amp;#120296;&amp;#120294; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;We are Tania &amp;#38; Adam and in Sep 2019, we left our busy lives in London to travel Europe in our 21-year-old campervan named Jitters aka Jits &amp;#128656; &amp;#128149; Living in a van &amp;#38; capturing our adventures through film &amp;#38; photography is our biggest creative endeavor yet. More than anything, we feel fortunate that in doing so, we have grown a wonderful &amp;#38; supportive travel-loving community. THANK YOU! More about us here: https://www.jitsintothesunset.com/about-us&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- - - - &amp;#120295;&amp;#120283;&amp;#120280; &amp;#120288;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120294;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120278; &amp;#120298;&amp;#120280; &amp;#120281;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120280; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;We use these two main music libraries - we love &amp;#38; recommend them both:&amp;#10;&amp;#10140;  ARTLIST: Get 2 months free off your annual membership when you use our referral link: https://bit.ly/2Uq3xOr&amp;#10;&amp;#10140; EPIDEMIC SOUND: Get a 30 Day Free Trial when you use our referral link: &amp;#10;https://bit.ly/3xS8o9I&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- - - - &amp;#120279;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120294;&amp;#120278;&amp;#120287;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120288;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120293; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;Where we could, we included our affiliate links, so that we may receive a very small commission, at no cost to you. It's a great way you can support our films for free. THANK YOU!"
    channeltitle "Jits into the Sunset"
