    title "Van Life Winter Camping - Too Much Snow!!"
    description "#winter #vanlifeuk Storm Arwen brought us some dangerous roads &amp;#38; camping as continue winter van life in the UK&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We start the video off down south in the Cotswolds and move back up north to the beautiful Peak District for a very snowy, wintery Britain &amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this video we visit Buxton, Bakewell, Birmingham, Cirencester and more beautiful locations in the Derbyshire Dales and South Yorkshire &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you like our content, subscribe to our channel&amp;#10;youtube.com/c/thosehappydays&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Interested in Van Life, say hello on Instagram:-&amp;#10; https://www.instagram.com/thosehappy_days/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Interested in Plant Based Food, check out these links:- &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127856;&amp;#127856; Our Vegan Food Website:&amp;#10;https://veganfooduk.co.uk/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127829;&amp;#127829;Find the latest vegan food on our Instagram:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/vegan_food_uk/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#129363;&amp;#129363;Check out our Facebook Page for all vegan food: https://www.facebook.com/veganfooduk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128055;&amp;#128020;&amp;#128004;&amp;#128017;&amp;#128007;&amp;#128054;&amp;#128572;&amp;#128044;&amp;#128032;&amp;#128012;&amp;#10;Join our Facebook Group &amp;#38; Community: https://www.facebook.com/groups/VeganFoodUK&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you would like promotional help then send us an email here vfooduk@gmail.com"
