    date "2019-08-11T13:00:40Z"
    title "3 PEOPLE LIVING IN A VAN | Van Life in Scotland "
    description "VAN LIFE UK | Sleeping 3 People in a Sprinter Van in Scotland&amp;#10;Go to http://audible.com/eamonandbec or text &amp;#8216;EAMONANDBEC&amp;#8217; to 500 500 to get one free audiobook, 2 free Audible originals &amp;#38; a 30 day free trial!&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; CLICK TO SUBSCRIBE  http://bit.ly/2DDSUgu &amp;#10;&amp;#10;With only 60 sq ft our tiny house on wheels has always amazed us with just how many people we can fit in there! And while our sprinter van has always seemed like plenty of room for the two of us, this week we test it's capacity with a third human!!! We will all travel across the country of Scotland (living, traveling, sleeping, cooking altogether).  Could you live in such tight quarters with two other people?!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Catch up on our last adventures with Adam in Baja &amp;#9728;&amp;#65039; &amp;#10;VAN LIFE VLOG 3 people living in a van https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fcg0bhOyQUI&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tour the renovations we've done to our self converted sprinter van:&amp;#10;VAN TOUR after 2 years living in our TINY HOUSE on wheels http://bit.ly/newvantour&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9825; Support Us &amp;#9825;  &amp;#10;&amp;#8608; shop our Cookbook https://www.eamonandbec.com/ &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; shop our chai blends https://chaiwalachai.com/ &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; shop Bec's handmade linen collection https://cedarandvine.net/collections/... &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; binge our latest adventures: BAJA BOUND http://bit.ly/2TJw6QL&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;Thank you to artists who allow us to use their music to enhance our videos!&amp;#10;Music by Nico Anuch  - With You - https://thmatc.co/?l=553AEB78&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ALL other music we use is from Epidemic Sound:&amp;#10;http://share.epidemicsound.com/eamonbec &amp;#10;Sign up for a free trial and download them&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Favourite Products &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Bec&amp;#8217;s Linen Clothing https://cedarandvine.net/collections/...&amp;#10;Bec&amp;#8217;s Workout/Everyday Gear https://bit.ly/2XeApWd&amp;#10;Our Sunglasses johnnyflyco.com/eamon (get 20% off with this link!)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What We Shoot On!&amp;#10;Daily Vlogger  https://amzn.to/2rgaNtN&amp;#10;B-Roll Beast https://amzn.to/2vYD2CF&amp;#10;Aerial Footage https://amzn.to/2XauZvi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Top Ten Van Life Essentials &amp;#10;Tooth Brush Holder https://amzn.to/2p1fIO9&amp;#10;Spice Jars https://amzn.to/2NxlTHY&amp;#10;Gimbal Fan https://amzn.to/2Qjlyae&amp;#10;Keep Cup http://bit.ly/beckeepcup&amp;#10;Fruit Hammock https://amzn.to/2QmLyBt&amp;#10;Essential Oils https://amzn.to/2oZFMJS&amp;#10;Car Diffuser https://bit.ly/2NkLjsI&amp;#10;Bug Screen https://amzn.to/2QmMjL0&amp;#10;Vitamix https://amzn.to/2BiW35r&amp;#10;Water Filter http://bit.ly/vanlifewaterfilter&amp;#10;Blinds http://www.vanmadegear.com/&amp;#10;Chaiwala Chai Kit https://chaiwalachai.com/&amp;#10;MAX TRAX https://amzn.to/2XBT8f9&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks for sharing a REAL WEEK of VAN LIFE in Wales with us!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you enjoyed today's video, you'll love our series from van life in Iceland!&amp;#10;Trading Van Life Canada for Van Life Iceland https://bit.ly/32Fevia&amp;#10;Land of Fire &amp;#38; Ice | Van Life Iceland https://bit.ly/2LxQPaq&amp;#10;Week of Van Life in Iceland | Ring Road Trip https://bit.ly/30MAzWE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want updates in between videos?&amp;#10;&amp;#9644; SHARE WITH US &amp;#9644; &amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Instagram: &amp;#10;https://instagram.com/eh.mon&amp;#10;https://instagram.com/rebeccamoroney&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OUR CAMERAS:&amp;#10;Daily Vlogger:  https://amzn.to/2rgaNtN&amp;#10;B Roll Beast: https://amzn.to/2vYD2CF&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Who are we?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We're Eamon and Bec, a Toronto-based couple who live full-time in our self converted Sprinter Van!! SUBSCRIBE for wanderlust travel, behind the scenes of what it's really like to live in a van, and videos all about the yummy vegan food we make + eat! VAN LIFE COUPLE. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We post new videos every Sunday :)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our goal here is to inspire you to chase after your own dreams however big (or small... tiny homes anyone?) they may be! We hope to create a community of like-minded, positive individuals who will grow to love and support one another on their own journeys. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #vanlifescotland #eamonandbec"
    channeltitle "Eamon &amp;#38; Bec"
