    date "2019-09-28T12:45:00Z"
    title "10 Best Camper Vans for Living the Van Life in 2019 - 2020"
    description "Camper vans are practical for those out there who want to avoid the time spent setting up a tent or a caravan just to bed down for the night. Throw in the ability to cook dinner safe from the elements and being able to take care of things inside when Mother Nature calls, and you can see why they're an option. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Now that you have a moment to calm down after seeing all of these, feel free to leave a comment letting us know which one you would pick. As a side note, when it comes to camper vans, the price is usually debated the most. Do you think they're what you need to live the van life?  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;*Subscribe!* &amp;#128276;&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/mindseyedesign?sub_confirmation=1&amp;#10;*Website* &amp;#10;https://mindseyevideos.com&amp;#10;SHOP CAMPING GEAR DEALS &amp;#128722;&amp;#10;https://mindseyevideos.com/camping-gear&amp;#10;&amp;#10;*Members* &amp;#128273;&amp;#10;New perks are available for members.&amp;#10;Join to get access.  &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZ7qe4QUGie6jtJPPEHQx7Q/join&amp;#10;*Playlists!* &amp;#10;https://goo.gl/KdumQF&amp;#10;*Connect* &amp;#10;https://goo.gl/fqrncD&amp;#10;*Explore* &amp;#10;https://goo.gl/UXobsF&amp;#10;&amp;#128310; SIGN UP HERE TO GET FEATURED IN A FUTURE VIDEO&amp;#10;https://www.avantlink.com/click.php?tt=ml&amp;#38;ti=15305&amp;#38;pw=290965&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128722; Escape Campervans is the largest campervan rental company in North America, with 13 convenient rental locations in the US and Canada. They have more than 600 custom-built campervans designed &amp;#38; built in-house, each uniquely hand-painted by top artists in Los Angeles. With New Zealand roots and nearly two decades of experience guiding travelers, they pride themselves on offering fun, hassle-free adventures for all. There campervan rentals are economical and easy to drive, giving you the freedom to get off the beaten path into places that are inaccessible to larger motorhomes and RVs&amp;#8212;and no stress driving through the city.&amp;#10;https://alnk.to/58kHvBc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Featured Camper Vans &amp;#11088;&amp;#10;00:00 Intro&amp;#10;0:36 Wingamm City-Suite&amp;#10;Monocoque VAN&amp;#10;https://www.wingamm.com/home/&amp;#10;$71,766&amp;#10;1:42 Westfalia Kepler Sixty Camper Van&amp;#10;https://westfalia-mobil.de/en/&amp;#10;$59,595&amp;#10;2:56 Nomad Vanz Yabba Dabba Doo Showcase Van&amp;#10;https://nomadvanz.com/&amp;#10;Custom builds start at $120,000&amp;#10;4:17 La Strada Avanti M Camper Van&amp;#10;https://www.lastrada-mobile.de/&amp;#10;$54,763&amp;#10;5:35  Tonke Van and Van XL Camper Van&amp;#10;https://www.tonke.eu/en/&amp;#10;Starting at $43,024 and $59,409&amp;#10;7:05 Adria Twin Campervan&amp;#10;https://www.adria-mobil.com/&amp;#10;$52,405&amp;#10;8:19 ModVans CV1 Full-Featured Camper Van&amp;#10;https://www.modvans.com/&amp;#10;$78,475&amp;#10;9:20 Outside Van NextGen Custom Van Conversion&amp;#10;https://www.outsidevan.com/&amp;#10;$N/A; Currently in testing&amp;#10;10:52 EXTV Kalahari Van&amp;#10;https://www.lexanimotorcars.com/&amp;#10;Conversions start at $39,000&amp;#10;(Van not included)&amp;#10;Honorable Mentions &amp;#127775;&amp;#10;Camerons Collapsible Camping Table&amp;#10;&amp;#128722; 12:10 $44.99 https://amzn.to/2nV8huH&amp;#10;Weigh Safe Trailer Hitch&amp;#10;&amp;#128722; 12:26 $299.99 https://amzn.to/2lNu0nH&amp;#10;Igloo Portable Ice Maker&amp;#10;&amp;#128722; 12:40 $118.99 https://amzn.to/2o2jdH6&amp;#10;12:56 Westfalia James Cook&amp;#10;https://westfalia-mobil.de/en/&amp;#10;$81,903&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Social Media &amp;#128483;&amp;#10;*Instagram*&amp;#10;https://instagram.com/design.mindseye&amp;#10;*Twitter*&amp;#10;https://twitter.com/mindseyevideo&amp;#10;*Pinterest*&amp;#10;https://pinterest.com/mindseyevideo&amp;#10;*Facebook* &amp;#10;https://facebook.com/mindseyedesignmedia&amp;#10;&amp;#10;@MINDS EYE VIDEO @Minds Eye Media &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Licensed Music &amp;#127911;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;10 Best Camper Vans for Living the Van Life in 2019 - 2020&amp;#10;#mindseyedesign #mindseyecampers #mindseyecamping &amp;#10;#mindseyevideo #mindseyevideos #mindseyecamper &amp;#10;#mindseyeinnovation #mindseyereviews"
