  [
    id 300
    label "UggADa3JdzE"
    step 0
    date "2021-10-17T15:00:03Z"
    title "24 Hour Tiny House Swap with Kara  Nate (van life comparison)"
    description "2 Sprinter Van Conversions, 2 Very Different Layouts. Which van life build will come out on top after this 24-hour tiny house swap? Go to http://audible.com/eamonandbec or text &amp;#8216;EAMONANDBEC&amp;#8217; and start listening today.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Watch @Kara and Nate 's version of our tiny house swap https://bit.ly/3DM2XLW&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Make sure you subscribe to them: https://www.youtube.com/c/KaraandNate/ &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; SUBSCRIBE for a new video every single Sunday http://bit.ly/2DDSUgu&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; The vlog continues on Instagram https://instagram.com/eamonandbec&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;0:41 Meet our van: Casa B&amp;#10;1:04 Kara &amp;#38; Nate's van &amp;#10;1:45 Their van has quirks&amp;#10;3:31 Eamon's to do list&amp;#10;4:05 Driving each other's vans&amp;#10;6:06 Our groceries don't fit &amp;#128586; &amp;#10;7:23 First bathroom experience &amp;#10;7:50 Let's get to work &amp;#128296; &amp;#10;12:12 Cooking dinner &amp;#10;14:25 Breaking into their van&amp;#10;15:24 Let's eat &amp;#127860;  &amp;#10;17:29 We have no power!&amp;#10;19:01 Our first van shower &amp;#10;20:35 Demolishing their van!!!&amp;#10;22:11 Nate would pay $175,000 for our van&amp;#10;22:51 Bloopers &amp;#128540; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Eamon &amp;#38; Bec Products&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; handmade chai blends https://chaiwalachai.com&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203; &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; cookbook, merch &amp;#38; van conversion guide https://eamonandbec.com/ &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Kara &amp;#38; Nate have been living out of their sprinter van since last year while we've lived in and out of DIY van builds since 2017. So, we thought it would be fun to trade vans for 24 hours to see what we love, hate and admire about each other's van layouts. The ultimate #vanlife showdown &amp;#128656; vs. &amp;#128656; !!!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hi Everyone &amp;#128075;   We're Eamon and Bec. In 2017 we bought our first sprinter van and spent 30 days renovating it into our dream tiny home. The plan was to van life around the world and we'd made it all the way from Canada to Africa. Fast forward to COVID...us abandoning our van in a Moroccan parking lot, flying home to Canada, converting yet another van, and then moving to our cabin in the woods. We've always envisioned moving into the woods by the lake and building our dream tiny cabin as a home base for us to come back to in between our international van life travels. Our return to van life is in the near future but before we fly to Morocco we wanted to have a little fun with Kara &amp;#38; Nate.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Catch up on our van life videos&amp;#10;6 People Living in a Van https://bit.ly/2YE5yZr&amp;#10;VAN TOUR | Sprinter Van Converted to Tiny Home https://youtu.be/KwcowOqSzbc&amp;#10;Back to Van Life https://bit.ly/2ZMEXtf&amp;#10;Abandoning Our Van in Africa https://bit.ly/2Wz3CAi"
    channeltitle "Eamon &amp;#38; Bec"
    channelid "UC4laAHbk8VSgmvB47tsd2XQ"
