  [
    id 306
    label "I0cqc2KWhsQ"
    step 0
    date "2020-10-22T15:00:03Z"
    title "SCOTLAND ROAD TRIP // VAN LIFE IN OBAN MULL  GLENCOE FULL VW CAMPER VAN TOUR DOG FRIENDLY HOLIDAY"
    description "Hi everyone!! &amp;#10;This week's video is our Scottish Highlands and Islands road trip. We did a quick 3 night tour of Oban, Mull and Glencoe. It was SO cool. We've never done van life before and we loved it. There's a full van tour from 3-7 mins on the video. It was our first family holiday as a three as we took Winnie with us which was so fun! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hope you enjoy the vlog. Any questions pop them in the comments! &amp;#10;I've linked below my full blog post guide of everywhere we went and all the places we stopped off. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out my IG for daily travels and updates:&amp;#10;http://instagram.com/jessroseparr&amp;#10;Home account: https://www.instagram.com/jessrosehome/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Campervan was from Staycation Scotland (loaned) &amp;#10;https://staycationscotlandcampers.com&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/staycationscotland/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BLOG POST: &amp;#10;https://www.thelayoverlife.com/2020/09/10/scotland-camper-van-trip-mull-oban-glencoe/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Personalised Google Map of everywhere we visited&amp;#10;https://www.google.com/maps/@56.8140261,-4.9850459,8.47z/data=!4m3!11m2!2sFkVqDUAdqGq70ijcp1gqIwAmD66RUA!3e3&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Links to places we visited: &amp;#10;Oban Seafood Shack https://www.tripadvisor.co.uk/Restaurant_Review-g186501-d2091037-Reviews-Oban_Seafood_Hut-Oban_Argyll_and_Bute_Scotland.html&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Oban Fish and Chip Shop&amp;#10;http://www.obanfishandchipshop.co.uk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;North Ledaig Campsite&amp;#10;https://northledaigcaravanpark.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Ferry Booking Site&amp;#10;https://www.calmac.co.uk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tobermory Fish Co&amp;#10;https://www.tobermoryfish.co.uk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Isle of Mull Ice Cream&amp;#10;http://www.isleofmullicecream.co.uk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Isle of Mull Cheese Farm&amp;#10;http://www.isleofmullcheese.co.uk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Eas Fors Waterfall&amp;#10;https://www.google.com/maps/place/Eas+Fors+Waterfall/@56.5036562,-6.1560888,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x488beca66b414ad5:0xa7a4df9a8881fc6d!8m2!3d56.5036562!4d-6.1539001&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Killiechronan Campsite&amp;#10;https://www.google.com/maps/place/Killiechronan+Cottages/@56.494156,-6.0063863,14z/data=!4m8!1m2!2m1!1scalgary+beach!3m4!1s0x0:0x762457dbcf05e374!8m2!3d56.499768!4d-6.0000372&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Fionnphort Beach &amp;#10;https://www.google.com/maps/place/Fionnphort+Beach/@56.3280094,-6.378368,15z/data=!4m12!1m6!3m5!1s0x488beca66b414ad5:0xa7a4df9a8881fc6d!2sEas+Fors+Waterfall!8m2!3d56.5036562!4d-6.1539001!3m4!1s0x0:0xd5b1da33ee8b74f1!8m2!3d56.3262285!4d-6.3683876&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Inverlussa mussel farm&amp;#10;https://www.google.com/maps/place/Inverlussa+Mussel+Farm/@56.3446819,-6.2801302,10z/data=!4m8!1m2!2m1!1scalgary+beach!3m4!1s0x488bde13a693efff:0xf8d7418c569c2982!8m2!3d56.4119071!4d-5.7371807&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Caolasnacon Caravan &amp;#38; Camping Park &amp;#10;https://www.kinlochlevencaravans.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Glencoe Trail&amp;#10;https://www.google.com/maps/place/Glencoe+Lochan+Trail/@56.6390655,-5.0498818,10z/data=!4m12!1m6!3m5!1s0x488beca66b414ad5:0xa7a4df9a8881fc6d!2sEas+Fors+Waterfall!8m2!3d56.5036562!4d-6.1539001!3m4!1s0x488936d480221647:0x9211f66fdb021001!8m2!3d56.6876338!4d-5.0967979"
