  [
    id 308
    label "uKC6a86M3ks"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-20T16:02:29Z"
    title "VAN LIFE!? In South Africa?"
    description "Greetings from South Africa! VAN LIFE!? In South Africa?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are pinching ourselves! Van Life In South Africa!? Let&amp;#8217;s GO! &amp;#128525;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Special thanks to CU Camper for making this dream trip a reality! You can find more of their vehicles available to hire in a number of different countries here https://www.cu-camper.com/en/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Support our channel HERE :)&amp;#10;https://buymeacoffee.com/sarahandmarek&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127916;Follow us on Instagram for behind the scenes content: @sarahandmarek https://www.instagram.com/sarahandmarek/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128231; Subscribe to our weekly newsletter for updates on our current travel plans and be the first to know when we have big announcements! https://sarahandmarek.com/weeklynewsletter/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We spent a total of $9 900 for the first 365 days of our travels &amp;#129327; for BOTH of us to travel (mostly around Europe) for a full year &amp;#127758;&amp;#9992;&amp;#65039; we visited 10 countries to be exact. Find out more in our income and expense report giving a full breakdown of our finances for our first year of traveling.&amp;#10;Income &amp;#38; Expenses Report Oct&amp;#8217;20 &amp;#8211; Oct &amp;#8216;21&amp;#10;https://sarahandmarek.com/income-expense-report-oct-20-oct-21/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How do we travel internationally on a budget? By doing volunteer work in exchange for food and accommodation through an organisation called Workaway. Want to find out more about how to sign up for and use workaway? Check out our blog post https://sarahandmarek.com/travelinternationallyonabudgetusingworkaway/&amp;#10;If you join Workaway using this link, you&amp;#8217;ll get THREE MONTHS EXTRA added to your subscription &amp;#127881;&amp;#10;https://www.workaway.info/invite/1X783BD5&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9992;Looking to TRAVEL IN 2021? Check out our best tips for travel this year https://sarahandmarek.com/tipsfortravellinginternationallyin2021/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128248;Our gear https://sarahandmarek.com/ourgear/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For business enquiries: sarah@sarahandmarek.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128444;We make our thumbnails here: https://www.canva.com/join/pineapple-stork-soon&amp;#10;&amp;#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;Who are Sarah and Marek!?&amp;#10;Two South African beans who set off on a world venture at probably the worst time ever &amp;#128567; Oct 2020. We worked HARD to make our travel dreams come true and enjoyed filming and making videos along the way. GET THIS! Some awesome people from around the globe enjoyed our amateur videos enough to join the crew &amp;#129321; Now we&amp;#8217;re hoping to turn this travel and filming thing into our full-time gig! Who knows what the future may hold but we are chasing after a life full of adventure and willing to go the extra mile to see our dreams come true! &amp;#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Watch some more &amp;#128516;&amp;#128071;&amp;#127996;&amp;#10;FOOD, SIGHTS, And Everything NICE | The BEST WAY To EXPLORE SKOPJE! https://youtu.be/Y5SisTcvLwA&amp;#10;Our FINAL FLIGHT After 1 Year + 4 Months | Is This The END? https://youtu.be/JmvKZPpMRPw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;New uploads every Tuesday and Friday&amp;#10;Subscriber count: 4 618 Adventurers&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can also find us here:&amp;#10;WEBSITE https://sarahandmarek.com/&amp;#10;INSTAGRAM https://www.instagram.com/sarahandmarek/&amp;#10;FACEBOOK https://web.facebook.com/Sarah-Marek-101089441688794&amp;#10;BUYMEACOFFEE https://buymeacoffee.com/sarahandmarek&amp;#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#127925; Find the copyright free songs we used in this episode here: sign up for free and get 10 free downloads every month https://uppbeat.io?referral=marek-qbh4x&amp;#10;Songs:&amp;#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;00:00 Intro&amp;#10;01:00 What&amp;#8217;s next?&amp;#10;02:45 Been looking forward to this for 4 months! &amp;#10;04:33 This trip is&amp;#8230; VAN LIFE SOUTH AFRICA&amp;#10;06:30 Driving our new baby away&amp;#10;08:37 First perk of driving a mobile home&amp;#10;09:53 Beautiful camp and thoughts on our first night&amp;#10;11:34 OUTRO&amp;#10;12:29 BLOOPS&amp;#10;13:03 Picking Up The Van BUDGET&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #vanlifesouthafrica #southafricanyoutubers"
    channeltitle "Sarah &amp;#38; Marek"
