  [
    id 317
    label "0Kb0r_Ft6to"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-10T08:00:00Z"
    title "Full Time Van Life Begins! | Luton Van Build EP8"
    description "We're Kieran and Alice, a young travel couple and for the last 2 years we've been exploring Europe with our dogs Freddie and Sookie in our converted Sprinter Van. We were FED UP of the 9-5 and limited travel, so we quit our jobs, switched to full-time van life and haven't looked back. We upload new videos every Sunday, so make sure to subscribe to never miss out!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We started travelling in our van during the pandemic, and have since explored France, Spain, Portugal, Scotland, Ireland, Wales, Croatia and quite a few more countries. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We're currently building our next home on wheels in an ex-removals Luton Van, and are documenting the whole renovation every week here on YouTube, so make sure you're subscribed to never miss an update.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We're also posting daily van build updates over on our instagram @kieran.and.alice&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our gear:&amp;#10;Drone: https://amzn.to/3FNhrvJ&amp;#10;Camera: https://amzn.to/3GN8AL5&amp;#10;GoPro: https://amzn.to/3qLgyzx&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Love our music? We have a spotify playlist: https://spoti.fi/3EmmaVO&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We're converting the van from scratch, so if you're thinking about living in a van, or have any questions about van life, we'd love a chat!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks for watching and subscribing! :)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Business Enquiries: kieranlukefield@gmail.com"
    channeltitle "Kieran and Alice - Van Life"
