    title "Driving from France to Switzerland | Solo female van life"
    description "Hello! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;I quit my corporate job to live in a van with my little pup Kevin! I have decided to start documenting my solo journey traveling across Europe in my van. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;-&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this video, I leave France after 2+ months and head towards Switzerland. I go on a few beautiful hikes and endure some van life struggles! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hope you enjoy :)"
