    id 321
    label "z0sraw6iMIc"
    step 0
    date "2018-10-23T00:11:42Z"
    title "VAN TOUR: FULL-TIME SOLO FEMALE VAN LIFE | Divine on the Road"
    description "Follow us on Instagram for daily updates: https://www.instagram.com/saraandalexjames&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join us for a Van Tour with our friend Sydney (@divineontheroad) who lives full-time solo female van life. She just had her second van converted and she let us come in for a tour of her 148&amp;#34; wheelbase Transit van conversion. Sydney also shares some tips on how to stay safe while traveling as a solo female.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can find Sydney here:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://shopdivineontheroad.com&amp;#10;https://instagram.com/divineontheroad&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxuSWQk4e9wo4YJ0I8oE6lg&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128656;&amp;#128149;SUBSCRIBE HERE: https://bit.ly/2U4HBWV&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Get our van layout guide here: https://saraandalexjames.com/van-build-layout-guide&amp;#10;&amp;#10;All van info here: https://saraandalexjames.com/vanlife/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; WHO ARE WE? &amp;#10;We are Sara &amp;#38; Alex, and definitely don't forget about our dogs - Bambi &amp;#38; Nugget - or else they might be a little upset. We converted our own Sprinter van and have hit the road for full time adventure and fun. Subscribe for new van life and travel videos every week!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We hope to inspire you to create the life you love - whatever that looks like for you! So get out there and start creating some epic content.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; CONNECT WITH US:&amp;#10;https://saraandalexjames.com&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/saraandalexjames&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/40hoursoffreedom&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; HOW WE TRAVEL FULL TIME: &amp;#10;https://www.joincreatorclub.com/squeeze-page25509325&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Van Life Tour | The Ultimate DIY Sprinter Van Conversion with Bathroom: https://bit.ly/2Km0899&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#solofemalevanlife #vantour #solofemaletravel"
