    id 323
    label "V64mcMGKXX8"
    step 0
    date "2020-02-23T16:01:51Z"
    title "VAN LIFE on Portugals Atlantic Coast! Ep 13 | VAN LIFE EUROPE | Van Life Diaries"
    description "&amp;#127909;Previous Episode - Cruising the Algarve - https://youtu.be/VQ8LGeiicEA&amp;#10;&amp;#128656;Subscribe! // New video every Sunday - http://bit.ly/30XwFLz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hello! We&amp;#8217;re Chesca &amp;#38; Ben, and we live full time in our self built 2012 sprinter van, Sophia. We spent 6 long months converting our tiny home on wheels, turning her from a workhorse into a place we call home. For the past few months, we've been chasing the winter sun, travelling around Spain and Portugal. Join us on our adventures as we explore the globe in our van &amp;#127757; &amp;#128656;&amp;#160;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9734; More videos &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Have you seen the last episode? &amp;#8608;  https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hEve-XqkRxA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our FULL van build in less than 20 minutes! &amp;#8608;  &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ip01BgNWVFI&amp;#38;t=3s&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Peek inside our van (full tour) &amp;#8608; &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tFqwTJevYQo&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9734; Stuff we use &amp;#10;&amp;#10;MAIN CAMERA: https://amzn.to/2rtZHFk&amp;#10;MAIN CAMERA LENS: https://amzn.to/2DZePxi&amp;#10;MINI VLOG CAMERA: https://amzn.to/2DU323l&amp;#10;DRONE: https://amzn.to/2rpc71e&amp;#10;GOPRO: https://amzn.to/2YvDSBj&amp;#10;TRIPOD: https://amzn.to/2s6XxLU"
