  [
    id 324
    label "eqOkaFJp6fw"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-13T14:00:17Z"
    title "A Look At A Day In Van Life | Friends Parting Ways  Back To Solo Travel"
    description "A Look At A Day In Van Life | Friends Parting Ways &amp;#38; Back To Solo Travel&amp;#10;&amp;#10;After traveling for 3 years alone I had found my group on the road.   But all good things must come to an end, at least for a while.     Back to solo travel but not before one more epic adventure with this day in the life.    &amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW MY FRIENDS Mentioned in this video:&amp;#10;Riley Does Life : https://www.youtube.com/c/RileyDoesLife&amp;#10;Aussie Van Man:  https://www.youtube.com/c/AussieVanMan&amp;#10;&amp;#10;------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128522; I NOW HAVE A PO Box: &amp;#128522;&amp;#10;Bunny&amp;#10;PO Box 22&amp;#10;Sunset, TX 76270&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you have enjoyed this adventure and would like to be a part of the channel I have  Patreon!!!  A donation of $3 or more guarantees you a post card a month, however there are other programs which include personalized phone calls, gifts and more!!!  Come be a part of the adventure!!&amp;#10;Patreon:  &amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/bunnyplayshere&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you would like to make a donation to a future adventure you can do so on Venmo, PayPal or CashApp.  &amp;#10;Venmo:  @bunnyplayshere&amp;#10;CashApp:  @bunnyplayshere&amp;#10;PayPal:  bunnyplayshere@gmail.com&amp;#10;Amazon items featured in video description are affiliate links. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you are interested in checkout our the PODCAST I just started with Riley (Riley Does Life):  https://open.spotify.com/show/1FPclYXhB76pCX9go60S89?si=54cfb58ee20f4eb7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out some of my designs and pick up your favorite travel shirt, mask or sticker:  https://www.etsy.com/shop/BunnyPlaysHere?ref=seller-platform-mcnav&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow me on NewsBreak!!!   I post travel tips, tricks &amp;#38; news related to locations I am traveling to currently.   Absolutely FREE news source!!&amp;#10;https://newsbreakapp.onelink.me/2115408369?pid=mp_1588057&amp;#38;msource=mp_1588057 &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Interactive Map of all the locations I have traveled to!!! https://www.scribblemaps.com/maps/view/Bunny_Plays_Here_Adventure_Map/BUNNY&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow me on social media:&amp;#10;IG:  http://www.instagram.com &amp;#10;FB:  http://www.facebook.com/bunnyplayshere &amp;#10;WEB:  http://www.bunnyplayshere.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #vanlifereality #vanlifediary"
