    description "GET 2 EXTRA VIDEOS A MONTH HERE: http://bit.ly/2Jyvts8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WE RELEASED AN ALBUM! CHECK IT OUT HERE: http://bit.ly/2Uj4r9m&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CHAT WITH US LIVE HERE: http://bit.ly/2IgbjT9&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BUY A HANDMADE CANDLE OR NECKLACE: https://etsy.me/2CsKhTt&amp;#10;&amp;#10;STUFF IN OUR VAN AND GEAR WE USE&amp;#10;Lighting&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Strip Light LED&amp;#8217;s: https://amzn.to/2zLu4bN&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Spot Light LED&amp;#8217;s: https://amzn.to/2P3D8Ok&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Ambiance Lighting: https://amzn.to/2y3rooA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Decorations&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Prayer Flags: https://amzn.to/2IuHJGQ&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;MUST NEED For Travel Photographers: https://amzn.to/2DbzqPa&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;The BEST Mattress: https://amzn.to/2CrMYad&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Solar&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Solar Panels: https://amzn.to/2CrybMz&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Charge Controller: https://amzn.to/2OJHxJH&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Battery Bank: https://amzn.to/2Pdg007&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Kitchen&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;The Refrigerator We Use: https://amzn.to/2zLCnVc&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Our Favorite Stove Top: https://amzn.to/2QrAX7N&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Compact Sink: https://amzn.to/2IzB9za&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Faucet: https://amzn.to/2xRcqCi&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Water Tank: https://amzn.to/2DLcRn2&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Water Pump: https://amzn.to/2zLxtr2&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Grey Water Tank: https://amzn.to/2O1lqPm&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Extractor Fan: https://amzn.to/2PajTCQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Bathroom&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Shower: https://amzn.to/2y61nEo&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;$20 Toilet Solution: https://amzn.to/2y61nEo&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Camera Gear&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;OUR FAVORITE VLOGGING CAMERA: https://amzn.to/2L2zLEE&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Best Cinematic Camera: https://amzn.to/2GImYcu&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Editing Software We Use: https://amzn.to/2LrYnrp&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;The Lens We Use: https://amzn.to/2H03s96&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Bendy Tripod: https://amzn.to/2GFpGzi&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;The Drone We Use:https://amzn.to/2LpyEzL&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;The Best Phone For Video: https://amzn.to/2Me6EAs&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;We Use Lenses On Our Phone: https://amzn.to/2CphEGH&amp;#10;&amp;#10;E-Mail: thenomadicmovement@gmail.com&amp;#10;Website: www.thenomadicmovement.com&amp;#10;Instagram: @thenomadicmovement&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music From Epidemic Sound&amp;#10;#vanlife #vanlifeguatemala #thenomadicmovement"
