    step 0
    date "2022-04-28T19:17:12Z"
    title "Van Life With Homer/Coolest Dog EVER!!!"
    description "#gloriouslifeonwheels,#vanlife, #cute dog, #rvliving&amp;#10;Meet Homer. The cutest traveling dog ever. Whether he is in an rv, or car camper conversion like shown in this video, or one of his own custom made cars Homer is the epitome of cool. He even has a driver's license that he wears around his neck. Stay tuned because next week I am going to do a tour of the custom made VW bug he is sitting on. Homer's  brillant and talented dad, Sergio, chopped, pieced together,  and did all sorts of other amazing things to convert a 1953 classic Volkswagon Bug . Trust me when I tell you that you won't want to miss this tour!!"
