  [
    id 333
    label "Nx1x5mXYYy0"
    step 0
    date "2020-07-11T09:00:06Z"
    title "VAN TOUR | Small, Modular, Smart Conversion w/ Shower + Toilet | Peugeot Boxer Autosleeper Symphony"
    description "Jitters is a 1999 (Petrol Engine) Peugeot Boxer Autosleeper conversion - a 'Symphony' model! She may be FAR from the most 'Instagrammable' van but she is full of quirk, character &amp;#38; is just damn perfect inside... we LOVE her! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;After 9 months of full-time van life, we are excited to share the full VAN TOUR of JITS AND HER VINTAGE BITS! &amp;#128656;&amp;#128171;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Jits has EVERYTHING... a separate indoor shower &amp;#38; toilet, a dual-gas hob, grill &amp;#38; oven, a mini-fridge &amp;#38; freezer as well as LOADS of smart hidden storage. Her modular design allows us to transform the living space from bedroom to lounge, to office, to dining room... large enough to host 4 people inside COMFORTABLY. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Jits belonged to Adam's mum, Sally, who sadly passed away in Jan 2019 from ovarian cancer. During this time, we were reminded how life is too short and felt inspired to take the plunge &amp;#38; pursue our dream of full-time van life.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you enjoy this film and would like to support us, please take the time to like &amp;#38; comment! And if you're new, please subscribe to join us on our Europe travels and beyond! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128656; &amp;#128149; xx Tania, Adam &amp;#38; Jits &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;|| &amp;#10024; IF YOU APPRECIATE JITS &amp;#38; HER RUSTY BITS &amp;#10024; ||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128077;&amp;#127996; THUMBS UP if you enjoy our films &amp;#38; want to help YouTube take notice of us&amp;#10;&amp;#127775; SUBSCRIBE to our channel to join our community &amp;#38; help us grow: https://bit.ly/ilovejitters&amp;#10;&amp;#128155; SUPPORT us on PATREON &amp;#38; unlock exclusive updates &amp;#38; videos: https://www.patreon.com/jitsintothesunset&amp;#10;&amp;#128075;&amp;#127996; INSTAGRAM: Come say hi, we love hearing from you (tag us)!: https://bit.ly/3lbSsrv&amp;#10;&amp;#127803; FACEBOOK: Join our community (we also have a private over 50s group!): https://bit.ly/3mafxfw&amp;#10;&amp;#128248; BLOG: A detailed tour of our filmmaking equipment: https://bit.ly/cameraequipment&amp;#10;&amp;#127470;&amp;#127466; BLOG: Read our Ultimate Van Life Ireland Guide: https://bit.ly/vanlifeireland&amp;#10;&amp;#127926; PLAYLIST: Listen to our Road Trip favourites: https://spoti.fi/3kz5yij&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;|| &amp;#128071;&amp;#127996; IF YOU ENJOYED THIS FILM &amp;#128071;&amp;#127996; ||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128250; WATCH Our Full Travel Series - 14 episodes in chronological order: https://bit.ly/2USoi1I&amp;#10;Or choose below from our full list of films:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;1. &amp;#127909; Van Life Ireland Part 1: https://youtu.be/UNkG7Ofwqi4&amp;#10;2. &amp;#127909; Van Life Ireland Part 2: https://youtu.be/kYar142Ws3Y&amp;#10;3. &amp;#127909; Van Life Ireland Part 3: https://youtu.be/I_TDLsUDdvU&amp;#10;4. &amp;#127909; Van Life Northern Ireland: https://youtu.be/kkzbrV_zMi4&amp;#10;5. &amp;#127909; Van Life Scotland: https://youtu.be/cLzkYdg4XtE&amp;#10;6. &amp;#127909; Van Life Portugal (Life before Lockdown): https://youtu.be/UpbMkcDrdbw&amp;#10;7. &amp;#127909; Van Life Lockdown on a Portuguese Farm during a Global Pandemic: https://youtu.be/Monw3vfC1rM&amp;#10;8. &amp;#127909; Van Life Spain: https://youtu.be/0SOJOaoxP7I&amp;#10;9. &amp;#127909; Van Life France: https://youtu.be/ARfMk1rZlto&amp;#10;10. &amp;#127909; Van Life Switzerland: https://youtu.be/FdOeI6-q_pE&amp;#10;11. &amp;#127909; Van Life Italy: https://youtu.be/TOMwRzs6ia4 &amp;#10;12. &amp;#127909; Van Life Wales with  @Kinging- It  : https://youtu.be/TrzBGY7fOAQ&amp;#10;13. &amp;#127909; Van Life on the Welsh Coast: https://youtu.be/FV4Mxo7zl2M&amp;#10;14. &amp;#127909; Van Life Iceland: https://youtu.be/lnVnsG_Q8o0&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;|| &amp;#128656; A BIT ABOUT JITTERS AKA. JITS &amp;#128656; || &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Jitters is a 1999 Peugeot Boxer Autosleeper 'Symphony'. Jits belonged to Adam's mum, Sally, who sadly passed away in Jan 2019 from ovarian cancer. During this time, we were reminded how life is too short and felt inspired to take the plunge &amp;#38; pursue our dream of full-time van life.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128250; WATCH OUR VAN TOUR where we show you Jits' smart &amp;#38; modular design, in hope that she may serve as inspiration for your own van build research: https://youtu.be/Nx1x5mXYYy0 &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;|| &amp;#128105;&amp;#127997; A BIT ABOUT US &amp;#129492;&amp;#127995; || &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are Tania (Irish/Mexican) &amp;#38; Adam (English) &amp;#38; in Sep 2019, we left our busy lives in London to travel Europe in our 21-year-old campervan named Jitters aka Jits &amp;#128656; &amp;#128149; Living in a van &amp;#38; capturing our adventures through film &amp;#38; photography is our biggest creative endeavour yet. More than anything, we feel fortunate that in doing so, we have managed to grow such a wonderful &amp;#38; supportive travel-loving community. THANK YOU! More about us here: www.jitsintothesunset.com/about-us&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;|| FAQ &amp;#8211; OUR FILMMAKING KIT ||&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9999;&amp;#65039; BLOG: Read a detailed tour of our camera equipment including our product links, tips &amp;#38; other recommendations: https://bit.ly/cameraequipment. Quick Links: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9675; Adam&amp;#8217;s Camera: https://amzn.to/3dGKbIA&amp;#10;&amp;#9675; Tania&amp;#8217;s Camera: https://amzn.to/381dsMR&amp;#10;&amp;#9675; Waterproof Action Camera: https://amzn.to/31alSPn&amp;#10;&amp;#9675; Aerial Shots/Drone: https://amzn.to/3evQPCu &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;|| &amp;#127925; THE MUSIC WE FEATURE &amp;#127925; || &amp;#10;We use these two main music libraries. We love &amp;#38; recommend them both. &amp;#10;&amp;#9675;  ARTLIST: Get 2 months free off your annual membership when you use our referral link: https://bit.ly/2Uq3xOr&amp;#10;&amp;#9675;  EPIDEMIC SOUND: Get a 30 Day Free Trial when you use our referral link: &amp;#10;https://bit.ly/3xS8o9I&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The above are affiliate links, so we may receive a very small commission, at no cost to you. It's a way you can support our films. THANK YOU!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vantour #vanconversion #vanlife"
