athroom&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Shower: https://amzn.to/2y61nEo&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;$20 Toilet Solution: https://amzn.to/2y61nEo&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Camera Gear&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;OUR FAVORITE VLOGGING CAMERA: https://amzn.to/2L2zLEE&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Best Cinematic Camera: https://amzn.to/2GImYcu&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Editing Software We Use: https://amzn.to/2LrYnrp&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;The Lens We Use: https://amzn.to/2H03s96&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Bendy Tripod: https://amzn.to/2GFpGzi&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;The Drone We Use:https://amzn.to/2LpyEzL&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;The Best Phone For Video: https://amzn.to/2Me6EAs&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;We Use Lenses On Our Phone: https://amzn.to/2CphEGH&amp;#10;&amp;#10;E-Mail: thenomadicmovement@gmail.com&amp;#10;Website: www.thenomadicmovement.com&amp;#10;Instagram: @thenomadicmovement&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music From Epidemic Sound&amp;#10;#vanlife #vanlifemexico #thenomadicmovement"
