    date "2021-07-11T14:30:05Z"
    title "the BIGGEST stop yet | van life couple vlog"
    description "While we are still slowly making our way back to the east coast we came across the biggest stop yet! and by biggest we really mean biggest. Living in a van means being able to stop spur of the moment which is what this whole van life couple vlog is about. This day was completely unexpected and turned out to be an awesome van life adventure. Our nomad life continues taking us through illinois getting us ready for the next big destination. Any guesses where our next stop is!?&amp;#10;vlog 76 , 7/7/21&amp;#10;&amp;#10;JOIN US FOR 100K MILES&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/lostrenegades&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CHECK US OUT&amp;#10;http://www.lostrenegadeslife.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW ALONG&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/lost.renegades&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/lostchazz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;STUFF IN THE VAN&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/lost.renegades&amp;#10;&amp;#10;DROP A COMMENT&amp;#10;best comments... wins a sticker set!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHO ARE WE?&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X9QWyXXtEj8&amp;#38;t=126s&amp;#10;#lostrenegades #vlog #vanlife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CONTACT&amp;#10;lostrenegadesvan@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;INTRO- Fall by Cospe&amp;#10;OUTRO- Feeling Crazy by Layn&amp;#10;&amp;#10;and always remember &amp;#34;phones off, friends on&amp;#34; &amp;#10;-Christina, the wise."
