    date "2018-09-23T14:00:04Z"
    title "VAN LIFE WITH A DOG // day in the life vlog"
    description "Day in the Life of Van Life with a BIG Dog [ VLOG ]&amp;#10;Can we all fit into 60 sq ft? How does stealth camping work with an excitable puppy? What will we do about all the shedding in our tiny house? Are we destined to adopt our own dog? All this and more answered in this week's vlog!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;&amp;#9658; CLICK TO SUBSCRIBE + join our van life adventures: http://bit.ly/2DDSUgu&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My sister and her partner are away on vacation so we signed up to housesit AND puppy sit while they're gone! While there are many perks to house life there are many reasons we are so excited to be back to living in a van! Come along for a day with us as we show Bruce behind the scenes of VAN LIFE and see for ourselves if having a pet in our self converted Sprinter Van is doable?! We're road tripping to Quebec, Canada and cannot wait to bring you along to this weekend's vanlife meet up... speaking of... would you like to see:&amp;#10;a) mini van tours of people we meet there&amp;#10;b) have us find out what most people do for work and money to live on the road full time &amp;#10;c) just a relaxed vlog of our time with everyone&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want updates in between videos?&amp;#10;&amp;#9644; SHARE WITH US &amp;#9644; &amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Instagram: &amp;#10;https://instagram.com/eh.mon&amp;#10;https://instagram.com/rebeccamoroney&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OUR CAMERAS:&amp;#10;Vlogging: https://amzn.to/2rgaNtN&amp;#10;Cinematic Work: https://amzn.to/2vYD2CF&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Who are we?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We're Eamon and Bec, a Toronto-based couple who live full-time in our self converted Sprinter Van!! SUBSCRIBE for wanderlust travel, behind the scenes of what it's really like to live in a van, and videos all about the yummy vegan food we make + eat!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We post new videos every Wednesday + Sunday AND a new, easy vegan recipe every Friday :)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our goal here is to inspire you to chase after your own dreams however big (or small... tiny homes anyone?) they may be! We hope to create a community of like-minded, positive individuals who will grow to love and support one another on their own journeys. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;New to our channel? Watch our 2017 recap video to get caught up:&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2DyCi6r&amp;#10;&amp;#10;More Eamon &amp;#38; Bec&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Van Life Tour | Our Custom DIY Sprinter Van Conversion:&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2n6QvRl&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How to Convert a Sprinter Van in 30 Days: &amp;#10;http://bit.ly/2BpzBlW&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#eamonandbec #vanlife #vanlifedog"
    channeltitle "Eamon &amp;#38; Bec"
