    id 346
    label "pMp1qq-dzME"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-13T16:00:12Z"
    title "VAN LIFING ALABAMA! The TOP Things To Do For VAN LIFERS!"
    description "Hey Freedom Family! Nikki and Emmaus(E -May -Us) here! Van living through Alabama! We visited Huntsville, Duaphin Island, Montgomery, Birmingham, Woodville in our luxury converted Promaster Van - Carmen VanDiego!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join us in revealing history and culture throughout beautiful Alabama. You'll see all the amazing museums, nature and OOPS! Typical VAN-LIFE Difficulties! Through this trip we were van living full time, working on our marriage all while running multiple businesses from our van.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Be sure to SUBSCRIBE for lots of love, business, adventure, inspiration and tips! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; SUBSCRIBE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; FOLLOW on Instagram&amp;#10;Emmaus - https://instagram.com/emmausferdinand?igshid=vc01wfyqtx3v&amp;#10;Nikki- https://instagram.com/nikki__ferd?igshid=&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WANT TO VANLIFE? Here&amp;#8217;s what you&amp;#8217;ll need!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Income &amp;#129297;(Ya Needs Money to live on the road. See resources below):&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Book &amp;#128214;:&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/dp/1080230254/ref=cm_sw_r_cp_awdb_imm_AG2YTC5CJ7XX911WZZ60&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Website &amp;#128187;: www.myfreedomuniversity.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Store&amp;#127978;: https://www.amazon.com/shop/nikki__ferd"
