  [
    id 348
    label "5ofhatjEXSI"
    step 0
    date "2021-01-24T14:30:00Z"
    title "we found the perfect place! | VAN LIFE south carolina"
    description "the vlog finally hits the beach for van life South Carolina. We found the perfect place, Folly Beach! This beach was the perfect home for our tiny home on wheels. Our South Carolina vlog continues as we make our way into town to stop by the best thing to do in Charleston SC..  an awesome dog bar!! We also head into James park to relax for the day and let adventure pup run wild. Of course van life with a dog means his tiny paws drag sand everywhere in our chevy conversion van. At least we are finally getting back to normal when it comes to how to live in a van again.&amp;#10;vlog 27 , 1/19/21 - 1/22/21&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUPPORT US&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/lostrenegades&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SHOP OUR STUFF&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/lost.renegades&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW THE ADVENTURE&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/lost.renegades&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/lostchazz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;DROP A COMMENT&amp;#10;see something you like.. we'll link it&amp;#10;got a good dad joke... tell us&amp;#10;think we're awesome.. by all means type away&amp;#10;don't like us... lie&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHO ARE WE?&amp;#10;Oh, hey! We are Charlie, Jenn and Opie&amp;#10;We converted our 95' Chevy van, Duke into what we think is the sickest home on wheels. Off grid and stealthy, he's ready for the open road of travel. Our pup Opie agrees, and definitely thinks we spent the summer of 2020 building his puppy dream car. So here we are, jobs quit and taking on the world by van as a travel couple. We have no idea how to do this #vanlife thing, but we're about to figure it out through many bad words and bickering. Welcome to our #travelvlog featuring the life of unemployment on the open road...&amp;#10;#lostrenegades&amp;#10;&amp;#10;and always remember &amp;#34;phones off, friends on&amp;#34; &amp;#10;-Christina, the wise."
    channeltitle "Lost Renegades"
    channelid "UCoXOKfFqGBOlqMaWL1xb-pg"
