  [
    id 349
    label "dcLhyoqQ7eA"
    step 0
    date "2020-01-19T14:00:05Z"
    title "VAN LIFE EUROPE CONTINUES!!"
    description "Goodbye House Life, Hello Van Life! In today's van life vlog we get back to living in a van in Spain &amp;#38; creating healthy routines while traveling but not before we share a little bit of what our life has been like back in Toronto&amp;#9658; CLICK to SUBSCRIBE so you never miss a video  http://bit.ly/2DDSUgu &amp;#10;&amp;#10035; Eamon &amp;#38; Bec Products &amp;#10035;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; our handmade chai blends https://chaiwalachai.com/ &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; our plant-based cookbook https://www.eamonandbec.com/weekday-whip-ups &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; our beautiful photo filters https://www.eamonandbec.com/presets &amp;#8606;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128171; We are so excited to continue to share our favourite vegan supplement brand with you: Vivo Life! We've recently introduced their B12, Omega + Vitamin D supplements into our diet and loving it. Check out their full line up here http://bit.ly/2OKMNMy and use code EAMONANDBEC for 10% off at checkout &amp;#128171; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;This week is all about getting back to our tiny house on wheels as we left our van behind in Spain to fly home and work a very important show for our tea business Chaiwala Chai.  However, in the time we've been away from the van we've definitely adapted to the luxuries of house life (cough, cough... unlimited hot showers and a laundry machine IN THE APARTMENT!).  To be honest, the thought of returning back to living in a van in unfamiliar places was rather overwhelming BUT we took the plunge anyways! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Happy to report that we couldn't be happier for VAN LIFE EUROPE to continue &amp;#38; we're super excited to see what adventures 2020 has in store for us! Don't believe us? Stay tuned to the end of this episode to see the natural beauty that Spain has to offer and for a cheeky preview of some upcoming challenges too!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Catch up on our last adventures:&amp;#10;Ditching the Van and Flying Home&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4XfVgv8yWEQ&amp;#38;t=405s&amp;#10;Someone Broke into our House (Van Life Nightmare)&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UcZMMR9SK_w&amp;#38;t=158s&amp;#10;Van Life Scotland | 3 People Living in a Van &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iXSxc6bnANk&amp;#38;t=900s&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tour the renovations we've done to our self converted sprinter van:&amp;#10;VAN TOUR after 2 years living in our TINY HOUSE on wheels http://bit.ly/newvantour&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Get a free trial of the best music for your videos: http://share.mscbd.fm/rebeccamoroney&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Looking for an all-inclusive, detailed van build guide?! Look no further!&amp;#10;https://thewanderful.co/?ref=eamonfitzgerald&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Today we show you around house life in Toronto and van life in Spain!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What We Shoot On!&amp;#10;Daily Vlogger  https://amzn.to/2rgaNtN&amp;#10;B-Roll Beast https://amzn.to/2vYD2CF&amp;#10;Aerial Footage https://amzn.to/2XauZvi&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Top Ten Van Life Essentials &amp;#10;Tooth Brush Holder https://amzn.to/2p1fIO9&amp;#10;Spice Jars https://amzn.to/2NxlTHY&amp;#10;Gimbal Fan https://amzn.to/2Qjlyae&amp;#10;Keep Cup http://bit.ly/beckeepcup&amp;#10;Fruit Hammock https://amzn.to/2QmLyBt&amp;#10;Essential Oils https://amzn.to/2oZFMJS&amp;#10;Car Diffuser https://bit.ly/2NkLjsI&amp;#10;Bug Screen https://amzn.to/2QmMjL0&amp;#10;Vitamix https://amzn.to/2BiW35r&amp;#10;Water Filter http://bit.ly/vanlifewaterfilter&amp;#10;Blinds http://www.vanmadegear.com/&amp;#10;Chaiwala Chai Kit https://chaiwalachai.com/&amp;#10;MAX TRAX https://amzn.to/2XBT8f9&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks for your patience with us as we took a break from van life and from filming.  We can't wait to see all the adventures we will go on together this year!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you enjoyed today's video, you'll love our series from van life in Iceland!&amp;#10;Trading Van Life Canada for Van Life Iceland https://bit.ly/32Fevia&amp;#10;Land of Fire &amp;#38; Ice | Van Life Iceland https://bit.ly/2LxQPaq&amp;#10;Week of Van Life in Iceland | Ring Road Trip https://bit.ly/30MAzWE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want updates in between videos?&amp;#10;&amp;#9644; SHARE WITH US &amp;#9644; &amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Instagram: &amp;#10;https://instagram.com/eh.mon&amp;#10;https://instagram.com/rebeccamoroney&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Who are we?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We're Eamon and Bec, a Toronto-based couple who live full-time in our self converted Sprinter Van!! SUBSCRIBE for wanderlust travel, behind the scenes of what it's really like to live in a van, and videos all about the yummy vegan food we make + eat! VAN LIFE COUPLE. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We post new videos every Sunday :)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our goal here is to inspire you to chase after your own dreams however big (or small... tiny homes anyone?) they may be! We hope to create a community of like-minded, positive individuals who will grow to love and support one another on their own journeys. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #vanlifespain #eamonandbec"
    channeltitle "Eamon &amp;#38; Bec"
