  [
    id 351
    label "p7SylvCMKCE"
    step 0
    date "2019-03-17T13:25:07Z"
    title "Beautiful Destination in Colombia | Van Life SOUTH AMERICA Ep.02"
    description "Sometimes the journey is the destination.&amp;#10;Join us as we navigate the perilous roads through the Andes mountains in order to get to the the famous colonial town of Popay&amp;#225;n (AKA the 'White City') and learn how this town got it's name! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUBSCRIBE to our channel to join the ADVENTURE!&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/MaxLeeandOccy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you enjoy our content and want to help support our video production &amp;#38; get exclusive access to the extended videos -- become one of our PATRONS &amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/MaxandLee&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-OR- &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Send us a one time donation via PayPal&amp;#10;helloleeandmax@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us on Instagram for more day to day travel content  @maxandlee_&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out our website - https://www.maxandleetravel.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHERE DO WE GET OUR MUSIC??&amp;#10;http://share.mscbd.fm/maxandlee &amp;#11013;&amp;#65039;&amp;#10;&amp;#11014;&amp;#65039;Get a free trial of the best music for your videos&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Songs used in this video;&amp;#10;1. Lucky by Sheffield &amp;#10;2. Never Backing Down (instrumental) - Tim Halperin &amp;#10;3. Angels - VANRA &amp;#10;4. Together - Layup &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Who are we?&amp;#10;We are Max &amp;#38; Lee + Occy. We are new to the YouTube world and stoked to be here. We are about living small with the world as our backyard. We love adventure and we want to bring you along with us! Follow us as we continue our travels from Colombia down to Argentina! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;LINKS TO OUR GEAR!&amp;#10;Gazebo - https://amzn.to/2UwwgMz&amp;#10;Dometic fridge - https://amzn.to/2MlbsTi&amp;#10;Maxxair fan - https://amzn.to/2Ko0SdX&amp;#10;Couch/Bed mattress - https://amzn.to/2N2QiuH&amp;#10;Overhead cabinet gas struts - https://amzn.to/2Kob8mm&amp;#10;Solar Panels - https://amzn.to/2Iw66Cr&amp;#10;Inverter - https://amzn.to/2MtmlTt&amp;#10;Our main Vlogging Camera! - https://amzn.to/2Af8QW3&amp;#10;Camera Gimbal - https://amzn.to/2MRxAJd&amp;#10;Renogy 200 Watt 12V Solar Starter Kit - https://amzn.to/2Iw66Cr&amp;#10;6v Deep Cycle Batteries - https://amzn.to/2wnwICB&amp;#10;6 Inch Memory Foam Mattress - https://amzn.to/2N2QiuH&amp;#10;Portable stove - https://amzn.to/2MUJUs4&amp;#10;Aquatainer - https://amzn.to/2PM3nJZ&amp;#10;12v Water Pump - https://amzn.to/2N0lsFM&amp;#10;Solar Shower - https://amzn.to/2N02SNZ&amp;#10;Roof Seal Paint - https://amzn.to/2wuFs9c&amp;#10;Rivet Nut Tool - https://amzn.to/2C3Ebf4&amp;#10;Essential Sprinter On The Road Tool Kit - https://amzn.to/2P9JX0o&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#livelifeoutside #vanlife #southamerica"
