  [
    id 357
    label "8dXTS_-CR_Y"
    step 0
    date "2021-11-07T16:00:06Z"
    title "A FRENCH DISASTER.. tragic story that blew my mind! VAN LIFE in EUROPE, the south of France."
    description "A FRENCH DISASTER.. we never even knew it had happened! VAN LIFE in Europe, the south of France.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out the BenQ GS50 projector here, use code CAMPER15 for 15% off (ends Nov 15th)&amp;#10;For the UK product page: https://benqurl.biz/3EA5Twt&amp;#10;For the US product page:  https://benqurl.biz/39rbjeN&amp;#10;BenQ Projector Calculator: https://projectorcalculator.benq.com/ &amp;#10;&amp;#10;For more info on using Netflix with this projector&amp;#10;GS50 Q&amp;#38;A | BenQ UK&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This week our van life adventures in Europe take us to visit the Malpasset Dam in the south of France. This is a very sad story and we can't believe we'd never heard it!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;To us van life isn't always about great park ups, we want to learn about the culture and the history of the countries we drive our self converted campervan to. We also find a dried out lake, visit St Raphael on the French riviera and find our first hot shower in 4 WEEKS! The reality of van life isn't always glamorous for vanlife couples ya know!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We also visit out first french campsite of this European road trip, and of course, theres a 2 minute tour, it wouldn't be a proper camper vibe travel series without at least one in each country!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hopefully you are enjoying this European travel series as much as we are, and we are managing to show you just some of the stunning landscapes that France has to offer in this French travel vlog. &amp;#10;As usual, we have tried to include a bit of everything, some cinematic scenery mixed with our usual female van life foolery, we always love hearing what you lot think in the comments so do let us know, and as always, thank you for watching!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us on our journey as we attempt to create a proper youtube travel series as we, two female travelers and vanlifers, attempt to travel across Europe in our rolling tiny home.&amp;#10;Hit the subscribe button to see where our DIY campervan takes us next and how this van life couple copes living in a van!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out our instagram for real time updates..&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/camper_vibe/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Have a look at emily's blog for her thoughts on all things van..&amp;#10;http://campervibe.co.uk/&amp;#10;(this is also where you will find all our park ups and list of our film making gear)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For stickers go to the website or..&amp;#10;Make a &amp;#163;5.00 payment to &amp;#10;https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/campervibe&amp;#10;and just leave your name and full address in the notes, just click add note.&amp;#10;If paypal confuses you (as it does me, Lou) then follow the below instructions;&amp;#10;Use your name as the reference then, email &amp;#10;campervibe6@gmail.com &amp;#10;with the same name as your reference of payment and full address.&amp;#10;The stickers will then be shipped out, thanks again for your support :-)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;*We use affiliate links from which we earn a small percentage at no extra cost to yourself. Most of this is used to keep emilys snack cupboard topped up but occasionally she lets Lou have some to buy the dog treats!"
    channeltitle "Camper Vibe"
