    title "Mitsubishi Delica 4x4 Perfect JDM Van Life - Finally Legal Ep.2 - GTChannel"
    description "Subscribe to GTChannel: https://goo.gl/g5wlmE&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Special thanks to Toprank Intl. Vehicle Importers! Check them out at www.importavehicle.com!&amp;#10;Justin reviews the AWD Mitsubishi Delica in the second episode of Finally Legal. The Mitsubishi Delica is a range of vans and pickup trucks designed and built since 1968. ... The passenger car versions were known as Delica Star Wagon from 1979 until the 1994 introduction of the Delica Space Gear.&amp;#10;#delica #mitsubishi #4x4&amp;#10;This is a 1991 Mitsubishi Delica Star Wagon Exceed Turbo D, which is a mid-engined, rear-drive, cab-over van with 4x4 and a proper low range. The engine is a 4-cylinder SOHC turbodiesel (non-intercooled) making 84 HP and 148 lb/ft through a 4-speed automatic transmission. It seats six, with sliding, swiveling captains chairs in the middle. &amp;#10;#vanlife #jdm #mitsubishidelicar&amp;#10;Top Rank Importers to get your JDM car!&amp;#10;https://www.importavehicle.com/&amp;#10;--------------&amp;#13;&amp;#10;If you create car videos, join the GTChannel network here: &amp;#13;&amp;#10;http://creator.gtchannel.com&amp;#13;&amp;#10;&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Like us on FB: http://www.facebook.com/gtchannel&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Send us video ideas on Twitter: https://twitter.com/GTChannel&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Instagram: http://instagram.com/gtchannel/"
