  [
    id 359
    label "r-B8OLv2v98"
    step 0
    date "2020-11-05T15:00:12Z"
    title "VAN TOUR | FORD TRANSIT CONNECT FOR TWO | BUDGET BUILD for FULL-TIME TRAVEL"
    description "Hello, and welcome to our tiny home on the road! Over the span of five weeks, we built out our one-year home, a 2013 Ford Transit Connect for two. We've been living and traveling full-time in this van for over three months, and it's about time we gave you a tour of our budget living space. If you're interested in seeing how much this entire build cost, stay tuned for an upcoming video, covering how we managed to buy, convert, and decorate this van for under $6000 USD. Thank you so much for touring our home, and we hope you tag along on our journey around the States. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;List of items featured in this video.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Phone Holder - https://amzn.to/37fk5Lu&amp;#10;RTIC 45 Cooler - https://amzn.to/36b0njw&amp;#10;Folding Table Brackets - https://amzn.to/38laDZ4 &amp;#10;Dicor Waterproof Putty - https://amzn.to/36iL9ZU &amp;#10;100 Watt Monocrystalline Solar Panel - https://amzn.to/38wSUhB &amp;#10;Max Air Fan DC Power Adapter - https://amzn.to/2JLo5LF &amp;#10;300W Power Inverter - https://amzn.to/3k7wO7o &amp;#10;Rockpal Portable Power Bank - https://amzn.to/32iLryI&amp;#10;Thinsulate - https://amzn.to/38jbZU1 &amp;#10;Reflectix - https://amzn.to/2JLonlJ &amp;#10;Maxxair Fan - https://amzn.to/32hT4oL &amp;#10;Collapsible Cutting Board - https://amzn.to/3pd5AQD &amp;#10;2.5-Gal Water Container - https://amzn.to/36aTpuJ &amp;#10;24 Mini Spice Jars - https://amzn.to/36amczv &amp;#10;8 Inch Mirror - https://amzn.to/3n1otUs &amp;#10;8 Liter Collapsible Water Container - https://amzn.to/2IfiDj7 &amp;#10;5.5 Inch Stainless Steel Funnel - https://amzn.to/32mXpau&amp;#10;Portable Travel Toilet - https://amzn.to/32ncfxz&amp;#10;LED Battery Powered String Lights - https://amzn.to/38iVlE9&amp;#10;Portable 5 gallon shower - https://amzn.to/2TZHTwr&amp;#10;LED Rechargeable Touch Light - https://amzn.to/2U4vA1Z&amp;#10;3 Magnetic Touch Lights - https://amzn.to/3eEaGQT&amp;#10;2 LED Light Bars - https://amzn.to/32kD1Xh&amp;#10;&amp;#10;0:00 Introduction&amp;#10;0:47 Pilots Deck&amp;#10;3:00 Living Room Setup&amp;#10;3:54 Bathroom&amp;#10;5:49 Shower&amp;#10;6:13 Overhead Shelf&amp;#10;6:46 Living Room Explanation&amp;#10;7:18 Cushions &amp;#38; Upholstery&amp;#10;7:48 Our Closets&amp;#10;8:29 Custom Shelf/Table&amp;#10;9:10 Flipout Table&amp;#10;9:36 Kitchen &amp;#38; Spices&amp;#10;10:11 Main Light&amp;#10;10:36 Back Shelf&amp;#10;11:00 Back Patio&amp;#10;12:54 Garage &amp;#38; Extra Storage&amp;#10;13:38 Bed&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VISIT OUR WEBSITE + STORE: www.chadandclaire.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BACKDOOR KITCHEN RECIPES (CLAIRE'S DIGITAL COOKBOOK):&amp;#10;https://chadandclaire.com/shop/p/clairesdigitalcookbook&amp;#10;&amp;#10;170+ USA VAN LIFE PARKING SPOTS (PLUS OUR ENTIRE USA ROUTE): &amp;#10;https://chadandclaire.com/shop/p/1-year-of-parking-spots&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJul...&amp;#10;Follow us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/chadandclaire/&amp;#10;Support us on Patreon: https://www.patreon.com/chadandclaire&amp;#10;Email us for inquiries: contact@chadandclaire.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OUR GEAR&amp;#10;Main Camera - https://amzn.to/2JW0mZF &amp;#10;Wide Lens - https://amzn.to/3hRMnAB &amp;#10;Zoom Lens - https://amzn.to/35kYhh7&amp;#10;Tripod - https://amzn.to/38ubGFX &amp;#10;Microphone - https://amzn.to/36qTuLn &amp;#10;Drone - https://amzn.to/3bg0XAB &amp;#10;Waterproof Camera - https://amzn.to/35hUnWf&amp;#10;15:31 Curtain&amp;#10;15:58 Lighting&amp;#10;16:38 Insulation &amp;#38; Ceiling&amp;#10;17:19 Decorations&amp;#10;17:50 Roof Fan&amp;#10;18:20 Power Bank&amp;#10;18:55 Outro&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe to our YouTube channel: https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCJul...&amp;#10;Follow Claire on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/clairechangtetz/&amp;#10;Follow Chad on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/chad_tetz/&amp;#10;Email us for inquiries: clairechang20@gmail.com // chadtetz@gmail.com"
