  [
    id 363
    label "qhAVB1g7vxU"
    step 0
    date "2020-08-23T13:22:25Z"
    title "FIRST WEEK OF FULL TIME VAN LIFE | Free Camping  Off- Grid Living"
    description "FIRST WEEK OF FULL TIME VAN LIFE | Free Camping &amp;#38; Off Grid Living Canada&amp;#10;&amp;#10;It&amp;#8217;s official it&amp;#8217;s our first week of full time van life. Getting back on the road finding free camping and living off grid has never felt better. For the last six months we have been living a stationary van life, traveling locally in our van and returning to our home base due to the pandemic. We are now traveling further, it&amp;#8217;s our first week back to full time van life. We&amp;#8217;re finding more off grid camps and seeing more of our home &amp;#38; native land of Canada. In this van life vlog we take our family Crown Land camping to be off grid and spend some quality time together before we depart. We then road trip North where we meet other van life friends (&amp;#38; legends -Lee, King Occy,  @Eamon &amp;#38; Bec ) and enjoy some free off grid camping on the beautiful Manitoulin Island. It&amp;#8217;s a great first week back to full time van life!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Click here to SUBSCRIBE &amp;#38; join our PACK &amp;#38; Van Life community! &amp;#10;https://tinyurl.com/y9fxsuyd&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Leemacmil&amp;#10;https://instagram.com/leemacmil?igshid=1vm4cjo9byxaz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Eamon &amp;#38; Becs Channel! &amp;#10;https://m.youtube.com/channel/UC4laAHbk8VSgmvB47tsd2XQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Have you been watching &amp;#38; enjoying our content? Send us a one time payment to help us keep creating stories on the road.&amp;#10;PayPal &amp;#10;jazandcrystal@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Journey! How did we get here?&amp;#10;We started living in our van full time in winter of February 2019. We drove across Canada spent 8 months on Vancouver Island working, living and traveling in our van. We then started our dream of overlanding Canada to Argentina. We fell in love with full time travel and van life as we carried on through Canada, USA, Mexico, &amp;#38; Guatemala. However, we couldn't keep going due to the travel limitations. Now on the horizon we are going to be driving across Canada (safely)! We cannot wait to show you our beautiful country! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;NEW VIDEO EVERY SUNDAY 9:30 EST &amp;#127774; &amp;#10;Make sure you join us as we continue to create van life vlogs of our alternative life style. We hope you've enjoyed our previous travel vlogs &amp;#38; continue to come along on this cross Canada road trip! &amp;#10;If you enjoy our content please share our channel with your mates on social media or even over coffee! It truly makes a huge difference for our channel &amp;#38; community. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us here! To know what goes on in between videos.&amp;#10;INSTAGRAM! @vanwives &amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/vanwives/?h...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For the RAW and UNFILTERED content follow our personal Instagrams!&amp;#10;Jaz https://www.instagram.com/jazzyjoyy/?...&amp;#10;Crystal  https://www.instagram.com/crysdd/?hl=en&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WATCH OUR MORE RECENT ADVENTURES:&amp;#10;Leaving The Van For This&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=b0t3W9W1fSs&amp;#38;t=36s&amp;#10;Nothing Ever Goes As Planned... &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ni9n0FZPryw&amp;#38;t=28s&amp;#10;SLEEPING OUTSIDE UNDER THE STARS&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dkz7MB2ZJbA&amp;#38;t=666s&amp;#10;WE FOUND A SECRET LAKE | Off- Grid &amp;#38; Alone In The Wilderness &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Sy8688_67V4&amp;#38;t=3s&amp;#10;WE FAILED.. But Kept Trying | Finding Off Grid Camping To Be Alone In The Wilderness https://youtu.be/WY51qzn2MUg&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WATCH THIS! &amp;#10;HOW DID WE GET HOME? We Drove 5300 KM in a WEEK&amp;#10;We're Just Trying to Get Home | A Week of Van Life During Pandemic: https://tinyurl.com/ybcsabg8&amp;#10;Stuck In Guatemala During Pandemic: https://tinyurl.com/ycv4lc88&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We get our music? From the one and only music bed &amp;#10;https://www.musicbed.com   &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Who we are? &amp;#10;We are the VANWIVES a Van Life Couple (Jazmyn and Crystal) and the other two members of our pack are our beautiful Australian Shepherd Van dogs Bella &amp;#38; Izzy. We are a lesbian couple from Canada who self converted a 2006 Sprinter Van to an off-grid home on wheels. We have been living in a van since February 2019 and love everything about VAN LIFE! We are so happy to be creating vlogs to bring you along for the road trip &amp;#38; show you what van life is really like... Don't forget to SUBSCRIBE and join us on weekly adventures. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks to everyone special who has encouraged us to start this epic adventure channel! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;This is an LGBTQ+ safe place! We are always here to chat&amp;#10;&amp;#10;See you on the Open Road! &amp;#10;Ciao&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Inquiries&amp;#10;jazandcrystal@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #fulltimevanlife #freecamping"
    channeltitle "Vanwives"
    channelid "UCtf6aq_atnqF6shEam6m1sQ"
