  [
    id 364
    label "NFx3c5_KVMA"
    step 0
    date "2022-02-27T23:33:23Z"
    title "VAN TOUR | Full-Time VAN LIFE Couple | JACKERY Powered | 170WB Sprinter Van"
    description "We are Lloyd, Alix, and Chip the Van! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We spent 9 months converting Chip and have now been living Vanlife full-time for 9 months, so we figured it was about time we give you a tour of our home on wheels! Chip is a 2015 Freightliner Sprinter Van 2500 with a 170WB.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We repurposed many materials to make Chip feel like home. He get energy from 300 WATTS of SOLAR  and is powered by our JACKERY 1500 and 500 portable power stations! We used HAVELOCK WOOL to insulate our build since we are from Minnesota and knew we needed the best insulation. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;The dinette layout fits our lifestyle perfectly and we love having a large bed (it is sized between a king and a queen). Lots of storage and organization was important to us, so we show you many of the ways we keep our small space clean. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;BUILD SERIES: https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLEr-yZ9RlTCGGCPf9cOe4av3_68mCOnEX&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We filmed our entire building process, so please click the link above to see the playlist. If you have any other questions about our build please leave them in the comments below! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;ETSY: https://www.etsy.com/shop/GoodsByAlix?ref=profile_header &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Even though Alix does not have anything posted on her shop yet, she is working diligently to get products up very soon!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;LLOYDFISHERPHOTO: https://lloydfisherphoto.pic-time.com/art&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Lloyd is also a professional photographer. If you are interested in seeing his work, please check out his website! Prints are available for purchase through this site. You can also see more of his work through Instagram @lloydfisherphoto.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please LIKE and SUBSCRIBE to keep up with our travels! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us on Instagram: &amp;#10;@chip.the.van&amp;#10;@lloydfisherphoto &amp;#10;@alix.brezinka &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us on TikTok: &amp;#10;@chip.the.van&amp;#10;&amp;#10;THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR THE SUPPORT!"
    channeltitle "Lloyd Fisher"
    channelid "UCclyj8wCRNwUJ54piZUYIYg"
