  [
    id 367
    label "ZRLApd58OfU"
    step 0
    date "2021-01-28T13:05:08Z"
    title "VAN LIFE | Family of FOUR | Sprinter Van Conversion | Bunk Beds"
    description "A family of four, the Tompkins family is headed out on the road in a customized van with bunk beds built by @RambleAndRevive !&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Yes, we have a shower. And yes we have a toilet! Watch more for the details!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are powered by The Jackery Explorer 1000:&amp;#10;https://www.jackery.com/products/jackery-explorer-1000-2-x-solarsaga-100w-solar-generator&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow along here:&amp;#10;http://instagram.com/kaylatompkins87&amp;#10;http://instagram.com/mike_tompkins&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Sweaters Here: http://tompkins.life/store&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music from &amp;#34;Then and Now&amp;#34; album by Mike Tompkins: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kNOFvzwWtGg&amp;#38;list=OLAK5uy_lxiWSoMbZ5hojCojeO8vz2bmwoqHYXA_M&amp;#10;&amp;#10;TAGS:  &amp;#10;Mike Tompkins,Tompkins,van life,van life with kids,van tour,van tour with kids,van life tour,sprinter van conversion,sprinter van camper,family vanlife,family camper van,van conversion,van build,van life build,diy sprinter van,van conversion ideas,vanlife shower,how to shower living in a van,van life toilet,bunk beds,off grid,minimalist,Mercedes sprinter,campervan,lifestyle,traveling,tiny house,tiny house tour,tiny home build,tiny homes,how to, how to live in a van with kids, HOW I SHOWER LIVING IN A VAN, VAN LIFE | A Day in The Life | MEXICO, van, van life, simple, simple life, tiny house, minimalism, max and lee, australian shepherd, ecuador, south America, overland, vlog, travel vlog, travel, explore, discover, mompiche, canoa, ayampe, beach, coast, surf, day in the life, vlogging, dolan twins road trip, ethan, grayson, tiny home, tiny home on wheels, country, america,USA, van life, living in a van, live in van, traveling van, traveling cross country, cross country, van conversion timelapse, vanlife, van tour, diy van, diy campervan, conversion, timelapse, sprinter van conversion, sprinter van, tiny house, tiny house on wheels, tiny home, travel, road trip, diy, construction, camping car, living in a van, ford transit van, ford transit van conversion, camper, how to build a van,how to build a camper,stealth campervan,low budget diy van, vanlifediaries, ford transit, van tour,van life,sprinter van, sprinter van conversion, van conversion, van life tour, sprinter conversion, van tour with bathroom, van build, 40 hours of freedom, family van, family van life, family van conversion, van life with kids, van life shower, sara and alex, sara and alex james, 4x4 sprinter van, van conversion with bathroom, tiny home, 4x4 sprinter van tour, 4x4 sprinter van conversion, van life build, 4x4 van, van bathroom, family van tour, familia diamond, txunamy, jennelle eliana, why do i live in a van?, how i shower living in a van, vanlife, living in a van, tiny home, vanlife shower, alternative living, tiny house on wheels, road trip,adventure, solo travel, tiny house,travel vlogger, vanlifer, off grid, van dwelling, van life: living in a van with a family of 6, family friendly"
    channeltitle "Mike Tompkins"
    channelid "UCYEnCCeFBCbrlmuNVzs21LQ"
