  [
    id 369
    label "2Bk8kXARJfM"
    step 0
    date "2022-04-18T12:30:00Z"
    title "A Rock Climbers Dream | Van Life in Moab, Utah + Arches National Park"
    description "After months of planning and building, our 1997 Dodge Ram van is finally ready for us to live in full-time! Our first stop, Moab, UT! With endless rock climbing, BLM land as far as the eye can see, and Arches National Park close by, Moab was the perfect place to start our trip! We have no plans on when we&amp;#8217;ll return home so follow along with us as we try to figure out how to live on the road while getting into whatever outdoor activity we can find! Enjoy:)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks to EcoFlow for sponsoring this video! &amp;#10;Visit EcoFlow&amp;#8217;s site at https://bit.ly/3xwpDQj to check out the Delta Max power station!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Like the colors? New S-Log3 LUTs available now! &amp;#10;&amp;#9658;https://codyblue.sellfy.store/p/slog3-luts/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Check Out Our Photo/Video Presets: &amp;#10;https://qaya.store/cody-and-victoria&amp;#10;Non US Viewers: https://codyblue.sellfy.store/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; ALL OF OUR GEAR - Cameras + Outdoor + Van &amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/codyblue&amp;#10;B&amp;#38;H: http://bit.ly/codyblue&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9835;&amp;#9835; The Best Music for YouTubers &amp;#38; Filmmakers  &amp;#9835;&amp;#9835; &amp;#10;Use code &amp;#34;CODYANDVICTORIA22&amp;#34; to get your first month free when you purchase an annual subscription.&amp;#10;http://share.mscbd.fm/codyblue&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Sound Effects&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/codysfx&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-----------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;== Follow Us ==&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/codyblue_&amp;#10;https://twitter.com/codyblue_&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/victoriaablue_&amp;#10;&amp;#10;== Website ==&amp;#10;http://www.codyjohnblue.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BUSINESS inquires ONLY email me at: partnerships@codyjohnblue.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Some of the links in this description may be affiliate links that allow me to earn a small commission (at no extra cost to you!) and keep this channel going. Thanks for your support!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Footage available for licensing: email -  licensing@codyjohnblue.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #EcoFlow #PortablePowerStations"
