    title "AND SO IT BEGINS... | Van Life Adventures  | Episode 1"
    description "And so it begins... We're off on our little van life adventure! Join us for episode 1 where we pack out bags, leave home and go on our first adventure with Flo, out little van. We're going to be living full time in our van from now on so this is a super exciting time for us. &amp;#128512;&amp;#128652;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127775; If you'd like to support us on Patreon and get insider info, discounts great offers and exciting updates here's the link! - https://patreon.com/livingthelifeyoulove &amp;#127775;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9480; &amp;#10023;&amp;#9789;&amp;#9788;&amp;#9790;&amp;#10023; &amp;#9480;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you have taken the time to watch our video then thank you so much. If you have any video suggestions please leave them below! &amp;#128512;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check Out Our Handmade Crystal Jewellery - https://www.etsy.com/uk/shop/luanacreationsbykay&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Find Us On Instagram &amp;#10;&amp;#10023;kayanddomdolife - https://www.instagram.com/kayanddomdolife/&amp;#10;&amp;#10023;domdoeslife - https://www.instagram.com/domdoeslife/&amp;#10;&amp;#10023;livingthelifeyoulove - https://www.instagram.com/livingthelifeyoulove/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Artist: &amp;#10;Song:"
