    id 374
    label "jbhh41ud1vw"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-01T16:00:32Z"
    title "12 Hour Overnight Ferry (taking our van to Tasmania)"
    description "Head to https://www.squarespace.com/flyingthenest - Our goal was to take our van to every state in Australia...and one just happens to me a overnight ferry away...12 hours later welcome to Tasmania everybody :)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out Raising Voyagers Video from the trip: https://youtu.be/DGuXH0a8zNE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #overnightferry #cruise&amp;#10;----------------------------------------&amp;#173;&amp;#173;--&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Flying the Nest:&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Follow our Journey &amp;#8594; https://linktr.ee/flyingthenest&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Shop our Presets &amp;#8594; https://linktr.ee/flyingthenestshop&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Learn to edit videos for YouTube &amp;#8594; https://bit.ly/ftnacademyvideo&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Learn to grow your Instagram &amp;#8594; https://bit.ly/FTNacademyinstagram&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Sign up for our Weekly Coop Update email: https://bit.ly/2Xj573c &amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Our current camera + gear setup &amp;#8594; http://bit.ly/currentgear&amp;#10;&amp;#10;----------------------------------------&amp;#173;&amp;#173;--&amp;#10;0:00 Intro: Who is Flying the Nest? (Stephen, Jess and Hunter) - Full time traveling Van Life family&amp;#10;0:31 Whats happening this episode (taking our van to Tasmania)&amp;#10;0:39 Why we are taking our van to Tasmania on a ferry&amp;#10;0:51 Boarding Spirit of Tasmania with a Van from Melbourne port&amp;#10;1:58 Spirit of Tasmania 4 bunk inside cabin room &amp;#10;2:23 Spirit of Tasmania full ship tour&amp;#10;3:05 Dinner at Tasmania market&amp;#10;3:25 Spirit of Tasmania 4 bunk inside cabin room tour&amp;#10;5:01 5am wake up Spirit of Tasmania in Davenport&amp;#10;5:35 Disembarking Spirit of Tasmania Davenport&amp;#10;6:13 Who are we traveling Tasmania with?&amp;#10;6:21 Meet Raising Voyagers&amp;#10;6:34 Driving to Cradle Mountain&amp;#10;6:47 Cradle Mountain campsite Discovery Parks&amp;#10;7:20 Van Life Cooking Sushi&amp;#10;8:17 Easter Celebrations&amp;#10;10:05 Thanks to Squarespace&amp;#10;10:46 Exploring Cradle Mountain Resort&amp;#10;11:21 Enchanted Walk Cradle Mountain&amp;#10;12:05 Dove Lake Walk&amp;#10;13:21 Easter Celebrations Continue&amp;#10;15:43 Tasmania Road trip in a van&amp;#10;16:00 Wine Glass Bay Cruise&amp;#10;17:14 Swansea Beach Chalets&amp;#10;&amp;#10;----------------------------------------&amp;#173;&amp;#173;--&amp;#10;All Spots we stayed at&amp;#10;-- Spirit of Tasmania&amp;#10;-- Discovery Parks Cradle Mountain&amp;#10;-- Swansea Beach Chalets: https://www.swanseachalets.com.au/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHERE YOU CAN FIND US:&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Instagram &amp;#8594; https://linktr.ee/ftnInstagram&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Flying the Nesters Travel Community Group &amp;#8594; https://linktr.ee/FTNFacebook&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Twitter &amp;#8594; https://linktr.ee/ftntwitter&amp;#10;&amp;#8594;  Our Blog &amp;#8594;  https://linktr.ee/flyingthenestblog&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Listen to our Podcast &amp;#8594; https://linktr.ee/storiesflyingthenest&amp;#10;----------------------------------------&amp;#173;&amp;#173;-&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Where we get our music from &amp;#8594; http://share.mscbd.fm/flyingthenest&amp;#10;&amp;#10;----------------------------------------&amp;#173;&amp;#173;--&amp;#10;Hi, we are Stephen, Jess and little Hunter, a traveling van life family who self-converted their dream house on wheels - we now live full-time in our Sprinter van called Cooper as we do a full lap of our home Australia. Inspired by our friends van life journeys Kara and Nate, Eamon and Bec and Kinging it."
