    id 375
    label "-jFB0r4bNYM"
    step 0
    date "2019-11-13T00:25:30Z"
    title "A Normal Day of Van Life as a Solo Female Traveler with a Dog"
    description "Hello! My name is Kelley (aka &amp;#34;Vava&amp;#34;) and I live in a van full-time with my dog, &amp;#34;Moop&amp;#34;. We have been living in the van full-time for 5 months now and traveling around the US and Canada. This video shows what a typical day of living in a van on the road is like, nothing glamorous or crazy, just me and my dog out in the world living our lives. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Instagram: @vava_vans&amp;#10;Facebook: Kelley Gildea&amp;#10;TikTok: vava_vans"
