  [
    id 377
    label "xbcgGuBarYQ"
    step 0
    date "2021-12-26T12:44:14Z"
    title "Starting Winter Van Life | Freezing Pipes "
    description "We've spent over two years, living &amp;#38; traveling in our tiny van, Jits! We've experienced the warm summers of Portugal &amp;#38; Spain, and we've been exposed to moments of cold, in Switzerland &amp;#38; Scotland. But until now, we haven't fully embraced winter in a van. This is the first film of our winter van life series and we explore the often overlooked destination of the Czech Republic, and soon discover it has a lot more to cover beyond Prague. Whether you're a long-time subscriber or new to our travel community, we're excited to have you join us! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Lots of love, Tania &amp;#38; Adam! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you enjoy this video, &amp;#10;&amp;#128077;&amp;#127996; &amp;#120295;&amp;#120283;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120288;&amp;#120277;&amp;#120294; &amp;#120296;&amp;#120291;, &amp;#120278;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120288;&amp;#120288;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120289;&amp;#120295; &amp;#38; &amp;#120294;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120277;&amp;#120294;&amp;#120278;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120277;&amp;#120280; if you enjoy our films. It helps hugely in getting YouTube to take notice of us so that it recommends our films to others.&amp;#10;&amp;#128075;&amp;#127996; &amp;#120284;&amp;#120289;&amp;#120294;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120282;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120288;: Come say hi, we love hearing from you (tag us)!: https://bit.ly/3lbSsrv&amp;#10;&amp;#127803; &amp;#120281;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120278;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120277;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120286;: Join our community (we also have a private over 50s group!): https://bit.ly/3mafxfw&amp;#10;&amp;#128155; SUPPORT us by joining our &amp;#120291;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120289; community where we share exclusive videos e.g. unseen footage and Q&amp;#38;As: https://www.patreon.com/jitsintothesunset&amp;#10;&amp;#10; - - -  &amp;#120297;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120279;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120290; &amp;#120278;&amp;#120283;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120291;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120294; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;00:00 Intro - About Us&amp;#10;00:46 Starting our Winter van life adventure&amp;#10;01:38 Let's go to Prague&amp;#10;03:25 The Spa Region&amp;#10;05:25 Royal Bath Spa Experience &amp;#10;07:00 Frozen Pipes in the Van &amp;#10;08:07 The picturesque town of Mari&amp;#225;nsk&amp;#233; L&amp;#225;zn&amp;#283; &amp;#10;09:38 History &amp;#38; Culture of the Czech Republic &amp;#10;09:53 Glass Blowing in the Crystal Valley - Making our own Pint glass&amp;#10;13:10 Leaving for our snowy Hike in the Kru&amp;#353;n&amp;#233; mountains&amp;#10;14:00 The best of Bohemia - Snow Wonderland Hike&amp;#10;16:38 Reaching Pajndl Lookout Tower&amp;#10;18:15 Tea in Jits with our friends&amp;#10;18:58 Visiting  Purkmistr Beer Bath in Plzen&amp;#10;21:29 Visiting the world-famous Pilsner Urquell Brewery - Beer from the Barrel&amp;#10;22:42 Roasted Chestnuts &amp;#38; Mulled Wine in our campervan&amp;#10;25:35 Thank you to our Subscribers &amp;#38; our Patreons &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- - - -  &amp;#120294;&amp;#120291;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120278;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120287; &amp;#120288;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120289;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120289;&amp;#120294; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;&amp;#10140; A big thank you Marc &amp;#38; Tanja from https://www.bestofbohemia.cz/ for taking the time to show us around Mari&amp;#225;nsk&amp;#233; L&amp;#225;zn&amp;#283; as well as our snowy winter wonderful hike in the Kru&amp;#353;n&amp;#233; mountains. We wish you the very best with your family-run Hiking Tours and hope that our community chose to have you lead them of their next Czech Republic Adventures. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10140; Thank you to Hotel Nov&amp;#233; L&amp;#225;zn&amp;#283; for hosting us and giving us a Royal Spa experience! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10140;  Thank you to Purkmistr Beer Spa for treating us to our beer bath experience &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10140; Thank you to Pilsner Urquell Brewery for inviting us to tour their world-famous Brewery &amp;#38; to sample beer straight from the barrel! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10140; And finally, to the Tourism Board at Visit Czech Republic, for going above &amp;#38; beyond in helping us plan our itinerary. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10; - - - - &amp;#120298;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120278;&amp;#120283; &amp;#120290;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120293; &amp;#120295;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120297;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120287; &amp;#120281;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120287;&amp;#120288;&amp;#120294; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;&amp;#128250; From Ireland to France to Iceland and everywhere in between! Watch our 14 travel films in Chronological Order: https://bit.ly/2USoi1I&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- - - - &amp;#120276; &amp;#120277;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120295; &amp;#120276;&amp;#120277;&amp;#120290;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120295; &amp;#120296;&amp;#120294; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;We are Tania &amp;#38; Adam and in Sep 2019, we left our busy lives in London to travel Europe in our 21-year-old campervan named Jitters aka Jits &amp;#128656; &amp;#128149; Living in a van &amp;#38; capturing our adventures through film &amp;#38; photography is our biggest creative endeavor yet. More than anything, we feel fortunate that in doing so, we have grown a wonderful &amp;#38; supportive travel-loving community. THANK YOU! More about us here: https://www.jitsintothesunset.com/about-us&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- - - - &amp;#120295;&amp;#120283;&amp;#120280; &amp;#120288;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120294;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120278; &amp;#120298;&amp;#120280; &amp;#120281;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120295;&amp;#120296;&amp;#120293;&amp;#120280; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;We use these two main music libraries - we love &amp;#38; recommend them both:&amp;#10;&amp;#10140;  ARTLIST: Get 2 months free off your annual membership when you use our referral link: https://bit.ly/2Uq3xOr&amp;#10;&amp;#10140; EPIDEMIC SOUND: Get a 30 Day Free Trial when you use our referral link: &amp;#10;https://bit.ly/3xS8o9I&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- - - - &amp;#120279;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120294;&amp;#120278;&amp;#120287;&amp;#120276;&amp;#120284;&amp;#120288;&amp;#120280;&amp;#120293; &amp;#10024;&amp;#10;Where we could, we included our affiliate links, so that we may receive a very small commission, at no cost to you. It's a great way you can support our films for free. THANK YOU!"
    channeltitle "Jits into the Sunset"
