  [
    id 378
    label "Jw0BOSWc0ec"
    step 0
    date "2021-03-07T16:00:06Z"
    title "WATCH THIS BEFORE STARTING VANLIFE!! (what we loved and hated) van life UK."
    description "WATCH THIS BEFORE STARTING VANLIFE!!  (what we loved and hated) van life UK. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;VANLIFE.. what we LOVED and what we HATED! Future vanlife plans have changed.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;So after spending almost a year building out a panel van into tiny little home on wheels, and after a good few months travelling around Europe in that same self converted campervan, we make some decisions about our future van life plans.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;A lot has changed since we started this journey, travel is more restricted, in fact non existent at the moment and, being realistic, travel in 2021 is looking difficult to say the least! Couple that with how we feel about living in a van in the UK, you know, with the miserable weather, we take a serious look at whether full time vanlife is a realistic option for us right now.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this video we discuss some of the things we love, and some of the things we hate about vanlife. Believe it or not, living in a van isn't always 27/7 epic adventure. We hope this information may be useful to people considering a similar journey and a similar lifestyle change or path into alternative living.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;One thing we do know though is that whilst fulltime vanlife UK may not be for us, full time travel definitely is!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us on our journey as we attempt to create a proper youtube travel series as we travel across Europe during this global pandemic.&amp;#10;Hit the subscribe button to see where our little tiny home on wheels takes us next and how we cope living in a van!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out our instagram for real time updates..&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/camper_vibe/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Have a look at emily's blog for her thoughts on all things van..&amp;#10;http://campervibe.co.uk/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For stickers..&amp;#10;Make a &amp;#163;5.00 payment to &amp;#10;https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/campervibe&amp;#10;and just leave your name and full address in the notes, just click add note.&amp;#10;If paypal confuses you (as it does me, Lou) then follow the below instructions;&amp;#10;Use your name as the reference then, email &amp;#10;campervibe6@gmail.com &amp;#10;with the same name as your reference of payment and full address.&amp;#10;The stickers will then be shipped out, thanks again for your support :-)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;*We use affiliate links from which we earn a small percentage at no extra cost to yourself. Most of this is used to keep emilys snack cupboard topped up but occasionally she lets Lou have some to buy the dog treats!"
    channeltitle "Camper Vibe"
    channelid "UC_7ZmNi09nP5UciW62-8BUw"
