    date "2020-07-10T20:59:08Z"
    title "Solo Female Van Life At 23 - DIY Campervan Built During Quarantine"
    description "Subscribe For More Videos : https://www.youtube.com/user/tylerdurdeno9/&amp;#10;Subscribe For Weekly Sneak Peeks : https://bit.ly/TinyHomeToursNewsletter&amp;#10;Subscribe For Life On The Road Videos : http://bit.ly/OffGridSkoolieSubscribe&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VIDEO DESCRIPTION:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Sarah is living the dream in her newly converted van. She has been traveling for quite a while in her small car and in tents, but while quarantined during Covid-19, she decided to convert a Nissan NV1500 into her new home for her and her cat, Peaches in less than a month. With a limited budget and limited shopping options, Sarah was able to get resourceful and use materials from her dad's barn for her van build. Her family, while they joked with her about her lifestyle, saw her excitement, and joined in on the process. They created an adorable little home for Sarah and Peaches. Feeling inspired but need some advice? Here's what Sarah has to say, &amp;#34;If you are thinking van life, just do it! It doesn't have to be perfect, just start!&amp;#34; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/moon_the_van/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;______________________________BONUS CONTENT_____________________________________&amp;#10;Nature's Head Toilet With Bonuses - http://bit.ly/NaturesHeadTHT&amp;#10;Tiny House &amp;#38; Skoolie Build Gear - https://skooliecentral.com/gear/&amp;#10;Tiny Home Tours Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/Tinyhome.tours/&amp;#10;Tiny Home Tours Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/tinyhometours/&amp;#10;Life On The Road Newsletter - http://eepurl.com/gAyDP5&amp;#10;Want To See More Skoolie Videos? - https://skooliecentral.com/&amp;#10;Need Something On Amazon? Shop With This Link - http://amzn.to/1R7HfqE"
