  [
    id 381
    label "igfKxSD4htI"
    step 0
    date "2022-03-17T16:00:22Z"
    title "The Long, Weird Trip of the Volkswagen Bus | Up To Speed"
    description "Thank you to Gran Turismo 7 for sponsoring today's episode! Gran Turismo 7, Rated E for Everyone, is out now for Playstation 4 and Playstation 5. The game is the latest installment in a franchise that many people consider the absolute pinnacle of automotive video games, and &amp;#8211; no surprise&amp;#8211; it&amp;#8217;s been getting rave reviews from the press and fans alike. Get your copy and start playing today: http://bit.ly/3qe9Lxz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For seven decades, the Volkswagen Bus&amp;#8211;or the Kombi, the Transporter, the Caravel, the Hippie Van, the Vanago, or the Type 2, if you prefer&amp;#8211;has been a global icon on the roads. But the staying power of this hardworking, underpowered cab-over that bursts at the seams with personality wasn&amp;#8217;t a sure thing. After it became a phenomenon, a conspiracy between an American president and a powerful labor union (yes, the States used to have those) nearly stopped the Bus in its tracks, and it all came down to chickens. From its humble origins as a back-of-the-napkin design exercise, to its upcoming all-electric rebirth, this is everything you need to know to get up to speed on the Volkswagen Bus!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Wanna show your love for the joy of cars? Peep this awesome Donut tee: https://donut.media/collections/joy-of-cars&amp;#10; &amp;#10;Edited by Griffin Wenzler. Check out ILikeToCuss.com for his comedy.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;HERE IN MY GARAGE&amp;#8230;&amp;#10;Curious what we use in the shop on a daily basis? Check it out below. And if you purchase these tools from these links, you&amp;#8217;re helping support Donut. We appreciate it!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Milwaukee Electric Tools 2550-20 M12 Rivet Tool (Bare Tool) https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B07C67BGVJ?tag=brooklinexdnm-20&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Milwaukee - 48-22-0125G - 25 ft. Magnetic Tape Measure - 2-Pack &amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B081MCBN67?tag=brooklinexdnm-20 &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Milwaukee 48-59-1880 M18 REDLITHIUM HIGH OUTPUT XC 8 Ah Lithium-Ion Battery and M18 /M12 Charger Kit&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B07V2P6LFP?tag=brooklinexdnm-20&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Milwaukee Angle Grinding 2781-22 M18 Fuel 4-1/2&amp;#34;/5&amp;#34; Slide, Kit&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B00FNDMYIK/ref=ppx_yo_dt_b_search_asin_title?tag=brooklinexdnm-20&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Milwaukee 2735-20 18V Li-Ion Flashlight&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/Milwaukee-2735-20-Flashlight-48-11-1815-Battery/dp/B075FXH9KW?tag=brooklinexdnm-20&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Milwaukee 2557-20 M12 Fuel 3/8&amp;#34; Ratchet&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B07779CDGX/ref=ppx_yo_dt_b_search_asin_title?tag=brooklinexdnm-20&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Milwaukee 48-11-1880 M18 REDLITHIUM HIGH OUTPUT 18v 8.0 Ah Lithium-Ion Battery Pack&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B07S2WNS3H/ref=ppx_yo_dt_b_search_asin_title?tag=brooklinexdnm-20&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Milwaukee 2125-21XC M12 LED Underhood Light Kit&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B071D6B8FL/ref=ppx_yo_dt_b_search_asin_title?tag=brooklinexdnm-20&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Milwaukee M18 FUEL 3/8&amp;#34; Compact Impact Wrench with Friction Ring&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/Milwaukee-Compact-Impact-Wrench-Friction/dp/B08P3SRT5P?tag=brooklinexdnm-20&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Adenna Dark Light 9 mil Nitrile Powder Free Exam Gloves (Black), Large - Box of 100 (DLG676)&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/Adenna-Light-Nitrile-Powder-Gloves/dp/B00QRELG06?tag=brooklinexdnm-20&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Scott Shop Towels Original (75143), Blue, 55 Sheets / Standard Roll, 30 Rolls / Case (10 Bundles of 3 Rolls), 1,650 Towels / Case&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/Scott-Original-75143-Standard-Bundles/dp/B01MXPSWUT?tag=brooklinexdnm-20&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Zep Cherry Bomb Industrial Pumice Hand Cleaner - 48 Ounce (Case of 4) ZUCBHC48CA&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/Zep-Cherry-Cleaner-Ounce-ZUCBHC48CA/dp/B07FVXFFCD?pd_rd_w=1QnJz&amp;#38;pf_rd_p=2db006dc-2a90-4f80-818a-95125a31dd13&amp;#38;pf_rd_r=SMB7XG5CRPR3D88M6PYW&amp;#38;pd_rd_r=985687ee-12e7-401b-81eb-8d51ed53bd85&amp;#38;pd_rd_wg=J25v9&amp;#38;pd_rd_i=B07FVXFFCD&amp;#38;psc=1&amp;#38;ref_=pd_bap_d_rp_10_i&amp;#10;&amp;#10;AIDEA Microfiber Cleaning Cloths-100PK&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/AIDEA-Microfiber-Absorbent-Lint-Free-12in-x12in/dp/B08CKJYXMK?tag=brooklinexdnm-20&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Barrow 52 in. Brown Large Rectangle Wood Coffee Table with Lift Top&amp;#10;https://homedepot.sjv.io/c/2095194/456723/8154?subId1=TD-SL&amp;#38;sharedId=donut&amp;#38;u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.homedepot.com%2Fp%2FBarrow-52-in-Brown-Large-Rectangle-Wood-Coffee-Table-with-Lift-Top-BW200CAS%2F305311400%3FcurationId%3D1058%3FMERCH&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Barrow 52 in. Brown Large Rectangle Wood Coffee Table with Lift Top&amp;#10;https://homedepot.sjv.io/c/2095194/456723/8154?subId1=TD-SL&amp;#38;sharedId=donut&amp;#38;u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.homedepot.com%2Fp%2FBarrow-52-in-Brown-Large-Rectangle-Wood-Coffee-Table-with-Lift-Top-BW200CAS%2F305311400%3FcurationId%3D1058%3FMERCH&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;New to the Channel? &amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Watch this: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLFl907chpCa42gkh1oJxuJBN0cZ4YT1HT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We upload almost every day, subscribe so you don't miss out!&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;Subscribe here: http://bit.ly/1JQ3qvO&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Click here for more info on joining the Donut Underground!&amp;#10;&amp;#9658;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCL6JmiMXKoXS6bpP1D3bk8g/join&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Shop Donut Merch: &amp;#10;&amp;#9658;http://www.donut.media/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Donut Media is at the center of digital media for the next generation of automotive and motorsports enthusiasts. We are drivers, drifters, and car enthusiasts who love to tell stories."
    channeltitle "Donut Media"
    channelid "UCL6JmiMXKoXS6bpP1D3bk8g"
