    title "Rooftop views on the beach | Van Life #shorts"
    description "Are you interested in owning a converted off-grid tiny home on wheels? Email us at support@movingoasis.com so we can get that started for you! We also RENT vans out for vacation and short trips! Check out our website for rental availability dates at movingoasis.com or DM us on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/movingoasisvans/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Who are we? &amp;#10;Moving Oasis is a women-owned, Florida-based van conversion company, founded by Nathalie Canate and Lillie Mysel. We build out vans for tiny homes and businesses and are available to any clients wherever they are located.&amp;#160;We&amp;#8217;re a couple of queers with big hearts and big dreams! Nathalie received her Master's in Architecture at UC Berkeley, in addition to a minor in sustainability. Lillie, a fellow environmentalist, is obtaining her Master&amp;#8217;s in Social Work at Florida State University.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW US!&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/movingoasisvans/&amp;#10;TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@movingoasisvans&amp;#10;Website: http://movingoasis.com&amp;#10;Email: support@movingoasis.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanbuild #vanlife #campervanconversion"
