    description "BUSTED BY THE FOREST RANGER // #vanlife Caravan in Sawtooth National Forest (VAN LIFE VLOG)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;4th of July weekend got a little crazy in Sawtooth National Forest! Join us this week for alpine lakes, caravan cookouts, and a run in with the forest ranger. Weekends spent with our friends are always the absolute best and we can't wait to being you guys along!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Don't forget to subscribe and follow along for new #vanlife adventures every week!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Chapters:&amp;#10;00:00 - intro&amp;#10;01:13 - morning trail run&amp;#10;02:57 - lakes = paddle boards &amp;#10;04:00 - back to camp for the night&amp;#10;05:17 - campfire hangs&amp;#10;06:40 - coffee, workout, and cold plunges&amp;#10;07:15 - enter the forest ranger&amp;#10;08:46 - onto the next spot&amp;#10;10:04 - group cookout&amp;#10;11:41 - cozy mountain mornings&amp;#10;13:04 - the sun finally makes an appearance&amp;#10;14:27 - sad see you laters&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Watch my friends channels!&amp;#10;Brandon and Sarah - @livinginadvance&amp;#10;Trent - @ttthefineprinttt&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can find all of my van build and design inspiration over on my All Things Van Life Pinterest board:&amp;#10;https://pin.it/2qEoKwF&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tour our Van!&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/Lt2YDi2S20s"
