    id 395
    label "CRi77AJQ3Fw"
    step 0
    date "2021-11-21T14:00:03Z"
    title "VAN TOUR FAMILY OF 4 lives in LUXURY 4SEASON VAN w/SHOWER,TOILET,HEATED FLOOR- SOCIETY MADE US DO IT"
    description "Kirt and Jen sold their home, cars, quit their job, pulled their kids out of school and hit the road to travel full time in their self-converted DIY 2018 Ram Promaster 3500 van. Enjoy a comprehensive tour of their beautiful, luxury tiny home on wheels as they tell their story of what drove them to this lifestyle. Their ALL ELECTRIC four season van houses everything you could think of from a toilet, two shower methods, a heater, a heated floor, a legless awning, custom storage boxes, seating and sleeping arrangements for FOUR, a removable work/dining table, water and food storage for days, and a GORGEOUS DIY epoxy countertop. PLUS- don't miss a special BIG announcement as they wrap up the tour and reveal their future plans!! If you love this van as much as they do- you won't want to miss the big surprise at the end! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;**UPDATE visit https://www.overlanduncharted.com for more information regarding the van**&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We broke this video down into timestamps for your viewing convince! If you are looking for something specific, find it below:&amp;#10;0:17 Intro&amp;#10;0:40 Structure of walls, windows, ceiling, insulation&amp;#10;1:44 Additional foldaway seating &amp;#10;2:28 Scopema Swivel seat (get yours, linked below!)&amp;#10;3:33 Flooring &amp;#38; heated floor&amp;#10;4:29 Espar heater&amp;#10;5:17 Our Story: Why did we choose this lifestyle?&amp;#10;8:00 Overhead storage space &amp;#38; charging station &amp;#10;9:09 Kitchen &amp;#38; epoxy countertop&amp;#10;10:22 Our Story: Keeping up with the Jones's&amp;#10;11:41 Sink/Kitchen cont'd &amp;#10;13:54 Overhead cabinets &amp;#38; food storage &amp;#10;15:04 Fridge&amp;#10;15:46 Drawer locks &amp;#38; pulls &amp;#10;16:22 Our Story: Pros/Cons of a nomadic lifestyle&amp;#10;19:30 Drawers &amp;#38; other storage &amp;#10;20:19 Bench seating/kid's beds &amp;#10;22:35 More overhead storage w/live edge wood&amp;#10;24:02 Lagun Table workspace/dinner table&amp;#10;25:50 Our Story: Sacrifices on the road &amp;#10;26:39 Airhead composting toilet &amp;#10;27:36 Fixed custom sized bed &amp;#10;29:29 Our Story: Problem with the wow factor &amp;#10;30:43 Outside walk around: legless awning, rims/tires, sumo springs &amp;#10;31:50 Swing arm rear-bumper system &amp;#38; custom exterior storage box &amp;#10;34:04 The Garage: storage, shower, hot water heater&amp;#10;35:17 Electrical System explained &amp;#10;37:07 Water Filtration system &amp;#10;38:29 WHAT'S NEXT?! BIG ANNOUNCEMENT!! click here for more info https://www.overlanduncharted.com&amp;#10;41:13 Tour wrap up&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks so much for watching and be sure to leave us comment if you have any questions about full time travel, logistics, destinations, or even recommendations to check out along our journey! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128722; SHOP our VAN &amp;#128175;% Products We &amp;#10084;&amp;#65039; for Full-Time Nomad/Van Life here &amp;#10145;&amp;#65039; https://www.amazon.com/shop/overlanduncharted&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128656; Building your own DIY CAMPER VAN? &amp;#10;~Get 12% your next favorite portable refrigerator from ICECO with the code KIRTFRIER or click this link for an automatic 12% off applied at checkout &amp;#10145;&amp;#65039; https://icecofreezer.com?sca_ref=1280563.s26X3gmgC2&amp;#38;sca_source=YouTube&amp;#10;&amp;#10;~Get your Scopema SWIVEL seat here  &amp;#10145;&amp;#65039; https://theswivelshop.com/?ref=OVERLANDUNCHARTED&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127926; Music Credits &amp;#127925;&amp;#10;All of our Music is From Epidemic Sound: Try it for free here &amp;#10145;&amp;#65039; https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/8fj8ki/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128176; Earn cash back on fuel with GetUpside app &amp;#128656; &amp;#10;It's totally FREE and there are gas stations nationwide offering cashback on fuel. Get an additional $0.15 back PER gallon when you sign up with code: JENNIFER732542 &amp;#128165;&amp;#10;&amp;#129302;Download for Android https://upside.app.link/JE