    date "2022-07-12T15:00:18Z"
    title "VAN LIFE EXPECTATIONS VS REALITY | Mental Health, Bathroom, and more!"
    description "Before starting this lifestyle we had a lot of expectations of what van life would look like and after 6 months on the road we finally feel like we understand the realities. In today's video we discuss everything from mental health to sharing a small space and what our bathroom situation looks like. Tune in to get a better understanding of life on the road. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #realities #expectationvsreality #lifeontheroad &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Shop our van:&amp;#10;Goal Zero Yeti 3000x: https://amzn.to/3rBRQBI&amp;#10;Renogy Solar Panels: https://amzn.to/3JNAaZT&amp;#10;40 Gallon Water Tank: https://amzn.to/36nPIpC&amp;#10;Gray Water Tanks: https://amzn.to/3jNlpvx&amp;#10;Composting Toilet: https://amzn.to/3xB6I73&amp;#10;Mattress: https://amzn.to/3EwQhdp&amp;#10;Diesel Heater: https://amzn.to/3MhxUfl&amp;#10;Outdoor Shower: https://amzn.to/3EoVDqZ&amp;#10;+ More: https://www.amazon.com/shop/influencer-f6253738&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Favorite Shoes: https://glnk.io/k33o/thewanderingwings (get a FREE pair of socks with purchase through this link!)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us:&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/the.wandering.wings/&amp;#10;TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@thewanderingwings&amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/The-Wandering-Wings-107282248463235&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hi, we are Brandon and Kristine!&amp;#10;We picked up our empty cargo van in November 2020 and built her into our tiny home on wheels over the next year. We finally hit the road in January 2022 alongside our sweet pup, Hopps, with a motto to live with less to experience more. Our goal is to take our van, Fern, all over the USA and beyond and inspire people to step out of their comfort zone and do what makes them happy. We are so excited you are along for the ride. Subscribe to follow along with our adventures. New videos posted every Tuesday. Hope to see you on the road!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PS: As an Amazon Affiliate, we earn from qualifying purchases from Amazon links. This is no cost to you, but helps keep us on the road! Thank you!"
    channeltitle "The Wandering Wings"
