    title "VAN LIFE GERMANY - TRAVELLING and MAKING MOVIES"
    description "After leaving Rothenberg ob der Tauber we headed north but didn't get very far as we couldn't resist stopping at another couple of little medieval towns, Iphofen and Mainbernheim....we need more time!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you for watching, hope you enjoyed the video. please like, comment, and don't forget to subscribe if you haven't already!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us on;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/the.exPAWers/ &amp;#10;Facebook:  https://www.facebook.com/exPAWers/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Support us;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.me/exPAWers &amp;#10;&amp;#10;NEW MERCHANDISE!!!  https://teespring.com/stores/the-expawers&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Camera Stuff (affiliate links)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Nikon 5300;  https://amzn.to/2NDseOS&amp;#10;GoPro;  https://amzn.to/2WAFDep&amp;#10;Microphone; https://amzn.to/2PTT7PR&amp;#10;Tripod;  https://amzn.to/2EWOSz4&amp;#10;Drone;  https://amzn.to/2PUpcqG&amp;#10;Cool camera strap;  https://amzn.to/2orWcdI&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Stuff in the van (affiliate links)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUP board;  https://amzn.to/2COIQjb&amp;#10;kayak;  https://amzn.to/2NbOXoh&amp;#10;dog life jackets;  https://amzn.to/2PNg0oh&amp;#10;gasoline stove;  https://amzn.to/2WkmVao&amp;#10;diesel heater;  https://amzn.to/2WtgqHi &amp;#10;solar shower;  https://amzn.to/2NzUodn  &amp;#10;12v shower;  https://amzn.to/2PSJVvi     &amp;#10;flexible solar panel;  https://amzn.to/2wtIv26&amp;#10;fold out solar panel(24w);  https://amzn.to/2MF6Z2A&amp;#10;fold out solar panel(200w);  https://amzn.to/2ETiJsk&amp;#10;Portable Urinal;  https://amzn.to/2S6SYJF&amp;#10;Porta Potty;  https://amzn.to/2wwzOnD&amp;#10;inverter;  https://amzn.to/2C4njoF  &amp;#10;potable power bank; https://amzn.to/2EW8KCO &amp;#10;octopus cloths dryer;  https://amzn.to/2N6XKaK&amp;#10;whistling kettle;  https://amzn.to/2LI7dQY&amp;#10;gas stove with grill;  https://amzn.to/2wubvH4&amp;#10;Smoothie maker;  https://amzn.to/2PQwMme&amp;#10;water filter jug;  https://amzn.to/2C4HVgy&amp;#10;bike rack;  https://amzn.to/2N3nh4D&amp;#10;levellers;  https://amzn.to/2PQGuVQ&amp;#10;bluetooth speaker;  https://amzn.to/2TTePoc&amp;#10;projector;  https://amzn.to/2TP9Gx4&amp;#10;projector screen;  https://amzn.to/2WFD7Uh&amp;#10;ridge monkey;  https://amzn.to/2EXjTTJ&amp;#10;portable freeview 9inch tv;  https://amzn.to/2EWrB0q&amp;#10;walkie talkies;  https://amzn.to/2ER2rjN&amp;#10;laptop;  https://amzn.to/2WgiQnG&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We would like to say a BIG THANK YOU to all our subscribers and everyone who watches our videos and for all your lovely comments, it really does mean a lot to us.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you would like to support us further and buy the dogs some treats or put a little fuel in Vinny, it would be very much appreciated and you can do so by clicking on the PayPal link below. &amp;#128522;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.me/exPAWers &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Contact us; &amp;#10;&amp;#10; the.expawers@outlook.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #germany #livelifeoutside"
