    title "Alone In My Van Again | VAN LIFE in AUSTRALIA"
    description "Ready to see what SOLO van life in Australia looks like? The first 1000 people to click the link will get a free trial of Skillshare Premium Membership: https://skl.sh/maxoccy01211&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Australia is bloody stunning. I mean wow. In this ep I travel solo (well with Occy) half the width of this beautiful country to go back to a campsite I visited 10 years ago. Join me for the journey and check out the paradise waiting for me at the end &amp;#128588;&amp;#127996;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe to Max &amp;#38; Occy here!&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCsphzld6v6ghCl_RyvihNgA&amp;#10;Follow me on Instagram &amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/max_bids/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Support me and join my Patreon fam here! &amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/maxandoccy&amp;#10;Or, for one time donations PayPal to maxbid88@gmail.com . Thank you!!! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHERE DO I GET MY MUSIC??&amp;#10;http://share.mscbd.fm/maxandlee &amp;#11013;&amp;#65039;&amp;#10;Elevate your videos with record-label quality music from Musicbed!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Song 1 The Ladder by Margolnick&amp;#10;Song 2 Andalucia by Max LL&amp;#10;Song 3 So ALIVE by Leucadia&amp;#10;&amp;#10;New logo made by the talented Maxime B&amp;#232;dard - https://www.behance.net/maximebedard&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Occy and have moved into my van to join the van life movement in Australia, allowing me to live, work and travel full time! I cannot wait to get out there and overland Australia &amp;#128588;&amp;#127996;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want to EDIT like me?? This is what I use!   https://bit.ly/2Px8tfk  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #australia #solovanlife"
