    step 0
    date "2020-02-23T18:01:51Z"
    title "FAMILY VAN TOUR: amazing bed lift that sleeps 4 with a full bathroom | SPRINTER VAN CONVERSION"
    description "Get the details on this van here: http://bit.ly/2Pj6has&amp;#10;Welcome to our latest family van tour! Wow, we are both SO excited to share this Sprinter Van Conversion for a family of four!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This is a 2019  170&amp;#8221; Extended 3500 Mercedes Sprinter Van with our family van layout with an amazing bed lift that sleeps 4.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This convertible bunk bed utilizes a HappiJac bed lift. This gives this family the best of both worlds - they have a place to sit and eat together as a family AND two beds - the lower bed is an almost king size bed and the top bed is almost queen size.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Other Features Include:&amp;#10;- 400 watts of Renogy solar with Rover Solar Controller: https://amzn.to/2Giw9OE&amp;#10;- Three 100ah Battle Born Batteries: https://amzn.to/2Gt8GM0&amp;#10;- 3000 watt Victron Inverter Charger: https://amzn.to/2GhrufQ&amp;#10;- Aluminess Roof Rack &amp;#38; Ladder&amp;#10;- 130 liter Isotherm Fridge&amp;#10;- Shower Pan: https://amzn.to/2uq9j24&amp;#10;- Espar D2 Diesel Heater: https://amzn.to/2RPwhxE&amp;#10;- 2.5 gallon Electric Hot Water Heater: https://amzn.to/2V5oQmE&amp;#10;- Nautilus Retractable Shower Door: https://www.stoett.com/nautilus/&amp;#10;- 12 volt dimmable light switch: https://www.superbrightleds.com/moreinfo/single-color-dimmer-switches/slvdx-60w-led-switch-and-dimmer-for-standard-wall-switch-box/1181/?fbclid=IwAR3_87w8rN1ixuRLr3NylarXp2GcmzIQeRDhlbHphswd5PQSsEA41p1THf4&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; GET OUR VAN FLOOR PLANS HERE:  &amp;#10;https://saraandalexjames.com/van-build-layout-guide&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; &amp;#128656;CLICK TO SUBSCRIBE HERE: https://bit.ly/2U4HBWV &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; HOW MUCH OUR VAN CONVERSIONS COST:&amp;#10; https://youtu.be/syl3Erx0aY0&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; VAN LIFE ESSENTIALS: &amp;#10;100ah Battle Born Batteries: https://amzn.to/2Gt8GM0 &amp;#10;3000 watt Victron Inverter Charger: https://amzn.to/2GhrufQ &amp;#10;Farmhouse Sink: https://amzn.to/2DhEUYC &amp;#10;Faucet: https://amzn.to/2Nj2NX7&amp;#10;Separett Urine Diverting Toilet: https://amzn.to/2Is0rC1&amp;#10;30 gallons of Fresh Water storage: https://amzn.to/2InYMNB &amp;#10;2.5 gallon Electric Water Heater: https://amzn.to/2V5oQmE&amp;#10;Aeropress: https://amzn.to/2KC93qh&amp;#10;Electric Kettle: https://amzn.to/2zau9Yu&amp;#10;Hand Vacuum: https://amzn.to/2z42OXT&amp;#10;Tech Towels: https://amzn.to/2KDQq24&amp;#10;Sun Shade: https://amzn.to/2Ni8iBf&amp;#10;EnamelWare: https://amzn.to/2LhzotO&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CAMERA: https://amzn.to/2PpmWI1&amp;#10;GIMBAL: https://amzn.to/2BxR9By&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; VAN DETAILS&amp;#10;https://saraandalexjames.com/vanlife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; WHO ARE WE? &amp;#10;We are Sara &amp;#38; Alex (aka &amp;#34;40 Hours of Freedom&amp;#34;), and definitely don't forget about our dogs - Bambi &amp;#38; Nugget - or else they might be a little upset. We converted our own Sprinter van and have hit the road for full time adventure and fun. Subscribe for new van life and travel videos every week.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We hope to inspire you to create the life you love - whatever that looks like for you! So get out there and start creating some epic content. We live by: Create more, Consume Less.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10163; CONNECT WITH US:&amp;#10;https://saraandalexjames.com&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/saraandalexjames&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/40hoursoffreedom&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #vantour #familyvan"
