    description "Curious how the trusty Ford Econoline stacks up against the modern Ford Transit van? After crossing several states together and riding mountain bike trails all over the South, Drew's Wolf Wagon E350 squares up against @Jeff Lenosky's, the Trail Boss himself, Ford Transit. Both Jeff and Drew are budget-minded vanners, and found great ways to build and buy their respective vans without going into debt.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Would you rather spend under 12 grand for a stylish Econoline or over 25 grand for a more spacious and modern looking Ford Transit? Each van has it's strengths, and we point them out in this video and hope you enjoy the ride inside two road-ready Ford vans. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks for watching &amp;#10;------------------------------------&amp;#10;FOLLOW US&amp;#10;Website: https://www.theloamwolf.com/&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/theloamwolf/&amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/theloamwolf"
