    date "2020-06-14T14:00:15Z"
    title "VAN LIFE TOUR Bimobil ATEGO 4x4 Expedition Vehicle // Motorcycle Carrier Build  | RV Part 2"
    description "&amp;#128073; Sign Up to our Newsletter! https://liveandgive4x4.com/newsletter&amp;#10;See in this new episode the part 2 of our Van Life TOUR! Here we are doing a walk around of our Expedition vehicle truck, showing you all the special storage and details of our Bimobil EX480. The technical information of our Mercedes Atego 4x4, the build of our Motorcycle carrier, the reasons why we decided to have a dirt bike with us on board. You will also see an emotional meeting between Fabian and his host family from 1997. Don't miss it! We hope you will enjoy this video!&amp;#10;See ya when we see ya &amp;#128075; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Fabian Isabela and Matheo&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.liveandgive4x4.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Book a call with us: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.liveandgive4x4.com/book&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tomorrow's adventure&amp;#8217;s coming soon. Hit that Bell and Subscribe as you too can follow us through the #LiveandGive4x4Tour. Can't wait? Live the experience in real-time with Patreon, Facebook, and Instagram.&amp;#128521;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128073; SUBSCRIBE to our channel &amp;#38; to join our community! &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/liveandgive4x4?sub_confirmation=1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::&amp;#10;Support our Production&amp;#10;:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::&amp;#10;&amp;#127758; Patreon Family:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you enjoy and like our content and want to help support our video production:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/liveandgive4x4&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join our Patreon Community and be part of the FAMILY! &amp;#10;Get EXCLUSIVE content &amp;#38; CONNECT with us or even travel with us in real life!&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;..&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127757; Paypal one time donation:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You simply want to donate and help us fill our DIESEL TANK a bit? Please click here:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.me/LiveandGive4x4&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You make us go further on our trip down to South America! &amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;..&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127759; Business or Sponsorship:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You want LiveandGive4x4 to support YOUR mind-blowing idea? &amp;#10;We have NOW new opportunities for YOU! Contact us for your open slot NOW!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please email us at info@liveandgive4x4.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Together we can make a difference!&amp;#10;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#8230;&amp;#10;&amp;#128717; Products we use:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Help kids in an orphanage in La Paz by clicking on the link and purchasing your own Water Filtration System for your house, RV, or boat! 3 % of purchases go directly to the kids!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.guzzleh2o.com/liveandgive4x4&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want to upgrade to the RELiON lithium batteries we upgraded to? Get a 10% discount by using this link to RELiON when ordering!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.liveandgive4x4.com/relion&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Interested in more discounts we negotiated for YOU? &amp;#10;Sign up to our NEWSLETTER and leave message RELiON or/and GUZZLEH2O to receive a special discount! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.liveandgive4x4.com/newsletter&amp;#10;...............................................&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128717; Amazon shop: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Click here to know which gear or products we use on our travels. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/liveandgive4x4&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you buy something you will pay the same price and we will get a small commission from Amazon. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::&amp;#10;       Follow us live&amp;#10;:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/liveandgive4x4/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/liveandgive4x4/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Doggies Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/furry4x4journey &amp;#10;&amp;#10;:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::&amp;#10;Top Playlists and videos &amp;#10;:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128250; Start Here to see from the beginning: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLcRmj4rMVfFIfBV24Fs7xbKDRypq9ejNs&amp;#10;&amp;#128250; Tiny Living Interview: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLcRmj4rMVfFL_SCwR3mQNmOuuOFz5RREc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::&amp;#10;        Music Credits &amp;#10;:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127908; &amp;#34;Music: &amp;#34;Already there&amp;#34; &amp;#34;Blowing, Going, Gone&amp;#34; by Josh Woodward http://joshwoodward.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::&amp;#10;Thank you Patron $20 pledge&amp;#10;:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10084;&amp;#65039; Dennis Ham&amp;#10;&amp;#10;:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::&amp;#10;       About us&amp;#10;:::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::::&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128054;&amp;#128107; &amp;#128054; We are Isabela from Brazil and Fabian from Germany and together we travel the world with our two lovely dogs. Our journey doesn&amp;#8217;t have a deadline and this makes us happy. We love adventure, nature, meeting new people, and live life to the fullest. We want YOU to come along on this journey with us! We even offer limited possibilities to travel with us on Patreon. Check out the rewards.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you so much for your support and for watching! It makes us really happy to know that we have such a strong and beautiful community! We love your comments, thumbs-ups, and likes! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Together we can make a difference! See you when we see ya! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Isabela and Fabian"
