    id 407
    label "ZZzqBh9LOTs"
    step 0
    date "2021-12-17T21:19:51Z"
    title "Stealth Step Van TOUR - FedEx Truck Converted into Tiny Home"
    description "John did a fantastic job converting this step van into his own tiny home on wheels. I can't wait to see it fully complete but this is what this type of lifestyle is all about.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/stepvan88m/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My Information and Products:&amp;#10;Brand Deals/Business Inquiries: brandon@thestation.io&amp;#10;Comedy Channel: https://www.youtube.com/jarrodtoccicomedy&amp;#10;Website: https://www.jarrodtocci.com&amp;#10;Consulting: https://jarrodtocci.com/contact/&amp;#10;Merch: https://www.jarrodtocci.com/shop&amp;#10;             https://teespring.com/stores/jarrodtocci&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/jarrodtocci/ (@jarrodtocci)&amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/JarrodGHOST&amp;#10;Pinterest: www.pinterest.com/jarrodtocci/&amp;#10;Podcast: https://anchor.fm/dontbeachump&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Partnerships/Affiliates I personally work with:&amp;#10;VanLife Academy from Project VanLife:&amp;#10;https://toccighost--projectvanlife.thrivecart.com/van-life-academy/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Looking for great batteries? These are the batteries in my Van and Jeep!&amp;#10;ReLion Battery:&amp;#10;http://relionbattery.com?aff=6&amp;#10;Relion Battery Discount Code: Ghost5&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Havelock Wool Insulation:&amp;#10;http://havelockwool.refr.cc/jarrodt&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Portable Diesel Heater and Planer Heater. Also a ton of other useful products:&amp;#10;https://expeditionupfitter.com/?ref=jarrodtocci&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Van Life Tech Products:&amp;#10;Verified DIY Package Link (that allows payments):&amp;#10;https://vanlifetech.samcart.com/products/van-life-tech--roman-holiday--diy-package--payment-plan-tocci/&amp;#10;12PK of VLT Beer (Shipper Pack):&amp;#10;https://vanlifetech.samcart.com/products/vlt-down-by-the-river-ipa-12-pk-shipper-tocci&amp;#10;Rogue VLT System:&amp;#10;https://vanlifetech.samcart.com/products/diy-rogue-tocci/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Guzzle H2O Water Filtration system:&amp;#10;https://www.guzzleh2o.com?ref=6&amp;#10;I use the portable one and the built-in one!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Lion Energy:&amp;#10;https://lionenergy.com/discount/Ghost15?redirect=%2Fproducts%2Flion-safari-ut-1300%3Fafmc%3D5u&amp;#10;Discount Code: Ghost15&amp;#10;&amp;#10;EcoFlow Delta Power Source:&amp;#10;https://ecoflow.com/collections/portable-power/delta?aff=6&amp;#10;Great for camping or for when the power goes out. Also great for certain van builds!!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Epoxy Used for Woodworking and any Finishing&amp;#10;http://www.totalboat.com/&amp;#10;Discount Code: ghost15 for 15% off first purchase&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WeBull Investing:&amp;#10;https://act.webull.com/kol-us/share.html?hl=en&amp;#38;inviteCode=D9J7XQhkOqfg&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Scott from @ComesWithaView (Instagram) Van Building Guide book:&amp;#10;https://thewanderful.co/?ref=jarrodtocci&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Donations here to help with gas, taking trips, stand up, or just because I&amp;#8217;m lovable.&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.me/JarrodTocci&amp;#10;&amp;#10;These are products I used and some I suggest, mostly amazon links:&amp;#10;BEHIND THE WALLS:&amp;#10;Insulation - Havelock Wool (link above)&amp;#10;Kilmat 50 mil 50 sqft Sound Deadener: https://amzn.to/33VgkJf&amp;#10;Frost King FV516 Duct Insulation: https://amzn.to/360N9qT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;KITCHEN / BATH / WATER&amp;#10;Kitchen Faucet - https://amzn.to/2OVO4R6&amp;#10;Sink - https://amzn.to/2BwIxbT&amp;#10;Shower Head - https://amzn.to/31pfrFI &amp;#10;Shower Hose - https://amzn.to/2Bm8xqc&amp;#10;Shower Valve - https://amzn.to/32q8Ax9&amp;#10;Water Pump - https://amzn.to/32ps0SD&amp;#10;Water Accumulator - https://amzn.to/32kwwBX&amp;#10;Electronic Ball Valve (used for gray water tank) - https://amzn.to/2OUmXWw&amp;#10;7 Gallon Gray Water Tank - https://amzn.to/32lbQK2&amp;#10;Portable Induction Burner - https://amzn.to/2BmXEo8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;HARDWARE / FINISHES&amp;#10;Roof Vent - https://amzn.to/2nZFGFa&amp;#10;Drawer Slides - https://amzn.to/33FzEIK&amp;#10;Drawer Pulls - https://amzn.to/2BhfDwd&amp;#10;Mattress - https://amzn.to/35L5Hc3&amp;#10;Floating Ceiling Lights - https://amzn.to/31sqwFP&amp;#10;Under Cabinet Lights - https://amzn.to/32vtwTy&amp;#10;Bedside Light - https://amzn.to/2OUs9K0&amp;#10;Cabinet and Drawer Latch - https://amzn.to/35J0v8H&amp;#10;Cabinet Hinge - https://amzn.to/2MM0058&amp;#10;Murphy Bed Stopper - https://amzn.to/2IXS7IA&amp;#10;Tile (Stick on) - https://amzn.to/31phmda&amp;#10;Toilet - https://amzn.to/2Mnq4oi&amp;#10;4 USB Outlet - https://amzn.to/32r08NV&amp;#10;2 USB Outlet with 12v port - https://amzn.to/2VOoKxE&amp;#10;Epoxy/Resin mix used for Tables - https://amzn.to/2Mp7E6I&amp;#10;&amp;#10;DISCLAIMER: This video and description contains affiliate links, which means that if you click on one of the product links, I&amp;#8217;ll receive a small commission, only if purchased. This helps me grow as a business and my brand, so I can continue to bring you the best content possible. Thank you for all your support!"
