    id 408
    label "FuXEodbLAqs"
    step 0
    date "2020-03-16T11:00:05Z"
    title "6 Reasons Why Van Life SUCKS!"
    description "We're on the road with my MOM &amp;#38; she's gone full-time Van Life! We're sharing some of the difficulties and struggles of moving into an RV. It's an awesome lifestyle but there are a few not-so-sweet realities that may help you decide if traveling in a Van is right for you.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Get more Van &amp;#38; RV newbie tips on our website: https://www.gonewiththewynns.com/van-life-reality&amp;#10; &amp;#10;I&amp;#8217;m proud that my mom&amp;#8217;s gone full-time nomad, it takes a lot of guts to sell it all and downsize life into a van.  If you&amp;#8217;re a fellow nomad, RVer or VanLifer, you can find her on Instagram @Marys_Van &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We&amp;#8217;ll share a couple more vids on my mom&amp;#8217;s van, so subscribe and ring that bell if you want to stay in the loop.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Cheers,&amp;#10;Jason and Nikki Wynn&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127926; AWESOME Royalty Free tunes for videos:  http://bit.ly/artlist-gwtw &amp;#10;  - Artist - Space Doves&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUPPORT OUR VIDS  &amp;#128591;  http://bit.ly/patreon-wynn &amp;#10;GET SOCIAL with us  &amp;#128241;  http://bit.ly/gwtw-social &amp;#10;WANT MORE? Check out our SWEET Site: http://bit.ly/gwtw-home&amp;#10;&amp;#10;----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Enjoy our vids? Want to give us a virtual high-five? Treat us to an espresso? Or pitch in on a tank of fuel? Click over to see how you can support our productions (most of the ways won&amp;#8217;t cost you a dime):  http://bit.ly/join-gwtw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you wanna get social with us we're all over the place, hop in and join the adventure here: http://bit.ly/gwtw-social&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #RoadTrip &amp;#10;&amp;#10;----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#169; Gone With the Wynns 2020"
