    id 409
    label "wKPa3uVddbU"
    step 0
    date "2015-03-25T15:49:32Z"
    title "The Millionaire Pitcher that Lives in a Van"
    description "Daniel Norris signed a bonus worth just over $2 million to join the&amp;#10;Blue Jays organization out of high school. While life on the road&amp;#10;becomes normal for any pro athlete, the 21-year-old takes things to&amp;#10;the next level by spending his summers living in a Volkswagen camper van. VICE Sports traveled down to Blue Jays Spring Training to meet one of the sport's top pitching prospects.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Up Next:&amp;#10;La Sangre: Baseball in San Pedro - http://bit.ly/2sQhZip&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Subscribe to VICE Sports here: http://bit.ly/Subscribe-to-VICE-Sports&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out VICE Sports for more: http://www.vicesports.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow VICE Sports here:&amp;#10;Facebook: https://facebook.com/VICESports&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/VICESports&amp;#10;Instagram: http://instagram.com/vicesports&amp;#10;More videos from the VICE network: https://www.fb.com/vicevideos"
