    id 416
    label "ZMead-o2_-s"
    step 0
    date "2019-07-21T18:10:04Z"
    title "VAN LIFE | How We Save Money Traveling In Our Sprinter Van!"
    description "One of the many fantastic reasons about travelling in a van is the ability to travel a lot cheaper than if you had to catch flights, rent hotel rooms and go eat in restaurants every day. In today&amp;#8217;s video we leave the UK on the channel tunnel, before driving through a number of different countries on our route to Finland!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;2014 travels through Norway, Sweden, Germany, Austria, Switzerland, France, Andorra and Spain: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLAEl3ci6ChXiRND1wlovhesu2qpTFZI_6 &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Some of the ways we save money:&amp;#10;- Keep a budget&amp;#10;- Recycle...this will make sense once you watch the video&amp;#10;- Fuel up in cheaper places&amp;#10;- Wild camp&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUBSCRIBE so you don&amp;#8217;t miss new content every week: http://bit.ly/SubscribeTheIndieProjects (click that notification bell too!)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Become a member of our Patreon : http://bit.ly/IndieProjectsPatreon&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW US!&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Instagram: http://instagram.com/TheIndieProjects &amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Facebook: http://facebook.com/theindieprojects&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Twitter: http://twitter.com/theindyprojects &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Enjoy the music used in our videos? Try a FREE trial from Musicbed for great tracks: http://share.mscbd.fm/theindieprojects&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Exclusive Merchandise and more: http://theindieprojects.com &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; BLOG POSTS: http://theindieprojects.com/blog&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; FILMING KIT:&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/filmingkit&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; FREE Van Life eBook:&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/freevanlifebook&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8608; Check out our PODCAST:&amp;#10;http://bit.ly/IndieProjectsPodcast &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Contact us: &amp;#10;&amp;#8608; contacttheindieprojects@gmail.com"
