    date "2020-12-23T20:33:21Z"
    title "Amandas Van Life Updates | New Water Jugs and a Place for My Toilet Tent |"
    description "I'm always changing small things in my van, and I want to make regular &amp;#34;update&amp;#34; videos. Do you guys have any name suggestions for the series? I was thinking something like &amp;#34;Amanda's Van Life Memos.&amp;#34;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Leave your feedback in the comments!&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;This is my 2011 Dodge Grand Caravan no-build minivan camper conversion. I travel full time with my Chihuahua. We&amp;#8217;ve visited 28 states in the continental US!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I am a creative writer, and work in the digital space. You can follow our journey on dogmomdays.com.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Instagram: @DogMomDays&amp;#10;Facebook: @DogMomDays&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please note that by purchasing items from Amazon using our links, we may earn a small commission to help with our business expenses. Thank you! Xoxo Amanda &amp;#38; Wynston&amp;#10;&amp;#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;Amazon Items by Category: (affiliate links)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Electronics and Power:&amp;#10;Jackery Power Station: https://amzn.to/2IAG4DU&amp;#10;Jackery 60W Solar Panel: https://amzn.to/2IGhHVc&amp;#10;30 AMP Adapter: https://amzn.to/2K9IwSA&amp;#10;Asus 11.6&amp;#8221; Laptop: https://amzn.to/36106k1&amp;#10;Portable Camping Fan: https://amzn.to/3ps6xVj&amp;#10;Portable A/C Unit: https://amzn.to/2KcMFFt&amp;#10;Bluetooth Car Visor Speaker: https://amzn.to/38Lcsib&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Food, Water and Cooking:&amp;#10;MSR Pocket Rocket Camping Stove: https://amzn.to/3lEaROT&amp;#10;Electric Water Dispenser: https://amzn.to/35yD0RD&amp;#10;Igloo 6 Gallon Water Jug: https://amzn.to/3o5Ij1F&amp;#10;Yeti Tundra 35: https://amzn.to/2J6guqK&amp;#10;Carbon Monoxide Detector: https://amzn.to/2K2PiJI&amp;#10;Yeti Mug: https://amzn.to/3pZZOlp&amp;#10;Kuju Pour Over Coffee: https://amzn.to/3fzjjNc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Pet Items:&amp;#10;Collapsible Pet Water Bowls: https://amzn.to/395qlHY&amp;#10;Popup Playpen: https://amzn.to/2K28De9&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hygiene: &amp;#10;Wolfwise Popup Toilet Tent: https://amzn.to/3n4fm5T&amp;#10;Portable Shower: https://amzn.to/3lFvaLW&amp;#10;5 Gallon Bucket Toilet Seat: https://amzn.to/3lAuWW7&amp;#10;Portable Camping Toilet: https://amzn.to/3mcvj9K&amp;#10;Coleman Toilet Deodorizer: https://amzn.to/36yQUDU&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Curtains: &amp;#10;Magnetic Window Curtains: https://amzn.to/32PfZIt&amp;#10;Hippie Tapestry: https://amzn.to/3m24vbx&amp;#10;Celestial Tapestry: https://amzn.to/3oPfyGT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Bed:&amp;#10;Low Profile Ozark Camping Cot: https://www.walmart.com/ip/Ozark-Trail-Compact-Folding-Cot-Low-Profile-Cot/575222454&amp;#10;Trifold 4&amp;#8221; Memory Foam Mattress:  https://amzn.to/36z4q9o&amp;#10;Orthopedic back pillow: https://amzn.to/2UOTGOU&amp;#10;Fleece Blankets: https://amzn.to/3nZ0PZo&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Miscellaneous: &amp;#10;Sticky Gel Pads: https://amzn.to/3no94xR&amp;#10;HangPro Seat Organizer: https://amzn.to/3pxrxd7&amp;#10;Desktop Organizer: https://amzn.to/3nrFuaO&amp;#10;United States Map Car Vinyl Sticker: https://amzn.to/3nspRjq&amp;#10;Binder Clips: https://amzn.to/36T7hKj&amp;#10;Decorative Sticky Paper: https://amzn.to/2Ks2fNH&amp;#10;Gorilla Hot Glue Gun: https://amzn.to/33l00lT&amp;#10;Magnets: https://amzn.to/2V8CweZ&amp;#10;CD case for cords: https://amzn.to/3ldFABe&amp;#10;Sunbeam Heating Pad: https://amzn.to/3llbFqI&amp;#10;Hand Warmers: https://amzn.to/3mqdHre&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Ikea Furniture: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Lack Bedside Table: https://www.ikea.com/us/en/p/lack-tv-unit-black-90243297/&amp;#10;Omar Kitchen Shelf: https://www.ikea.com/us/en/p/omar-shelf-unit-galvanized-00069768/&amp;#10;Ikea Lill Curtain Panels: https://www.ikea.com/us/en/p/lill-lace-curtains-1-pair-white-90111980/"
