    id 429
    label "-znw0bFu_8s"
    step 0
    date "2020-10-21T23:00:00Z"
    title "VAN LIFE TOUR with TOILET and SHOWER | Ram Promaster 136 WB"
    description "SUPPORT US ON PATREON: https://www.patreon.com/travelingatlas&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We finally got around to making an official van life tour! Watch as we take you on a tour, showing the features we build into our Ram Promaster affectionately named Ronnie. These features include a shower, toilet, running water, propane stove top, and more!&amp;#10;&amp;#10; &amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Links to Van Build Items Used in the Van Build(affiliate links): &amp;#10;Bamboo Shower Mat: https://amzn.to/31HtIAu&amp;#10;Foam Mattress: https://amzn.to/37HRLDf&amp;#10;Spice Rack: https://amzn.to/2HAuOGY&amp;#10;MAGZO Bug Screen (side door): https://amzn.to/2HtcgIW&amp;#10;MAGZO Bug Screen (back door): https://amzn.to/3jryA2E&amp;#10;Maxxair Fan 6200k: https://amzn.to/3dX1BRv &amp;#10;Dicor Caulking: https://amzn.to/3e0mU4y &amp;#10;Caulking Gun: https://amzn.to/2LDNmoP &amp;#10;Butyl Tape: https://amzn.to/2WFSf74 &amp;#10;Eternabond Tape: https://amzn.to/2WFlc2O &amp;#10;Fat Mat Sound Dampening: https://amzn.to/3g10ceD &amp;#10;Liquid Nails: https://amzn.to/2WYyKGI &amp;#10;Jig Saw with Blades: https://amzn.to/2AXuhvF &amp;#10;Electric Sander: https://amzn.to/36uq1zw &amp;#10;12V Cable I WISH I USED: https://amzn.to/2MslqVn &amp;#10;120V Cable: https://amzn.to/3doxIty &amp;#10;Electrical Panel: https://amzn.to/3cgcjBz &amp;#10;Blade Fuses for 12V Loads: https://amzn.to/2TW5gHF &amp;#10;Conduit: https://amzn.to/2XjfB2A &amp;#10;Self-Adhesive Cable Straps: https://amzn.to/2yPe76J &amp;#10;Zip Ties: https://amzn.to/3cgcE7j &amp;#10;Wire Stripper/Crimper: https://amzn.to/2MgKsq8 &amp;#10;Butt Splices: https://amzn.to/2zMiiRk &amp;#10;Electrical Tape: https://amzn.to/3eBIk8K &amp;#10;Promaster Attachments: https://www.ebay.com/itm/Promaster-Roof-Attachments-Clips-and-Pads/143255014326?ssPageName=STRK%3AMEBIDX%3AIT&amp;#38;var=442178303352&amp;#38;_trksid=p2060353.m2749.l2649 &amp;#10;Solar Panel 200W (We got 2): https://amzn.to/2MF0CtK &amp;#10;Superstrut (much cheaper at Lowes): https://amzn.to/30pBD5w &amp;#10;Cone Nuts for Superstrut: https://amzn.to/3f0AxkQ &amp;#10;Shiplap (similar to what we got at Home Depot): https://amzn.to/2XQUcxT &amp;#10;Smart Isolator: https://amzn.to/2UUtCSD &amp;#10;Inline Circuit Breakers: https://amzn.to/2YD8pO4 &amp;#10;4 AWG Cable: https://amzn.to/2UTpcLI &amp;#10;Renogy 200Ah Deep Cycle AGM Battery (x2): https://amzn.to/2zRJ22N&amp;#10;Renogy 1000W Inverter: https://amzn.to/3154xbQ&amp;#10;Electrical Panel: https://amzn.to/31fKxmX&amp;#10;Circuit Breakers: https://amzn.to/2CtKuJL&amp;#10;On/Off Kill Switch: https://amzn.to/2NiXIeo&amp;#10;6 Terminal Common Busbar: https://amzn.to/37QF0o8&amp;#10;12V Switch: https://amzn.to/319HpJf&amp;#10;12V Dimmer Switch: https://amzn.to/2YTl2VD&amp;#10;USB Charger: https://amzn.to/3hO7HXg&amp;#10;Battery Monitor: https://amzn.to/3doxKAR&amp;#10;Kreg Pocket Holes: https://amzn.to/389P8br&amp;#10;Nature's Head Composting Toilet: https://amzn.to/3dKhABU&amp;#10;LED Strip Lights: https://amzn.to/3hEs2x8&amp;#10;Paint Guard Mold Prevention: https://amzn.to/2WTo2B9&amp;#10;Ruvati Sink with Cutting Board: https://amzn.to/3gJZthZ&amp;#10;Black Faucet: https://amzn.to/2PFcZaI&amp;#10;2 Burner Stove Top: https://amzn.to/30IbrTK&amp;#10;Under Sink Water Purifier: https://amzn.to/31zKalv&amp;#10;Grey Water Tank: https://amzn.to/3kvxYLp&amp;#10;Camco Sink Drain: https://amzn.to/2XIxSpZ&amp;#10;Shower Head: https://amzn.to/31ENcow&amp;#10;Pipe Thread Sealant: https://amzn.to/3iQtSfd&amp;#10;Swivel Seat for Promaster: https://www.swivelsrus.com/promaster_swivels.php&amp;#10;500 lb Drawer Slides: https://amzn.to/2Y9soEN&amp;#10;Nomad Internet: https://nomadinternet.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Get $$$ off your first AirBnB stay through our link!: https://www.airbnb.com/c/brandonc374/&amp;#10;Best Travel Clothes - BLUFFWORKS: http://bit.ly/2MTSftS &amp;#10;CAMERA GEAR - Travel Video Gear Guide: https://travelingatlas.com/resources/ &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;WEBSITE: https://travelingatlas.com &amp;#10;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/travelingatlas &amp;#10;INSTAGRAM: @travelingatlas https://www.instagram.com/travelingatlas &amp;#10;TWITTER: @traveling_atlas https://twitter.com/traveling_atlas&amp;#10;&amp;#10; &amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Traveling is embedded into our relationship as we met on a Spring Break cruise in 2016. Since then, we haven't stopped traveling together in the United States and abroad. We left New York in July 2019 to travel the world and we took work with us, including starting a travel vlog. We have made it our mission to slow travel for 16 months throughout South America and Asia and to create travel videos along the way. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Due to the pandemic, we changed course and bought a van to convert into a campervan (#vanlife) to travel to all 50 National Parks in the lower 48 states (excluding Hawaii and Alaska) before Christmas. We are Brandon and Erin, follow the journey and stay tuned.&amp;#10;#vantour #rampromaster"
