  [
    id 438
    label "aXVjsF7EnYg"
    step 0
    date "2018-08-26T16:02:15Z"
    title "Van Life - Couple Sold Their House To Live in a DIY Camper Van"
    description "Adam &amp;#38; Vanessa are living in their beautiful and functional DIY camper van.&amp;#10;Free 2-month Skillshare trial for the first 500 people: https://skl.sh/ExpAlt2&amp;#10;&amp;#10;They are expecting a baby and plan to hit the road in the spring as a family of 3 once their baby is born.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;They're in the process of adding a 3rd seat in between the driver and passenger seats to make room for a baby seat, and they're coming up with ideas to widen the bed so they can co-sleep with the little one.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this video we sit down with the couple to talk about why they decided to sell their house, shut down their business, downsize their stuff, and hit the road in a van.  And we get to see the inside of their epic DIY camper build.  Plus we get to eat a veggie curry and rice in between takes.  But there aren't any leftovers ;) &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We had a great time spending a couple of days with these two lovely people and we loved sharing stories from the road, and learning about their camper van build.  They've inspired our build in several different ways, and they also gave us lots of new ideas to make our build more functional when we were together.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow Adam &amp;#38; Vanessa over at Create Wondr for some awesome video content:&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCkSnMB1ZmXAMq7EBa5z4K-w&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks for watching!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Mat &amp;#38; Danielle&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;STAY IN TOUCH!&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Blog: www.exploringalternatives.ca&amp;#10;Facebook: /exploringalternativesblog&amp;#10;Instagram: @exploringalternatives&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;COMMENTS&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We want our channel and our comments section to be an inclusive space where everyone feels welcome to watch and to contribute.  For this reason, comments that are inappropriate or hateful will be reported and/or deleted.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please discuss and debate with respect, and report inappropriate or hateful comments directly to YouTube.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;SUBTITLES AND CLOSED CAPTIONS&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;A very special thank you to our subtitle and closed captions contributors! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you would like to contribute subtitles or closed captions to an Exploring Alternatives video, please click here to see which ones need your help:&amp;#10;http://www.youtube.com/timedtext_cs_panel?c=UC8EQAfueDGNeqb1ALm0LjHA&amp;#38;tab=2&amp;#10;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;SPONSORS&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We occasionally include paid sponsor messages/integrations in our videos to help fund the channel.  We do our best to work with companies and organizations that offer products or services that are in line with our values, and that we think would be interesting and useful to our viewers.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We will always disclose if we&amp;#8217;re promoting products that were given to us for free, or if we&amp;#8217;re including a sponsored message in our video.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For business or sponsorship inquiries, please email us at danielle.is.exploring@gmail.com &amp;#10;&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;VIDEO CREDITS&amp;#10;-------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music &amp;#38; Song Credits: &amp;#10;All music in this video was composed, performed, and recorded by Mat of Exploring Alternatives.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Editing Credits:&amp;#10;Mat and Danielle of Exploring Alternatives&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Filming Credits:&amp;#10;Mat of Exploring Alternatives&amp;#10;Adam &amp;#38; Vanessa of Create Wondr (second cam for interview)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Photo Credits:&amp;#10;Adam &amp;#38; Vanessa of Create Wondr"
    channeltitle "Exploring Alternatives"
