  [
    id 440
    label "pclBn0VpRp8"
    step 0
    date "2018-09-06T18:43:01Z"
    title "VAN LIFE IN LA: The Last 3 Days"
    description "ATTENTION: SOMEHOW THIS VIDEO GOT CUT OFF 2 MINUTES EARLY! I spent all night trying to figure out what happened and this morning, after visiting a repair center, I was informed that my hard drive crashed and that is why the video never uploaded fully. I no longer have this video in my files since the hard drive that crashed had all of our videos and photos on it (yes, it's heartbreaking) so I cannot re-upload this with the ending clips! I'm so sorry for the confusion and I hope you still enjoy the vlog! Love all of you.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PS If you'd like to donate to the channel (which will help us get a new hard drive), you can do so here: www.paypal.me/earthmamamedicine&amp;#10;Anything is appreciated. Much love to all of you.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tune in next time to see us drive up the coast to Oregon!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Welcome, new subscribers! Matt and I quit our jobs in NYC and moved into our van this March. We currently live in our van full-time and make a living working online creating custom nutritional health plans, social media content &amp;#38; Matt&amp;#8217;s sovereign life coaching. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you are interested in supporting us, you can using the links below:&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.me/earthmamamedicine&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/earthmamamedicine &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us on Instagram to get a closer look!&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/earthmamamedicine &amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/eyenero&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/rumithesphynx&amp;#10;&amp;#10;UPCOMING VIDEOS&amp;#9759;&amp;#10;Driving up the Western Coast&amp;#10;Medical Mushrooms&amp;#10;My Thoughts on Birth Control&amp;#10;Meditation for Beginners&amp;#10;My thoughts on CBD&amp;#10;Yoni Egg exercises&amp;#10;My thoughts on Cannabis&amp;#10;What we Eat in the Van&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If any of these topics sound interesting to you, hit that SUBSCRIBE button so you're notified when a new video is uploaded!&amp;#10;If you already watch my videos regularly, what are you waiting for? Join the family! SUBSCRIBE! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;LINKS TO EVERYTHING SEEN IN THIS VIDEO&amp;#9759;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WORKOUT LEGGINGS: https://treetribe.com/&amp;#10;ROLLED OATS &amp;#38; COCONUT AMINOS: (this link will give you 25% off &amp;#38; a FREE 30 day trial) www.thrivemarket.com/earthmama &amp;#10;SOLAR PANEL: https://amzn.to/EQkeAf&amp;#10;RAW PROTEIN: https://amzn.to/CsFEep&amp;#10;GREEN POWDER: (30% off discount code: EARTHMAMA) https://www.thematchareserve.com/collections/blends/products/super-green-me&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Learn more about our cat, Rumi:&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/RSvr62BLSgw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CAMERA WE USE: https://amzn.to/2L3yr4w&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Learn more about us LIVING in our VAN here! &amp;#9759;&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLvua0O9ngg9fCn2XDCsYMgY3Np1go_akQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Learn more about EMM Custom Healing Plans &amp;#9759;&amp;#10;https://www.earthmamedicine.com/services&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Stay connected with us on Instagram! &amp;#9759;&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/earthmamamedicine &amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/eyenero&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/rumithesphynx&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Facebook &amp;#9759;&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/earthmamamedicine &amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/no-ordinary-stranger &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Website: https://www.earthmamedicine.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Email: earthmamamedicine@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Love Earth Mama Medicine? Leave a review!&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/pg/earthmamamedicine &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Support&amp;#9759;&amp;#10;https://patreon.com/earthmamamedicine&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.me/earthmamamedicine&amp;#10;Bitcoin Wallet: 15GRpX6AUTcpnsNhSxV5F9uUoFuwsSjYLu&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Directed by Veladya Chapman&amp;#10;Edited by Veladya Chapman&amp;#10;Produced by Matt Hill &amp;#38; Veladya Chapman&amp;#10;Associate Producers: Melanie Younger, Chelsea Creeks, Tai Samad, Brandi &amp;#38; Shanae&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Want to become a producer of this channel and help us continue to make videos?&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/earthmamamedicine &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Copyright Free Music provided by www.epidemicsound.com"
