  [
    id 442
    label "OBI5BpOiejM"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-13T18:00:10Z"
    title "VAN TOUR | How do you carry a MOTORCYCLE with a camper van? #vanlife #camper #RV"
    description "These two lovely people were a joy to get to know. Their van was also so stunning and so creative using every bit of space to live the way they want to live. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;I had a blast filming this van tour and I hope you all will love to escape too as you watch this van tour unfold xx&amp;#10;&amp;#10;w#vanlife #RV #camper #vantour #sacredtraveller #influencer #instagram #tiktok #YouTube #solar #portablepower #offgrid #motorcycle #motorbike #jackery #bluetti #leisurewise #UK #youngcouple #bfgoodrich #tinyliving # #holisticliving #minimalisim #bigvansmallworld #offgridliving #tinyhome #overlander #lifeoffgrid #camping #campervan #camper #van #woodburner #solo #solofemale #travel #explore&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Jake &amp;#38; Perdie - GO FOLLOW THEM!&amp;#10;TikTok: @perdiemilard&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/perdieandjake/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VAN TOUR | How do you carry a MOTORCYCLE with a camper van? #vanlife #camper #RV&amp;#10;&amp;#10;**MY TOP PRODUCTS FOR 2022**&amp;#10;OceanBottle: https://amzn.to/3LiRM0L&amp;#10;Audible: https://amzn.to/3Li6PHK&amp;#10;Kindle:https://amzn.to/39rEt0o&amp;#10;Monte's Tracker: https://amzn.to/3wh0R5H&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Toilet Products:&amp;#10;SheeWee: https://amzn.to/3ae4MIq&amp;#10;Decompostible Bags: https://amzn.to/3ukogBU&amp;#10;Thetford Porta Potti 335: https://amzn.to/3yFELv7&amp;#10;Hydrate Pee Bottle: https://amzn.to/3NA13Ct&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Portable Shower:&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3yC8wN3&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Camping Essentials&amp;#10;Vango Chair: https://amzn.to/3AmxfX7&amp;#10;Mini Solar charger: https://amzn.to/3OFp5gZ&amp;#10;Camping Portable Table: https://amzn.to/3IdIRNS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MY STICKERS:&amp;#10;Buy me a coffee and I'll send you a sticker!&amp;#10;https://www.buymeacoffee.com/sacredtraveller&amp;#10;&amp;#10;POWER TO THE PEOPLE&amp;#10;Jackery 240: https://amzn.to/3lf1iau&amp;#10;Solar Panel: https://amzn.to/3Nkwz86&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ORGANIC &amp;#38; NATURAL BODY PRODUCTS: &amp;#10;Earthkind Shampoo Bar: https://amzn.to/3Lj5uQU&amp;#10;Earthkind Conditioner Bar: https://amzn.to/3FMivBE&amp;#10;Aloe Vera Gel: https://amzn.to/3Mns3W8&amp;#10;Tangle Teezer mini: https://amzn.to/3LhCskS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;KITCHEN:&amp;#10;KeepCup: https://amzn.to/3NibJ94&amp;#10;LifeSky Aluminium Water Bottle: https://amzn.to/3lfeBaN&amp;#10;HYDRATE water bottle: https://amzn.to/3MlT1NP&amp;#10;LeisureWise Portable Grill: https://amzn.to/3FMR8ax&amp;#10;Leisurewise Air Fryer: https://amzn.to/3wBtnya&amp;#10;Leisurewise Induction Hob: https://amzn.to/3FVME1l&amp;#10;&amp;#10;BEDROOM:&amp;#10;USB white portable light: https://amzn.to/39WTFTD&amp;#10;Natural condoms: https://amzn.to/3LbOpbK&amp;#10;Clip on book reading light: https://amzn.to/3PhAR1L&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127946;&amp;#127995;&amp;#8205;&amp;#9792;&amp;#65039;WATERSPORTS&amp;#127946;&amp;#127995;&amp;#8205;&amp;#9792;&amp;#65039;&amp;#10;JOBE Leona Paddle Board Kit: https://amzn.to/3PmMd4s&amp;#10;Palm Life Jacket: https://amzn.to/3wqL04V&amp;#10;Tyhpoon Wetsuit: https://amzn.to/39Ra77R&amp;#10;DryBag: https://uludrybags.com/product/guardian2-pink/&amp;#10;Beach Buggy: https://amzn.to/3NkHcHZ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Backpack:&amp;#10;https://babymel.com/collections/backpack/products/george-black-grey&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Email me: sacredtraveller.contact@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Buy me a coffee&amp;#10;https://www.buymeacoffee.com/sacredtraveller&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Become a patreon&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=51385487&amp;#10;&amp;#10;My corner on Amazon&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.co.uk/shop/melsvanworld?listId=1A7D4O4LYI0IH&amp;#38;ref=cm_sw_em_r_inf_list_pub_melsvanworld_dp_FeNSSaKBmgJBK &amp;#10;&amp;#10;W E L C O M E &amp;#10;Hello beautiful souls, my name is Becky. &amp;#10;I have a passion for living life out of the box and being unique. No matter who you are, what experience of life you have; we all can have connection with each other and the universe. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;V A N L I F E &amp;#10;My latest journey is converting my van into an off grid campervan. You can expect to see videos all about my life as I start on my journey of living off-grid. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;S P I R I T U A L &amp;#10;I am an empath and a Starseed on a journey to enlighten myself and rediscover the wonders of the universe. I endeavour to uplift and inspire those around me to reconnect with their souls and their soul journey. If this is something that is close to your heart then please become a part of this soul tribe. I would love to connect with you. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Mel's Channel&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC72V8FXcD4SIxZx7_P6Ak9g&amp;#10;&amp;#10;*This video is created for fun and entertainment purposes only. The thoughts expressed are mine and do not reflect upon anyone else. Please use your own discretion and judgement when making decisions, life choices and potential purchases*&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#travel #vanlife #sacredtraveller #rv #rvliving&amp;#10;#melsbigvansmallworld #offgridliving #solofemale #travel #explore"
