    title "What is happening in Ecuador? Are we stuck in Colombia? Van life Updates from South America"
    description "Support our Expedition. &amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/leaw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Travel Insurance! Get a quote here:&amp;#10;https://www.worldnomads.com/Turnstile/AffiliateLink?partnerCode=L34W&amp;#38;source=link&amp;#38;utm_source=L34W&amp;#38;utm_content=link&amp;#38;path=//www.worldnomads.com/travel-insurance/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;NEW! LeAw T-shirts collection online and more!!&amp;#10;https://teespring.com/stores/leaw-leaveeverythingandwander&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Good morning beautiful people, in this episode we want to give you an update real time about what is going on here. What is happening in Ecuador?? Is this affecting our overlanding?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://edition.cnn.com/2019/10/13/americas/ecuador-protest-curfew-intl/index.html&amp;#10;https://www.trtworld.com/americas/what-is-happening-in-ecuador-30528&amp;#10;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2019/10/ecuador-moreno-indigenous-groups-open-talks-protests-rage-191014011131898.html&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you enjoy our content and want to help support our video production and our expedition, please become a Patron.&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/leaw&amp;#10;or &amp;#10;Send us a one-time donation via PayPal&amp;#10;leawwild@gmail.com&amp;#10;you can click this link&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.com/cgi-bin/webscr?cmd=_s-xclick&amp;#38;hosted_button_id=KG6DG8M3972GY&amp;#38;source=url&amp;#10;Please keep supporting us and our channel!!&amp;#10;Thank you &amp;#10;Sara &amp;#38; Luca&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our gear:&amp;#10;# Camera Lumix GH5: https://amzn.to/2JMGbuo&amp;#10;# Camera Lumix GX800 : https://amzn.to/2K5alro&amp;#10;# Iphone 7 plus: https://amzn.to/2D5BPKT&amp;#10;# Iphone X : https://amzn.to/2LzZUzn&amp;#10;# GoPro: https://amzn.to/2y4K6Mr&amp;#10;# Drone: https://amzn.to/2G8ubkQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Visit our Amazon Shop: https://www.amazon.com/shop/l_e_a_w&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUBSCRIBE to our channel to join the adventure!&amp;#10;www.youtube.com/c/leawvlog&amp;#10;&amp;#10;More about us: &amp;#10;www.l-e-a-w.com https://goo.gl/A2npBa&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Facebook // LeAw // https://goo.gl/Y1YyX3&amp;#10;Facebook // Sara // https://goo.gl/9etHpB&amp;#10;Facebook // Luca // https://goo.gl/LK4uCB&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Instagram // LeAw // https://goo.gl/VWjwzj&amp;#10;Instagram // Sara // https://goo.gl/S6zsZM&amp;#10;Instagram/ Luca // https://goo.gl/NKbeJC&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow LeAw Leave Everything and Wander and be part of our adventure!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #leaw #leaveeverythingandwander #ecuador #overlanding #colombia #news"
