  [
    id 444
    label "_9tL8EgveZs"
    step 0
    date "2018-10-22T14:28:33Z"
    title "VAN LIFE as a SOLO FEMALE TRAVELER // Tour + Interview."
    description "Kendra lives in her 1994 volksvagon westfalia with a converted hightop. This video is a look into her life and why she decided vanlife is for her, and a tour of her Van home. Minimalism is something Kendra was always drawn too and when she found this van it felt right for her to just move into it and start traveling, she ended up living in squamish and tofino throughout the summer in her van. Her instagram bio says she is just an island chick doing her thing in a van named Penelope, and that sounds pretty accurate! So please enjoy this mini documentary which is a look into the life of solo female van dweller!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow kendra on instagram!&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/kendrastoner/&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/penandken/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Van Life Tours&amp;#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL8TC5LCUPfit4qO8aiIh_iHtC2xFWtIzA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vanlife Video Podcast&amp;#10;https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PL8TC5LCUPfitJMClK--WFcx1CUHI-rGM7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vanlife Audio Podcast&amp;#10;https://anchor.fm/vanlifeandchill&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Movies&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3HnMwHJ&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3HmmEfw&amp;#10;https://amzn.to/3gxFchf&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Discord&amp;#10;https://discord.gg/4kWjnSfF6U&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Vlogs&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/ForrestStevensYT&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you to Patreons! Jamie F, Renay E, Andrew B, Madison and Raynor, Jennifer S, Mario R, Doug B, Marian H, Cody S, Ashton S, Akshay A, Curtis, and Sonya B! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Patreon&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/ForrestStevens &amp;#10;Paypal&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=ML6MEHLAHUMFN&amp;#10;Bitcoin&amp;#10;3Ao1PoA7i1mY4R2eQp8HYSJv77jZ1HkMN7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you read all this give us 1 thumbs up emoji, 1 tree emoji and 1 Video camera emoji in the comment section."
