    date "2022-07-06T12:00:39Z"
    title "Van Life With An Unexpected Dog Hero"
    description "#vanlife, #gloriouslifeonwheels, #dog, #rvliving, #animalheroesprotecting,&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Many of the people I meet who are involved in van life have a dog and truly love their dogs. During this interview for Glorious Life On Wheels Derec shared an amazing story of how he saved a dying dog and how that dog, Gunner,  is now a hero dog protecting him and returning the favor many times over.  Although Gunner is not a talking dog like some on You Tube, LOL, he clearly communicates his love and devotion. I think you are going to truly be touched by the.bond between De4ec and Gunner.  Let me know in the comments if you are. If you have a touching story about your beloved four legged companion I'd love to hear it."
