    description "We finally made it to my favorite National Park and Bryce's brother flew in to adventure with us for the week!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow along on Instagram! https://www.instagram.com/courtneyzinckgraf/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;A LITTLE ABOUT US&amp;#10;Hi! We are a married couple from Jacksonville, Florida. We quit our jobs, bought a 30 year old van named Hidalgo and fixed it up. Now we are living full time in the van while we drive around America seeing National Parks and meeting cool people. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hit the subscribe button to keep up with our videos!"
