  [
    id 454
    label "GG4bsQP3nlQ"
    step 0
    date "2020-12-20T18:01:47Z"
    title "DRIVING HOME for CHRISTMAS - END of VAN LIFE in PORTUGAL"
    description "The first 1000 people to use the link will get a free trial of Skillshare Premium Membership: https://skl.sh/theexpawers12202 &amp;#10;&amp;#10;After the weather changes, the temperature drops and the rain comes we make the difficult decision to end our van life adventure in Portugal and drive back to Andalusia and our house.   A little apprehensive as to whether this is the right decision as it is likely that we will be locked down in a house again losing our freedom but we decide it's time to drive home for Christmas.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you for watching, hope you enjoyed the video. please LIKE, COMMENT, and don't forget to SUBSCRIBE to our channel; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCasvDNJLIODOEO1YBNKBnGQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW US for daily updates and more;&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/the.exPAWers/&amp;#10;Facebook:  https://www.facebook.com/exPAWers/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUPPORT US;&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.me/exPAWers&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out our Amazon Shop for our camera equipment and must have van life gear;&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.co.uk/shop/theexpawers&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This video is sponsored by Skillshare &amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHO ARE WE?&amp;#10;We are Nick and Sarah a couple with our 2 little dogs Dizzee and Charlie we are the exPAWers! We have a passion for CREATIVE FILM MAKING and a LOVE FOR TRAVEL and our plan is to DRIVE ACROSS THE WORLD and to inspire others to follow their dreams.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUBSCRIBE! if you're interested in what it's like to be LIVING IN A VAN, how to TRAVEL THE WORLD ON A BUDGET, easy and healthy VAN LIFE MEALS and the BEST PLACES TO VISIT IN EUROPE and AROUND THE WORLD.&amp;#10; &amp;#10;We may not have a new SELF CONVERTED SPRINTER VAN, a VW CAMPERVAN, a 4WD OVERLANDING EXPEDITION VEHICLE, a luxury RV or MOTORHOME but we have all we need in our 29 year old RETRO FORD TRANSIT VAN 'Vinny'.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;THANKYOU;&amp;#10;We would like to say a BIG THANK YOU to all of our Subscribers and everyone who watches our videos and for all of the lovely comments, it really does mean a lot to us. &amp;#10;If you would like to support us further and buy the dogs some EXTRA treats or put a little fuel in Vinny, it would be very much appreciated and you can do so by clicking on the PayPal link below. &amp;#128522;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.me/exPAWers&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CONTACT US;&amp;#10;the.expawers@outlook.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10; #vanlife #vanlifeeurope #fulltimevanlife"
