    id 456
    label "DaiUsATSEoE"
    step 0
    date "2022-05-19T16:30:01Z"
    title "Burgers, Beach, and Buns! | Van Life Vlog"
    description "Beach season has arrived, people!! Well, for some of us&amp;#8230; sorry to my friends outside of California! The weather is warming up, which means spending quality time o u t s i d e. My friends and I got the van ready and hit the beach for some burgers, buns, and sun! And by buns, I mean the cutest booty-shaped cupcakes we made &amp;#129473; Even though the whole point was to get work done from the van (spoiler alert - we didn&amp;#8217;t), I&amp;#8217;d say camper life was a success! I hope you enjoyed watching and get a chance to enjoy the outdoors soon! And as always, like and subscribe if you want. But you don&amp;#8217;t have to. &amp;#128150;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#brielarson #beachday #vlog #vanlife #dayinmylife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WATCH MORE BRIE&amp;#10;Charcuterie + Q&amp;#38;A!: https://bit.ly/38Awkq0&amp;#10;I Learned How to Compost!: https://bit.ly/3NSShRt&amp;#10;Get Ready With Me: Fresh Faced and Shoot Ready: https://bit.ly/37ppJhB&amp;#10;How I&amp;#8217;m Prioritizing Myself in 2022: https://youtu.be/Ik62dB6ktcw &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow Brie:&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/brielarson&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/brielarson&amp;#10;LinkTree: https://linktr.ee/BrieLarson &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join the fight for racial justice:&amp;#10;Equal Justice Initiative: https://eji.org/&amp;#10;Justice for Breonna: https://justiceforbreonna.org&amp;#10;Black Lives Matter: https://blacklivesmatter.com&amp;#10; &amp;#10;Black Creators + BLM Creators &amp;#38; Resources &amp;#10;Jovian Zayne: https://www.instagram.com/jovianzayne&amp;#10;Justina Omokhua: https://www.instagram.com/justeenahoh&amp;#10;Keah Brown: https://www.instagram.com/keah_maria&amp;#10;Kimberly Blackwell: https://www.instagram.com/kimblackwellpmm&amp;#10;Latham Thomas: https://www.instagram.com/glowmaven&amp;#10;Lauren Wesley Wilson:https://www.instagram.com/laurenwesleywilson&amp;#10; &amp;#10;For business inquiries: Anne Woodward @ Authentic Talent"
