  [
    id 458
    label "maTkmWF-gtI"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-10T12:14:09Z"
    title "VAN LIFE, UTAH - 5 NATIONAL PARKS IN 1 WEEK"
    description "Join us as we visit all the famous Utah National parks in one week! ALSO: we're back! To everyone that commented asking where we went: so sorry for ghosting you all! We're back to condo life for the summer, and since we've been home life has been busy and I've been putting off editing the last two van trip vlogs. I'm aiming to have the final installment of the US van trip series out in the next two weeks so stay tuned!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us on Instagram: www.instagram.com/katieanddaninavan&amp;#10;If you want to actually find us on Instagram, check out: www.instagram.com/katiesteckly&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128656; Katie and Dan in a Van FAQ &amp;#128656;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What kind of van do you have? &amp;#10;A 2018 Ram Promaster - 159&amp;#34; wheel base, high top roof!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Where are you going to travel? &amp;#10;First around our home country of Canada, and eventually someday, the WORLD! &amp;#127757;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;How do you two know each other?&amp;#10;We're youth choir sweethearts who got married at 22 and 24 years old, and now we've been together for 8 years, married for 3, and we love to go on adventures! (this is our biggest one yet)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;What do you do for work? Are you going to live in your van full time?&amp;#10;Dan works at a tech company (has been remote for over a year... because ya know &amp;#129335;&amp;#127996;&amp;#8205;&amp;#9792;&amp;#65039;) and Katie is a startup founder - check out her social media company at www.instagram.com/creatorlymedia &amp;#128187; right now, we're planning on part-time van life - but we'll see how it goes! (We aren't selling our condo yet!)"
    channeltitle "Katie &amp;#38; Dan in a Van"
