  [
    id 461
    label "j6ZWEG2v70c"
    step 0
    date "2020-04-01T09:55:26Z"
    title "Van Life Gamer - Full Size Gaming and Streaming PC in a Van"
    description "Trent from the youtube channel &amp;#8220;TheFinePrint&amp;#8221; lives in a van and lives the Van Life, now unlike most people who live in a van, he does not use a laptop, instead he used a full size PC, and when I say full size, I MEAN FULL SIZE.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;He does not simply have a PC in his van, he has a gaming Rig that he can play games on for 15 hours straight, all powered by his solar panels &amp;#38; battery system.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Trent&amp;#8217;s gaming PC is complete with a 27&amp;#8221; monitor, Tower case with LED lights, keyboard, mouse, a swing arm microphone and audio mixer.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Trent runs all of his van and his PC with a 400 watt solar power system on the roof and batteries under the bed.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Trent said, this PC may not be the most ideal setup, and takes up a lot of space and power, and overall is just not practical in a van, but I use it because I still had it storage, but I will probably end up transitioning to a laptop soon.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks for watching.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Definition of Boondocking &amp;#8211; There are many definitions for boondocking, from dry camping in a developed camp ground to staying overnight at a rest area. But mainly it means to camp anywhere without electricity, water or sewer regardless of location. Which means you can boondock in the forest or city streets. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;___________________________________________________________________&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CREDIT LINKS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; TTTHEFINEPRINTTT Youtube Channel =  https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCLGOiIudM7bGHXM652Pat7w&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9733; PC Gaming in a Van Video = https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qwH6km3DD9Y&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9733; Trent's Van Tour Video = https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=78D2L9eir4A&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Trents Twitch - www.twitch.tv/slarxy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Tiny Home Tours Youtube Channel = https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCidJftClM4kU1196YynvqXg&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9733; Tiny Home Tours (CC) Video 1 = https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xuSu_b_V4kk&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9733; Tiny Home Tours (CC) Video 2 = https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k6rv6zTkWc8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Tiny Home Listings Youtube Channel = https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCF2kg1ZzNVyoQit2mysQs0A&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9733; Tiny Home Listings (CC) Video 1 = https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_9VIFkE_Jao&amp;#10;&amp;#10;____________________________________________________________________&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Wonder World Twitter - https://twitter.com/WonderWorld_YTC&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9733; For personal story suggestions or business enquiries about product stories / reviews, please contact me on my email from the ABOUT page. Note: All suggestions are welcome, but may not be chosen as they are not suitable for this channel.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9733;&amp;#9733; NOTE: Please do not ask for permission to use footage in this video, or the whole video itself, as the ownership of all footage remains that of the owners who gave me permission to use it. If you want to use any of the footage click on the links above and seek permission from the owners."
    channeltitle "Wonder World"
