  [
    id 463
    label "jb0ikXl5H1o"
    step 0
    date "2020-05-16T13:00:18Z"
    title "VAN LIFE in a PANDEMIC | 4 Day Journey During TOTAL LOCKDOWN"
    description "After being trapped in Argentina for 60 days and counting, are we actually going home?? Watch to see VAN LIFE in a PANDEMIC in South America. // Follow us on instagram: https://instagram.com/thematneys_ for daily updates during this quarantine. // Buy our course: https://thematneys.co/course&amp;#10;&amp;#10;As this global pandemic has hit the world, we find ourselves in South America. Thankfully, Argentina, the country we're in, has acted quickly, instilling a quarantine. But, that means that very few travelers were able to leave the country before the lockdown began, even if they wanted to. Because of that, we have been trapped for almost two months. The country has also just announced that all commercial flights will be suspended until September, so it is time to find a different way home. Today we embark on a four day journey from El Calafate to Buenos Aires where we hope to be able to ship our van and fly home.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Friends:&amp;#10;Follow Alex and his partner: https://www.instagram.com/wandererswithoutborders/&amp;#10;Follow Ale and Duda:  @GetOutside - Ale &amp;#38; Duda  &amp;#10;Follow Ana and Gio: https://www.instagram.com/roadtrippersbr/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Map of South America Travels: http://bit.ly/2H8lEOL&amp;#10;Map of Colombia Travels: http://bit.ly/2Hqg1f1&amp;#10;Map of Central America Travels: http://bit.ly/2wxiazP&amp;#10;Map of Mexico Travels: http://bit.ly/2Z0c3kv&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out our recommended products: https://thematneys.co/recommended-products&amp;#10;&amp;#10;About The Matneys:&amp;#10;We're Christian and Aubry, a couple traveling North and South America in our converted Sprinter Van. On The Matneys, we love chatting about the reality of living in a van, what van life allows us to do, and how traveling to new places with new cultures can really open your eyes to so much about the world, our own country, and ourselves. Our little home is simple, but it takes us to the most magical paradises in the world."
    channeltitle "The Matneys"
    channelid "UC_NVASg3VB2TCjHx5w2ZJ-Q"
