    id 466
    label "QWVXLSVYG1I"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-14T18:41:48Z"
    title "UTAH Canyons - The Most BEAUTIFUL Drive in the WORLD | Couple Van Life Travel 4k Vlog"
    description "In today's adventure, we journey deep into the heart of Utah - through canyons, valleys, and gorges! Follow us as we have the road trip of our lives on the way to Valley of the Gods, and capture some stunning views in the amazing American Southwest. #vlog #travel #vanlife&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Excited to announce our new van life adventure series &amp;#34;Northbound&amp;#34;! Every week, follow our journey with a new episode showcasing our 5,000 mile trip where we lived entirely on the road and visited some of the most gorgeous winter places in the Northwest, including Oregon, Olympic National Park, the Rocky Mountains, and more. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out the Northbound playlist:&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZoNZoGKZFAs&amp;#38;list=PLCdQ1lg2Ygdk_dQYTHWKY64beXWAGGb6Y&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Catch up on our previous road trip &amp;#34;From East to West&amp;#34; across America: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sDZSaDAs5vQ&amp;#38;list=PLCdQ1lg2YgdnZnFPhxw5SED793f91SoMx&amp;#38;index=1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow our journey and subscribe to this channel for more life, laughs, and adventure &amp;#128073;&amp;#127995;&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCIoBVyxitpk_qBWqFQ020Qw?sub_confirmation=1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Talk to us in the comments below! Ask questions and share it with other van life, music, and travel lovers! Stay tuned for more videos.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Timestamps:&amp;#10;&amp;#10;0:00 Intro&amp;#10;0:10 Cathedral Valley Morning&amp;#10;0:52 A Hanksville Horror Story&amp;#10;3:03 Cathedral Valley Views&amp;#10;3:30 55 to Cainville&amp;#10;4:49 2 Hard Boiled Eggs in a Van&amp;#10;6:50 The Moon of Utah&amp;#10;8:24 On the Way to Hanksville&amp;#10;9:24 I Could Carry it for Awhile&amp;#10;10:06 Sit Back and Enjoy the Magic of Rock&amp;#10;10:55 Hanksville Bates Motel&amp;#10;12:13 Two Nutjobs on the 95&amp;#10;13:30 Scenic Backway Near Canyonlands&amp;#10;14:30 A Part You Wish You Had Skipped&amp;#10;15:33 Distant Shadows&amp;#10;16:46 The Most Beautiful Drive in the World&amp;#10;20:40 Outro&amp;#10;21:00 Behind the Beans&amp;#10;&amp;#10;About my channel:&amp;#10;My name is Andrea Nicole King and I'm a little dreamer. Nothing makes me happier than traveling around in my 1988 Happy Times G20 conversion van! I'm a singer/songwriter and have a debut album coming out later this year. Make sure to subscribe, share, and push the notification bell if you want to support my channel!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can follow my travels &amp;#38; music on:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/theandreanicoleking&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/theandreanicoleking&amp;#10;https://www.theandreanicoleking.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow Will:&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/officialwillash&amp;#10;https://www.facebook.com/officialwillash&amp;#10;https://www.twitter.com/officialwillash&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you so much for watching! Stay tuned for more!"
