  [
    id 467
    label "KTKOoZdZKYU"
    step 0
    date "2021-03-14T14:04:05Z"
    title "MY TRUTH about solo female van life"
    description "my TRUTH about solo female van life goes into 5 things I've come to learned traveling solo on the road. These things I've learned are personal and are the reality of van life for me. One thing everyone can definitely relate to is female van life safety and the difference things you do while living alone. As solo female van lifers we rock! How to live in a van full time solo is much harder but I've learned I am capable of so many things that I never thought I was. solo female van lifers, we rock!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUPPORT US&amp;#10;https://www.patreon.com/lostrenegades&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SAW SOMETHING YOU WANT&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/lost.renegades&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW THE ADVENTURE&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/lost.renegades&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/lostchazz&amp;#10;&amp;#10;DROP A COMMENT&amp;#10;see something you like.. we'll link it&amp;#10;got a good dad joke... tell us&amp;#10;think we're awesome.. by all means type away&amp;#10;don't like us... lie&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHO ARE WE?&amp;#10;Oh, hey! We are Charlie, Jenn and Opie&amp;#10;We converted our 95' Chevy van, Duke into what we think is the sickest home on wheels. Off grid and stealthy, he's ready for the open road of travel. Our pup Opie agrees, and definitely thinks we spent the summer of 2020 building his puppy dream car. So here we are, jobs quit and taking on the world by van as a travel couple. We have no idea how to do this #vanlife thing, but we're about to figure it out through many bad words and bickering. Welcome to our #vlog featuring the life of unemployment on the open road...&amp;#10;#lostrenegades&amp;#10;&amp;#10;and always remember &amp;#34;phones off, friends on&amp;#34; &amp;#10;-Christina, the wise."
    channeltitle "Lost Renegades"
    channelid "UCoXOKfFqGBOlqMaWL1xb-pg"
