    description "Going on the ultimate van life adventure in the Storyteller Overland Ford Transit MODE with Charley the yellow lab. Watch more Storyteller Overland camper van videos: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLpqJFyT0tg-IXKuOP7hxHpRhQeKobYXSR &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Watch our Summer with Mom camper van road trip video series: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLpqJFyT0tg-LmIMWGPzamL3ULfQb6jy7w&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Official Website https://weretherussos.com&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Newsletter http://bit.ly/wtrsignup&amp;#10;&amp;#9658; Books https://weretherussos.com/books/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Joe and Kait have been traveling in various adventure based campers since 2015. For travel destinations, camper guides, essential gear and tips from the road visit https://weretherussos.com and youtube.com/weretherussos&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9442;&amp;#9444;&amp;#9425;&amp;#9442;&amp;#9426;&amp;#9441;&amp;#9432;&amp;#9425;&amp;#9428; &amp;#38; Turn on Notifications for New Videos&amp;#10;http://www.youtube.com/subscription_center?add_user=weretherussos&amp;#10;&amp;#10;=========================&amp;#10;&amp;#169; We're the Russos, LLC 2019. All Rights Reserved.&amp;#10;=========================&amp;#10;&amp;#10;- Disclosures -&amp;#10;We&amp;#8217;re the Russos is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising and linking to Amazon.com."
