    title "Van Life Topics: Keeping Your Dog Cool While Camping  Traveling"
    description "See below for ways to support our adventures! Thanks for being here!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;~ Send a &amp;#8220;Super Thanks&amp;#8221; on any one of our videos by clicking the heart $ on the same line as the thumbs up!&amp;#10;~ PayPal: paypal.me/dogmomdays&amp;#10;~ Venmo: @Amanda_Yantos&amp;#10;~ CashApp: $AmandaYantos&amp;#10;~ Become a &amp;#8220;MEMBER!&amp;#8221; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCI83u2kGeSMIs8uglLtiFgA/join&amp;#10;~ Or purchase from one of our Amazon links below!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PO Box:&amp;#10;Adventuring With Amanda&amp;#10;485 S. Watson Rd. Ste 103&amp;#10;PMB 148&amp;#10;Buckeye, AZ 85326&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This is my 2018 Dodge Grand Caravan no-build minivan camper conversion. I travel full time with my Chihuahua. We&amp;#8217;ve visited 33 states together in the continental US, and our home base is in Arizona.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;I am a creative writer, and work in the digital space. Be sure to follow us on Instagram! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Instagram: @amanda.yantos &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Please note that by purchasing items from Amazon using our links, we may earn a small commission to help with our business expenses. Thank you! Xoxo Amanda &amp;#38; Wynston&amp;#10;&amp;#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&amp;#10;Amazon Items by Category: (affiliate links)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Electronics and Power:&amp;#10;Bluetti EB70S Power Station: https://amzn.to/3JmEn6F&amp;#10;Bluetti PV200 Solar Panel: https://amzn.to/3yS8v8m&amp;#10;Jackery 240W Power Station: https://amzn.to/2IAG4DU&amp;#10;Jackery 60W Solar Panel: https://amzn.to/2IGhHVc&amp;#10;Rockpals 300W Power Station: https://amzn.to/3oDUKUj&amp;#10;30 AMP Adapter: https://amzn.to/2K9IwSA&amp;#10;Portable Camping Fan: https://amzn.to/3ps6xVj&amp;#10;Onite USB Light Bulb: https://amzn.to/38z8s2I&amp;#10;Collapsible Solar Lantern: https://amzn.to/3wsFEWN&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Food, Water and Cooking:&amp;#10;Collapsible Sink With Drain: https://amzn.to/3y9gr26&amp;#10;MSR Pocket Rocket Camping Stove: https://amzn.to/38xBUto&amp;#10;Electric Water Dispenser: https://amzn.to/35yD0RD&amp;#10;Yeti Tundra 35: https://amzn.to/2J6guqK&amp;#10;Kuju Pour Over Coffee: https://amzn.to/3KBxRu8&amp;#10;Collapsible Tea Kettle: https://amzn.to/3t6DNSP&amp;#10;Alpicool Fridge: https://amzn.to/2TRq6ek&amp;#10;Travel Spice Containers: https://amzn.to/3i4AbNc&amp;#10;Collapsible water bag: https://amzn.to/3xEemxq&amp;#10;Collapsible bucket: https://amzn.to/3jRBeBt&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Pet Items:&amp;#10;Collapsible Pet Water Bowls: https://amzn.to/395qlHY&amp;#10;Popup Playpen: https://amzn.to/2K28De9&amp;#10;Earth Rated Dog Wipes: https://amzn.to/3wqcbfV&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hygiene: &amp;#10;Shower: https://amzn.to/3Lq26E9&amp;#10;Scrubzz Rinse-free Bath Sponges: https://amzn.to/3KOIBVE&amp;#10;Wolfwise Popup Toilet Tent: https://amzn.to/3n4fm5T&amp;#10;Folding Portable Camping Toilet: https://amzn.to/3EnVxOT&amp;#10;Hygiene Caddy: https://amzn.to/3mXO440&amp;#10;Paper Pellet Litter: https://amzn.to/3GQ5W7i&amp;#10;Biodegradable Trash Bags: https://amzn.to/3slSCTv&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Curtains: &amp;#10;Magnetic Window Curtains: https://amzn.to/32PfZIt&amp;#10;Hippie Tapestry: https://amzn.to/3m24vbx&amp;#10;Celestial Tapestry: https://amzn.to/3oPfyGT&amp;#10;Mesh Bug Window Screens: https://amzn.to/3r46Oic&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Bed/Lounging:&amp;#10;Trifold 4&amp;#8221; Memory Foam Mattress:  https://amzn.to/36z4q9o&amp;#10;Orthopedic back pillow: https://amzn.to/2UOTGOU&amp;#10;Fleece Blankets: https://amzn.to/3nZ0PZo&amp;#10;Fitted Cot Sheet: https://amzn.to/3uVQcKO&amp;#10;Cooling Blanket: https://amzn.to/3H6CCev&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Miscellaneous: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Awning: https://amzn.to/3eOQAUK&amp;#10;Sticky Gel Pads: https://amzn.to/3no94xR&amp;#10;HangPro Seat Organizer: https://amzn.to/3pxrxd7&amp;#10;United States Map Car Vinyl Sticker: https://amzn.to/3AZhbI5&amp;#10;Binder Clips: https://amzn.to/36T7hKj&amp;#10;Hand Warmers: https://amzn.to/3mqdHre&amp;#10;Waterproof Blanket: https://amzn.to/39SoXaD&amp;#10;Windshield Sun Visor: https://amzn.to/36fXNc8&amp;#10;Carbon Monoxide Detector: https://amzn.to/2K2PiJI&amp;#10;Straw Mats: https://amzn.to/37VPXZO&amp;#10;Grandpa Gus&amp;#8217;s Mouse Repellent: https://amzn.to/3NLAJpK&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Furniture: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Tail Veil SUV tent: https://amzn.to/3bL9ryL&amp;#10;3 Tier Slim Cart: https://amzn.to/3sn6bzv&amp;#10;Aluminum Folding Table: https://www.walmart.com/ip/Ozark-Trail-Aluminum-Top-Rectangular-Outdoor-Camping-Folding-Table-Silver-Color/531930310&amp;#10;Bamboo Lap-Sized Table: https://amzn.to/3hnN8S7"
