  [
    id 482
    label "tA84L2BpArw"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-10T14:13:22Z"
    title "Van Life Spain - Getting Stuck in Costa Brava"
    description "We just wanted to reach the woods in Costa Brava, but we ended up getting nearly stuck on a road that was impossible to drive!! But then we had an amazing experience and... stick till the end because we're revealing the NEWS of our TOUR!! &amp;#129395;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128073;&amp;#127995; SUPPORT US:&amp;#10;Your support means a lot to us, even just the price of a tea and coffee can make a huge difference in our life journey with Van Arthur:&amp;#10;-  buymeacoffee.com/bemayone&amp;#10;- https://paypal.me/beandsimo/          &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#129526; DUSTY VITA:&amp;#10;Our Dusty Vita shop is now LIVE!! Bea creates Macram&amp;#232; on our van, with recycled cotton, woods we find on our journeys, and so much love &amp;#129505; There are so many objects that will come, for now, have a look at the shop if you want something for your van/home or as a gift for your loved ones:  https://www.etsy.com/it/shop/DustyVita?ref=profile_header&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128107;&amp;#127995; ABOUT US:&amp;#10;We're Bea and Simo, and this year we took a big step out of our comfort zone toward our dream life: the VAN LIFE! Together with Nala &amp;#128054; we'll be exploring new places and experiencing unforgettable moments.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128187; BE PART OF THE FAM:&amp;#10;We are digital nomads, working online with a sustainable and business that allows us to prioritise our health and our happiness. We now help you do the same, and live your travel dream by working online alongside our fam from all over the world! Apply here &amp;#8594; https://bemayoneblog.typeform.com/to/G5vA4s&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127800; Follow us daily on INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/bemayone_&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128233; Subscribe to the Bemayone Letter: https://mailchi.mp/f07599062a04/bemayone-letter&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127881; Patreon + Ebooks &amp;#8594; COMING SOON!! &amp;#127881;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127926; ALL the music we use is from Epidemic Sound: https://www.epidemicsound.com&amp;#10;&amp;#8594; Sign up for a free trial and download them:&amp;#10;Cotton Candy Armor (Instrumental Version) - Mattias Tell&amp;#10;Reaching For Infinity - Dawn, Dawn, Dawn&amp;#10;Stone By Stone (Instrumental Version) - Windshield&amp;#10;Surfer Kids - Elliot Holmes&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Cannot wait to have you on board of this new journey! And maybe also on our business fam to own your freedom!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9728;&amp;#65039; Reminder: YOU ARE ALWAYS ONE DECISION AWAY FROM A COMPLETELY DIFFERENT LIFE.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #costabrava #vanlifeproblems"
    channeltitle "Bemayone"
    channelid "UCn9gI6IEt_N55DXugq0E6Cw"
