    date "2022-07-09T14:00:06Z"
    title "Living In a Van UPDATE | Our Last 3 Months (America The Beautiful)"
    description "Donate with PayPal &amp;#38; Thank You for your Support to our channel (and Michelle&amp;#8217;s addiction to pie! &amp;#129383; &amp;#129299;) https://www.paypal.me/LivinRVision&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Living In a Van UPDATE - Our Last 3 Months (America The Beautiful) (SN 6 EP 192)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8505;&amp;#65039; About this episode:  &amp;#10;We have been living full-time in a van for 3 months now! In this episode of LivinRvision, we share how life has been in the GrechRV Strada-Ion Tour and what we like and dislike about this Class B.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128085;&amp;#128090;T-SHIRTS!! &amp;#10;Looking for some LivinRVision swag? You can find it all on the LivinRVision YouTube main page OR at LivinRVision.com THEN, click on - LRV Swag OR go here &amp;#128073;&amp;#127995; https://teespring.com/stores/livinrvision-2&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Our Favorite RV items can all be found at &amp;#10145;&amp;#65039; https://amzn.to/33s9Rae&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Join the Visionary Gang email list! https://www.livinrvision.com/contact/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUBSCRIBE HERE &amp;#128073;&amp;#127995; https://www.youtube.com/c/LivinRVision?sub_confirmation=1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128588; HELPFUL LRV (LivinRVision) PARTNERS &amp;#10;&amp;#10;These are brands we enjoy using that you might too. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9654;&amp;#65038; Thousand Trails:  https://www.livinrvision.com/resources/ SAVE $$! CONTACT KIM here &amp;#10;&amp;#9654;&amp;#65038; Harvest Hosts:   http://harvesthosts.refr.cc/LivinRVision 15% DISCOUNT!&amp;#10;&amp;#9654;&amp;#65038; TSD Diesel Fuel Discount:  https://www.tsdlogistics.com/services/fuel-program/ Let them know LivinRVision referred you.&amp;#10;&amp;#9654;&amp;#65038; LECTRIC eBikes - The Lectric XPLite models were a real game changer for us! Click the following link ( https://alnk.to/eOHvL9R ) for the best price available! If asked, be sure to use the code, LivinRVision.&amp;#10;&amp;#9654;&amp;#65038; TechnoRV:  http://technorv.com?Click=11818 RV recommended products.&amp;#10;&amp;#9654;&amp;#65038; RV Trip Wizard: https://www.rvtripwizard.com/#5eab0bb6ae892 Route planning tool &amp;#38; more.&amp;#10;&amp;#9654;&amp;#65038; Wholesale Warranties FREE NO OBLIGATION QUOTE &amp;#128073;&amp;#127995; https://wholesalewarranties.com/rv-landing-page/?sr=LivinRVision&amp;#10;&amp;#9654;&amp;#65038; GasStop (Propane Safety): Diversifiedpower.com Coupon Code: LivinRVision&amp;#10;&amp;#9654;&amp;#65038; Solo Stove: https://solostove.com/?rfsn=4549819.002494 Tired of campfire smoke following you like a magnet?&amp;#10;&amp;#9654;&amp;#65038; Beddy&amp;#8217;s: https://bit.ly/LivinRVision 15% off coupon code- LIVINRVISION&amp;#10;&amp;#9654;&amp;#65038; TravelData (T-Mobile) $10 off first order over $100. Here is your referral link -&amp;#160;http://traveldata.refr.cc/livinrvision&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127925;MUSIC We Use&amp;#127925;&amp;#10;Epidemic Sound:  https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/c3mjz2/&amp;#10;Intro Music: &amp;#8220;Be Free With Me&amp;#8221;  ~ Siine, Frank Moody&amp;#10;Outro Music: &amp;#8220;Call It A Day&amp;#8221; ~ Tommy Ljungberg&amp;#10;&amp;#10;AFFILIATE LINK DISCLOSURE:&amp;#10;Some of the links on this page are affiliate links. If you chose to make a purchase using our links, we will earn a commission. This commission comes at no additional cost to you, but helps us keep providing the content we love to share. We recommend these products because we have found them to be helpful. Every product we recommend, we use ourselves.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are also a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate advertising program designed to provide a means for us to earn fees by linking to Amazon.com and affiliated sites.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11015;&amp;#65039; NON-AFFILIATE LINKS &amp;#11015;&amp;#65039;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Reserve America (Army Corps of Engineers Campground): https://www.reserveamerica.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;America The Beautiful Pass: (National Parks &amp;#38; Federal Recreational Lands Annual Pass)&amp;#10;https://store.usgs.gov/pass&amp;#10;&amp;#10;LivinRVision, All Rights Reserved&amp;#10;This channel is for entertainment purposes only. We are not professionals, RV or travel experts. We share our opinions and what works for us and you should do your own research.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Limit of Liability/Disclaimer of Warranty: While all persons associated directly or indirectly with this site and video use their best efforts in preparing the content, there is no express or implied representations or warranty with respect to the accuracy or completeness of the content of the videos, including any content, links or resources shared, including those by third parties. Furthermore, all parties specifically disclaim any and all express or implied warranties of merchantability or fitness for a particular purpose.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;@GrechRV&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #americathebeautiful #grechrv #rv #fulltimervlife #livinrvision #livingourvision #rvliving #lrv #rvlifefulltime"
