  [
    id 502
    label "s3amhlJ4IRs"
    step 0
    date "2020-12-20T16:00:27Z"
    title "VAN LIFE BREAKDOWN... our van broke down in spain.. breaking down abroad!"
    description "VAN LIFE BREAKDOWN... our van broke down in spain.. breaking down abroad!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;As most of you will all know last week our van broke down in southern spain. Thankfully our AA cover has sorted us out with a hire car and an apartment (for now anyway) and emily takes the chance to give you a full apartment tour, as well as take us all for a spin in the car!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;It's been a pretty stressful week as news on the van is limited, and the time for repair is looking like its going to be a long one! One of the biggest problems with living in a van is that your tiny little home on wheels can break down at any moment leaving you homeless and transport less, the situation is magnified further by the fact we are in a foreign country!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This certainly isn't what we was expecting from vanlife europe (who thought this would be the issue travelling in 2020!) but we will have to make the most of it, this weeks spanish travel vlog is a little bit different, mostly as it doesn't feature our self converted campervan but our spanish air bnb! But hey, at least its warm here right!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us on our journey, 2 female solo travellers, as we attempt to create a proper youtube travel series as we travel across Europe during this global pandemic.&amp;#10;Hit the subscribe button to see where our little tiny home on wheels takes us next and how we cope living in a van!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out our instagram for real time updates..&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/camper_vibe/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Have a look at emily's blog for her thoughts on all things van..&amp;#10;http://campervibe.co.uk/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;For stickers..&amp;#10;Make a &amp;#163;5.00 payment to &amp;#10;https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/campervibe&amp;#10;and just leave your name and full address in the notes, just click add note.&amp;#10;If paypal confuses you (as it does me, Lou) then follow the below instructions;&amp;#10;Use your name as the reference then, email &amp;#10;campervibe6@gmail.com &amp;#10;with the same name as your reference of payment and full address.&amp;#10;The stickers will then be shipped out, thanks again for your support :-)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;*We use affiliate links from which we earn a small percentage at no extra cost to yourself. Most of this is used to keep emilys snack cupboard topped up but occasionally she lets Lou have some to buy the dog treats!"
    channeltitle "Camper Vibe"
    channelid "UC_7ZmNi09nP5UciW62-8BUw"
