    title "5 things we HATE about our van build"
    description "New Here?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are Denise and Reed,  a couple who dreamed of traveling but had no idea how to make it happen. Then, in 2018 we stumbled upon the van life, which has changed our lives. Now we travel full-time in our self-converted van with our dog Bella and cat Rita. We have had so many unique experiences that we wouldn't give up for the world! So follow along as we share our experiences as full-time travelers.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;For more shenanigans, follow us here!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Website: https://deniseandreed.com/&amp;#10;Denise and Reed Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/deniseandreed/&amp;#10;Denise Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/denisemeeker_/"
