  [
    id 508
    label "exsucLVRGIk"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-10T08:00:12Z"
    title "VAN LIFE CORNWALL // SMUGGLERS COVES AND SUNSETS"
    description "This week we hike to Bessys cove and Prussia cove which are old smuggler beach&amp;#8217;s. Bessys cove is a rocky stony beach where you can sun bath on the rocks which made us feel like we were in Italy. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;We drive to the northern coast to watch the sunset at Watergate Bay as summer solstice hits, Cornwall really does have incredible sunsets!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We hope you enjoy this episode.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ANNOUNCEMENT!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We have just launched our first sticker collection. We have a sticker for everyone in the FOA team including Jonny, Hannah, Tia, Skye and also Harvee the Transit.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You can buy our stickers on our store via this link - https://ko-fi.com/findingouradventure&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks to everyone who supports our adventures, we couldn't do any of this with out you!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;VIDEO CONTENTS&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WANT TO SEE MORE? - Please like comment and subscribe to support our channel!&amp;#10;Watch our Ford Transit van tour here - https://youtu.be/unp9X0Dprig&amp;#10;Subscribe to our channel here - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCmjKjwhT2iIcydCXWXgtMYw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;OUR CHANNELS - We love it when you connect with us!&amp;#10;Instagram - www.instagram.com/findingouradventure&amp;#10;Website - www.findingouradventure.com&amp;#10;Facebook - www.facebook.com/findingouradventure&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ABOUT FINDING OUR ADVENTURE&amp;#10;We are Jonny &amp;#38; Hannah and we love to travel! After traveling through South East Asia and starting Finding Our Adventure we wanted to explore more of our own country and Europe. That led to a 2 year van obsession, we watched every video on Youtube we could find and spent countless hours designing our own tiny home on wheels. Finally we were able to purchase our Ford Transit and spent 7 months converting it into our very own little campervan.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;THE MUSIC WE USE&amp;#10;We use Epidemic sound for all our music in our vlogs, it is easy and fun to use. Click on our referral link to get a free 30 day trial - https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/gd5ho7&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#cornwall #findingouradventure"
    channeltitle "Finding Our Adventure"
    channelid "UCmjKjwhT2iIcydCXWXgtMYw"
