  [
    id 510
    label "xqYV7GTqLIU"
    step 0
    date "2020-11-13T18:43:29Z"
    title "Story Time Living Van Life Summer to Winter - My Truck Camper Travel Adventures"
    description "Living and traveling in a truck camper has brought me on so many adventures. Some people call it van life, I call it the free life. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;As seasons change from summer to winter, I shift my time from the ocean to the mountains. I've found myself in many scenic places in nature, all equally beautiful and peaceful. Nature gives me hope, there is beauty to be found everywhere. It all depends on your outlook and perspective in life.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Whether you travel in an RV, truck camper, van or car, there's something about traveling freely that's incredibly freeing. I feel that the true gift in life is being able to choose what you do with your time. I forever work towards achieving this complete freedom and hope that one day you can too!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thanks so much for watching, don't forget to like and subscribe so you don't miss my next adventure! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Make sure you check out my coffee:&amp;#10;https://www.drstraight.com/products/mushroom-coffee"
    channeltitle "Dr. Hannah Straight"
