  [
    id 515
    label "846WLPu7wgQ"
    step 0
    date "2022-01-30T18:00:27Z"
    title "Van life MOROCCO - a SAD reality (emotional)"
    description "Today on our van life journey through Morocco, we bath and photograph 12 rescue dogs in the hopes of getting them adopted!&amp;#10;We will create a calendar of the doggos which is for sale on our website (link below) - all money raised will go straight to Morocco Animal Aid to help fund their incredible work!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;It's not your typical vanlife vlog but this is such an incredibly heart warming story and hands down one of our favourite videos we've ever made, it was such an emotional rollercoaster hearing all of the animals back stories and how they ended up in MAA shelter.. so emotional. &amp;#10;This charity are BEYOND WORDS amazing. Rescuing and rehabilitating many animals not just stray dogs off the streets of Morocco - they are true angels on the earth and their story is amazing.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;But this kind of work doesn't come cheap - not when you have 400+ mouths to feed.&amp;#10;Please consider donating to these guys or if you wish to sponsor or even adopt a dog -&amp;#10;please see all the information below &amp;#10084;&amp;#65039; (and we'll LOVE you forever)&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127775; GET YOUR CALENDAR HERE: https://www.kinging-it.com/morocco-animal-aid&amp;#10;&amp;#128155; DONATE - https://www.paypal.com/paypalme/moroccoanimalaid&amp;#10;&amp;#129505; SPONSOR a dog here: https://moroccoanimalaid.com/sponsoring/&amp;#10;&amp;#10084;&amp;#65039; ADOPT a dog here: https://moroccoanimalaid.com/discover-our-animals/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128154; Follow Morocco Animal Aid here: https://www.instagram.com/moroccoanimalaid/ &amp;#10;Like, Share, Comment, Follow - every little helps!! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Credit to - Matti Page for a section of this footage.&amp;#10;-------- &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128107; &amp;#128663; WHO ARE WE?&amp;#10;We are Craig and Aimee.&amp;#10;After Aimee was diagnosed with Cancer at 18 and Craig broke his neck shortly after by a freak accident, we decided life really is too short. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Watch our story here -  https://bit.ly/3kuiZBA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Social Media -&amp;#10;&amp;#128998; Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/kingingit&amp;#10;&amp;#128997; Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/wearekingingit&amp;#10;&amp;#129000; Website - http://www.kinging-it.com&amp;#10;&amp;#129002; Twitter - https://twitter.com/kingingit100&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlife #rescuedogs #vanlifemorocco"
    channeltitle "Kinging- It"
