    id 519
    label "57emb6kADmc"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-13T17:00:32Z"
    title "Is this goodbye Norway | Van Life in Scandinavia Ep 9"
    description "Join our channel membership  to get access to some cool perks:&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCdyRAR2t7gpry5uf-LPYn-g/join&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Is this goodbye Norway | Van Life in Scandinavia Ep 9&amp;#10;In this weeks episode we reevaluate our travel plans from the UK to Nordkapp. Cabin fever was taking it&amp;#8217;s toll on all 3 of us but we know the best of Norway is still yet to come. Do we stay or do we go?&amp;#10;On a lighter note, we experience our first time dumpster diving, what do we find? And go on a midnight hike to find some more moose!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;PREPARING FOR YOUR EUROPEAN ROAD TRIP: https://www.nicroams.co.uk/preparing-for-your-european-road-trip/&amp;#10;Access all of our park ups: https://www.patreon.com/nicroams&amp;#10;Send a &amp;#8216;thank you&amp;#8217; cider to: https://paypal.me/nicolakb?locale.x=en_GB&amp;#10;Shop our merch: www.nicroams.co.uk/merch &amp;#10;Shop van builds: https://www.nicroams.co.uk/van-builds/&amp;#10;Van Build Cost and Process eBook: https://www.nicroams.co.uk/ebooks/ &amp;#10;------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CAN&amp;#8217;T LIVE WITHOUT&amp;#10;FILTRATION BOTTLE: https://iconlifesaver.com/?wpam_id=61 &amp;#10;WASH BAG: https://thescrubba.com/?ref=DpgMxx5nMaB0 (use code NICROAMS10 for 10% off)&amp;#10;PROJECTOR CINE LITE: https://cine-lite.com/?ref=-nicroams&amp;#10;PORTABLE SHOWER: https://amzn.to/3jagS6K &amp;#10;JACKERY 500w POWER STATION: https://amzn.to/3DQZ49b&amp;#10;JACKERY 100w SOLAR PANEL: https://amzn.to/3h4qJK0 &amp;#10;WHEEL LOCK: https://amzn.to/3kSQiiq&amp;#10;WIND DEFLECTORS: https://amzn.to/3h8DoM5 &amp;#10;PORTA POTTI: https://amzn.to/2FMoECZ&amp;#10;STORAGE SQAURES: https://amzn.to/3the4bN &amp;#10;GOPRO: https://amzn.to/3x0nsDU&amp;#10;CAMERA STAND: https://amzn.to/3ncLjbq&amp;#10;CAR USB CHARGER: https://amzn.to/3nlymMr&amp;#10;POWER BANK: https://amzn.to/38Zruzl &amp;#10;--------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;MUSIC&amp;#10;All music is from Epidemic Sound, https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/6q91md/&amp;#10;Sign up for a free trial where you can download the music! &amp;#10;--------------------------------&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW MY JOURNEY&amp;#10;Website: https://www.nicroams.co.uk/ &amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/nicroams/ &amp;#10;Pinterest: https://www.pinterest.co.uk/NicRoams/&amp;#10;TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@nicroams&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#norwayvlog #roadtripseries #norwaytravel #visitnorway #norge"
