  [
    id 525
    label "VSUCoL3KU_s"
    step 0
    date "2022-01-30T11:45:00Z"
    title "FIRST ALL ELECTRIC CAMPER VAN CONCEPT FROM WINNEBEGO 2022"
    description "Today, we&amp;#8217;ll be showing you the very first all-electric motorhome to come to America; the e-RV from Winnebago!  &amp;#10;Stick around until the end of the video for a look at our honorable mentions as well. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128276; SUBSCRIBE FOR MORE CONTENT https://www.youtube.com/c/mindseyedesign?sub_confirmation=1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128310; ALL OUR VIDEOS! #mindseyedesign&amp;#10;&amp;#128310; MORE CAMPER VIDEOS! #mindseyecampers&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128310; WEBSITE https://mindseyevideos.com&amp;#10;&amp;#128310; MINDS EYE SHOPS https://mindseyevideos.com/all-shops&amp;#10;&amp;#128310; SIGN UP HERE TO GET FEATURED IN A FUTURE VIDEO&amp;#10;https://www.avantlink.com/click.php?tt=ml&amp;#38;ti=15305&amp;#38;pw=290965 &amp;#10;&amp;#128310; MEMBERS &amp;#128313; Join this channel to get access to perks!&amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCZ7qe4QUGie6jtJPPEHQx7Q/join&amp;#10;&amp;#128310; PLAYLISTS https://www.youtube.com/c/mindseyedesign/playlists&amp;#10;&amp;#128310; CONTACT US https://mindseyevideos.com/contact&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; Escape Campervans is the largest campervan rental company in North America, with 13 convenient rental locations in the US and Canada. They have more than 600 custom-built campervans designed &amp;#38; built in-house, each uniquely hand-painted by top artists in Los Angeles. &amp;#10;With New Zealand roots and nearly two decades of experience guiding travelers, they pride themselves on offering fun, hassle-free adventures for all. There campervan rentals are economical and easy to drive, giving you the freedom to get off the beaten path into places that are inaccessible to larger motorhomes and RVs&amp;#8212;and no stress driving through the city.&amp;#10;&amp;#128310; https://alnk.to/58kHvBc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088; FEATURED CAMPERS &amp;#11088;&amp;#10;00:00 Intro&amp;#10;01:16 E-RV ELECTRIC CAMPER VAN&amp;#10;Design: Winnebago Industries Advanced Technology Group &amp;#10;https://www.winnebagoind.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;03:44 ESTREAM ELECTRIC CAMPER&amp;#10;Design: Thor Industries&amp;#10;https://www.airstream.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;05:39 Rivian R1T New All-Electric Camper Truck &amp;#10;https://youtu.be/jKWgO4HyF68&amp;#10;&amp;#10;05:56 LOKI BASECAMP OFF-ROAD TRUCK CAMPER&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/ap16PYNB5sE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;06:17 Volkswagen Type 20 Electric Microbus &amp;#10;https://youtu.be/_L3KMOnCBN4&amp;#10;&amp;#10;06:45 Hofmann Living Vehicle &amp;#10;https://youtu.be/XA6ttt0IKeQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#129309; SOCIAL MEDIA &amp;#10;&amp;#128313; INSTAGRAM https://instagram.com/design.mindseye&amp;#10;&amp;#128313; TWITTER https://twitter.com/mindseyevideo&amp;#10;&amp;#128313; FACEBOOK https://facebook.com/mindseyedesignmedia&amp;#10;&amp;#128313; LINKEDIN https://www.linkedin.com/company/minds-eye-media-llc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127911; MUSIC &amp;#10;&amp;#11088; Millennium X Beats &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCzQrITcZJMhXTs-RhIqweuQ&amp;#10; &amp;#10;FIRST ALL ELECTRIC CAMPER VAN CONCEPT FROM WINNEBEGO 2022&amp;#10;#mindseyetrailers #mindseyecamping&amp;#10;#mindseyevideo #mindseyevideos &amp;#10;#mindseyereviews #mindseyeyoutube &amp;#10;#campers #camping&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#129309; Credits and Attributes &amp;#10;For any copyright concerns or adjustments. &amp;#10;&amp;#128236; mindseyeworld@outlook.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#129309;SUBSCRIBE &amp;#10;https://www.youtube.com/c/mindseyedesign?sub_confirmation=1&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Affiliate Links &amp;#10;Some links in this description are &amp;#8220;affiliate links&amp;#8221;. This means if you click on an affiliate link and purchase the item, we will receive a small commission. &amp;#10;By using the affiliate links, you are helping support the channel, and we genuinely appreciate your support. &amp;#10;https://mindseyevideos.com/disclosure"
