  [
    id 526
    label "TBJ2PPekSU8"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-12T18:00:07Z"
    title "Van Life with Four Dogs | FREE Boondocking / Dispersed Camping in Colorado | Antero Reservoir"
    description "This video shows our 3 day stay at Antero Reservoir in Hartsel, Colorado. You can stay at these FREE campsites (with picnic benches and fire pits, no hook ups) for up to 14 days. We filled our water tank, set up our solar generator and relaxed for a few days with our 4 dogs. They loved being able to go swimming multiple times a day and it was gorgeous weather with highs in the 70s everyday, in July! This would be an amazing spot for anyone who likes to fish or has a boat. Comment below your favorite camp spot for us to try next!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Like, comment, share &amp;#38; subscribe for more van travel content!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Connect with us! :) &amp;#10;Email: runawayroaddogs@gmail.com&amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/RunawayRoadDogs&amp;#10;Instagram: @runawayroaddogs https://www.instagram.com/runawayroaddogs/&amp;#10;TikTok: @runawayroaddogs https://www.tiktok.com/@runawayroaddogs&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Music:&amp;#10;Stuck in the Moment - Alexa Cappelli&amp;#10;Good Things Will Come Eventually - DJ DENZ The Rooster&amp;#10;Pancakes - Dylan Sitts"
