    title "MOTORHOME EUROPE 2022 | Czech Republic Full Time Van Life"
    description "We've just racked up our 27th country in a van and boy is it a good'un &amp;#127881; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Travelling europe in our Iveco motorhome throughout 2022, we have LOVED every moment + everything about Czechia - a new one of our favs for sure &amp;#128076; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this travel vlog, we share a cheap and beautiful campground, plus an easy, free van life park up.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Hope you enjoy, cheers - martin and kate &amp;#9996;&amp;#65039; &amp;#10;&amp;#11090;&amp;#10;&amp;#11090;&amp;#10;&amp;#11090;&amp;#10;We love to share our journey with you - come along for the ride, hit the subscribe + notification buttons....anything you want to know more about + covered in our vids, let us know!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow our tracks on socials:&amp;#10;&amp;#128073; Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/VanJourney &amp;#10;&amp;#128073; Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/Van_Journey&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128231; Connect with us - vanjourney@outlook.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Send us a message + buy us a coffee - we really appreciate it + love to hear from you!.... https://www.buymeacoffee.com/VanJourney&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128506;  We sold it all and hit the road back in 2017 - we totally fell in love with the travelling lifestyle and have been sharing our travels on Facebook - we've been asked, so we delivered + are now creating vids to give everyone an insight into our life on the road!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanjourney  #martinandkate  #motorhomeeurope"
