    description "VAN LIFE SERIES EP. 22: DAY IN THE LIFE: VAN LIFE FAMILY (How we cook in the VAN) &amp;#10;This is a realistic look at a day in our VAN LIFE! We are a family currently travelling around Australia. Today, we keep it real by showing you how we cook whilst travelling and living as a VAN LIFE FAMILY.&amp;#10;JOIN THE TRIBE &amp;#38; SUBSCRIBE - http://bit.ly/2Bt3uHv&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ABOUT US&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are a Full Time Travelling Family, living in our TINY HOUSE ON WHEELS, a 2018 Jayco Journey OutBack. We plan on Travelling across as much of Australia as possible and sharing the whole adventure with you all.&amp;#10;If you would like to get to know us more, then feel free to subscribe to our channel. Follow our family adventures and share our experiences as we navigate our way through this crazy life.&amp;#10; &amp;#10;GET IN TOUCH &amp;#10;&amp;#10;ourhappytribe@gmail.com &amp;#10;&amp;#10;CONNECT WITH US &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10008;FACEBOOK: https://www.facebook.com/ourhappytribecommunity/&amp;#10;&amp;#10008;INSTAGRAM: https://www.instagram.com/ourhappytribe/&amp;#10;&amp;#10008;TWITTER: https://twitter.com/ourhappytribe?lang=en&amp;#10;&amp;#10008;WEBSITE: www.ourhappytribe.com.au&amp;#10;&amp;#10008;SNAPCHAT: ourhappytribe&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#vanlifefamily #vanlife #TravellingFamily"
