    id 551
    label "RsQXjxJMnJk"
    step 0
    date "2022-06-13T00:55:53Z"
    title "Brand New Van Broken Already  Hillary #vanlife"
    description "VAN LIFE VLOG: Ep: 37 // Feeling disappointed in the quality of the Thor Tellaro Van so far. We try and take it to a dealership to get it fixed but just get a complete run around. &amp;#8595;&amp;#8595;&amp;#8595;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128276; Subscribe to our channel! &amp;#9658;https://www.youtube.com/c/vancaskeys&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128248; Follow us on Instagram for behind the scenes content!&amp;#10;https://www.instagram.com/vancaskeys&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Watch our whole Baja series here: https://youtu.be/SEIhnWoQs-8&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUPPORT US &amp;#10;Shop at our AMAZON STOREFRONT https://www.amazon.com/shop/hillarymccaskey&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SumoSprings Rear for Dodge RAM ProMaster - https://www.amazon.com/shop/hillarymccaskey&amp;#10;&amp;#10;DISCLAIMER: most links in this description are affiliate, which means that if you buy from my link, we will get a small percentage of the profit at NO EXTRA COST TO YOU!! Thanks for supporting us.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Timestamps: &amp;#10;0:00 Taking our Thor Tellaro Van to a dealership to get the window fixed&amp;#10;2:07 The Problem with the window&amp;#10;3:01 They couldn't helps us&amp;#10;3:57 Plan B-Drive to La Mesa RV and show them the problem&amp;#10;5:29 Two weeks later...still not fixed&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHO ARE WE?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We are Bob and Hillary, from Chandler, AZ. While we love living in Arizona we are not going to lie...the summers are brutal! So since both our boys are now in college we decided it was time to buy a #van and travel!  We originally thought we would build one out. But after the past 2 years we realized that prices went up and things were hard to find. So much is on back order. So we did the next best thing! We bought one completely finished and ready to go! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;What is our WHY? Why do we want to share it with you? The biggest reason is we have had some hard times and lost very dear people in our life which has caused us to want to make the most out of every moment we are given!  Our goal is to inspire everyone to chase their dreams no matter their age and season of life, to help people see the behind the scenes of a couple doing that very thing! And if we can help you achieve your very own home on wheels that's icing on the cake!  #vanlife #travelvlog #vanlifecouple #vanvlog"
    channeltitle "Vancaskeys "
    channelid "UCFOX0mnv61u4bXl7NZawAfA"
