    id 565
    label "4rPb9okkVSg"
    step 0
    date "2022-07-14T17:58:54Z"
    title "ALL GONE WRONG - STRUGGLING with VAN LIFE in PORTUGAL - (OFF GRID LAND SEARCH)"
    description "Get NordVPN&amp;#8217;s 2 year plan + 1 extra month for free here: https://nordvpn.com/theexpawers It&amp;#8217;s risk free with NordVPN&amp;#8217;s 30 day money back guarantee!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We leave van life in Spain behind and cross the border in search of some off grid land in Portugal. But the dream soon becomes a van life nightmare when the temperatures go over 40 degrees! Living in a van is almost impossible for us and our dogs in this heat wave and it doesn't look like its going to end any time soon! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Have we made a huge mistake coming here in July, will we still be able to look for off grid land in central Portugal.. Its not looking too good for us at the moment as van life becomes unbearable.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Thank you for watching, hope you enjoyed the video. please LIKE, COMMENT, and don't forget to SUBSCRIBE to our channel; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCasvDNJLIODOEO1YBNKBnGQ&amp;#10;&amp;#10;FOLLOW US for daily updates and more;&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/the.exPAWers/&amp;#10;Facebook:  https://www.facebook.com/exPAWers/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUPPORT the CHANNEL (send us a treat)&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.me/exPAWers&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CHECK OUT OUR NEW MERCHANDISE; https://the-expawers.creator-spring.com/?&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Email me if you want a STICKER PACK; sarah@theexpawers.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Check out our Amazon Shop for our camera equipment and must have van life gear;&amp;#10;https://www.amazon.co.uk/shop/theexpawers&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Get the power you need with AMAZING JACKERY Products here;  https://uk.jackery.com?aff=36&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Like the music we use? Use our link and get a 30 day free trial to Epidemic Sound; https://www.epidemicsound.com/referral/q8eotp/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WHO ARE WE?&amp;#10;We are Nick and Sarah a couple with our 2 little dogs Dizzee and Charlie we are the exPAWers! We have a passion for CREATIVE FILM MAKING and a LOVE FOR TRAVEL and our plan is to DRIVE ACROSS THE WORLD and to inspire others to follow their dreams.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;SUBSCRIBE! if you're interested in what it's like to be LIVING IN A VAN, how to TRAVEL THE WORLD ON A BUDGET, easy and healthy VAN LIFE MEALS and the BEST PLACES TO VISIT IN EUROPE and soon AROUND THE WORLD.&amp;#10; &amp;#10;We don't have a NEW MOTORHOME, SELF CONVERTED SPRINTER VAN, VW CAMPERVAN, 4WD OVERLANDING EXPEDITION VEHICLE, or a LUXURY RV but that doesnt stop us! Our 32 year old rusty FORD TRANSIT keeps going and has taken us to 30 countries already.. So stay tuned for many more!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;THANKYOU;&amp;#10;We would like to say a BIG THANK YOU to all of our Subscribers and everyone who watches our videos and for all of the lovely comments, it really does mean a lot to us. &amp;#10;If you would like to support us further and buy the dogs some EXTRA treats or put a little fuel in Vinny, it would be very much appreciated and you can do so by clicking on the PayPal link below. &amp;#128522;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.paypal.me/exPAWers&amp;#10;&amp;#10;CONTACT US;&amp;#10;hello@theexpawers.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WANT TO WORK WITH US?&amp;#10;brands@theexpawers.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10; #vanlife #vanlifeeurope #fulltimevanlife"
