  [
    id 573
    label "BGdWHy0PIgA"
    step 0
    date "2021-07-18T18:18:12Z"
    title "VAN LIFE UK - We went to a NUDE beach!"
    description "VAN LIFE UK - We went to a NUDE beach! &amp;#129321; #vanlife Wales babyyy! &amp;#10;Be a Sheila- head to  Squarespace.com for a free trial, and when you&amp;#8217;re ready to launch, go to squarespace.com/KINGINGIT to save 10% off your first purchase of a website or domain.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Who'd have thought the pair of us would ever find ourselves on a nude beach! &amp;#128514; We get out kit off and let it all hang out  (in the breeze it was lovely) because this activity was on Aimee's bucket list believe it or not! It felt rather strange to be naked in a public place haha!&amp;#10;Our Welsh road trip is coming to an end in our bus Custard and we wanted to go out with a bum &amp;#128518; We didn't even know there were nude beaches in Wales!&amp;#10;Are we naturists now?!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128653; Our bus stats:&amp;#10;2001 Mercedes Vario 814&amp;#10;4.2 Litre Diesel&amp;#10;Was 24 seats (now 2) &amp;#10;Air Suspension&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10145;&amp;#65039;&amp;#128107; A bit about US- &amp;#10;We are Craig and Aimee, from South Wales, UK. After Aimee was diagnosed with Cancer at 18 and Craig broke his neck shortly after by a freak accident, we decided life really is too short. Watch our story here -  https://bit.ly/3kuiZBA&amp;#10;&amp;#10;We love to give ourselves travel challenges and attempt things the normal folk wouldn&amp;#8217;t dream of. Throw us into some mad country with an even madder vehicle and you&amp;#8217;ll find us having the best time possible. We now travel in our renovated bus Custard - Our mantra is Rule Your Own World - we only get one life and it&amp;#8217;s YOURS to chose how to live it - make it count.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128663; Top 10 videos to watch on Kinging-it&amp;#8217;s channel:WATCH HERE! - http://bit.ly/3uHC5sy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;ALL the music we use is from Epidemic Sound - 30 day FREE trial here - http://share.epidemicsound.com/kingingit&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Social Media -&amp;#10;&amp;#128998; Facebook - https://www.facebook/com/kingingit&amp;#10;&amp;#128997; Instagram - https://www.instagram.com/wearekingingit&amp;#10;&amp;#129000; Website - http://www.kinging-it.com&amp;#10;&amp;#129002; Twitter - https://twitter.com/kingingit100&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127804;SHOP &amp;#10; Get your Kinging-it clothing here -  http://www.kinging-it.com/shop&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#127800;PODCAST&amp;#10; Kinging it PODCAST - https://www.kinging-it.com/the-podcast&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#11088;&amp;#65039; Become a Patron - https://www.patreon.com/KingingIt&amp;#10;&amp;#11088;&amp;#65039; Join our Facebook Community here - http://bit.ly/kingingitfacebookgroup &amp;#10;&amp;#11088;&amp;#65039; &amp;#163;25 off your first Air Bnb Trip - http://bit.ly/2a9hngR&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#Vanlife #nudebeach #vanlifeuk #nudist"
    channeltitle "Kinging- It"
